#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "34952"
msgid "Save current progress?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523224"
msgid "You need money? Sure, no problem.\nFor you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, I'll lend as much as\nyou need."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523324"
msgid "For now… yes,\ndoes 100,000-ish Sm sound alright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523400"
msgid "\"100,000 Sm\"-ISH…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523712"
msgid "That priest is a pretty sharp businessman.\nHe charged me an exorbitant rate of 100 to 1."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523824"
msgid "But I'll be satisfied so long as it helps you,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. We're friends after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524088"
msgid "………………………huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524124"
msgid "If were to lend you 100,000 Sm,\nthen after 10 days it would become 110,000 Sm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524340"
msgid "What… did you say….!?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "524784"
msgid "Please, lend me the 100,000 Sm!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525024"
msgid "Man, #C236196003Leo#CDEF's smile is shinier than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525380"
msgid "…I'll forget about the loan.\nThis \"Tenterest\" thing is just too risky.\nAlso, #C236196003Leo#CDEF's smile is really scaring me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525900"
msgid "What should I do―――"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "525936"
msgid "Borrowed 100,000 Sm from #C236196003Leo#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530308"
msgid "No, there's no particular reason, but…\nSomething about #C236196003Leo#CDEF is strange."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530528"
msgid "Ah, it must be the uniform, right? In my case,\nI used to look charming in my bronze-red\nuniform, which glowed in that blue school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531100"
msgid "Maybe we've been optimized by this \"old school\"\nlocation. I'm a classical kind of guy―\nI like it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532092"
msgid "Maybe the #C000246204Commissary#CDEF sells our uniforms…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "563704"
msgid "Presently, she IS also a Master\nwho sustains a Servant. That, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565068"
msgid "She saved many people.\nBut each one of them trampled on her good will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565740"
msgid "And the conglomerates had backing from\nthe Holy Church. That lot hasn't been able\nto put out a saint in years."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566468"
msgid "She was even able to free an elderly man,\non the brink of death and obsessed with\n\"prolonging his life,\" from that suffering."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566608"
msgid "What I found astonishing was――\nAfter that elderly man experienced her\nteachings, he became an impeccable person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567052"
msgid "She's still a cybercriminal, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567400"
msgid "We know she's being misrepresented,\nbut we deem that it's best\nto err on the side of caution."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579136"
msgid "I have to give it to him, it was a brilliant\nblitz strategy. But I guess #C236196003Julius#CDEF knew it well,\nsince he led counter-terrorist units on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579864"
msgid "I know. #C236196003Julius#CDEF didn't betray us.\nHe put on a show to trick #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nI get it. We're still alive, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580032"
msgid "After he didn't finish us off,\nI thought, \"okay, this is an act.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580900"
msgid "No longer do I think that such a thing is cruel.\nBehind her dispassionate words is sorrow\ntowards two people she deemed as worthy adversaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581056"
msgid "…still…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581140"
msgid "Isn't #C236196003Rin#CDEF surprised…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581968"
msgid "So listen, go rest.\nWe'll have our briefing after you wake up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582872"
msgid "Until then, please get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583076"
msgid "Yeah, I was chosen…\nThere's no way I'd lose in the 1st Round――\nHuh? O-Oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583628"
msgid "Gulp, it's #C236196003#NICK#CDEF…\nF-first of all, I'm happy you're alright.\nDon't go too overboard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583864"
msgid "………I mean, sorry,\nbut I'll just be dragging you all down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583936"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF can't fight anymore.\nI've got no power. I won't be like #C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584328"
msgid "I mean, that's all I…\nIt seems that's all I can do…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587712"
msgid "Ready to take the plunge?\nWe're ready whenever."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "587840"
msgid "Give me a sec."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590740"
msgid "I'm not used to it…!\nIt was the first time Senpai infiltrated me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591496"
msgid "Yes. You're very smart, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "598336"
msgid "…no, nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598628"
msgid "The theory is, when you go back to the past,\nand put the known present aside,\nyou can rewrite the unknown present."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599652"
msgid "…more or less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599828"
msgid "We can't perceive all three at the same time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600340"
msgid "I mean, you'd be able to flip to any\n#RUBS time#RUBEpage#REND you wanted. No more past or future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601732"
msgid "…so, #C236196003BB#CDEF knew from the very start―that we\nwouldn't make it in time, no matter what."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601968"
msgid "Were we fighting so that we would lose…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638528"
msgid "The future has been decided.\nAll we can do now is live here in this place…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638612"
msgid "…she's right.\nIf the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is still functioning\nas a database,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638708"
msgid "then there's meaning in preserving you\nand Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF here as human samples."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638840"
msgid "…that's the only…\nreason left for us to exist…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639832"
msgid "Huh――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641148"
msgid "I, #C236196003Caster#CDEF, don't wish to see Darling…\nor anyone who fought alongside\nus wear sullen faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641540"
msgid "then we haven't met defeat!\nI say we'll only lose if Darling gets\ninfatuated over another woman!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641648"
msgid "C-#C236196003Caster#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641688"
msgid "Are we even talking about the same thing here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641736"
msgid "I mean, seriously. We haven't lost.\n\"Oh no, the future is decided.\"\nWell obviously. Same goes for the gods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642584"
msgid "Without having first been defeated,\nthis coming battle would have never come about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643540"
msgid "The present \"tomorrow\" can be revised.\nAnd we can do it―― No.\nOnly we can, because the time is now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643652"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643668"
msgid "Ah. That's right.\nWhat was I thinking?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643996"
msgid "We're fighting to change the future #C236196003BB#CDEF\nended up deciding."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644592"
msgid "We still have work to do…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644924"
msgid "…sorry.\nI really embarrassed myself there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645140"
msgid "However, I'll take my place again now.\nAs an operator, as an Atlas alchemist,\nI'll be of use to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645304"
msgid "Thinking that, I spring back to life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645612"
msgid "But they dispelled their distress.\nThey say there's still work we need to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645888"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, the most outstanding of us all,\nleft the rest up to #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nThis must be why."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646316"
msgid "――――I have a solution for that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646436"
msgid "That Labyrinth Core doesn't belong to #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nThat Wall… is mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646524"
msgid "Wha!?\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, y-you've got trauma THAT bad!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646932"
msgid "I had picked up on your remark, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF had lost her composure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647172"
msgid "What hacker wouldn't go nuts over\nseeing a firewall like that? None."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647260"
msgid "…………\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF. I'll think of some\npenalty to put on Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647416"
msgid "…#C236196003Rani#CDEF. No, listen everyone.\nAbout that―― I have a favor to ask."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647672"
msgid "But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647764"
msgid "Then…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657640"
msgid "All set? Once you're in,\nyou #C000246204can't leave until you finish the mission#CDEF.\nSo keep that in mind."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "657888"
msgid "All set."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658156"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF hands me a small item folder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658216"
msgid "It's a cube five inches all around.\nWith its jet black exterior, it looks like\na textbook cursed item."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658452"
msgid "Yes, ready whenever.\nI have data from last time,\nso I can simplify the process."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658644"
msgid "In the center lies your Servant's\nSpiritron core, #ROFS0003#RUBS locked#RUBEsealed#REND away by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nDestroying it is your mission today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659612"
msgid "Please. I've trusted you all from the beginning.\nIf you can't do it, no one can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663664"
msgid "WH-WHAT!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663852"
msgid "I don't know what happened,\nbut I might live to see her reform herself…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664032"
msgid "…I couldn't bring myself to tell her about #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664404"
msgid "You'll have to keep her around until she\nreforms herself."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "664552"
msgid "　Gave the #C000246204black cube#CDEF\nto #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694072"
msgid "Thus, we can presume that the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's characteristic skill is\nhyper-compression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694724"
msgid "However, the things inside\nthat cube… the NPCs are all still alive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "694800"
msgid "…in short, this cube is a mass of flesh.\nThis dust data you recovered may be\nin this form, but it's alive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "695356"
msgid "…I'll work out a countermeasure at once to\navoid the worst outcome, her hyper-compression,\nand resist its instant-death effect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703304"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703560"
msgid "In any case, sentient humanoids within the\n#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF have souls―\"Stored models\"―\nvia pseudo-Spiritrons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "703896"
msgid "Yes… You're right.\nSorry for interjecting.\nPlease, continue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704156"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704176"
msgid "…anyone?\nAnything come to mind?\nI don't feel any different, by the way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704352"
msgid "…………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704548"
msgid "…………………………………well, about that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "704760"
msgid "But I have no clue what this \"truth\" is about.\nMaybe I already know what this \"truth\" is.\nI just haven't realized that it's a \"truth.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "705296"
msgid "Huh―― No, that's not it.\n…I'm sorry.\nI should get some rest in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710312"
msgid "Our operation is meaningless now.\nI'm… starting to despise myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710496"
msgid "I hate myself for thinking that way.\n…I'm sorry.\nI'm an imperfect homunculus…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "710616"
msgid "…about the Moon Cell's AIs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710724"
msgid "I considered asking about AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "710868"
msgid "What's the reason for that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711744"
msgid "…oh.\nWhether it's #C236196003BB#CDEF or some other AI,\nthe end result is the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "711996"
msgid "―could be considered \"humane\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "712036"
msgid "…that assumption makes no sense. Since\nAI aren't supposed to be able to\nassimilate with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729628"
msgid "Thank you very much.\nWith a power source of this quantity,\nI can unseal the black box."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729812"
msgid "Finished.\nI'll transfer the Matrix data to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729896"
msgid "Woah… This is just bonkers.\nNow I get why #C236196003BB#CDEF can do whatever she pleases."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "729988"
msgid "Still… This alone isn't enough, huh…\nIsn't there some way we can block it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "730156"
msgid "Seriously!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "730484"
msgid "So, we'll add such a power to our Servant here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731160"
msgid "Yes. Fortunately, we have the know-how on that.\nI believe it's quite a feasible #RUBS  operation#RUBEprocedure#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731280"
msgid "I-I see.\nBasically, like back when #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was attacked by #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nthis time I'll be diving into my Servant's digital frame!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "731744"
msgid "All bodies possess a sanitation program.\nAnd when it's a Servant's body…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732164"
msgid "Or rather, attack you. Full-on attack you.\nJeez, I can't even trust my own instincts!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732284"
msgid "They'll probably eat you bone and all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "732728"
msgid "Going in will backfire on us…\nA mere doll just isn't up to the task.\nShould we prepare a special kind of familiar?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "733028"
msgid "So…\nI say we request help from #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "733108"
msgid "She could transfer #C236196003Lancer#CDEF over to escort\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. There's no question\nthat #C236196003Lancer#CDEF is powerful enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "733804"
msgid "Still… Is this going to work?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734188"
msgid "I reply with a nod, \"of course.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734296"
msgid "Before doing so, discuss with #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF.\nWe're suggesting it, but she might\nnot be so eager to help…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734620"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734648"
msgid "She's muttering about something, I wonder what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "734872"
msgid "…true, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF definitely won't talk to #C236196003Rin#CDEF or #C236196003Rani#CDEF now."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "735160"
msgid "has opened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "736720"
msgid "The final battle is nigh…\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, do you have #C236196003Launcher#CDEF's matrix?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "736892"
msgid "I was in such a rush to gather #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's #C000246204SGs#CDEF\nthat I left Launcher's…#C236196003Karna#CDEF's Matrix incomplete."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796000"
msgid "………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "796028"
msgid "……Julius?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796044"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "796064"
msgid "Juliuuusss?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796084"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "796096"
msgid "Heeey, mister Juliuuusss!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796160"
msgid "……stop it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796176"
msgid "Damn, people like you are so…………\n……………………………………………\n……………………………………*sigh*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796308"
msgid "Huh? That's it……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796412"
msgid "Beggars can't be choosers.\nI even told you again and again\nthat I didn't have any money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796664"
msgid "O-oh, I didn't know……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "796804"
msgid "No. It's your money now.\nIf you can't beat #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF,\nwe're all in big trouble."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "797232"
msgid "Received\n800 Sm"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822008"
msgid "Agh! Everyone here has that cowardly NPC look\non their face! Where have all the\nself-respecting Masters gone!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822660"
msgid "But, I just can't remember his name.\nThough I've seen him before, I may have\nnever actually talked to or fought him…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "822852"
msgid "…and now he's noticed me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823024"
msgid "My name is #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF. I've navigated through\nmany flavors of theology; attained many\ntruths; a super truth-seeking monk, I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823300"
msgid "No Servant…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823328"
msgid "Is that… even possible in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?\nNo Servant means you were defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "823992"
msgid "\"Of course,\" I immediately reply.\nWe're trapped here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824096"
msgid "I haven't thought about escaping.\n…hmmm.\n#[Lad][Lass]#, somosan!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "824168"
msgid "Somosan?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825648"
msgid "…and, he's gone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "825672"
msgid "For now, I got one person to cooperate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826024"
msgid "…#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF can't be left as she is now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "826088"
msgid "Hm? It's odd for me to be supporting #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?\nYou say I was more reckless and macho\nin the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834108"
msgid "…ah, hrm. I mistook him for the sun.\nWhat an incredible God-V series.\nHow about calling him Red-wing #RUBS   Schwarz#RUBEJet-Black#REND Sun?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834352"
msgid "………\n…………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "834600"
msgid "Oh? A Cat Keychain.\nSo if I can find it―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "835096"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. If you happen to find the\n#C000246204Cat Keychain#CDEF first, would you mind bringing\nit to me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844392"
msgid "（仮）桜イベント１\n桜に制服を作ってあげる。"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "844900"
msgid "（仮）桜イベント２\nＢＢの登場で落ち込む桜を慰める。"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "848984"
msgid "Um… may I, ask you something?\nIt's about #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849236"
msgid "That girl… #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is a part of us,\nthe Sakura Series."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849320"
msgid "She… um, said all those things, to you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849820"
msgid "Despite how #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF looks,\ndo you consider an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF to be\npart of my series?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "849936"
msgid "I think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "849964"
msgid "…………………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "850204"
msgid "Of course.\nAh, sorry. I asked you a weird question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "858856"
msgid "…so, how it feel like to be dived into?\nDoes it tickle? Does it hurt?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859436"
msgid "Erm… It didn't hurt.\nIt tickled a little… I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "859964"
msgid "Wow, how bold…\nBut it sounds like it might be fun鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860180"
msgid "I'm ready whenever you are.\nOkay, bring it on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "860228"
msgid "U-uh…\nPlease be careful during your dive, okay?\nIt's still dangerous…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "865508"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nIs something the matter…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866016"
msgid "Huh? Umm……… What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866044"
msgid "I explain that it's a classic\nTsukumihara school uniform I got for her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866208"
msgid "No…… I can't! Sm is such a precious resource!\nTo use it on a uniform for me……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866524"
msgid "Was I being presumptuous after all……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866772"
msgid "……really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866788"
msgid "Really."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866800"
msgid "Really, really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "866816"
msgid "Really, really.\nSo please don't look so down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "867280"
msgid "Of course, don't mind if I do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875140"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875160"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875348"
msgid "Ah… #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…\nI'm sorry. I was daydreaming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875632"
msgid "No, that's not it.\nWhile Psycho Dives are difficult to process,\nI was assisting #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, so it was fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875756"
msgid "More importantly…\n#C236196003BB#CDEF has been weighing on my mind…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876920"
msgid "Uuugh. Why…!\nI'm seriously worried here…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876972"
msgid "That worry has gone much too far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877428"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877644"
msgid "Isn't that… right…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877988"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nThank you very much for paying me a visit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "974508"
msgid "…yes.\nEverything those girls spoke of is true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "974740"
msgid "Pardon me.\nNow, suddenly, I'm wondering―\nIf I committed a crime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975084"
msgid "They were committed to their desires\nand wasted their lives out of that lust."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975216"
msgid "I love all people equally.\nAnd I want to BE loved. That's what I crave.\nI can't help it, I'm selfish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975340"
msgid "That's why…\nI can never belong to one person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975532"
msgid "How can anyone rebuke such a devoted love?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "975768"
msgid "Goosebumps jolt all across my body.\nThis here is a good woman. Completely benevolent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "976448"
msgid "…what terrible irony."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "976676"
msgid "…I apologize.\nI understand your argument,\nbut I don't intend on stopping."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "976756"
msgid "And even a person like me has\nconvictions that can't be conceded.\nMy life cannot end just yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "977116"
msgid "If #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's life deserved to\nhave been lived, or if not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "977200"
msgid "Yes, if it's you… I hope you'll tell me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "977424"
msgid "I've dealt with many Masters up to this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "977472"
msgid "And she's a Master, too―throwing herself into\nbattle for the sake of a wish she can't give up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1017960"
msgid "Sleeping? Where?\nHuh, the Infirmary?\nHm, they have one of those here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1018040"
msgid "Well, your dimwitted self WOULD\njump in bed as soon as you got here!\nYou never fail to be third rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1019076"
msgid "Thanks for the concern. That I don't need.\nI always go at it alone.\nGames are best played solo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1019680"
msgid "Huh? A Servant?\nYou have Servant with you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1019848"
msgid "I ask about #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's Servant, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1019960"
msgid "I feel like that golden Servant isn't a \"traditional\" Servant,\nbut we pretty much made a contract."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1020060"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's astonishment was closer to fear than confusion.\nI ask about #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's Servant, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1020964"
msgid "And the loser gets――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1021004"
msgid "Hmph.\n\"When you lose, you die,\" right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1021516"
msgid "If we leave this structure and\ngo to some other area,\nwe'll reconnect in a flash. Definitely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1021700"
msgid "After all, the biggest contender―me―is here.\nManagement wouldn't abandon a star,\nnow would they?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1040780"
msgid "Her?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1040792"
msgid "Who?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1040804"
msgid "Sakura?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1040816"
msgid "By \"her\" I mean HER, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!\nThe drain-lady who made a complete fool\noutta me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1041208"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF asks me for battle data on #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1041288"
msgid "…oh, yeah.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF wasn't there when #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF attacked us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1041944"
msgid "I speak about her basic stats,\nas well as the special skills she had used――\n\"Drain\" and \"#C000246204Invincibility#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1042580"
msgid "Eh? You weren't attacked this time?\nShe's straight up snubbing you!\nYou don't even qualify as an enemy to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1043304"
msgid "But still――\nYou'll go back to the Near Side?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1043496"
msgid "I should――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1043540"
msgid "I still have to stop BB."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1044416"
msgid "Most likely――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1044432"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF―― Everyone is worried."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1044792"
msgid "Don't go into the Labyrinth anymore!\nIf you piss off #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nshe'll come down on us, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1044968"
msgid "We're down to four people…\nIf you disappear, too…\nWhat the hell will we do…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1045184"
msgid "That's what #C236196003BB#CDEF kept warning us to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1051048"
msgid "Damn, they even went as far as\nshutting the blinds.\nThat #C236196003Leo#CDEF, what're you tryin' to hide?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1051412"
msgid "I guess I'll try calling out to him."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1051488"
msgid "Good morning～!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1051512"
msgid "Whaddafu――!? D-damn, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nWh-why are you……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1051816"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1051828"
msgid "\"Nope\"!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1052296"
msgid "…………hey."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1052480"
msgid "…………woah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1052496"
msgid "\n\nSo he is interested, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083040"
msgid "Oh, money?\nI can spot you, like, 3000 zeni."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083096"
msgid "You're not talking about games?\nSakurament? #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, do you\nreally think I'd have any Sakurament?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083760"
msgid "How about you go rescue #C236196003Rani#CDEF lickety-split, huh?\nI'll watch from here, tepidly, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nSo, go get 'em."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1083984"
msgid "To you it may be tepid, but to another it may\nbe cold. I want you to say a specific value."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1084828"
msgid "Anyway, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF did her part.\nNow it's your turn to see it through,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085128"
msgid "If #C236196003Karna#CDEF would shut his trap, couldn't he\nbecome a sweet normie like #C236196003#NICK#CDEF? Ahh,\nbut he's such a wimpy sprout, so probs not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1085592"
msgid "…?\nIsn't \"popular\" a compliment?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086000"
msgid "The loser is doing her loser thing,\nminding her own biz over here～\nSo, get out, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF～♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1086428"
msgid "I won't be like the old man, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nHe was a real oddball."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1087988"
msgid "…you go on ahead.\nI'll catch up to you in a bit. I will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1114976"
msgid "I dare not check."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115088"
msgid "From among them, one stands out:\n\"Introduction To Curry For Dummies\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115164"
msgid "―――I'm not sure why, but I'm sad now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1115344"
msgid "One book happens to catch my eye.\nI haven't seen it before, so I take it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116780"
msgid "……huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116792"
msgid "Ah. Come on you two.\nPlease work with me here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1116944"
msgid "Let's take it from the top.\nOne, two…\nGood morning, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117032"
msgid "G-good morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117060"
msgid "G… good morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117092"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117108"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF silently smiles, coercing me for something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117180"
msgid "Do I also have to give that embarrassing greeting…?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1117256"
msgid "GOOD MORNING!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1117280"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117384"
msgid "Yep, yep! #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you're the #[friend][woman]# \nI knew you were, after all!\nWe're totes #C000246204mabu#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117520"
msgid "…#C236196003Julius#CDEF.\nA tangential question, but what is \"#C000246204mabu#CDEF\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117608"
msgid "…it's Japanese jargon expressing deep\naffection, but its meaning depends\non gender. Really… where did he…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1117720"
msgid "Oh? You won't play along?\nAs I recall, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF was always a\nrather odd fellow though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118020"
msgid "#[He][She]#'s simply stunned by your behavior, I'm sure.\nEven #C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF and I aren't used to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118296"
msgid "…!\nJust like me, he was swallowed by that \"Black Noise\"…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118376"
msgid "What's this \"Black Noise\"?\nI'm talking about #C236196003Julius#CDEF' crappy curry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118504"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118832"
msgid "How did you even make that, brother?\nDo you even know what curry is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1118972"
msgid "…sorry.\nFor me, curry is something powdered that\nI sprinkled over my rations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119292"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119516"
msgid "This classmate… that I know…\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF, never had such a friendly disposition, I'm pretty sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119824"
msgid "…but what a shame.\nIf you HAD forgotten me, this would've\nbeen a great chance to change my persona…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1119940"
msgid "…\nShould I point out how different he sounds from the old #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nwhen he says that…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120120"
msgid "A pleasure to meet you.\nI'm #C236196003Leonardo #CDEF#RUBSBistario#RUBE#C236196003B.#CDEF#REND #C236196003Harwey#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120472"
msgid "Servant, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF.\n…erm, my lord is currently exhibiting\nan innocence befitting his age."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1120580"
msgid "Thus, please excuse his slight\nselfishness. I sincerely hope that\neveryone will be tolerant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121164"
msgid "For some reason, he's a Master who's lost his Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121720"
msgid "Now that's the #C236196003Leo B. Harwey#CDEF I remember.\nThe strongest Master, accompanied by the strongest Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1121912"
msgid "…given the situation, I figured the girls\nwould be here somewhere, but if they're not,\nthen leave it be."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1122848"
msgid "About my memory loss."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1122872"
msgid "About where we are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123232"
msgid "I only faintly remember, but I was attacked\nduring the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF by black slime.\nWhen I came to, I found myself here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123512"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nMay I explain the preliminaries system?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1123904"
msgid "\"An ordinary student from the year 2000.\"\nThat's the role we were given.\nDo you remember?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124028"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124324"
msgid "It would be strange if you didn't pass\nthe preliminaries since you're contracted\nto a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124556"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124564"
msgid "I only remember the day to day of the \"preliminaries,\"\nthat abyssal darkness,\nand my Servant who kept calling out to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124696"
msgid "Um… may I, #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1124748"
msgid "After #C236196003Leo#CDEF fell here, he awoke immediately.\nBut since #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF was asleep for so long…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1125240"
msgid "Then, that #C236196003Shinji#CDEF and #C236196003Leo#CDEF were both just dreams…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126020"
msgid "My lost memory.\nI ask about why I've lost my memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126256"
msgid "I only remember my Servant and the data\nof those I fought in battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126332"
msgid "I, for example, can affirm that I hadn't\nlost yet, but I don't know how many\nrounds I got through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126560"
msgid "…I'm embarrassed to say that the same\napplies to me. Likely for your Servant as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1126852"
msgid "And because #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nwas in such a long coma…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127304"
msgid "………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127384"
msgid "N-no, nothing really.\nI was also trying to remember something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127704"
msgid "Where are we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127724"
msgid "Is this unfamiliar, wooden school building\na part of the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1127832"
msgid "It's part of the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF, but it's not where we\nwere before. This is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…\nA place outside the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128020"
msgid "The #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF is a virtual reality constructed\nby the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF to advance the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128248"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF.\nBring it up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128292"
msgid "Here, #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128324"
msgid "Thinking this might happen,\nI prepared my WKTK-diagram."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1128624"
msgid "…I was looking to make it easier to read.\nI like the occasional style in briefings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129156"
msgid "O-okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1129168"
msgid "So, this is the Far Side of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…\nOriginally, this was a sealed information\nwarehouse \"not to be used.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130124"
msgid "At any rate, we've awoken in a dangerous area."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1130876"
msgid "In these circumstances, what should we do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131316"
msgid "Yes, that's how it was. It slipped my mind.\nIn a sense, we're trapped in a one-day loop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131416"
msgid "Um, so, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI'll also loop back to the question:\nwhat do you think we should do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131736"
msgid "I'm still empty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131904"
msgid "I agree.\nThat's the best goal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1131948"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF will be delighted to hear this.\nI'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132012"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF will be delighted to hear this.\nI'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132076"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF will be delighted to hear this.\nI'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1132740"
msgid "………………huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133060"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133256"
msgid "Some Masters, in the same boat as us, are in\nthe building, so please scout top to bottom\nfor talented people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133372"
msgid "The talk ends there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1133556"
msgid "….uhh.\n   Is this really a good idea, #C236196003Leo#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1134596"
msgid "Oh, my.\nWe meet once again, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135032"
msgid "As I thought, \"#C236196003Taiga Fujimura#CDEF\" doesn't seem to be her name.\nSo, her real name is…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135136"
msgid "My name is #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF. I had the role of a\nteacher in the preliminaries.\nThat's when I met you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135460"
msgid "I'm truly glad, however. I had made my peace\nwhen I was attacked by the Black Noise,\nbut you made it out safely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135580"
msgid "―――Hold on a second."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135604"
msgid "Just now, did she say \"attacked by the Black Noise\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135868"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF's chaste clothes rustle as she holds out one hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1135956"
msgid "She may not be aware of it, but her\ngestures are excessively soft and feminine.\nMen are a given, but even women would be captivated by her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136284"
msgid "…yes. All because of this attire.\nI fell over while running and sadly\nsunk into the black mud."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136484"
msgid "…I shook my head, \"no.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1136652"
msgid "Assailed with guilt, I unconsciously lower my eyes in shame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137496"
msgid "However―――I apologize.\nI cannot join the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137560"
msgid "!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137636"
msgid "There's no way I can accept this without an explanation!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137696"
msgid "The reason is plain to see.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF, you, and the others are earnestly\nand entirely devoted to escaping."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1137816"
msgid "Mixing in someone who \"has no desire to leave\"\nwould impact your morale."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138012"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF lowers her eyes sorrowfully."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138388"
msgid "I'm not strong enough.\nHowever, maybe if #C236196003Leo#CDEF's or your Servant\ntries, perhaps you can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138712"
msgid "I don't want to become a burden on you,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1138880"
msgid "I don't know who trapped us here.\nYet, despite having this many resources at their\ndisposal, they're leaving us alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139104"
msgid "I narrowly escaped death.\nThose here now were let go out of that\n\"someone's\" pity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139196"
msgid "…#C236196003Kiara#CDEF makes a fair point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139312"
msgid "And anyway, isn't it a stretch to say they\nlet us go when they trapped us here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139488"
msgid "Still, I lack power.\nI'm sure that―――In the very end,\nI'll end up hindering everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139592"
msgid "To avoid that, I'll keep my distance.\n…like just now, avoiding people like you\nwho grieve simply for not rescuing me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1139988"
msgid "You're not like me, it seems.\nI don't need to be told so to see that.\nYour intentions are pure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140216"
msgid "Did you hear that, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140268"
msgid "Your criticism may prove useful, paltry as\nit is. Won't you give these individuals\nsome advice?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140372"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF called her Servant not by class,\nbut by their hidden #C000246204True Name#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140608"
msgid "…ah, it makes sense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140764"
msgid "A young boy appears. One could say he looks \"handsome.\"\nYet, in his eyes are the shadows of bitter despair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1140876"
msgid "#C236196003Hans Christian Andersen#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141048"
msgid "…hmph. As introduced,\nI'm the third-rate Servant, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141452"
msgid "Now that's a decent life.\nWe're all born from the womb and can\nonly laugh at the world's ugliness, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1141556"
msgid "Hm? What's with that look? What, not\nlooking for criticism? You want advice?\nMoron. Say so from the start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1142496"
msgid "Speaking the truth is my job.\nListen, a person's life has value.\nYou squander that value, she-devil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1143412"
msgid "She might change her mind with time.\nFor now, I'll settle for this―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144420"
msgid "……#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144672"
msgid "…#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nYou brought HIM?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144792"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is the one who said \"anyone is fine.\"\nIt's not my fault."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144880"
msgid "…excuse me, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nDo you have your Servant with you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1144964"
msgid "No, she's not here.\nMy god has departed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145012"
msgid "However, be enlightened knowing this: even\nwithout a Servant, I'm a famous Master.\nI won't be a bother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145508"
msgid "…it is what it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145664"
msgid "……I know you mean well,\nbut curse you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1145864"
msgid "So, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWhere is the rest of our personnel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146276"
msgid "Both #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and her Servant, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF,\naren't the type to cooperate directly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146444"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF may come around eventually,\nbut #C236196003Kiara#CDEF… I don't really get her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146568"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nWhat do you mean you \"don't get her\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1146636"
msgid "We met #C236196003Kiara Sessoyin#CDEF once.\nShe was a virtuous person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147264"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nHave you created a gate to allow us inside?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1147420"
msgid "We don't know what's going on inside, and we\ncan't scan or monitor it from here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148020"
msgid "For the time being, only #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and I will\nbackup #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148336"
msgid "The #C000246204Arena#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1148912"
msgid "Leaving here is suicidal.\nBut… I discovered a relatively stable\nstructure that leads to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149636"
msgid "Nightatbest?\nWhat place is that? Everest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1149980"
msgid "You don't have that kind of#RUBS    Magi#RUBE#C000246204 Wizard#CDEF#REND skill,\ndo you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150628"
msgid "Am I not allowed to go?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1150728"
msgid "Since it's an #C000246204Arena#CDEF, there are enemies.\nYou and I couldn't… no, even if we\ndid take down one, that would be our limit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151172"
msgid "U-uhm…\nThat wording is a little…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151216"
msgid "? How come?\nI thought I chose a totally normal word."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151280"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nWhat the lady sees as a problem is…\n*psst psst*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151352"
msgid "Ah, I get it!\nYeah, I've also heard of that meaning!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1151524"
msgid "N-nevermind, please don't bring it up again!\nHurry on now, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nPlease pretend you never heard any of this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152328"
msgid "If #C236196003Leo#CDEF can't do it, then no one can.\nHacking that door is probably impossible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152436"
msgid "Brother, aren't you exaggerating?\nI threw in the towel, but another person\nmight crack it easily, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1152872"
msgid "The conclusion is: #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF is genuine.\nHer conduct was odd, but her\ncharacter was roughly as we remembered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153632"
msgid "Marvelous as always, #C236196003Julius#CDEF.\nThen continue I shall: #C236196003Lancer#CDEF is not all that\nstrong of a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1153832"
msgid "…#C236196003Gawain#CDEF may have stated that nonchalantly,\nbut a B@ to A Servant is top class."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154516"
msgid "Now then. Presently, our progress is\nbeing impeded by these two items.\nAny questions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1154672"
msgid "Though we lack intel on \"queen\" #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nand #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, augmenting our offense should\nlet us handle them well enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155016"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155024"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF hands me data on the Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155164"
msgid "We must, it's a chance we have.\nIf we currently can't analyze it,\nthen we should let someone else try."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155272"
msgid "If she is as the rumors say, she may know\nabout illegal bypasses…\nI hope she does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1155724"
msgid "…I'll let #C236196003Gatou#CDEF do his thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156248"
msgid "About how we were obstructed by that mysterious wall\nand met with #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156600"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF clasps her hands together while blushing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156664"
msgid "Umm… why?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1156872"
msgid "She may actually be quite the oddball."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157196"
msgid "Putting that aside, I hand over the Shield data I got from #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157384"
msgid "And then―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157400"
msgid "I've seen this before.\nIt cannot be deciphered.\nNo, actually, it must never be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157628"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. This data's owner…\n\"#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF,\" was it?\nDid this person say anything peculiar?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157932"
msgid "I think she said something to that effect…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1157980"
msgid "Just as I thought.\nThat barrier is not composed from ordered logic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158700"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF said that Arena was her castle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1158956"
msgid "…please relax."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1159324"
msgid "…hmph. No use worrying now. I oppose breaking\nthis Shield… this mental wall,\nbut #C236196003Rin#CDEF is acting differently, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160000"
msgid "Welcome back, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nDid #C236196003Kiara#CDEF tell you anything that may\nlead to a clue?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160180"
msgid "Though surprised, #C236196003Leo#CDEF nods in understanding."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160252"
msgid "…#C236196003Kiara#CDEF is right.\nI study psychology, but all it amounts to is\ninformation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160552"
msgid "Thank you, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF. I'll keep that in mind.\nUnlike a one-sided faith, I'm aiming for\na more human salvation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160676"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF looked a little lonely in saying that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1160992"
msgid "In his final moments, will he realize that this\nis his limitation, his challenge…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161076"
msgid "Pardon me. I am #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF,\nhere to assis―――\nOh? How very somber it is in here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161388"
msgid "Yes, please leave it to me.\nAlthough, about all I can provide is\nan explanation and a transfer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1161568"
msgid "Yes. We'll get to that soon.\nFirst, I'll start by explaining what this\nmental wall is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1162596"
msgid "Such is the far goal all religions seek. Without\nthe third eye―the eye which \"sees\" not external\nbut internal form―one can't see minds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163240"
msgid "Oh, it's not THAT special of a technique.\nIt just finds openings in a person's mind\nand extracts dregs they don't even know of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163376"
msgid "Five Meditations… you say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1163828"
msgid "\"Hidden secrets\" are carnal desires.\nTo attain Nirvana, one engages in\nself-awareness… Sure, that makes sense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164080"
msgid "Certainly so. However, #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF is different\nfrom who she used to be, yes? I took a vow to\nsave all who are lost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1164812"
msgid "Rather than \"see through,\"\nit extracts affected areas."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1165864"
msgid "…I see. I get the theory now.\nLet's install the Five Meditations into\nour analyzer and monitor Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166000"
msgid "It'll observe the \"workings of her mind.\"\nOnce it deduces Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's secrets,\nit will physically extract them…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166152"
msgid "Am I right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166396"
msgid "Eh…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1166960"
msgid "I-I object to this!\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF mustn't be burdened with\nsuch risk!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167208"
msgid "Everyone is taken aback by #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's sudden outburst."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167400"
msgid "Only #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is unmoved.\nWith calm eyes, she smiles at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167524"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167532"
msgid "Even for exceptions, you must uphold the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's rules to your utmost, no?\nI'm asking why you decided otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167668"
msgid "Huh… U-uh…? That, err…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1167892"
msgid "Still, you won't do. Only humans can read\nemotions. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, even if you can observe,\nyou can't comprehend."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168020"
msgid "Moreover, is #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF not the one who will\nconfront #C236196003Rin#CDEF? Only #[he][she]# can do this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168156"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168168"
msgid "Does anyone else desire to object?\nIf not, then… #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, come over here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168596"
msgid "And then―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168612"
msgid "Mm―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168652"
msgid "Now THIS is unexpected!\nBrother, start recording! Quick, quick!\nUse camera 4, camera 4!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168844"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168860"
msgid "……, …………!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1168880"
msgid "……, …………, ………………!!!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169180"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is grinning, giving a thumbs up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169516"
msgid "Yes. Since #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF is a rather feisty one,\nI had narrowly almost failed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1169868"
msgid "A Wall's presence indicates that the lady,\nits source, desires help.\nThe rest depends on #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's efforts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170096"
msgid "Make a girl feel gladness; hatred;\njoy; fear―――Whatever pleases her\nwill suffice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1170696"
msgid "…y-yes. If it will assist everyone,\nthen I think it will be allowed as an exception."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171060"
msgid "…I unintentionally gulp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171388"
msgid "Neither #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Julius#CDEF, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF―――\nnor #C236196003Sakura#CDEF herself showed any hint of discontent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1171796"
msgid "O-okay.\nI appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1171948"
msgid "Wouldn't that just be peeping?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1172720"
msgid "I hear the door slide open."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173316"
msgid "\"Mhm, mhm,\" I nod to #C236196003Leo#CDEF in approval.\nWe can't let #C236196003Julius#CDEF have all the fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173432"
msgid "…you guys.\nJust what do you take me for?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173624"
msgid "Guh… what a rigid man!\nThat manner of speaking reminds me of #C236196003Lancelot#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173712"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF… I knew he was devoted to his work,\nbut not this much…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1173868"
msgid "Hey now, why apologize to me, #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1174056"
msgid "Oh? Is no one here curious?\nI'm curious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175028"
msgid "…what's with this mood?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175332"
msgid "Not really, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175652"
msgid "I ask if adding this new function caused any harm to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1175896"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF gives a slight bow, then leaves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177052"
msgid "H-hey.\nThank you very much, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177304"
msgid "Eh? Hm, I'm not sure. For some reason, I felt\nthat I just had to thank you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1177580"
msgid "Good morning.\nSince we're all here now, let's discuss our next\nplan of action."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179296"
msgid "\"You're right,\" I nod in agreement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1179888"
msgid "She might really have cast aside her pride,\nintending to beat #C236196003Leo#CDEF. Otherwise―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1180020"
msgid "…it's possible…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180172"
msgid "…she was somewhat possessed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180632"
msgid "It's simple.\nIn a way, I trust Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF more than anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180836"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181136"
msgid "But… the power gap between #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's\nServant and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF is still an issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181760"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181784"
msgid "Bwaa…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181952"
msgid "Oh?\nIsn't eavesdropping an invasion of privacy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182200"
msgid "Awawawa…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182600"
msgid "I heard the details from #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nThere's a Wall with #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's design on it,\nor so I'm told."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182880"
msgid "That sculpture must be #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's true self.\nWhat surrounds it is the heart's shell.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF's true feelings slumber within."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183040"
msgid "If you succeed in confronting her heart,\nfilled with wicked thoughts, #C236196003Rin#CDEF should be\nfreed from her shell and return to normal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183240"
msgid "But how can we get inside like #C236196003Lancer#CDEF did?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183872"
msgid "So, please be immaculate in your preparations.\nI shall wait for you in front of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's design,\nso please come by when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185320"
msgid "\"#C236196003jinaKO#CDEF\"… You―you're THAT #C236196003jinaKO#CDEF!?\nWith over 6,000 hours in FA―the\nTotal-Champ!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186624"
msgid "I am sorry.\nI did a lot of bad things.\nSo please, forget all of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186696"
msgid "Although I was being used by #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nI made trouble for you all…\nespecially for you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186820"
msgid "With a half-pout, #C236196003Rin#CDEF bows her head, \"Sorry.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187092"
msgid "The money stuff aside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187232"
msgid "…#C236196003Leo#CDEF… You really believed in me…\nI'm sorry. I misunderstood you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187556"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188820"
msgid "…I see. It's possible that #C000246204dark AI#CDEF occupied\na portion of Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's consciousness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190040"
msgid "About #C236196003BB#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190080"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190828"
msgid "If she felt like it, she could probably\n#ROFS0004#RUBS hack#RUBEcreep#REND into the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF without a scratch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191436"
msgid "It is what it is.\nYou're a properly functioning AI,\nand she's a runaway AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191676"
msgid "Hey, can you hold up for a second?\nThat \"#C236196003BB#CDEF\" girl―How can you tell for sure\nthat she's gone berserk?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192072"
msgid "…that isn't possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194328"
msgid "But… there shouldn't be any AI like #C236196003BB#CDEF\nwho are trying to capture Masters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194584"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is malfunctioning. As an AI, #C236196003BB#CDEF is failing.\nShe only seeks to expand her functionality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195384"
msgid "………yes.\nPlease think of it that way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195436"
msgid "…we must ameliorate this situation with our\nown two hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196880"
msgid "He's obviously not.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF unashamedly revealed his Servant in\nthe final selections."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199956"
msgid "Ahahahaha! \"Doing the best you can\"?\nAre you crazy? No one can be this#RUBS   bad#RUBE dumb#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200160"
msgid "Of course. The security in this old school\nis airtight. However―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200232"
msgid "Yes. Even the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is in the\n#C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF: a cloud platform where the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nperforms the basic computing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200656"
msgid "#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF, start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201640"
msgid "Ah, you over there. Uh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201720"
msgid "This program is brought to you all by\nhacking your eyes and ears鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202584"
msgid "To be honest, I was planning to explain\nonce I finished off #C236196003Rin#CDEF, buttt…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202744"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is verry sorry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203060"
msgid "―――Don't be deceived. AI doesn't lie.\nIn that moment, #C236196003BB#CDEF probably came to kill\n#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF, not you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203528"
msgid "Huh? Is that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203572"
msgid "Huh? Is that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203616"
msgid "Huh? Is that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203660"
msgid "Huh? Is that #C236196003#SVT#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204008"
msgid "Okay, no problem."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1204396"
msgid "A shield?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1204408"
msgid "A wall?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1204420"
msgid "R-18?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204544"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204780"
msgid "Just what exactly is that Shield?\nDoes everyone here know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204916"
msgid "In the Labyrinth's Core is a revolutionary,\ngirl-integrated firewall!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205080"
msgid "That means―――\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF was… being used as a human tool…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205684"
msgid "―――Wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205700"
msgid "She says that she just used #C236196003Rin#CDEF and that girl\nas Cores, meaning――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205820"
msgid "The next boss of the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF,\nthe sentimental #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF, makes her debut♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205940"
msgid "This boss is exotic and academic!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206120"
msgid "#C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206156"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206292"
msgid "………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206316"
msgid "…hmm?\nUnlike #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF doesn't talk very much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206912"
msgid "Now everyone understands, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207024"
msgid "That design is this Sentinel system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207152"
msgid "Take as much time as you need."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207804"
msgid "Ah. Just please be careful, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207840"
msgid "Fundamentally, I loathe every one of you―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207952"
msgid "and licking my lips, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208620"
msgid "Yeah. If so, then it's like #C236196003Leo#CDEF guessed.\nI don't know the reason why, but #C236196003BB#CDEF can never\nenter this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208848"
msgid "Since this school was originally a Near Side\nstructure, #C236196003BB#CDEF can't interfere very well―\nI think. I'm also controlling it right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209000"
msgid "The bad news follows the good. The point behind\nthe #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF is baffling, but we've learned\nsomething new from it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210508"
msgid "Because of you, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, we were able to expose\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF's embarrassing secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210624"
msgid "Th-that was YOUR doing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210656"
msgid "Well then, I have a question. #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nCould it be that you knew about #C236196003BB#CDEF for some\ntime now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211320"
msgid "――――――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211336"
msgid "…#C236196003Kiara#CDEF was already captured by #C236196003BB#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211580"
msgid "\"Whoever crowded us in here is merciful.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211656"
msgid "So that's what she meant… but how did #C236196003Leo#CDEF\ncome to realize this fact, I wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212112"
msgid "Oh dear. You give me too much credit.\nI'm not that much of a witty woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212200"
msgid "A pact with #C236196003BB#CDEF… basically, a contract.\nWhat are the details? If you oppose her, a\ncollar will explode, sort of thing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212584"
msgid "…you have the same idea as #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nUntil then, like #C236196003Shinji#CDEF, you'll spectate?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213172"
msgid "Indeed so. As long as I don't tarry in the\nStudent Council Room, to #C236196003BB#CDEF I am\n\"simply in the school\" and nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213440"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF bowed, then exited.\nAfter she said all that, we can't stop her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214364"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF is firm and tough, after all.\nIf we leave her be, she should spring\nback in no time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214584"
msgid "Do you think that #C236196003BB#CDEF uses #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF because\nshe's the same type of AI as you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214840"
msgid "All #C236196003BB#CDEF can do is modify the system and produce\n#C000246204Sentinels#CDEF… I believe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214972"
msgid "She can't fight on her own―――So that's it.\nThey're pawns… that's why she's preparing\n#C000246204Sentinels#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215380"
msgid "#C236196003President Leeeooo#CDEF! Somewhat resembling my\nbeauteous god, oh beautiful #C236196003President Leeeooo#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215652"
msgid "Ah! Ouch, oucchh! The glasses girl! When the\nglasses girl denies the entire loser of a man,\nthe 40-somethings will go extinct!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215968"
msgid "…his words are incoherent, but I at least got\nthat #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is desperate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216220"
msgid "Wooooooah! Red! In any case, it's the red one!\nThe red flappy girl and a glasses flappy\ngirl are attacking me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216548"
msgid "Waaaaaaaaaaaaaahh! Lifeguards!\nMass-re-cruit-ing-now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216752"
msgid "……welp. I was just getting tired o' grinding,\nso I'll monitor as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216836"
msgid "…things just got out of hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217404"
msgid "Good work. It's unfortunate that we didn't\nfind #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, but above all, you're safe,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217904"
msgid "Having #C236196003Rin#CDEF work on my backup gives me hope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218124"
msgid "I requested to trade the risky jobs off\nto #C236196003Julius#CDEF, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219220"
msgid "This conforms to the #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219736"
msgid "I only know this much: within our #C000246204Holy Grail\nWar#CDEF, only two people had the qualities to\nendure a Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220104"
msgid "Before #C236196003BB#CDEF can secure new #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF, let's\nacquire #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF and break through\nthe Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220268"
msgid "#C000246204SG#CDEF… #C000246204SG#CDEF, huh…\nI'm against forcibly exposing a person's\nsecrets, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220472"
msgid "All we can do is have #C236196003Rani#CDEF show us an\nembarrassing episode like with me, right…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222388"
msgid "Put your feet up, #C236196003Rin#CDEF. Workers be losers,\nya know? It's old net slang."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222648"
msgid "Typically, hedonists don't rush through life\nbecause they're reckless,\nthey simply don't have any boundaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222764"
msgid "Limitless consumption and growth, huh?\nThat lifestyle is very like Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nIt clashes with my own, but I get it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222996"
msgid "Nothing that physical.\nI just want to have myself more\ndelicious feasts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224848"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224864"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224876"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224888"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225052"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225068"
msgid "Those two."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225212"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF, what's wrong?\nShowing such raw hostility is unlike you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225344"
msgid "…I apologize, #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nHowever, this concerns my oath to you.\nI must not let―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227164"
msgid "Therefore, don't you have any regret for that\nas a Servant? This time you can serve a\nrighteous king."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228380"
msgid "As you said, our principles differ.\nIt was meaningless to even exchange words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228600"
msgid "Similarly, I―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1228624"
msgid "……………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228860"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF disappears with scorn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228996"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229012"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229044"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nWhy did you speak out all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229156"
msgid "\"I think that's wrong.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229220"
msgid "Wrong, about what?\nNaturally you would defend #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF,\nbeing his Master and all, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229332"
msgid "I know.\nEverything #C236196003Gawain#CDEF said was correct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229536"
msgid "Nevertheless, he's no murderer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229888"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, with scorn, disappears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230608"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, can you add a closet facility\nto My Room?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230728"
msgid "Y-yes, of course.\nThen I'll transfer your new clothes to\nyour closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230812"
msgid "Thanks. Since it'll be there,\nplease #C000246204go change in your room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231444"
msgid "O-okay…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232184"
msgid "Could it really be that she thinks\nshe \"has no more secrets\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232976"
msgid "But, no program is perfect. Even if each\nindividual part is perfect, when two parts\ncollide, the reaction can breed flaws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233176"
msgid "If you can agitate, or even make #C236196003Rani#CDEF excited,\nyou might be able to get a glimpse of her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233304"
msgid "…the hell are you―― Don't talk to me!\nUnlike you, I'm busy, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233704"
msgid "Did you know? Conflict only breaks out\nbetween those of equal levels.\nKid bait only baits kids."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233812"
msgid "Thaaat aside…\nWhy do you know about Darling's problems?\nDid you eavesdrop in so-me-whe-re, hmmm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234600"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF doesn't know much about real,\ninterpersonal relationships. Do you, #C236196003Karna#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235292"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's final secret… Hmm.\nIt's difficult to say, since I've never met\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF… What's your take, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235924"
msgid "…are you serious? A harpy like you should\nbe able to smell a fragrant girl's pretension\nall the way from the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236184"
msgid "…I don't understand what you mean, but…\nhave you completely figured out #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236292"
msgid "Yes. Thus, I can't give advice. Giving a girl's\nsecret to outsiders is the height of stupidity.\nLike praising flowers while you pluck them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236568"
msgid "Or what, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nAre you telling me to become an honest writer,\nputting the plain truth down with my pen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236700"
msgid "…*sigh*. You really are a pain to deal with.\nI apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease seek help from someone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237016"
msgid "Heh…\nLooks like you need my help, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237356"
msgid "Hmm. Let's take a break in My Room for now,\nDarling～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237420"
msgid "#C236196003Tamamo#CDEF's brain is wiped out from\nthinking too much. Let's have ourselves\nsomething sugary, real sugary鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238808"
msgid "Ehhh. #C236196003Shinji#CDEF, beating THAT human computer?\n…maybe I shouldn't say so.\nHe seems pretty determined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238940"
msgid "Divinations sometimes come true, and sometimes\ndon't. Anyway, we won't know unless we try.\n\"Kelp,\" was your name, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239368"
msgid "King? Well, sure I guess. I AM the Game Champ.\nI practically sweat auras!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239536"
msgid "Dang, he looks so cool…\nAh, uh, not that he could beat my #C236196003Rider#CDEF!\n…as long as she's not hammered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240024"
msgid "Congratulations.\nYou extracted #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF safe and sound."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240896"
msgid "Anyway, it didn't matter to me at all! All it\ndid was flare up my desire to fight! Like, \"If\nyou came to get me, I'll beat you to a pulp!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242240"
msgid "…she's crafty. She spoke of a stage or some\nsuch, but that there is a countermeasure\nagainst #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242584"
msgid "Hehe――I'll use your lives to set\nthe finest stage you'll ever get to see.\nBe glad you get to contribute to my beauty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243192"
msgid "We can't let that happen…!\nWe need to stop #C236196003Lancer#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243456"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, please hurry to the Labyrinth.\nWe'll contact #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nPlease meet up with #C236196003Rani#CDEF face-to-face!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244132"
msgid "If she escapes, we'll be right back at square\none. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. After you free #C236196003Rani#CDEF, don't\nrelax. Continue to the end and capture #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244676"
msgid "Alright. Then hurry. No time to dawdle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245092"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245324"
msgid "…um. Are you really going in there?\nThis #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF is different from the one before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245432"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's stats surpass your Servant's,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Your chance of winning, counting\na standard deviation, is 40%."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245588"
msgid "While I say that I'll back you up,\nI don't believe that you can win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245720"
msgid "…so, please answer me this.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Why do you fight?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246204"
msgid "Ah, of course.\nIf we don't stop #C236196003BB#CDEF now, things\nwill become even worse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246528"
msgid "So…\nUm, please make it back safe and sound!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246576"
msgid "Eh, u-uh…\nDo I seem like I'm in pain…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246624"
msgid "She does, at least to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246660"
msgid "She's an AI whose thinking may differ from my own,\nbut I saw with my own eyes that she was suffering."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246968"
msgid "…………\n…………\n…………um, err."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247028"
msgid "May I hear that one more time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247220"
msgid "………um.\nAs an AI that manages everyone's health,\nhearing this is strange…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247580"
msgid "Everyone has the same gloomy expression.\nThey must know that #C236196003BB#CDEF prepared new #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF…\nor rather, two#RUBS   Alter Egos#RUBE#C000246204 offshoots#CDEF#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248000"
msgid "Yes. Allowing a good recuperation will help.\nEmotional support is important."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248084"
msgid "That tanned girl's cruel verbal abuse almost\ncaused my ego to collapse. As you can see\nthough, I'm the usual #C236196003Monji#CDEF again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248500"
msgid "But I shall pass on Japanese plums!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248624"
msgid "What is this \"Silver Ash,\" #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248904"
msgid "#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF…… to compare\nthe troop's supply line to gold and silver\nmakes you quite a worthy man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250420"
msgid "We'll be fine.\nOnce you get some sleep and recharge, we'll put\nyou right back to work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250920"
msgid "…is that so? I certainly have been keeping\nat it. Her work may be in health management,\nbut it's tough to fool #C236196003Sakura#CDEF… an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251772"
msgid "…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251780"
msgid "What happened? #C236196003Sakura#CDEF crumples from the knees suddenly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251852"
msgid "……, ………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252152"
msgid "I'm okay.\nMy processing just, like, got a bit heavy,\nis all…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252336"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF. Please give Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF a hand.\nTake #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252456"
msgid "N-no, umm!\nI'm fine!\nI can't be resting before everyone else――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252964"
msgid "…that's… right.\nI understand.\nPardon me then, everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253308"
msgid "…#C236196003Leo#CDEF is right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254052"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nToday's… no, did you sleep well last night?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255656"
msgid "Oh, looks like you've relaxed.\nYou're grinning from ear to ear, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255984"
msgid "Please come in.\nEveryone is gathered here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256144"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF! She's up and about already…!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1256396"
msgid "No, you look great."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257868"
msgid "What do you think, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nStrict, right from her acceptance speech!\nTruly dependable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258180"
msgid "Overcoming the Labyrinth is a great\nphysical strain on #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258272"
msgid "Damage recovers automatically with rest, so\nthat is okay. Food, however, gives mental\ncalories to one's soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258680"
msgid "Did I say something strange?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258852"
msgid "Thanks to #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF and I were\nreleased from #C236196003BB#CDEF's control and freed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259136"
msgid "Or so we were thinking…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259216"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF created new pawns, #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF, and used\nthem as Cores to further extend the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259420"
msgid "However, that \"end\" was moved further into\na deeper layer. #C236196003BB#CDEF has added to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259528"
msgid "I surmise that the space #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF saw was\npart of a drill #C236196003BB#CDEF was using to burrow through\nthe #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF… no, the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259800"
msgid "Hmm? Doesn't that seem odd?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260416"
msgid "If #C236196003BB#CDEF keeps adding #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF and #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF,\ncould it be that we'll never reach the \"end\"\nfor all eternity?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260576"
msgid "That's…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260680"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF were the only Masters I could\nuse as #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF, and there are only\ntwo #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261376"
msgid "Get ready!\n#C000246204BeeeBeee,#CDEF #C000246204Channnnelll#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261860"
msgid "Ahh, how can this be…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262052"
msgid "Good evening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262252"
msgid "Your horror, #C236196003BB#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263556"
msgid "I laughed so hard I cried!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263804"
msgid "Abandon me to her #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263936"
msgid "Ah! Oopsies, that was a secret♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264796"
msgid "―――#C236196003Saber#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265168"
msgid "―――#C236196003Archer#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265588"
msgid "How about penciling us into your time schedule\nand giving us health management?\nI just reconsidered it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265712"
msgid "N-no, that's not important.\nIt sounded like #C236196003Archer#CDEF just showered\n#C236196003BB#CDEF in praise…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266100"
msgid "I mean, look. This TV show is like, all glitzy,\nit feels like I fit right in!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266320"
msgid "Dammit.\nI swung at her speedily without thinking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266488"
msgid "Oww. Your comeback was so speedy…\nBut thanks to that, I snapped out of it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266692"
msgid "――――Wow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266716"
msgid "By the way, mind giving me your\nsparrow friend's number, #C236196003Caster#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266824"
msgid "Waaaahhh…\nI don't! I don't have such a thing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267576"
msgid "#C236196003Gi-Gilgamesh#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267912"
msgid "Huh?\nMy improvised \"Adore #C236196003BB#CDEF Brainwashing Song\"\nwas cleared away?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268008"
msgid "…tch.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF is a real pain, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268232"
msgid "And with that, we'll call it a day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268872"
msgid "My sights returned to the Student Council Room,\nwithout any hint of dizziness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268960"
msgid "…that broadcast show is finally over, right?\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, can't we block it out?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269140"
msgid "I can expel viruses like the one just now,\nbut #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF is akin to a texture overwrite."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269496"
msgid "…now I see, after having returned here. #C236196003BB#CDEF is\nan abnormality. Escaping the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF is\nimportant, but we have to hurry and catch her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269784"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF casts a calm gaze over the Student Council members."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270068"
msgid "Yes.\nGetting back our [#C000246204Memories#CDEF]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270128"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF showed that she's capable of using mind\nmanipulation, albeit weakly. Thus, she must\nhold the missing portion of our #C000246204Memories#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270596"
msgid "No need, #C236196003Chief Gatou#CDEF. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF confirmed\nsomething before. She says that in the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, there are some Absolute Rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271060"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is an AI made by #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\neven if she has gone rogue. She must be\nstoring our #C000246204Memories#CDEF as data somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271440"
msgid "Impractical…?\nWhat do you mean, Miss #C236196003Rani#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271932"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF has to be careful of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's\nsurveillance. If the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF catches her,\neven #C236196003BB#CDEF will be instantly disassembled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272260"
msgid "If it's discovered that such data exists,\nit'll trace right back to the offender…\nThe abnormality #C236196003BB#CDEF will be exposed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272596"
msgid "Hmm…\nShe can't erase the memory she acquired…\nSo AI had an Absolute Rule like that, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272732"
msgid "It's fine if#RUBS   humans#RUBE we#REND just forget on our own,\nbut since those #C000246204Memories#CDEF were \"stolen by #C236196003BB#CDEF,\"\nshe can't erase them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272924"
msgid "But something's strange… If #C236196003BB#CDEF can disassemble\nand absorb Masters like she does Servants,\ncouldn't she just do that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274028"
msgid "If we encounter them in the Labyrinth,\nthey'll likely attack without mercy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274208"
msgid "Traversing the new #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF before #C236196003BB#CDEF\nappends to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274476"
msgid "Got it, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274512"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275896"
msgid "That isn't possible. #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are beings born\nfrom rogue AI and are even more evil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276244"
msgid "Those girls are beings we cannot allow to exist.\nIf they aren't terminated, surely―――\nthey'll bring harm to everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276752"
msgid "That sounds more nefarious than unique.\nYou're picking up #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's mindset of\ndestroying things, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277764"
msgid "Oh, hey.\nBefore that, #C000246204please head over to Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278000"
msgid "I've sent #C236196003Kiara#CDEF the results of your search,\nso please ask for her impression… her advice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278504"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF smiles gracefully."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278804"
msgid "―――Oh dear.\nSurely you don't need to be so humble.\nYou really are so innocent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279300"
msgid "However―――It also brings blossom\nto flowers. I love such flowers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279380"
msgid "By all means, please come to know that\npain in your own way. I'll be supporting you,\nin secret."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279808"
msgid "…yes. No matter how inexperienced or\nself-righteous she may be.\nA loving mind is always a vivid thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280532"
msgid "I want to ask about #C000246204SGs#CDEF.\nCan they be extracted from #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF too?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281648"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281660"
msgid "Please be careful.\nConfronting an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF means entering\ntheir space."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282808"
msgid "No. #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's first #C000246204SG#CDEF that you\nobtained yesterday was itself a big hint\nabout our #C000246204Memories#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284056"
msgid "H-huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284132"
msgid "This wouldn't even take me three seconds.\nSo? What's in it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284300"
msgid "To be frank: it's trash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284456"
msgid "I'm so sorry, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. I made a mistake\nwith my decision and ended up\nwasting your time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284872"
msgid "This time, we'll focus on tackling #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285264"
msgid "Good morning. We're finally at the ninth floor,\nthe last of this Labyrinth's Core―\nthe #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285496"
msgid "Hm. #C236196003President Leo#CDEF. Defeating #C236196003BB#CDEF isn't included?\nShe's none other than the root of all evil,\na venomous scorpion we must drive away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285664"
msgid "It's necessary to dispatch #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, as she's\nforming the Shields; but dispatching #C236196003BB#CDEF depends\non the circumstances. Think of it like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286124"
msgid "Just a Servant Eater, possessing a\nspecialized anti-Servant virus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287224"
msgid "…that's IF the time format here is\nthe same format as over there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287588"
msgid "She added floors due to us reaching the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288588"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF observes and records all. If it\nidentifies missing #C000246204memories#CDEF in a participant,\nit should immediately restore them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289584"
msgid "…judging by the result, yes.\nI could conjecture as to why this occurred,\nbut I have no solid evidence yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289708"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. If possible,\nplease find one of those cubes again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289796"
msgid "With two samples, if the same result occurs,\nthen it won't be a conjecture:\nI'll be able to propose a hypothesis."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291008"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF zeroed in on him…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291776"
msgid "Welcome back.\nWhile you were on the way,\nwe drafted our next strategy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291876"
msgid "The whereabouts of our \"#C000246204Memories#CDEF\"\nand the ninth floor Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291960"
msgid "We expect to settle these two matters\nby stirring the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292448"
msgid "#C000246204Breast Valley#CDEF… The special disposal\nspace in #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's chest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292552"
msgid "If we're talking about being \"firmly secure,\"\nthen there isn't a more suitable hiding place than that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292656"
msgid "It's not a place we can\nsearch unless we capture #C236196003Lip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292728"
msgid "*cou-cough* …ugh.\nSorry, my throat is just acting up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294020"
msgid "I would've never thought that #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF\nwouldn't even fight us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294220"
msgid "Yes. Capturing #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF on one's\nown is a hard task."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294540"
msgid "…#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, huh? Sure, even if #C236196003Lip#CDEF attacked her,\nshe could hold out with her Servant.\nBut would she actually cooperate with us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294708"
msgid "This kind of thing is #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's area of\nexpertise. Right, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nPlease start by bringing her over here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295104"
msgid "#[Oh God no!][Spare me!]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295340"
msgid "Alright, please go ahead and persuade #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nWe'll be here readying strategies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295440"
msgid "I relented and took up persuading #C236196003Jinako#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295980"
msgid "That's right. I did meet her in that\nhumiliating game of mahjong, but it was in\nan accelerated subspace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296208"
msgid "…yeah.\n#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's servant is strong.\nWe can't ignore that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296640"
msgid "…………………………\n…………………………\n………………………'kay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296796"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296812"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296828"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296844"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296912"
msgid "…what's with this reaction?\nWhy are most of you on mute?\nOh, and buzz off, old man. For real."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297260"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297524"
msgid "So, can I leave now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297552"
msgid "S-sorry!\nWe didn't mean it like that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298188"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF likely possesses our [#C000246204Memories#CDEF]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298544"
msgid "With that said, we want #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, who has a\nServant, to enter the Labyrinth\nalongside #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298672"
msgid "The two of us, do a pincer attack…\nIt's pretty simple for a strategy, but you know,\nisn't it futile?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298788"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF can pop out and disappear at will.\nEven with a pincer attack, she'll just go\n\"I'm embarrassed!\" and run off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299036"
msgid "Yes, that's correct.\nSo for that reason, we'll have you\npretend to be #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's lover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299168"
msgid "――――Eh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299188"
msgid "――――Oh m～y."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299212"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299228"
msgid "W-what is this man saying!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299316"
msgid "In addition, yet ANOTHER rival!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299352"
msgid "Uhuh.\nHave #C236196003Jinako#CDEF pretend to be my lover.\nRight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299428"
msgid "―――Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299444"
msgid "I see, very impressive.\n―――so what da fuck did you just say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299508"
msgid "As I said, you'll behave like\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's lover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299576"
msgid "It's obvious to anyone that #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF\nis obsessed with #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300156"
msgid "Wha―――wait a sec!\nNo one told me about THIS!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300212"
msgid "Decoys, lovers―Why not just have\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF or #C236196003Rani#CDEF do all that then!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300320"
msgid "We would very much love to do so, but we have\nno Servants. If we get attacked by #C236196003Lip#CDEF,\nit's an instant whammy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300628"
msgid "Decoys, lovers―Why not just have\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF or #C236196003Shinji#CDEF do all that then!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301056"
msgid "Ughh… I don't remember saying that,\nbut that WAS a LONG play time…\nI probably just let that one slip…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301504"
msgid "A-alright, I got it.\nBut, even if I'm fine with it, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF\nmight be against it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301600"
msgid "Aren't you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302072"
msgid "S-see, #[he][she]#'s okay with―――\nH-huh?\n\"Okay,\" with it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302152"
msgid "\"Yeah, I don't mind,\" I said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302320"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302400"
msgid "The #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF will come attack just\nby you being together with #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303180"
msgid "I only see #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Leo#CDEF, and #C236196003Gawain#CDEF in the room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303488"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304204"
msgid "She also handles the #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF.\nLet's have her debug herself, and afterwards,\nwe can challenge the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304872"
msgid "……me? #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, can you hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305960"
msgid "…now I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306248"
msgid "That might explain the result,\nher falling into a state of panic―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307076"
msgid "The only one not here is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\nwho turned into a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307192"
msgid "Ah, you're here, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307408"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307424"
msgid "………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307440"
msgid "――――――."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307564"
msgid "Everyone… excluding #C236196003Gatou#CDEF… has their lips sealed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307792"
msgid "…………sorry.\nIf only I was faster in catching\n#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307984"
msgid "It's not your fault, brother.\nIf anything, it's my fault for letting #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nend up alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308164"
msgid "……………I guess so.\nHearing that is a big relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308532"
msgid "Sh-shut it!\nI was born with blue hair!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308792"
msgid "What are you on about?\nYour entire BODY is shaking!\nIt's a super vibration piston."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309216"
msgid "Preparations to release the memory cube are\ncomplete. #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, please handle any mental care\nnecessary, just in case."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309552"
msgid "If a serious conflict like that occurs,\nthat will truly complicate things.\nSo, I'll be here at the ready to help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309680"
msgid "…indeed.\nWorst case, two exterior personalities\nwill manifest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310168"
msgid "#C080080080I saw,\n     fragmented, yet vivid flashbacks of vivid battles.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311128"
msgid "#C080080080\"#C120200255Alice#CDEF#C080080080,\" the ghost,#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311312"
msgid "#C080080080I remembered. No, I regained.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311840"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, are you okay!?\nPlease hold on…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312196"
msgid "Heh…\nGwahaaahahahahahahahaha!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312316"
msgid "You… ug…\n…ug… ughh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312600"
msgid "………\nThat figures."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312872"
msgid "However… I can verify only my own records.\nThe most I can recall is who fought against who."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313044"
msgid "How about you, brother?\nI expect you kept pace with me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313160"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF looks over towards me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314148"
msgid "…our memories were deprived to preserve peace\nin this old school… Is it so, #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314444"
msgid "…not a single hand is raised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314540"
msgid "…that said, I myself don't even know any\nof #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's personal details."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314652"
msgid "Haha… ha…\nI kinda, knew it…\nI knew it…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314736"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314952"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF isn't acting normal."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1315208"
msgid "Live and learn, Shinji."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315232"
msgid "W-what did I remember…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315596"
msgid "FINE. I'm fine, so just leave me alone!\nThis shouldn't be…\nThis isn't how it should be for me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315696"
msgid "…#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is covering his face with his hands,\nmuttering to himself…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316552"
msgid "Yep. I have no recollection of #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317216"
msgid "Thinking so, I go to ask again about her\nkidnapping, then see #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317532"
msgid "Wha―!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317540"
msgid "――――――!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317828"
msgid "That's the way! Nice lunch!\nNice sugar!\nNice caramel!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319172"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, are you okay?\nThat circuit was especially demanding on you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319284"
msgid "Thanks, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319920"
msgid "For sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320172"
msgid "You damn voyeur!\nI could say the exact same things about you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320724"
msgid "This is bad.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, we can talk later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321376"
msgid "To help my fellow peon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322232"
msgid "That's not true… is what I would like to say,\nbut my level of alertness certainly\nHAS gone down. I'll be more cautious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323072"
msgid "Yet… it's amazing that #C236196003BB#CDEF was able to\ninduce such remarkable manifestations\nof the human mind's ways."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323232"
msgid "Every human tries to hide a guilty conscience.\nEven I'm no exception to that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324652"
msgid "F-fainted―――!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324900"
msgid "I was respecting #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's own wishes…\nBut not letting you all know\nwas an oversight on my part. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325044"
msgid "Huh―――Well, okay.\nAs long as you feel some remorse…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325972"
msgid "―――#C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326440"
msgid "Yeah.\nWould've been nice if you remembered\nthat from the beginning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326512"
msgid "It would've saved me the pain of this process of\nelimination, salvaging highly concealed battle\ndata one by one until the very LAST set!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327264"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF didn't lose in a \"battle between Masters.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328024"
msgid "We recovered the cube from #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF and\nregained our memories. Although it did leave\nEVERYONE considerably confused―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328288"
msgid "…who are we supposed to blame here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328372"
msgid "Having recalled that memory,\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF probably didn't have the willpower to defy #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328672"
msgid "Her actions are baffling. Her optimism is as\nbrittle as sculpted candy, and her escapism is\nas useful as burying her head in sand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329092"
msgid "…#C236196003Gatou#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF's conflicting exchange continues."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329764"
msgid "I won't tell you to be peaceful anymore.\nI don't see it unseemly to injure one another.\nThat said―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329872"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, I believe that you'll be the one\nto break this absurd spiral of us having to\nhurt our allies to continue forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331412"
msgid "And Zeno's arrow has finally hit the target."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331772"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332344"
msgid "We'll hit the goal before #C236196003BB#CDEF catches on to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333052"
msgid "That's WAY out there, that can't―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334000"
msgid "…so listen everyone.\nBefore that happens, please, stop #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334832"
msgid "…………I give a stiff nod."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334864"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF smiles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334896"
msgid "She holds firm like she usually does,\nbut her eyes are somewhat swollen.\nIt looks like she hardly got any rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335312"
msgid "Ultimately, no one here shunned the act of\nsacrificing the defeated to\nput themselves ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335704"
msgid "…but right now, she's also fallen into a trap\nand is frightened of us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336296"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF suddenly stands up, then comes over to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336364"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF has answered our request and\nfinished her preparations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336444"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336460"
msgid "…………?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336472"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF, behaving formally, fixes her gaze on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336540"
msgid "…#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, I also have hope in you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338396"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Have some coffee.\nIt's #RUBS an instant#RUBEa simple#REND #RUBSrecipe#RUBEblend#REND, but it's tasty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338808"
msgid "Still… no, that's EXACTLY why I mustn't lose spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339008"
msgid "What is this…….?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339456"
msgid "#C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339672"
msgid "From what we know, after these seven days,\n40% of humanity will have perished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339752"
msgid "40%――\nSuppose someone had ten friends.\nFour of them would die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340180"
msgid "I'll help as much as I can.\nSo―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340336"
msgid "Until then, we can't give up―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340456"
msgid "…that's right.\nAs an AI, I also can't let #C236196003BB#CDEF go unchecked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341912"
msgid "…I don't expect her to have not realized this\nmassive problem…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342344"
msgid "Yippee! No introduction!\n#C000246204BB!!!!#CDEF\n#C000246204CHAAANNEELLL!!#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346936"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346948"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347132"
msgid "Likewise. Therefore,\nDO NOT dig up what's dead and buried\nfrom when we were Sentinels."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347296"
msgid "Silence!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1347308"
msgid "SORRY, MA'AM!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347328"
msgid "……*sigh*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348088"
msgid "And yet, these girls assert that we'll be fine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348508"
msgid "Okay! I'll make one now.\nI'll add a little more sugar to keep your\nhead from being overworked!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348916"
msgid "…go for it, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF, our new President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349068"
msgid "Maybe #C236196003Leo#CDEF can pull it off, but I know\nI'm not fit to inspire these members."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349628"
msgid "By showing us the future, she'll stir you up,\nget you to fight her, then make you despair…\nAnd sit perfectly in the palm of her hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349764"
msgid "Regardless, #C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF is a trustworthy\nsimulator. There's no sense in not using it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350572"
msgid "G-good morning, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350604"
msgid "You came right on time.\nWe just got a report on the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350912"
msgid "Knew? Endeavor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351148"
msgid "I wonder if #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are getting enough sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351600"
msgid "No dumpster diving this dungeon.\nYou can manage, right, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351808"
msgid "Umm, Senpai?\nIf it's any consolation, please take this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352256"
msgid "Morning. Sleep well?\n…hm? What's that mail you got there?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352524"
msgid "It's probably a trap, in all likelihood.\nBe careful, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. There are Charm\nand#ROFS-002#RUBScompulsion#RUBE Geas#REND programs mixed in with that food."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352796"
msgid "With that… I wonder where #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353192"
msgid "In the process of doing so, #C236196003BB#CDEF ended up\nhogging various #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF systems to herself\nand modifying them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353436"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's stance toward protecting us is\nconsidered illegal within the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353792"
msgid "Wh――wh-what the…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353820"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF never mentioned a word of this to me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1355708"
msgid "It's not realized through pure defense.\nIt's clearly a skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1355880"
msgid "Of course!\n#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are Servant composites."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1355944"
msgid "Maybe one of the goddesses #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF\nis based on has a relevant background."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1356624"
msgid "It's about as burdening as when you're in\nthe Labyrinth, and I put that effect on you\nto protect against essence dissolution."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1356824"
msgid "So long as I'm here, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's tasks won't go up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1357160"
msgid "Of course.\nIt's like the DNA pattern of a soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1357408"
msgid "―――And here they are.\n103 matching results."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1358104"
msgid "What? Nonsense, there's NO way!\nShe's invincible by DEFAULT!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1358272"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body flicks, as if jolted by something.\nHer eyes are blank, and her body is spasming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1358384"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF!? What happ――!?\nShe's being hacked directly by\nthe Spiritron data…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1359320"
msgid "Ugh…!\nPlease… protect my… ego-border…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1360424"
msgid "Hehe. I'll also be taking your Servant\nfor myself, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nThis world will only be for me and him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1361032"
msgid "Don't look so down. Who do you think I am?\nI've cleared up pinches like this\nplenty of times before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1362368"
msgid "You want to borrow my Code Cast?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1363404"
msgid "Ermm…\nI'm uncertain as to what to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1363448"
msgid "I also hope it can help you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF…\nBut in return, I won't get, umm…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1364144"
msgid "Like a child who doesn't want to get out of bed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1365320"
msgid "…makes no dang sense…\nJust what is that brat thinking…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1365456"
msgid "That #C236196003Kiara#CDEF woman isn't worth being understood.\nThat brat on the other hand…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1365644"
msgid "Frankly, I can't understand why someone as\nresourceful as #C236196003Andersen#CDEF bothers to rouse\na creature like her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1366716"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1366912"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1367724"
msgid "Please go on ahead and rest, President.\nI'll clean up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1368056"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF is scowling at the monitor, brow furrowed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1368216"
msgid "The three of us are in for some tough fights ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1368276"
msgid "I'm ready for it, but still,\neveryone is far too on edge…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1368448"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's smile was undoubtedly one of concern for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1368516"
msgid "\"Did something happen?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1368540"
msgid "I ask again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1369584"
msgid "We're fighting to prevent this damage.\nIt all depends on you, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1370380"
msgid "…I wonder if it's despair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1370412"
msgid "I think they learned an unbearable truth\nand are desperately trying to hide it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1370504"
msgid "…sorry.\nWe can't say anything for sure yet.\nBut…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1370568"
msgid "It's not that we're fighting to stop #C236196003BB#CDEF.\n…we may be fighting to change our destiny."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1370796"
msgid "Stop. Change."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1371300"
msgid "Since #C236196003Kiara#CDEF was destroyed by #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nsomeone has to take #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1371920"
msgid "Ah, ahem, ahem.\nSooo, I'll master this somehow, and you just\nlook forward to it, okay, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1372420"
msgid "No more games from this floor on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1372532"
msgid "Ugh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1372540"
msgid "…could it be?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1372556"
msgid "Don't tell me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1377796"
msgid "Her usual self, huh…\nShe wasn't putting much attention on toying\nwith you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1378320"
msgid "…alright.\nLet's ignore #C236196003BB#CDEF's enthusiasm for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1378792"
msgid "Given this, I can only be sure that…\nsince it's the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's offense versus its\ndefense, it may never have an outcome. Or――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1379852"
msgid "It should be gone now,\nso go through it to get to the 16th floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1380060"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is a fiendish AI.\nI amplified the jamming so that she\nwon't detect you, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1381528"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1382076"
msgid "…then we have no choice but to have her\nput up with it for us.\nAs a technician, I feel ashamed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1382508"
msgid "…#C236196003#NICK#CDEF. Once you settle down,\ngo to the Infirmary. That girl seems to\nenjoy it when you visit her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1382628"
msgid "I propose the same.\nPlease treat #C236196003Sakura#CDEF well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1383992"
msgid "―――Well, that's―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1384040"
msgid "I also have an opinion on that.\nWould you like to hear it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1384104"
msgid "Now it's #C236196003Rani#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1384288"
msgid "You're becoming essential to her existence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1384456"
msgid "…erm, this is nothing more than speculation,\nbut perhaps #C236196003Sakura#CDEF likes you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1385168"
msgid "Please be as sincere with her as you can.\nI'll also be giving it my all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1387844"
msgid "Apparently, something minor happened before I stopped by."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1387904"
msgid "Did something happen?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1388036"
msgid "I-I keep the old school building perfectly\nsanitary…!\nNo bug will get past me, not while I'M alive!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1388340"
msgid "I made them angry…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1388744"
msgid "―――So, what was he looking for?\nGive us more details about that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1388812"
msgid "I figured he would do this eventually…\nHas that boy sunk this low?\nSo, what did he steal?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1389308"
msgid "Only #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is able to use it.\nIt's just poison if we use it; a cursed item,\nso to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1389744"
msgid "But――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1390048"
msgid "What does #C236196003Shinji#CDEF intend to do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1390720"
msgid "Oh, yes.\nI'll lend a hand if I can be of use."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1390980"
msgid "That's not all. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nWhere's the other data #C236196003Archer#CDEF left you with?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1391896"
msgid "Is that so…? I understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1392536"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. You're both\nphysically and mentally sound―the good old\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF we know and love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1392768"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1393216"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1393280"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF is here, so let's be efficient."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1393492"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1393688"
msgid "Ah… I'm glad you're happy and all,\nbut let us finish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1393968"
msgid "She took control of the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's\nmanagement system and altered one\nfundamental rule:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1394576"
msgid "So, if I check the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's management system\nand remove the bug, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF will revert\nto normal, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1394740"
msgid "Ah… but that won't be possible… #C236196003BB#CDEF controls\nthe #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, so I can no longer\nperform system checks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1394888"
msgid "Correct. Therefore, #C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF must\ntravel to the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's management system to\nlift #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's invincibility―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1395076"
msgid "Which means, #[he][she]# must reach the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Central Region#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1395976"
msgid "You and your Servant will stroll into\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell's Central Region#CDEF on your own\nand access the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's key systems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1396492"
msgid "I know.\nSo long as there's a chance, it's a risk worth taking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1397184"
msgid "Please trust me to keep you pointed\ntowards the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF after you\nenter the Central Region, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1397552"
msgid "Then, as soon as you reach the Shield,\nwe'll break it down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1397788"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1397992"
msgid "N-no, I was just wondering: what was that\naltered rule originally about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1398204"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF overwrote that loss to become\na \"loss of registered hits on her.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1398408"
msgid "If we had thought there was no time limit,\nwe might have still been on the second floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1398544"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF sure causes a lot of trouble. \nI wonder if #C236196003BB#CDEF has realized this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1398652"
msgid "Probably not.\nThey say no one knows you better\nthan yourself, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1399172"
msgid "By taking every human being――and turning them into #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nshe's trying to make a world\njust for #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF and herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1399340"
msgid "……the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1399572"
msgid "By taking every human being――and turning them into #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nshe's trying to make a world just for #C236196003Archer#CDEF and herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1400288"
msgid "The mood throughout the Student Council Room is grave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1400676"
msgid "\"No problems,\" I reply."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1401012"
msgid "Ah, okay, I'll check.\n…the coaster's durability, descent time,\nharmonic-sync protection…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1401128"
msgid "Everything is excellent, #RUBS Triple A#RUBEa AAA#REND rating!\nSplendid job, #C236196003Rin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1401228"
msgid "Phew.\nWe're all ready on our end then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1401448"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF will infiltrate #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nmind and defeat her in the center."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1402056"
msgid "All #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF has to do is enter the Core.\nA Master like #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF won't be hurt\nby entering the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1403528"
msgid "Yes, please leave it to me.\nI'll be okay. I have plenty of memory to spare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1403912"
msgid "…good. #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF are okay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1404264"
msgid "…the simulator has finished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1404564"
msgid "…90%.\n…that big of a number is what we end up with, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1405092"
msgid "\"…still, we have to do it,\" I say.\n…I can't stand by and watch the Earth collapse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1405260"
msgid "#C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF is both a simulator and a\nrecording device."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1405572"
msgid "…I can't understand what #C236196003Rani#CDEF is saying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1405772"
msgid "…yeah. Humanity fell.\nFell the moment \"#C236196003BB#CDEF reached the Core.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1406000"
msgid "…time doesn't pass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1406172"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1408692"
msgid "W-we still have this place!\nIf we stay here, where time is distorted…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1408868"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1409308"
msgid "A strong sense of failure shrouds my vision in darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1409524"
msgid "\n…we simply hadn't realized it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1409856"
msgid "#C236196003#[Mr.][Ms.]##CDEF#C236196003 #NICK#CDEF.\nAbout analyzing #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF, actually――"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1410432"
msgid "Bill: #C00024620450000 Sm#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1410472"
msgid "to analyze \"#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1410612"
msgid "M-mhm. Truly promising, and profitable!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1410652"
msgid "W-wait, that's all we need for\nthe final analysis!?"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "1411196"
msgid "Transfer #C00024620450000 Sm#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1411244"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1411252"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Sim"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1414456"
msgid "I believe a normal Servant's frame can't handle\nthe #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF's output.\nPlease use it only once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1414584"
msgid "Mhm, no cause for concern.\nI won't change into it so readily.\nI understand well to don it but once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1415584"
msgid "…it's time.\nI take a deep breath to calm my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1416000"
msgid "S-sure.\nEveryone is exhausted,\nso let's rest for one night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1417344"
msgid "In a show of my heartfelt respect,\nI also partake in a meal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1417548"
msgid "I rested and stripped all extraneous functions―\nMy style now is all offense!\nDon't my avatar's movements look smoother?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1417972"
msgid "You look like you slept well.\nI also got plenty of rest.\nI'll have no issues with self-control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1418796"
msgid "Ah, but, I still have one more chance!\nWhen we break down the Wall to the Core, \nI'll send a transmission from here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1418916"
msgid "G-give me a little more time until then!\nPlease, take it slow and steady!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1419152"
msgid "Yes. You worked hard, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nWe have only one job left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1419636"
msgid "A splendid tough act you're putting on,\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. It helps me stay my own fears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1420760"
msgid "―――Well.\nIt wouldn't be appropriate to answer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1420948"
msgid "Okay.\nThen―――yeah."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1420976"
msgid "Farewell, #C236196003Rani #RUBSEighth#RUBEVIII#REND#CDEF.\nWe were pretty good friends, weren't we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1421512"
msgid "Bwahaha!\nYou think that I have money, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1422592"
msgid "In contrast to those plump breasts and fairly\nhuge claws, #C236196003Lippy#CDEF seems terribly shy.\nI hope we can start off as friends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1422840"
msgid "For I am a MAN before I am a monk!\nI can't resist boob magic! Gah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1423720"
msgid "You may think I'M meddlesome,\nbut when it comes to being meddlesome,\nI don't hold a candle to you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1424060"
msgid "お金の工面１"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1424076"
msgid "お金の工面２"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1424456"
msgid "Sorry, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\n#C236196003Gawain#CDEF bears you no ill will.\nIf he gets on your nerves, I apologize."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1424716"
msgid "Thus, #[Mister][Miss]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF cannot\nbe entrusted with this defense.\nDo you think it should be otherwise?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1425404"
msgid "No need to worry, however.\nAs #C236196003Leo#CDEF stated, this situation is your specialty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1428012"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's first #C000246204SG#CDEF is not aimed at herself,\nbut at others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1428264"
msgid "Whether it's Lady #C236196003Rin#CDEF's or Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's,\nall of these \"#C000246204SGs#CDEF\" are categories\nwell beyond my comprehension…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1428608"
msgid "Anyway, how about you try to speak with\nLady #C236196003Rani#CDEF once more?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1428972"
msgid "And #C236196003Lancelot#CDEF… pardon me.\nI don't wish to recall his polite yet\npatronizing tactics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1429556"
msgid "By the way, what is your opinion of #C236196003Kiara#CDEF,\n#[Mister][Lady]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1429972"
msgid "Good morning.\nWe were just finishing breakfast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1430348"
msgid "Um…\nI think that might not be the issue here…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1430508"
msgid "Truth. Even a junk food junkie like me\nhas gotta say no thanks to that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1430580"
msgid "Only piggos on a farm will eat that.\nNo, those are scraps that even piggos will\noink and snort at!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1433272"
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1433292"
msgid "Guh…\nThat #C236196003Julius#CDEF―what a stubborn man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1435860"
msgid "It'll probably be an intense fight,\nbut you should be able to make it happen,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1436064"
msgid "…well, those claws make a waste of\nthose merits, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1437172"
msgid "The system is down except for one room,\nand NPCs are in forced sleep.\n…you hurry back and get some rest, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1437404"
msgid "……what?\nYou want a #[friendlier][warmer]# greeting from me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1438596"
msgid "Take a rest yourself if you get to your room.\nYour Spiritron structure is a bit messed up. I\nguess you got caught by some corrosion trap?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1438952"
msgid "………s―so you… made it… back…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1439284"
msgid "…oh, it's you. Good job exploring.\nI'm just about to head out to bring #C236196003Gatou#CDEF back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1441476"
msgid "Come on, hurry now. I hear that if you\nstop moving, your youth will pass by in a flash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1443888"
msgid "Before #C236196003BB#CDEF finds new Sentinels, we need\nto acquire #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF and break through\nthe Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1445980"
msgid "It's because #C236196003Rani#CDEF doesn't get jokes.\nLook at Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, her reactions betray\nall expectations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1446412"
msgid "See?\nLike I said, isn't she raring to go?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1448440"
msgid "No, we were careless as well.\nWe were so cautious for attacks from #C236196003BB#CDEF that we\noverlooked signs of an #C236196003Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1448936"
msgid "…that's good enough.\nBut, now I get it… #C236196003BB#CDEF can't physically\nget in here, can she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1449776"
msgid "I was wondering how I'd persuade you to\nget #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, but that's no longer necessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1450204"
msgid "Good morning.\nThe operation to remove #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF will begin\nas planned."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1450292"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF should already be waiting by the Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1450912"
msgid "…I see, so #C236196003Gawain#CDEF did that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1451468"
msgid "Oh? That's the uniform you wore in the\nNear Side of the Moon, isn't it?\nEverything looks good on you."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1451660"
msgid "I prefer this uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1451824"
msgid "Okay. I'll enjoy this uniform for a\nlittle while longer.\nPlus our uniforms match."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1453184"
msgid "Enough, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF.\nThat is all you ever talk about…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1453504"
msgid "Splendidly done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1453528"
msgid "You safely obtained #C236196003Rin#CDEF's secret――\nher #C000246204SG#CDEF, as you call it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1453772"
msgid "…is that so?\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF did all that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1453904"
msgid "I wonder what sort of #C000246204SG#CDEF #C236196003Rin#CDEF will have next?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1454140"
msgid "Do you perhaps scorn me over my pact with #C236196003BB#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1454456"
msgid "Blame yourself over summoning me, who's\ntotally useless in combat!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1454976"
msgid "…*sigh*. Really now. Why was such a Servant\nbrought here, I wonder…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1455056"
msgid "……\n…………\nCough, cough…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1455432"
msgid "Please keep this to yourself.\nDon't tell #C236196003Andersen#CDEF, especially. Please?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1455744"
msgid "Oh dear, oh dear. The #C000246204Habit of Exposure#CDEF #C000246204SG#CDEF…!\nAnimism is alive and well at Atlas!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1456080"
msgid "Only you can extract #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease try your best, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1456324"
msgid "I have looked over the data from #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1457044"
msgid "Damn. Couldn't peel away this nun's facade.\nA little more and her #C000246204SG#CDEF would've rolled\nright out of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1457164"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF…\nI'm truly glad we didn't end up losing a pure\nsoul such as yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1457308"
msgid "I heard, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nTo think that you would date #C236196003Jinako#CDEF…\nI never knew you two were like that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1457524"
msgid "Oh my, so that's it!\nHow very good.\nI feel relieved now, at least!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1457764"
msgid "Please enjoy your date with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1457824"
msgid "Ah, yes. It's not a date, is it?\nMy apologies. Hmhmhmhm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1457884"
msgid "…is that so? #C236196003Jinako#CDEF was…\nNow that means…\nSorry, I'm just thinking out loud."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1457980"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, like the front-runners of the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1458116"
msgid "and the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF,\nis an unusual type of #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1458480"
msgid "For something so ubiquitous to become an #C000246204SG#CDEF\nmeans that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF must possess a pure mind, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1459064"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF…!\nOh thank goodness you're okay…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1459844"
msgid "Please, don't submit to her.\nThe way you are, you won't lose to a\nrogue AI such as her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1460780"
msgid "The #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF.\nAn AI offshoot of #C236196003BB#CDEF, charged with combat.\n#C000246204Sentinel#CDEF of Floor 7 of the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1461064"
msgid "…? Is something the matter?\nIs something on my chest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1461184"
msgid "…I feel a little dissatisfied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1461288"
msgid "The reason why #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF invaded this\nschool is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1461424"
msgid "This is still just conjecture, but you may\nhave saved us in the nick of time, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1461532"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and I are promptly\nstarting work together on constructing a new\nfirewall version for the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1461896"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF actions are clearly\ncontrary to that principle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1462272"
msgid "Please buy the \"#C000246204Dustcloud of Osiris#CDEF\"\nin the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1462536"
msgid "That was an option!!??"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1462560"
msgid "Want to subdue #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF?\nUse the \"#C000246204Dustcloud of Osiris#CDEF!\"\nIt will keep you safe! Operators standing by!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1463036"
msgid "We've got your backup all set up.\nNo need to look over your shoulder,\nplease fight freely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1463252"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's case now makes\nthat readily apparent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1464852"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Aren't you CASUALLY making me\nout to be a money-grubbing kind of girl?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1465292"
msgid "#C236196003President Leo#CDEF had his style,\nand you have yours, #C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1465656"
msgid "I understand your concern for #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nHowever, please consider #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's feelings\nas well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1465864"
msgid "…never, right?\nHm… I wonder if maybe it has happened before…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1466332"
msgid "What happened? She escaped?\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF did?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1466580"
msgid "…anyway, I'm glad that you, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nand #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF are okay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1467072"
msgid "Don't be deceived by her deviant mind.\nPlease face the Labyrinth steeled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1467268"
msgid "That's a good idea.\nI'll do so as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1467316"
msgid "Hey!\nEnough of that, you two!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1467452"
msgid "We've reaped a hefty gain by\nobtaining #C236196003BB#CDEF's data."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1467520"
msgid "To be honest, I'm ready to assume that any\ninformation about #C236196003BB#CDEF would be unobtainable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1468276"
msgid "Uh… is that a compliment?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1468304"
msgid "Of course.\nPlease be proud."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1469200"
msgid "Alright.\nI'll be switching to private mode early today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1469392"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, does wearing it increase your\nstats?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1469492"
msgid "…not at all, you say?\nThen it makes no sense. Why wear it if\nit doesn't raise your stats?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1470240"
msgid "Let me tell you something.\nOur relationship is an even one! Fair!\nDebt-free!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1470324"
msgid "I'm grateful that you rescued me from #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nbut blowing my dang secrets wide open\nis a different matter!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1470728"
msgid "Since, back when we were attacked by #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nhe splendidly evaded #C236196003BB#CDEF's tentacles――\nThose Shapeshifters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1471152"
msgid "Compared to the #C236196003Leo#CDEF I know, he's very,\nyou know, like…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1472152"
msgid "By the way, what are you grinning at? Aha!\nSo it's #C236196003Rani#CDEF's uniform, right? Sheesh!\nAll the men are the same!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1472828"
msgid "Come on. Enough with the silliness.\nHurry over to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1472916"
msgid "Oh, yeah. #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are AI, not humans,\nso I wonder if they have #C000246204SGs#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1473752"
msgid "N-no… that's not…\nThat's not what I mean!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1473912"
msgid "Enough about me, get your butt over\nto the Labyrinth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1474036"
msgid "#C000246204The eighth floor, northeast#CDEF, huh…\nI wonder why she's there?\nMaybe she dropped something? Cash?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1476324"
msgid "…#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF cooked more than\nI thought she would. But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1476708"
msgid "I'll keep the encroachment at bay.\nSo hurry and #C000246204go see Kiara#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1476800"
msgid "Did you get the Code Cast from #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1477108"
msgid "Hey! #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1477308"
msgid "Annddd, now I want to take a shower, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1477632"
msgid "Th-that was obviously a joke.\nCool it with the bloodlust, #SVT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1477804"
msgid "…well, it doesn't really matter if you did.\nBe sure to go visit #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1478776"
msgid "Thanks.\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1479016"
msgid "Huh? You still here, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nHurry over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF already.\nWe'll take care of things here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1479204"
msgid "And me? Well… I can't take the resources\nI gathered back with me…\nCan't take the… money either…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1480820"
msgid "I asked him to have you two meet up in a\nclassroom.\nIt was a huge headache for me, you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481124"
msgid "Thus, regretfully, I have the Infirmary closed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481272"
msgid "Oh, yes.\nIf you'd like, please take this.\nIt's not much, just some supplies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481356"
msgid "The Labyrinth is an unknown Arena…\nPlease be very careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481648"
msgid "Um… Please be careful, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1481756"
msgid "Umm, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nDoes it hurt anywhere?\nIf necessary, I can do a full body scan, or…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1482500"
msgid "Viruses won't be getting in,\nbut if some accident were to happen…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1482904"
msgid "I'm sorry. I'm doing all I can to maintain\nthe premises and support your exploration……\nso I have no free memory to spare……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483104"
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483128"
msgid "There seem to be no problems with your\nphysical and mental states. Your mind\nand body are in perfect health, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483448"
msgid "The Relief appeared in the form of #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nbut I wonder… is it #C236196003Rin#CDEF, herself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483760"
msgid "It is my sworn duty to ensure your……\nno, everyone's safety. I can't do much, \nbut I'll do everything I can to help you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1483996"
msgid "I lent #C236196003Rin#CDEF an empty classroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484052"
msgid "Like how your personal room is for you,\nit's isolated from other spaces\nso there's complete privacy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484172"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF is running a jamming code,\nthough it's weak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484252"
msgid "With this and #C236196003Julius#CDEF' skills, typical hostile\nprograms shouldn't be able to detect him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484536"
msgid "So you obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nI find it very interesting that #C236196003Rani#CDEF also\nhas an #C000246204SG#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484796"
msgid "U-umm…\nNo, nevermind…\nYou have it rough, don't you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484872"
msgid "I gave the clothes to #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nPlease get them from her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1484968"
msgid "Whenever you obtain a new outfit, it will\nautomatically be sent to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1485100"
msgid "…ah, you need some supplies?\nUmm… it's not much but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1485424"
msgid "I may be an AI, but I have no area of\nexpertise…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1485552"
msgid "Please don't bring it up again… it feels\nlike my trauma might turn into an #C000246204SG#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1486208"
msgid "Um, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nBe careful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1486264"
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1487020"
msgid "You, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nI don't really think of you in that way.\nSorry…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1487140"
msgid "You, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nRather than an older #[brother][sister]#,\nI think of you as… N-never mind!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1487272"
msgid "Good morning.\nLooks like you slept well last night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1487980"
msgid "Until now, I assumed the Aggression Wall was\nfor repelling #C236196003BB#CDEF, so its density…\nIts mesh wasn't fine enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1488220"
msgid "…however, please understand that even\nallocating this many resources won't block\n#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1488456"
msgid "*cough*…\nNo, I'm fine.\nMy throat is just hurting a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1488524"
msgid "……………………………………\n……………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1488668"
msgid "P-pretend couple…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1488816"
msgid "Good morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1488932"
msgid "Hey, um…\nH-here, some provisions…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1489184"
msgid "Ah! Sorry!\nI was just looking up ways to prepare\ndelicious black tea…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1489344"
msgid "So, um…\nPlease don't worry about it too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1489636"
msgid "My guess is that she found the back-entrance\nto the \"now door-less\" Janitor's Closet,\nby coincidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1490280"
msgid "I'm happy to hear that you're worried about me.\nBut please put your own well-being first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1490752"
msgid "Huh? Did that antacid work for you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1491572"
msgid "Something's wrong with #C236196003BB#CDEF……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1491852"
msgid "Hacking is a skill for exposing\n#RUBSa person's#RUBEan AI's#REND private information, anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1491952"
msgid "Right…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1491968"
msgid "Leave the rest to us.\nPlease go get some rest in My Room, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1492316"
msgid "What's the matter? Can't sleep, maybe?\nI have some nice herbal tea if that's the case."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1492408"
msgid "………u-umm…… Senpai………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1492524"
msgid "P-pretty strange, isn't it?\nI… I wonder what's the matter with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1492592"
msgid "I-I'm sorry!\nI'll be performing a full maintenance on myself,\nso we can talk later… is that okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1492828"
msgid "…oh, yes. I still haven't given you today's\nprovisions. Here, please take this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1493020"
msgid "Luckily nothing happened on the sixteenth floor,\nbut that also means we didn't collect\nany data on #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1493620"
msgid "You're #C000246204in the Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nwhere #C236196003BB#CDEF was born;\nwhere the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF were born―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1493780"
msgid "It's all my fault.\nYet, you don't hate anyone or place any blame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494348"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's primordial power……\nThat certainly may be able to compete with #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494456"
msgid "But will #C236196003Jinako#CDEF be willing to help us out?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494592"
msgid "Still, leaping to face #C236196003BB#CDEF without\nany plan is nothing short of suicide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494736"
msgid "Hehe… That's just like you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nHere you go, please take it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1494820"
msgid "I'm happy to still be of some use.\nPlease stay strong and healthy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1495040"
msgid "But I'm happy to hear this!\nActually, I was hoping this would happen――\nSo I went all out to make THIS!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1495596"
msgid "Ah. Those are the clothes I made\nfor #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1495664"
msgid "Hehe. I'm glad to see them being used.\nThey really do suit #C236196003#SVT#CDEF a lot better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1497164"
msgid "O-ohh……\nY…… yeah, well,\nI knew that stuff already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1498528"
msgid "Ahh, man. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF turned out to be hopeless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1498620"
msgid "Since we've competed over the net,\nI expected her to be no ordinary player.\nBut look! She's just a damn NEET!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1498828"
msgid "Huh…? Back already, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1498888"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's Labyrinth is tougher than #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1499024"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…? Nah, no relation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1500016"
msgid "…hmph. I hate to say it, but #C236196003Rani#CDEF won.\nI AM a gamer.\nWe accept it when we lose in the game."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1500380"
msgid "Good. Since I'M the one\nwho's going to beat her at chess, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1500548"
msgid "Eh? The chess games are over?\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF went into the Relief?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1500628"
msgid "Wh-what's going on!?\nJust who beat her in chess!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1500880"
msgid "Ahh, my head is still spinning…\nWhy was only MY camera spinning around\nand around!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1501156"
msgid "#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF still had human weaknesses,\nbut those #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\nerr, they're no joke, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1502704"
msgid "Heh. I was worried for a second there,\nbut #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are no big deal.\nEven you could take 'em on, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1503040"
msgid "Huh? It's an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF?\nYou've been going up against THAT!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1503116"
msgid "Catching an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, huh?\n…well, I won't be doing anything about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1503968"
msgid "#C236196003J#CDEF-#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is missing?\nWhat did you do, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1504068"
msgid "You left her alone there and came back\non your own? Did you just up and run away…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1504164"
msgid "N-no… That can't be it.\n…sorry, my bad.\nNo point in blaming you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1504728"
msgid "………! #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nYou, if it weren't for you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1504792"
msgid "…no, that's not it.\nThat's not it…! DAMN IT!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1504852"
msgid "Shut up! Don't talk to me!\nLeave me alone!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1505172"
msgid "……so #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's the Sentinel this time around…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1505260"
msgid "So this was how she felt, huh?\nI… get how she feels now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1505332"
msgid "Ultimately, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF had no place to go back to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1505492"
msgid "So, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF faced off against #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, huh?\nI had to face…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1505672"
msgid "Come on, leave me alone!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1505716"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF… is dead…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1505760"
msgid "Haha… hahahahahaha…\nThat dumbass…\nAnd he even had a tiny shred of hope left…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1506192"
msgid "So how about we just surrender to #C236196003BB#CDEF?\nSooner rather than later.\nShe'll spare us, won't she?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1506628"
msgid "…oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nHaha, you must think I'm a hopeless case,\ntoo, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1506880"
msgid "Sympathy is only going to make me\nmore miserable! #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, you――\nevery one of you is looking down on me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1507152"
msgid "……what, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nIs there something on my face?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1507276"
msgid "You got somethin' you need to do\nover there, too? Then don't worry about me\nand get to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1507780"
msgid "What is it? I'm about to leave."
msgstr ""

#. locationOrName
msgctxt "2165680"
msgid "Rin Tohsaka"
msgstr "Tohsaka Rin"

#. locationOrName
msgctxt "2165692"
msgid "Shinji Matou"
msgstr "Matou Shinji"

#. locationOrName
