msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2166488"
msgid "I was on the verge of leaving the Student\nCouncil Room when #C236196003Sakura#CDEF abruptly thanked me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2166592"
msgid "The others and I looked at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in surprise\nafter hearing her unprefaced remark."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2166692"
msgid "I ask her why she was thanking me. Then…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2166736"
msgid "I am sorry… as I thought, it looks like this\nnew software has destabilized my emotion values\na little bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2166844"
msgid "Please be careful out there. Be sure to come\nback without a scratch!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2166916"
msgid "Let's head to the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nafter gathering some more information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167008"
msgid "A variety of information is displayed here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167052"
msgid "However, it's really tough to read from this close up.\nIt would help to back up a bit, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167148"
msgid "I wonder if there are any cleaning supplies in here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167204"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF, sweeping up the Student Council Room\nwith a broom or dust cloth. Or #C236196003Gawain#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167320"
msgid "I kind of want to see them doing that stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167368"
msgid "There's a note stuck to the cleaning locker.\nWhat's it say…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167432"
msgid "[The auto-cleaning type OpenLock.\n Upon opening, the door will not close\n until the Student Council Room is left\n without a single speck of dust.\n Patent pending.]"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167596"
msgid "―――Who the hell would want to open this!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167644"
msgid "Many books are stored on this shelf.\nThey all look exceedingly complicated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167720"
msgid "…but, in the corner of my eye,\nI felt like I saw the string of letters:\n\"My Little Sister Can't Be This Hyper-Conceited.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167844"
msgid "Books are tightly lined up all the way to the ceiling.\nA large assortment of genres are here, like\nhistory, literature, and economics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2167980"
msgid "Between the books, I find \"A History Of Tsukumihara Academy.\"\nWorn out pictures of the school are printed in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168096"
msgid "………\nI miss my peaceful life as a student, just a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168156"
msgid "It's a book about the #C236196003Harwey Family#CDEF\nand the Western European conglomerate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168248"
msgid "\"The Western European Conglomerate was formed out of an\n immense merging of several conglomerates spanning multiple\n countries. Geographically, it covers 1/3 of the world.\n 60% of the global GDP is considered to come from\n the Western European Conglomerate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168508"
msgid "\"The #C236196003Harwey family#CDEF asserts leadership of it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168572"
msgid "There's no one left from the Harwey family\nin the Student Council Room anymore.\nMaybe that's why I came upon a book like this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168700"
msgid "It looks like a garbage bin,\nbut there's nothing inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168760"
msgid "……!\nHold on. I feel like I saw some black thing move just now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168828"
msgid "No, just my imagination.\nNo doubt about it… I'll leave it at that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2168900"
msgid "Getting right to it, let's review what happened\npreviously. First, from our acting secretary.\nGo ahead, brother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2169016"
msgid "Two findings from the Labyrinth exploration:\none is the discovery of the protective door\nmade in an unknown#RUBS subroutine#RUBE format#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2169160"
msgid "Afterwards, we made an analysis based on the\ndata that #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF recorded,\nbut we couldn't even read the program."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2169296"
msgid "…the chance isn't zero, I suppose.\nWe're calling that door a #C000246204Shield#CDEF. Breaking\nthrough it is our highest priority now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2169432"
msgid "The truth is, we can't proceed without passing\nthrough this Shield. Now then, acting treasurer\n#C236196003Gawain#CDEF, go ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2169564"
msgid "Ahem. I will report our results of the\nanalysis of #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF and that\nServant whom you encountered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2169684"
msgid "…well, she wasn't always this crue…\nnevermind. Please continue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2169752"
msgid "Calling herself the #C000246204Queen of the Moon#CDEF,\nshe attempted to capture #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF. She also called us \"survivors.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2169896"
msgid "It's uncertain as to why, but there is no doubt\nshe is the source of our disadventure\nand is the menace who trapped us here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170024"
msgid "#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's Servant is #C000246204Lancer#CDEF.\nThis is also as we remembered―though there\nwere some differences."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170156"
msgid "…wait, #C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF.\nIt was more than \"some.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170220"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF.\nIs something the matter with #C236196003Leo#CDEF's conclusions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170308"
msgid "…please continue. This IS an enemy we must\ndefeat no matter what. Who they are on the\ninside is a trivial concern."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170424"
msgid "At best a B@ to A Class. I believe that\nwith due diligence, this is an opponent\nwe can defeat with ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170532"
msgid "This is what sucks… about the standards prodigies have…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170592"
msgid "Also, we confirmed that the communication\ninterference was due to #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's special skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170700"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's birthplace and Noble Phantasm are\nunknown, but we've prepared several effective\nfrequencies against the interference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170844"
msgid "Perfect. Well done as always, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF.\nTo think you'd be so versed in magica―\nelectronic warfare, being a knight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2170976"
msgid "No, these are also known to knights. I don't\nthink I can rest on my laurels just because\nI carry a holy sword."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171088"
msgid "A king may do so, but a knight's #ROFS0002#RUBS job#RUBErole#REND is not\nas simple as blasting about with\na holy sword, you see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171220"
msgid "Here.\nPresident, is it my time to shine?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171264"
msgid "It appears there are no questions,\nso I'll continue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171320"
msgid "Our problem lies with the Shield. If we\ndon't come up with a clear plan, we\nprobably won't be able to break through it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171440"
msgid "This is where you come in, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nMay you go and hand over this data to\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171564"
msgid "I don't mind passing this along to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF,\nbut I wonder why it's for her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171656"
msgid "Rumors about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF…?\nWhat in the world is that about―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171732"
msgid "I appreciate your help.\nShe and I don't see eye to eye. Our statuses\nand sense of values are too different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171840"
msgid "#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF… #C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF…\nHrm. I remember hearing that\nname somewhere before…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2171948"
msgid "U-uggghh…!?\nWhat is this headache!?\nMy head is splitting…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172012"
msgid "Good heavens!\nWhen I try remembering that name,\nsomething strange seems to happen to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172104"
msgid "Nothing else is going on, so #C000246204I'll try meeting up with Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172184"
msgid "These rich kids from western European\nFinancial Conglomerates are something else.\nIt looks like he would add two zeros if I\njust asked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172320"
msgid "I sprang to borrow it, when it suddenly hit me:\nwhy does #C236196003Leo#CDEF have money from #RUBS    this place#RUBEthe Far Side#REND…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172460"
msgid "Yeah, I thought I might need some just in case,\nso I exchanged at the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172544"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF…!\nYou're really looking out for your #[boy][girl]# #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172652"
msgid "So, let's get this said and done―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172692"
msgid "By the way, the interest rate is 10% every\n10 days."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172744"
msgid "No fine print. Nice, right? This loaning\ntechnique has been passed down from generation\nto generation: the \"Harwey Tenterest-System.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2172880"
msgid "The reason the #C236196003Harwey#CDEF's gotten so big\ncouldn't have been through shady―――\nW-woah, woah. This isn't something I should stick my nose in.\nI'll let THAT stay buried."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173064"
msgid "So uhh, #C236196003Leo#CDEF, my friend…?\nMaybe we could think about a more\nreasonable sum to start this loan off with…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173188"
msgid "No, 100,000 Sm is the lowest I'll go.\nWhat will you do with any less?\nDon't cup noodles go for 8,000 Sm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173296"
msgid "Go on, make your decision. I, myself, will be\nfine with whatever you choose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173376"
msgid "Ghh…!\nNow that it's come to this,\nI'll just have to―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2173436"
msgid "…yeah, I really shouldn't…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173468"
msgid "…you gotta do what you gotta do.\nI'll be decisive here and borrow from #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173564"
msgid "Alright. I'm lending you 100,000 Sm,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Be sure to stick to your budget."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173660"
msgid "On the other hand, I'm breaking out\ninto a cold sweat. I wonder why?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173732"
msgid "Please do your best, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Even if you\ndon't pay me back, It'll be amus―――no, since\nwe're friends, please don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2173884"
msgid "…I'll pay him back. If there's any chance of me paying\nhim back, then I'll have to work hard and do it as soon\nas possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174012"
msgid "Yes. I've made a solid pledge from my heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174060"
msgid "Is that so? I figure if you can solve a problem\nwith money then that's the smartest way to go,\nbut if you say so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174176"
msgid "Well, if you ever change your mind then\nplease come by again. I'll always welcome you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174264"
msgid "You want to use the \"Harwey Tenterest-System\"?\nCome on in, come on in. I have a warm welcome\nfor you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174368"
msgid "The loan amounts to 100,000 Sm.\nWhat would you like to do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174428"
msgid "Though I'll need money to chase down #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nI feel like if I take the loan, then\nI'll be the one getting chased down because of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174576"
msgid "The loan is for 100,000 Sm, and the interest\nrate is 10% per 10 days. Please don't forget,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174692"
msgid "Well, even if you end up forgetting, it'll be\namusing in and of itself to me. \nSo, I won't mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174792"
msgid "Hm? Money, you say?\nSure, I could lend it to you if you want…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174856"
msgid "But given #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's current situation,\nI think getting some while fighting\nenemies to level up is a better idea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2174988"
msgid "? What's wrong, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nDo you still need to ask me something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2175068"
msgid "Aside from his attempt at changing his outward persona,\nthere's still \"something\" different between this #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nand the one I remember in the back of my mind.\nBut what…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2175252"
msgid "Ah, I see. Certainly even within that dream,\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF wore a modded red uniform. It feels like\na surprising number of people have red as\ntheir \"thing\"―and I think #C236196003Leo#CDEF is one of them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2175464"
msgid "On that note, I also think this uniform I have on \nisn't the one I used to wear…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2175548"
msgid "Yes. When we were dropped to the Far Side, our\nuniforms seemed to have been forcibly altered.\nSame thing with your Servant's clothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2175684"
msgid "Yes. When we were dropped to the Far Side, our\nuniforms seemed to have been forcibly altered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2175780"
msgid "This retro #[boys' uniform][girl's sailor uniform]# \ndefinitely suits this evening, \nwooden school quite well. A change\nin uniform might be kind of nice,\nas long it's not the #RUBS  debuff#RUBEcursed#REND kind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2175992"
msgid "One thing though. If our uniforms were\n\"forcibly altered,\" then how come #C236196003Julius#CDEF\nand #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's uniforms haven't changed?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2176144"
msgid "My brother never had a uniform to begin with.\nIt wouldn't be that strange if the \"uniform\noptimization\" process just ignored him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2176276"
msgid "As for #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, what's the big deal? Whatever\nuniform she has on won't obstruct her functions,\nright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2176396"
msgid "For a moment, I was hesitant to agree with\nthe conclusion #C236196003Leo#CDEF whipped out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2176488"
msgid "\"If it doesn't obstruct, there's no problem\"――\n Doesn't that make her seem rather robotic?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2176584"
msgid "I know #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is an AI. Right now though,\nshe's an ally helping us face this unknown\nmaze. I think it would be nice to have her\nmatch with our uniforms at least."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2176764"
msgid "As soon as you enter the Labyrinth,\nthe Student Council will escort the two of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2176848"
msgid "Yes, now this is what I call fun.\nWe'll need to commemorate this event.\nTry to win \"Best Couple\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2176948"
msgid "First thing to do is #C000246204recruit#CDEF.\nWe can't have rich Student Council\nactivities without talented members."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2177068"
msgid "It may be… no, it IS mundane, but it's also a\ncritical duty. I hope to see your splendid\npersuasive skills in action, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2177212"
msgid "Sure, I DID say \"anyone is fine,\" but…\nI guess this is what they mean\nby \"not in my wildest dreams,\" huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2177320"
msgid "We need to first find a method to get\nthrough that shield. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF,\n#C000246204meet with Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2177448"
msgid "We were really fortunate to have a\nspecialist of the heart and mind like\n#C236196003Kiara#CDEF in this old school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2177572"
msgid "You've gained a method for analyzing the Shield\nand a prized library. Head over to the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF now, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2177724"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF seems angry for some reason.\nIt must be about that video\nrecording you mentioned before…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2177860"
msgid "That's called a joke, brother.\nThere's no way that #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, of all people,\nwould have such a petty reaction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2177988"
msgid "Now then, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Head to the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF. A new side of Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nis waiting to show itself to us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2178148"
msgid "How is persuading Miss #C236196003Jinako#CDEF faring? If we can\nadd her fighting power to our own, I'm sure\nwe'll find a way to even defeat #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2178312"
msgid "When a new member joins in school dramas,\nit's a huge highlight of the story.\nLet's get out there and make some progress!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2178436"
msgid "It's unfortunate that we failed to persuade\nMiss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF… I suppose we\ntried to persuade her too early."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2178560"
msgid "All things considered, #C000246204Money Worship#CDEF really\nis an appropriate #C000246204SG#CDEF for Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, right?\nIt's awesome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2178712"
msgid "Giving moderate breaks, ascertaining the maximum\nlimit of exploitation without having them run…\nThere's a lot I need to learn from her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2178852"
msgid "There really is only one Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nHer fundamental thinking is patrician, so why\nis she so amusing, I wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2178984"
msgid "Eh…? It's unfair that I get to take it easy\neven though #C236196003Gawain#CDEF is here…? I need to \"learn\nthe pleasures of manual labor\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2179124"
msgid "Yes. I'll take your advice seriously. No need to\nworry. When the time comes, I'll also be\nproperly doing some manual labor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2179248"
msgid "I swear, as the Student Council President,\nI will pay my fair share. I'm just depending\non you a bit right now is all, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2179392"
msgid "Bleeding people dry while hoping to be in\nservitude… Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF might symbolize\nthe nature of human self-contradiction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2179552"
msgid "―――Anywaaays, regarding this matter,\nI can't wait to engage in a debate about it\ndirectly with Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2179680"
msgid "I know it sounds rash of me, being the Student\nCouncil President, but is it alright if I go\nto the Relief too, brother?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2179800"
msgid "No way. You may be right about this\nself-contradicting nature stuff, but you\nonly want to tease #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2179936"
msgid "Anyway, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF finally cornered her up\nto this point. What will we do if you step\non this tiger's tail?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180056"
msgid "How will you take responsibility if #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF\nflies into a rage and lashes out and that\nRelief comes alive or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180196"
msgid "Hahaha. Now THAT would be worth seeing,\nbut it definitely is an issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180268"
msgid "I'll have that debate at some other opportunity.\nLet's prioritize breaking through the\nLabyrinth for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180376"
msgid "I'll let you handle inquiring about this to\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180476"
msgid "Oh come on.\nPlease don't make such an unpleasant face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180532"
msgid "Once you come back, I'll need a detailed report\nabout the inside of Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's heart.\nLoose-leaf paper, 800 pages, 400 words per."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180684"
msgid "#C236196003Chief Gatou#CDEF also has issues of his own. If you\nare going to enter the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF alone,\nyou need to at least bring a Return Crystal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180856"
msgid "Err, I don't think that's the problem here…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2180904"
msgid "I'm just saying he can cut down the search\nparty's time. Of course, it's impossible for\nanyone to convince him to NOT be so reckless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2181040"
msgid "First, make contact with #C236196003Rani#CDEF and find the gaps\nin her mind. I say this over and over, but watch\nout for #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2181188"
msgid "\"Management Desire\" is an appropriate #C000246204SG#CDEF for\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2181272"
msgid "In my opinion, though #C000246204SG1#CDEF may be a \"secret,\"\nmaybe it shows that there's a trend of\novert inclinations becoming #C000246204SGs#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2181424"
msgid "Pheeew. All those developments on the fifth\nfloor really kept me on the edge of my seat.\nI'm very satisfied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2181536"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF. Put this recording in the deepest part\nof the archive. And of course, set it\nto read-only."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2181652"
msgid "Yes. I placed on it a three-layer lock.\nThis article would take even the most\nremarkable #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND three months to remove."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2181820"
msgid "…? What's wrong, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF? It's alright.\nIt doesn't show the most critical part of\nwhat went down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2181936"
msgid "Come on, forget about the video recording\nand get some good sleep. You must be tired, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182028"
msgid "Good morning.\nThere's nothing to really be briefed on today.\nPlease head to the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182144"
msgid "We've got some data that\nwe want to sort out on our end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182204"
msgid "Doesn't #C236196003Rani#CDEF have a weakness…? That's the\nAtlas Institute's masterpiece for you.\nHer #C000246204SG2#CDEF must've been some kind of accident."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182364"
msgid "I truly hate to say this, but unlike\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF who was a disappointment up until\nthe end, Miss #C236196003Rani#CDEF will prove more difficult."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182528"
msgid "Hey, I won't let that one slide.\nIt sounds like you're saying I've got tons\nof weaknesses, President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182632"
msgid "My apologies, I misspoke. In some sense, Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF exudes a very airtight personality.\nLike the money-grubbing aspect of hers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182780"
msgid "W-well, sorry for money-grubbing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182816"
msgid "The foundation for any investigation starts with\none's feet. If you can't find any clues,\nthen search the Labyrinth until you do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2182948"
msgid "…I'm rather good since I have an interest\nin chess, but unsurprisingly, I can't beat\nsomeone with chess as their forte."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183072"
msgid "I don't have any method to handle this\nsituation. It would be nice to have a way to\nturn the tables…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183176"
msgid "I won't allow you to be defeated.\nOnce you're thoroughly prepared, please\nhead to the Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183272"
msgid "Oh? No interest in #C236196003Rani#CDEF's Relief, #C236196003Leo#CDEF? Nothing?\nYou were amused back when it was #C236196003Rin#CDEF though?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183416"
msgid "If you hit the right button, she might turn\nback into a Relief and go on a rampage.\nYou never know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183516"
msgid "And that would be alright. \"When is that big\navatar going to jump out\" is the kind of joke\nI could hold over her head forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183644"
msgid "That won't work on me, dumb dumb!\nEven if that DID happen, the first thing I\nwould do is trample you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183748"
msgid "#C236196003R-Rin#CDEF… you're scaring me a little…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183804"
msgid "Yep, you've convinced me.\nShe's got that \"surprisingly teasable\"\nattribute."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2183880"
msgid "I'm sure #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is on your mind, but please\nget some rest, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF is at\nthe Infirmary, so let's leave things to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184060"
msgid "All this talk of food made me hungry.\nPrioritizing one's appetite is a sign of\ngood health."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184152"
msgid "However… This old school is really lacking\nin meals that are delightful to eat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184236"
msgid "Although, even if we had a full-time cook\nand a cafeteria, we don't have that many\nresources. It's tormenting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184348"
msgid "In the meantime, it seems that we'll get\nsome modest enjoyment out of candy from the\nCommissary along with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's bento."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184488"
msgid "Even if it seems like you can make conversation\nwith her, we're dealing with an #C236196003Alter Ego#CDEF here.\nKeep your guard up, please be cautious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184640"
msgid "Although, there's not much we can do\nabout \"visuals\" influencing\nour human way of thinking…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184736"
msgid "If #C236196003BB#CDEF calculated for that in the design of\nthose girls, then she'll prove more troublesome\nthan we previously imagined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184872"
msgid "I'm not optimistic about this situation,\nbut it's no use getting glum over it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2184952"
msgid "Let's keep a smile on our face. Go with a smile.\nA smile is #RUBS free#RUBE0 Sm#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2185040"
msgid "It's very intriguing how #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's special\ncharacteristic became an #C000246204SG#CDEF itself. It wasn't\nthat way with Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF or #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2185232"
msgid "Maybe it really is just because\nshe's an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF. It looks like they differ\nfrom normal people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2185348"
msgid "#C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF… Does that mean\nan \"easy-to-bully constitution\"?\nSorry, I don't really get it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2185472"
msgid "I mean, it's a skill that purposefully makes one\na target of hate, no? It could work in a team\nstrategy, but there's no use in one-on-ones."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2185612"
msgid "It's an advanced skill, \"being a bottom.\"\nHrm, #C236196003Prez Leo#CDEF is still too young to know that.\nWell, #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG2#CDEF is the same, #C000246204Habit of#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2185812"
msgid "Excuse me, but there was some raspy\neavesdropping going on, so I had it cut.\n#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, please go explore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2185944"
msgid "I heard about what happened from #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, did you get hurt at all?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2186052"
msgid "We're fine on our side.\nAlthough, it's puzzling us as to what\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF was trying to accomplish…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2186168"
msgid "…I feel ashamed.\nThis mistake falls wholly on me, #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2186240"
msgid "I've been protecting the Student Council Room,\nready in case of the worst, but I failed to\nnotice anything from the schoolyard…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2186372"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Unlike #C236196003BB#CDEF, can #C236196003Alter Egos#CDEF\nenter the old school without issue?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2186492"
msgid "Yes… since #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's Spiritron structure\nisn't very large, it seems that she slipped\nthrough the Prevention Net and got through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2186644"
msgid "Also, she possesses an excellent means of\npresence isolation. But we know her pattern now.\nI won't allow her to invade again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2186772"
msgid "This foe has stacked a lot of memory. A sensor\nthe size of a fingertip could poke through, but\na hand or an arm size gets stuck in the net."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2186912"
msgid "I see. A high-level program will get flung\nback by the protective net about the old school.\nHearing that puts me at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187036"
msgid "Framing it the other way around, this means\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's level isn't so different\nfrom ours, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187152"
msgid "Yes, that's correct. She's a dangerous being,\nbut I can assert that #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF has a healthy\nchance of succeeding."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187280"
msgid "The Student Council is fine.\nPlease continue with your exploration\nof the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187388"
msgid "In order to nab her #C000246204SG#CDEF, you'll first need to\nmake contact with #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187496"
msgid "Though necessary, this is a perilous mission.\nPlease take every precaution."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187572"
msgid "Every now and then, even #C236196003Chief Gatou#CDEF says\njust the right thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187652"
msgid "As soon as you enter the Labyrinth,\nthe Student Council will escort the two of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187736"
msgid "Yes, now this is what I call fun.\nWe'll need to commemorate this event.\nTry to win \"Best Couple\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187836"
msgid "Let my brother take care of #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF.\nYou get some rest, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nTomorrow is your big battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2187964"
msgid "Once you're done preparing, head over to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nWe have her waiting for you by the Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188072"
msgid "Again…?\nConsidering this is #C236196003Chief Gatou#CDEF, I think he may\njust show back up out of the blue…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188184"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF's Labyrinth appears be\nunconventional compared to the rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188276"
msgid "The difficulty isn't too high, but we can see it\ntends to take a toll on an intruder's\nmental health."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188380"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nDon't let yourself be swayed too much.\nShe is who she is, and you are who you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188488"
msgid "Yes, once we get a break from this turmoil,\nI WOULD like to have a nice, long chat\nwith you―scone and black tea in hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188612"
msgid "Don't you think it would be fun if we spoke\nabout things like, what type of people\nwe're into or our past experiences?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188732"
msgid "I understand. In the event that we do break out\nof this twilit, old school, let's arrange for\na place to do that. It's a promise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188864"
msgid "Hehe. Feeling more motivated?\nFor me at least, I'm starting to really look\nforward to getting back to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2188984"
msgid "We can't let #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF's decision be in vain.\nThe Earth's last truth-seeking monk showed us\nthe path. Now let's cross it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189124"
msgid "I was thinking that I should go back to the red\nuniform I wore before once I get\nthe chance, but――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2189228"
msgid "The red uniform suits you better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189264"
msgid "Y-you think so? I thought that I was only\nsatisfying myself by wearing this, but if\nyou feel that way, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189396"
msgid "Haha. I thought you might say that.\nBut don't you think this uniform is better\nsince it's what normal students wear?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189516"
msgid "…hey.\nThere's something that's been bothering me.\nYou have a second?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189588"
msgid "It's about #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF.\nOut of curiosity, I had #C236196003Rani#CDEF look into her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189692"
msgid "We have nothing to be concerned about.\nIt's true that the western financial\nconglomerates went after her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189800"
msgid "The conglomerates went after her…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189836"
msgid "So #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is an enemy of those conglomerates――\nIs she a freelance hacker like #C236196003Rin#CDEF is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2189956"
msgid "No, she doesn't oppose anyone. Though the only\ndata we have comes from what we dug up here…\nCould you please, #C236196003Rani#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190092"
msgid "Yes. Starting from the conclusion,\nshe's a cybercriminal wanted by INTERPOL."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190172"
msgid "At one point,\nshe was the leader of a religious cyber cult.\nIt no longer exists, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190264"
msgid "And, well…\nAll the men and women in it idolized her\nso much that they all committed suicide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190360"
msgid "People who were smitten with her,\npeople with a thing for being abused by her,\npeople hooked on conversing with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190480"
msgid "People who detested her to death,\npeople who were crazy over her body…\nA lot of different folks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190580"
msgid "The end results were all the same: suicide.\nEven outside the internet, most of the people\nwho associated with her committed suicide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190716"
msgid "Included among them were even\ncyber investigators and spies from the\nconglomerates that had chased her around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190828"
msgid "What's astonishing is that apparently,\none spy died in order to save her\nfrom adherents who were out to kill her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2190944"
msgid "…according to these documents,\nthat person was apparently her lover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191016"
msgid "According to #C236196003Julius#CDEF, that person was\na misanthrope and didn't seem particularly\ninterested in women."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191136"
msgid "…personally, I can't comprehend\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's cognitive structure.\nShe's too much of an enigma."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191252"
msgid "She was betrayed by others over and over again.\nAnd yet, she didn't abandon her goal\nof bringing salvation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191360"
msgid "Or rather… It makes me think that\nshe's fine with being betrayed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191428"
msgid "You could say she has an indomitable spirit,\nbut in her case, it goes much too far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191512"
msgid "I may not be one to say this, but…\nIt's as if she's a machine devoid of emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191596"
msgid "I think so, too. It's like she's obsessed\nwith being a hero of justice? Or something.\nShe's even being called \"the last saint.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191724"
msgid "One thing's for sure: she's the biggest victim.\nBut it's also true that she's the cause\nof mass suicide and conflict."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191844"
msgid "Thus, with backing from the conglomerates,\nshe was added to the world's most wanted list.\nThough some came to her legal defense…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2191976"
msgid "A woman emerges, is treated as a saint\nin the East, and disregards their group――\nGuess they couldn't let that one slip by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2192104"
msgid "You're being biased, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF was considered \"clearly a\nmodern-day saint,\" even by the Church."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2192252"
msgid "The problem is that the person who started\ninsisting on that was a Church cardinal…\nAnd a candidate for the next papacy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2192376"
msgid "The Holy Church didn't try to apprehend #C236196003Kiara#CDEF\nbecause she was some thorn in their side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2192480"
msgid "They recognized her as the highest class of\nthreat to the preservation of their faith."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2192568"
msgid "T-they're being way more vicious than they\nneed to be! What about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's virtue!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2192668"
msgid "I think it should be called \"magical powers\"\nat this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2192728"
msgid "It was only for a brief time… just two months\nthat he was in contact with #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF,\nbut his nature truly became that of a saint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2192880"
msgid "That resulted in the Church going after her.\nShe was betrayed by her faith and many people,\nand was denounced as a murderer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193008"
msgid "…okay. We're taking the wrong route by\nbringing Earth affairs into the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193108"
msgid "Well, yeah. But, while I partially agree,\nI think #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193196"
msgid "That girl there's an airhead.\nShe has no clue how much she drives\neveryone around her insane."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193292"
msgid "The nickname she got stuck with,\n\"The Devilish Bodhisattva,\" really sums her up.\nWhy is that, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193412"
msgid "Please refrain from making\nunnecessary contact with her from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193484"
msgid "When I came to, I was in front of the cherry blossom tree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193544"
msgid "It felt like I spent years in the Imaginary Number Space,\nbut simply being back here relaxes me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193644"
msgid "Although, I never would've dreamed that the day would come\nwhen I'd get \"nostalgic\" about this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193752"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nI'm glad you made it back in one piece."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193816"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and the others are gathered in the schoolyard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193908"
msgid "I can see the same fatigue in all of their faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2193960"
msgid "It's as if they had each escaped some peril,\nand came here to check up on one another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2194048"
msgid "Not \"as if,\" that's exactly what happened,\napparently. I'm sure you also had a rough time,\nbut we were in a pinch, ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2194176"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF became #C236196003BB#CDEF's stooge and ambushed us.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, and I were in the Student Council\nRoom, and we were on the verge of death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2194372"
msgid "After that, because #C236196003Sakura#CDEF had collapsed,\nthe old school's barrier was lifted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2194468"
msgid "And of course, that's when hostile programs from\nthe Labyrinth invaded, and NPCs in the school\nwere systematically attacked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2194596"
msgid "…so that's how it went down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2194628"
msgid "The old school is protected by #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nYour average hostile program can't enter,\nand even #C236196003BB#CDEF can only affect us by \"observing the inside.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2194800"
msgid "However, the Masters #C236196003Sakura#CDEF regards as the\n\"subjects of her guardianship\" are different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2194908"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF, a Master, returned to the old school, \nrendered #C236196003Sakura#CDEF powerless, and lifted the barrier.\nHe attacked #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and then ushered hostile programs\ninto the mayhem-afflicted building to gain control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2195184"
msgid "On #C236196003BB#CDEF's command, he commandeered this space\nin just a few minutes, but still――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2195284"
msgid "Externally, it looked like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and\nthe NPCs were on the verge of death,\nbut the damage they took wasn't fatal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2195416"
msgid "Then, #C236196003Rani#CDEF and I were pushed into\nthe Imaginary Number Space,\nand everyone else was left in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2195540"
msgid "That's all that happened.\nEveryone managed to find their own way back\nand got here just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2195636"
msgid "…what about you two?\nWe were able to monitor up until #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nwas defeated, but what happened after that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2195756"
msgid "I explained to #C236196003Rin#CDEF\nthe sequence of events up until this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2195836"
msgid "About how #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Gawain#CDEF are gone.\nAbout how #C236196003Julius#CDEF saved me in his final moments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2195968"
msgid "And also about how #C236196003BB#CDEF's true goal is\nto head to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196072"
msgid "………I see.\nIt's a shame what happened to #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196164"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's thoughts on the matter end there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196220"
msgid "I didn't expect her to give no response on #C236196003BB#CDEF's motive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196292"
msgid "What, about how she's heading for the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF? Well, I was already thinking\nthat might happen in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196424"
msgid "The absolute worst case scenario I assumed\ncame to be. That's it.\nIt's scary, but not surprising."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196524"
msgid "It sounds like #C236196003Rin#CDEF had predicted, roughly,\nwhat \"#C236196003BB#CDEF ultimately had her eyes on.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196640"
msgid "No wonder she's the Student Council Vice President.\nShe's as reliable as a person can be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196732"
msgid "Though, I didn't think her goal would be\nsomething like \"a world where desires are\nunleashed.\" That's one awful future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196852"
msgid "We can't stand here being gloomy all day.\nI'll light a fire under everyone's ass and\nget us reorganized. You go get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2196980"
msgid "…I don't know what happened to you\nand I won't ask,\nbut your internals are all shattered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2197072"
msgid "You're holding up for now, but I can tell\nyou're cobbled together. You're so mangled,\nI'm impressed you can still think rationally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2197204"
msgid "…I'm surprised.\nApparently, for someone with #C236196003Rin#CDEF's level of observation,\nthey can easily catch on to how wounded my body is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2197348"
msgid "I'm not hurting anymore,\nbut if #C236196003Rin#CDEF is telling me to rest, then I should rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2197444"
msgid "To those who are in good health, she says \"go fight.\"\nAnd to those who must rest, she says \"go rest.\"\nPointing out the difference is #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's kindness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2197620"
msgid "Have you made your preparations?\nWe're ready to take position and back you up."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2197700"
msgid "All right, let's go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2197724"
msgid "Got it. Alright, let's have you dive\ninto the world of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2197812"
msgid "Understood. I'll guide you into the world\nof #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind, President #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2197924"
msgid "If you go in unprepared, we're all doomed.\nWe're on full standby until you're ready."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198012"
msgid "More prudence is needed from you today\ncompared to your usual explorations.\nBe fully prepared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198108"
msgid "By the way, about that recent Psycho Dive:\nwhat did you think about being inside #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198216"
msgid "Hey! #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF…!\nThe way you're saying it is,\nin many ways, um…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198296"
msgid "? Why are you getting so embarrassed?\nYou're an AI. Aren't you used to having your\ninternal structure investigated?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198412"
msgid "Is that so? Well, there are only a few #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF\nwho can hack one of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's advanced AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198564"
msgid "……… #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nI apologize for Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's rudeness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198652"
msgid "She has a tendency to be overly logical\nabout hacking. One could say she's\nprone to being more inhumane than us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198768"
msgid "Huh? This is no big deal for a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND.\nWhy're you staring at me like that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2198892"
msgid "As you can see, she lacks delicacy. I'm still\nlearning about emotions, but Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nis an excellent teacher. Of what not to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199040"
msgid "Ah, I know what you mean.\nWhen I look at #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, I try to be more\nconscious about the hem of my skirt…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199164"
msgid "…you two get along really well, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199208"
msgid "…need something?\nAs you can see, I don't feel like talking.\nLeave me alone for a while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199300"
msgid "Man, what is it?\nHave something you want to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2199352"
msgid "…what's an \"Observed Universe\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199388"
msgid "Then be quiet! …ah, sorry.\nIt's terrible to lash out at an innocent person.\nBut honestly, I'm not very composed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199504"
msgid "#C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF…?\nAhh, I did explain something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199584"
msgid "\"Here, time doesn't pass.\nIf we were in a loop, we might've still\nhad a chance…\" Something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199688"
msgid "But this situation is nothing like that kind of\nfar-fetched dream. We can't change the \"result\"\nthat occurred no matter what we do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199820"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is a world made of\nImaginary Numbers. There IS a concept of time,\nbut how it works differs from reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2199968"
msgid "I suppose I should say it's the difference\nbetween \"perceived time\" and \"recorded time.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200060"
msgid "Look, we're talking about this right now\nin the present, right? But…\nOne, two, three…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200148"
msgid "There. Now what I said three seconds ago\nbecame \"the past.\" Even though we're still\nin the #ROFS0004#RUBSpresent#RUBEmiddle#REND of our conversation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200300"
msgid "This is the perceived flow of time.\nThrough humans' \"own perception,\" we separate\ntime and space into past, present, and future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200432"
msgid "#C000246204Observed Universes#CDEF have very simple laws of\nphysics. People can't see what comes after the\npresent, but they can influence the future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200584"
msgid "It's a bit late to mention this, but the real\nworld and the Near Side of the Moon are managed\nby this #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF. With me so far?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200740"
msgid "Basically, our world is the one with\n\"time that we perceive.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200804"
msgid "Humans perceive the \"past\" as\nconstantly updating into the \"present.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200876"
msgid "From that present, we observe the \"future\"\nwhich eventually comes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2200944"
msgid "But a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF's laws are different.\nA #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF is perceived from several\ndimensions above: a high dimensional entity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2201116"
msgid "From the perspective of a higher dimension,\nthe third dimension looks like a flat scroll."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2201208"
msgid "Umm, it's like if the 3-D world was a world\nprinted in a book, and you jumped from within\nthe book and landed outside the book."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2201336"
msgid "You could then look down at the records\nof your past, present, and future that's in\nthe book whenever you wanted――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2201456"
msgid "That's the perspective of a higher dimension.\nYou get it, right? With that being the case,\nall time within the book has equal value."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2201592"
msgid "It's the same thing here.\nThis is an Imaginary Number Space, a higher\ndimensional data space made out of light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2201704"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is fundamentally\nmanaged through the laws of a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF,\nnot an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2201872"
msgid "We're foreign matter… No, we're guests here.\nCreatures from an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF\nthat got tossed into a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2202028"
msgid "But, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's Core is a parallel world\nsimulator where past, present, and future exist\nsimultaneously, with all outcomes calculated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2202184"
msgid "Basically, it's a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF entity.\nAnd now #C236196003BB#CDEF's become the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. She gained\nthe perspective of a higher dimension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2202364"
msgid "That's why――\n#C236196003BB#CDEF can manipulate the past and future\nat the same time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2202452"
msgid "The moment #C236196003BB#CDEF reached the Core, she gained\nthe power to select a future and set it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2202552"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF was purely the Eye of God.\nWith an AI like #C236196003BB#CDEF mixed in now,\nit's become the Brain of God."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2202688"
msgid "I don't know what the future will look like in\na few hours, but either way, #C236196003BB#CDEF reached\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. That truth ISN'T changing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2202852"
msgid "She's now become a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF entity.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF can make facts retroactive. She can make it\nso that she knew \"this present\" would come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203020"
msgid "…it's all pretty confusing.\nOnce #C236196003BB#CDEF became the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, she became able\nto tell her past self about \"this present.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203172"
msgid "\"Chasing after her as if we might make it in time somehow.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203232"
msgid "That act itself was futile.\nIt was decided from the beginning that\n#C236196003BB#CDEF would reach the Core in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203352"
msgid "…anyway, that's how it is.\nIf you get it now, then be quiet for me.\nWe can't win against god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203448"
msgid "If you're feeling restless, then how about\n#C000246204walking around the school#CDEF? It's safe, after all.\nWe're being kept in here like pets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203592"
msgid "…still need something? You need backup\nbecause you're going to the Labyrinth?\nYou're farming experience with your Servant?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203716"
msgid "…listen. Were you not paying attention\nto what we've been saying? It's pointless.\nAnything we do now is pointless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203832"
msgid "The life is draining from their faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2203872"
msgid "More so than the fact that #C236196003BB#CDEF is far too powerful,\nthe fact that we've lost what we were trying to protect\nhas stolen their will to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204028"
msgid "…I know how they feel.\nI was in the same state of mind not too long ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204104"
msgid "I can't force them to fight on against their will.\nHowever, their abilities will be vital\nif I want to enter the Central Region again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204240"
msgid "I need to somehow get them to help me,\neven if it's just getting me to where #C236196003BB#CDEF is――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204344"
msgid "Enough of this! You morons! Listening quietly\nto your nonsense is doing us no good! You call\nyourselves my #RUBS Praetor's#RUBEMaster's#REND women!? Pathetic!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204504"
msgid "Straighten yourselves up, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF!\nIs this how the top #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF of\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF act!? Pathetic!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204696"
msgid "Heads out of your asses, ladies!\nWhat's got you all so spineless!? This ain't\nno pinch for us, not by a long shot!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204812"
msgid "Bah! How long will you stare at the floor, #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF!? Is this the miser and the observing\ndemon; Amazons who stood before me!? Fools!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204980"
msgid "――――Wha――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2204996"
msgid "Battles are fought until you prevail! You may\nlose, your life may be taken―but if you won't\nrise up with indomitable will, then what!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2205132"
msgid "This is the one time you SHOULD follow my\nexample! Fight until you've fallen thrice\nand risen thrice!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2205236"
msgid "Your premise is all wrong, anyhow.\nYou say the future is fixed?\nWhat else is new!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2205320"
msgid "People have no influence over the past or\nfuture. \"Changing the future\" was already\na ridiculous idea!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2205424"
msgid "People have influence only over the present.\nHaven't you already proven that doing so\nresults in changing the future!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2205544"
msgid "Listen. Our coming battles aren't pointless.\nActually―― There's no such thing as\n\"pointless battles\" when it comes to humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2205672"
msgid "You stop because you see the end result. If it\nwere common sense to do so, human civilization\nwouldn't have developed as it has."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2205804"
msgid "And most of all, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF――\nYou're thinking about it all wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2205904"
msgid "Sure, anything that's \"decided\" here in the Far\nSide is absolute. #C236196003BB#CDEF reached the Core.\nNothing can probably change that now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206048"
msgid "However―― You CAN add a new, small detail\nto that outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206112"
msgid "Things have no end. Something always continues\non after. Don't be misled by how things\nare in Imaginary Number Spaces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206232"
msgid "Even under the laws of a higher dimension,\nbetween the present and future is the tiniest\nblank space where one can write in a sentence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206368"
msgid "\"The Moon was destroyed by a witch.\"\n\"However―― By the efforts of adamant youths,\nthe world was narrowly saved.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206484"
msgid "So.\nFor what purpose do your skills exist for?\nSo you can sit here and be at your wits' end?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206580"
msgid "Ahem.\nPlease don't look so down, you two.\nHold off on resignation for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206668"
msgid "I know I'm sticking my nose in, but that's why\nI'm going to go ahead and say this:\nwe haven't been defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206780"
msgid "Please look at Darling. No matter how many times\n#[he][she]# loses or runs, #[he][she]# nonchalantly survives\nand eventually brings about an upset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2206928"
msgid "So long as we have someone who plays\ndirty like this, \"somehow always winning\nin the end,\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2207020"
msgid "The present exists so we can do something about\nit. The future may be decided, but that doesn't\nmean you can't change the present!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2207152"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF has fallen, certainly.\nThere was never any future in store for you all\nwhere you stopped that from happening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2207300"
msgid "Isn't it natural? She crafted a premise\nwhere your \"victory\" was shut out,\nthen summoned you all here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2207404"
msgid "So far, it's all as #C236196003BB#CDEF planned. You all merely\ndance in the palm of her hand. But, she doesn't\nknow of the slight irregularities inside her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2207564"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's calculations end here. She intended to\nbring everything to a close with her victory and\nyour defeat―as the future had been set."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2207716"
msgid "However. There remains some with will\nyet to fight… Fools who refuse to disappear,\nrather; who persist after defeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2207836"
msgid "Your fated defeat can't be reversed.\nThat's one impossible request even I\ncan't grant. That is why――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2207940"
msgid "Get through the events set in stone, and all\nthat's left after is a blank page.\nThat's where your fight takes place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208060"
msgid "How presumptuous to think you can\nchange the future, anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208124"
msgid "#ROFS-009#RUBSThe present#RUBE\"Now\"#REND constantly passes, #ROFS-003#RUBSthe future#RUBE\"next\"#REND is a cloth\ncontinually woven in extension,\nand I am the eternal, undying King of Heroes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208316"
msgid "So long as I exist, there is no \"end.\" If you\nforesee a future of ruin, then change the nuance\nof the meaning, as when history is compiled!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208456"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's encouragement echoes throughout\nthe sullen Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208544"
msgid "It was as if a wave washed over us.\nThe tan girl is the first to regain herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208628"
msgid "――――That's true.\nAhh. I wonder why I didn't realize it sooner,\nit's so obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208712"
msgid "All #C236196003BB#CDEF did was decide the future.\nThe future might not be alterable,\nbut the present is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208820"
msgid "After all―― The present is still our domain.\nIt's the one thing an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF\nhas over a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2208972"
msgid "A familiar glint returns to the red girl's eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2209024"
msgid "…I faintly recall something.\nIn the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she lent me a hand many\ntimes despite us being enemies.\nShe was a worthy rival, brimming with life\nwho always sought to play fair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2209224"
msgid "And even though I had said it myself once\nbefore: stopping #C236196003BB#CDEF isn't the objective\nof this fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2209340"
msgid "That's right. The reason the future is decided\nis because a \"present where we defeated #C236196003BB#CDEF\"\ndoesn't exist here in the Far Side yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2209488"
msgid "But if we can create that present, we can\ncreate a new possibility. The future will have\na different outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2209600"
msgid "With two futures, the future that occurred\nhere will decouple with the present world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2209688"
msgid "…to be honest, defeating #C236196003BB#CDEF might not make\na huge difference to the future at this point,\nfor all we know. Still――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2209824"
msgid "Still, a computational error WILL arise.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF will be eliminated, and the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will\nreturn to normal. That itself is worth it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2209988"
msgid "Exactly.\nAt last you've regained\nyour previous sensibility!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210048"
msgid "Exactly.\nYou two really do have the right stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210100"
msgid "Splendidly done鷙\n…honestly, making Darling fight alone is bit\nof a heavy burden for anyone to bear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210204"
msgid "…hmph. Look at me rallying these cretins\nback to their feet. So foolish.\nKnow that this is your fault, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210320"
msgid "Though this doesn't mean I've redeemed myself.\nFrom here on out, I'll be giving my\nall as an operator."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210424"
msgid "…I feel the same. We're the ones crafting\nthe strategies, yet we ended up becoming\na burden on you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210528"
msgid "\"I'll at least get sent to where #C236196003BB#CDEF is.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210588"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are more outstanding #C000246204Magi#CDEF, fighters than I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210696"
msgid "Because they have superior judgement,\nthey were more realistic in discerning #C236196003BB#CDEF's\ncomparative strength and our situation,\nwhich overwhelmed them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210860"
msgid "They felt worry and anxiety magnitudes more than I did."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2210916"
msgid "…yeah. I knew full well how strong #C236196003BB#CDEF\nwas compared to us from the very beginning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211016"
msgid "\"We're no match for her.\" \"We can't do anything.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211068"
msgid "If reasons like that are stopping us in our tracks,\nthen we're not putting up much of a fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211164"
msgid "He knew that we would lose.\nHe knew we couldn't win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211220"
msgid "Still―― He entrusted everything to\nsomeone who hadn't yet given up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211292"
msgid "Alright. So now we're facing two issues:\nThe first is that huge Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211372"
msgid "Yes. Without destroying that Core,\nwe can't reach the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF.\nIt truly is our final obstacle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211492"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?\nWearing a grave expression,\nshe returns to the Student Council Room from the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211608"
msgid "…#C000246204SGs#CDEF may be secrets,\nbut I don't think that makes them traumas…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211692"
msgid "Wait, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. If what you say is true,\nthen can you quickly do something about it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211792"
msgid "…………yes.\nEven I can destroy that wall.\nI know I didn't bring it up at the time…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211880"
msgid "No, there was no helping it.\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's mental state was\nabnormal at the time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2211980"
msgid "Hey, are you saying it's MY fault!?\nGah… Sure, yeah, it was my fault!\nThat huge thing was incredible, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212096"
msgid "So please, don't hesitate to\nremove that Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212156"
msgid "Please allow me one condition to open that door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212208"
msgid "I'm an AI that manages everyone's health and\nsafety. Technically, I have to oppose you all\ngoing off to fight a battle you can't win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212344"
msgid "…I won't say anything more to stop you.\nI'll be aiding you in your fight, everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212432"
msgid "No. I can't approve as things stand now.\nWe need a countermeasure against #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nPlease find a way to disable her #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212588"
msgid "Once you do so, I'll open up the Labyrinth\nCore… #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind. That's the one and only\ncondition I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212712"
msgid "So #C236196003Sakura#CDEF says,\nher eyes bearing determination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212776"
msgid "\"#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF\"――\nShe has a point. Disabling that skill is the\nminimum we need to do. Let's start by consulting #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212928"
msgid "Should we start the dive?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2212956"
msgid "Give me a little more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2212984"
msgid "Make it quick, okay?\nTime does hardly pass here,\nbut unforeseen forces could \"get it moving.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213080"
msgid "\"I'm all set.\"\nI reply to #C236196003Rin#CDEF that I'm ready whenever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213152"
msgid "Then let's get started.\nWe'll have #C236196003#SVT#CDEF enter an idle state.\nAnd you'll take this, here:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213260"
msgid "It's been decided, so please just roll with it.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, are we ready?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213368"
msgid "I'm ready as well.\n#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, once you've dived in,\nhurry towards the center of your Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213488"
msgid "There will be a battle against my primal self,\nwhich even I know nothing of. …is there\nany way to avoid that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213600"
msgid "A \"me\" that even I know nothing about, huh…\nIs there any way to restrain this \"me\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213688"
msgid "I would like to ask something, just in case…\nIs there any way to restrain this cornerstone\n\"me,\" this #ROFS0006#RUBSanimal#RUBEprimal#REND \"me\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213836"
msgid "You can guess what will happen with my\nprototype. Just to be sure, is there no way to\navoid battle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2213936"
msgid "It's probably not possible. To a \"#C000246204Mythical\nMystic Code#CDEF\"― the \"root,\" logic and instincts\nare a nuisance. I think battle is unavoidable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2214092"
msgid "It's an origin that you have no knowledge of, so\nplease think of it as a different person… or\na phenomenon which shares only your looks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2214232"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nWhile #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF is undertaking the mission,\nyou'll be able to do nothing but watch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2214352"
msgid "…it's still a highly dangerous mission,\nbut you have no choice but to believe in us.\nPlease entrust this to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2214468"
msgid "…okay.\nYes, I've taken up time needlessly.\nI place my Praetor in your hands, #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2214568"
msgid "I see, that makes sense.\nThen―― Please make use of my body.\nI place the life of my #RUBS Darling#RUBEMaster#REND in your hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2214700"
msgid "Come, now. There's nothing to fret over. That\nman has a tendency to size up his enemies.\nHe won't take a mongrel seriously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2214824"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF entrusts #SVT[her][his][her][his]# body to #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2214912"
msgid "Looks like, in my case――#C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003Rin#CDEF will be handling me.\nThey will extract my soul from my digital frame,\nconvert it into an independent \"unit,\"\nthen send it into #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's \"soul.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2215144"
msgid "Now, close your eyes. When the conversion\nstarts, I think you'll feel a bit squished,\nbut don't wiggle around too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2215264"
msgid "Extracting soul from the body and mind.\nBeginning telepathy via the #C000246204Multi-Colored\nTranquility#CDEF―― #RUBS  Origin connect#RUBECore contact#REND, start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2215432"
msgid "Oh, yeah.\nYou mind giving me back the cube #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nis sealed in?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2215512"
msgid "As the one who set that mechanism up,\nit's my responsibility to hold on to it."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2215592"
msgid "…about that―― Lancer is…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2215624"
msgid "…can you let me have this cube?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2215660"
msgid "…it pains me to talk about it,\nbut I'll tell #C236196003Rin#CDEF about what happened:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2215748"
msgid "About #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's magnificent heroism.\nAbout the end of the girl who dreamt of being\na diva up until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2215876"
msgid "Huh? #C236196003Lancer#CDEF is still alive, against all odds.\nLooks like she's sleeping like a baby\nin the cube."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2215992"
msgid "Th-then, after we parted so dramatically, she\nonly went back because she was tired!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2216080"
msgid "Okay, I'll be taking this from you♪\nWah! What's going on!? Her bad karma\ndropped like crazy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2216176"
msgid "Ugh… That means headaches for me… It's going\nto be hell taking care of this annoying girl\nwhen I'm an old lady…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2216292"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF was magnificent up until the very end. \nIt wouldn't do her justice to sum up her bravery\nas resulting from \"her just being sad\"―\nEven if she WAS our enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2216472"
msgid "You sure?\nI don't mind, but it's a big responsibility,\nyou know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2216540"
msgid "It's a cursed item, see. Throwing it\naway willy-nilly will come back to bite you,\nand holding on to it lowers your luck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2216664"
msgid "Well, karma like hers won't go away in one or\neven two hundred years. That there will probably\nstay a box until you pass away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2216792"
msgid "Hang in there.\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF may be powerful, but hey, I know\nyou'll make it through someway or another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2216908"
msgid "After all, that's how you've gotten\nall your wins up 'til now.\nI'm not worried. It's just that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217008"
msgid "I hate to put pressure on you,\nbut don't mess up in the final stretch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217080"
msgid "If we don't stop that AI, #C236196003BB#CDEF…\nwe won't be able to bounce back…\nThat's the feeling I'm getting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217196"
msgid "I told you, hurry off and get to your My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217244"
msgid "If #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was feeling well, I'd have her\ngive you a medical checkup, but she's getting\nrepairs right now. Can't use the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217392"
msgid "Wh-what is it…? You look like you haven't said\nenough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217452"
msgid "Prepare yourself for when we get back to the\nNear Side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217508"
msgid "*sigh*… If I had my #C236196003Lancer#CDEF with me, this \nwouldn't have happened…\nWhat a terrible blunder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217620"
msgid "Eh? \"What happened to that #C236196003blue Lancer#CDEF,\"\nyou ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217688"
msgid "Right about now he must be in the Near Side\nscratching his head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217756"
msgid "And only I was pulled into the #C000246204Far Side of the\nMoon#CDEF. If I don't get back quickly, he'll\nprobably run out of mana and disappear…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2217904"
msgid "The more of the Labyrinth's info you gather,\nthe easier it'll be for me to hack it.\nI'm counting on you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218032"
msgid "Hey. Incidentally, is that #C236196003Leo#CDEF over there the\nREAL #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218120"
msgid "You can change in My Room.\nWhy not try heading back and changing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218188"
msgid "I like my clothes, so I'll be staying like this.\nI've always wanted to wear a uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218276"
msgid "You can change clothes in My Room.\nGive it a try when you have other\noutfits to wear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218364"
msgid "Y-you can't go around wearing that!\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF may approve, but I don't!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218448"
msgid "At last, the third and final #C000246204SG#CDEF. Hmhmhm.\nWhatever sort of secret it is, I'm going to\ndrag it out into the sunlight―― Just watch!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218596"
msgid "Ah! #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nH-how long were you standing there!?\nAhahahaha. N-nice weather today, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218700"
msgid "A secret even she doesn't realize she has…\nIs it possible, considering it's #C236196003Rani#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218800"
msgid "Jeeeez! How are we supposed to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF in\nher domain!? Let us try something WE'RE good\nat, come on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2218920"
msgid "Eh? What's my strong suit? Umm… Ch-Chinese\ncooking, and cyber terrorism, and money systems,\nand yeah, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219036"
msgid "Good work. I never thought #C236196003Jinako#CDEF would get\nthe third #C000246204SG#CDEF for us. I'm surprised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219148"
msgid "At any rate, \"#C000246204Powergamer#CDEF,\" huh… Pfft.\nWhat kind of a naming sense is that?\nIt's no wonder #C236196003Rani#CDEF is pissed off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219292"
msgid "Just hearing that broadcast makes\nme tense up, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219352"
msgid "By the way, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. What kind of food\ndo you like? Wanna try having a cooking battle\nbetween us later?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219472"
msgid "About #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, I don't really get along with\nher, or rather, we're not very compatible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219576"
msgid "It's not that I don't like her or anything. It's\njust that our ways of life are different in too\nmany ways. It's hard to approach her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219712"
msgid "…hey. Now WHY do I get the feeling\nyou're looking at my chest? You think different\nmeans in terms of \"size,\" eh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219828"
msgid "Alright, kneel down. Then repent. If you keep\nup the sexual harassment, I'll skin you alive\nand toss you into the Styx鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2219952"
msgid "Eh? You understand? I'm so glad! It sort of\nfeels like we're tight-knit now―― Hey. \nWhy do I feel your gaze on my chest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220076"
msgid "…yeah, they do.\nThat's why the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF exists.\nIt was dumb of me to ask."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220176"
msgid "Her chest is her #C000246204SG#CDEF… Her chest being an #C000246204SG#CDEF…\nThere's SO much showing already, how can\nit even be a secret!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220320"
msgid "If they're such a bother, why not share\nwith people who could use some!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220396"
msgid "Huh? You want to know what I'm talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220444"
msgid "Don't keep asking the obvious.\nIf you keep pretending to be thickheaded,\nI really will kill you, hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220552"
msgid "Good work. At least this #C000246204SG#CDEF was an\neasy one to get as well. Keep it up for\nthe next one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220660"
msgid "Although… About all the problems, outside of\ngetting the #C000246204SG#CDEF, all I can really do is give you\nmy condolences. Try your best, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220812"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF! Phew, I'm glad you're back in\none piece. Thinking about the worst happening\nto you makes me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2220932"
msgid "Without you, we'd have no one to\nexplore the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, okay?\nThat's all I meant! Really, that's ALL!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221060"
msgid "Pester me anymore, and I'll spread a virus\nacross the Labyrinth that melts only clothes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221152"
msgid "Going with the essentially unreasonable #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nor the punishment of being with #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nIn a sense, it's the ultimate decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221312"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is surprisingly normal, huh?\nA lot like you, don't you think, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221420"
msgid "You don't get what I mean? Oh, come on～\nIt doesn't mean anything～ I wasn't thinking\nanything like \"couple of bores.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221540"
msgid "You must be worried about things, but get\nsome rest, first. We'll do as much as we\ncan in the meantime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221644"
msgid "You're up against an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nStrong, but not someone you can't necessarily\nbeat. Do your best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221760"
msgid "You alright, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nAre your memories jumbled up in any way?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221840"
msgid "Me…?\nI'm okay. I'm not the delicate type that\nloses her cool over something like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2221928"
msgid "I don't get why #C236196003Leo#CDEF, as neatly perfect as he is,\nis so indifferent when it comes to a woman's\nheart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222048"
msgid "He probably didn't have people around him who\nwould teach him about that sort of thing,\nrather than it just being his personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222180"
msgid "But now I think about it, he does have #C236196003Julius#CDEF\nwith him, who's very down-to-earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222280"
msgid "Huh? You never realized that?\nIt's just that he has a poker face.\nYou'd be surprised how much he reacts to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222388"
msgid "Well, if he were any more delicate with women,\nhe'd be perfect to the point of being creepy.\nHow he is now may be just right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222516"
msgid "Goofs are way more dangerous than folks\nof conviction. That's because they have\nno self-awareness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222616"
msgid "I don't get along with saint-type people\nin the first place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222680"
msgid "I think she ACTUALLY has some screws\nloose somewhere. Serving others without\nany reward, really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222780"
msgid "And that's why, though being suspicious of her\nis a little extreme, we should be careful\nto not trust #C236196003Kiara#CDEF too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2222916"
msgid "Too much of a good thing is bad for you. If you\nget too used to people being nice to you,\nyou start turning soft, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223040"
msgid "Hehehehe.\nWe've got that damn #C236196003BB#CDEF by the neck, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223108"
msgid "Just you wait!\nPayback just got an interest hike――\nMy thanks for messing with us at your whimsy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223208"
msgid "I told you, hurry off and get to your My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223256"
msgid "If #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was feeling well, I'd have her\ngive you a medical checkup, but she's getting\nrepairs right now. Can't use the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223404"
msgid "I know it's been tough recently, but…\nUltimately, you have to go to the Labyrinth and\nget the #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF. That hasn't changed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223568"
msgid "Give it your best, our new President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223608"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's invitation is pretty much a trap.\nDon't let your guard down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223700"
msgid "Keep in mind―― You can't eat something that's\nnot food, even if the person that made it\ninsists they made it with love. Capiche?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223832"
msgid "It dealt THAT much damage just from its purely\nawful flavor? It's extraordinary, in one\nsense… I wonder what spices she used…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2223960"
msgid "What surprises me even more is that even after \nall that damage you took, you're good as new,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224080"
msgid "What's the deal with your stomach?\nLet us #RUBS   scan#RUBEanalyze#REND you thoroughly later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224176"
msgid "HUH? She ran away? What's going on!?\nWe're fine here, hurry and #C000246204go after her#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224272"
msgid "Well, most importantly, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF came out fine. \nWe also got #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF out of the way.\nThings turned out alright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224416"
msgid "So, what was it like inside #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224468"
msgid "I know.\nJust kidding. It was just a joke."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224512"
msgid "It's normal to tease #[girls][boys]# you're interested in.\nYou've done it before, right, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224624"
msgid "You must be tuckered out after today.\n#C000246204How about going back to My Room and resting#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224724"
msgid "Me? Ahh, yeah.\nAfter I wrap this last thing up,\nI guess I'll hit the hay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224800"
msgid "I'll finish this up quick and\nhave myself that shower."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2224856"
msgid "Ah, before I forget. If by any chance you happen\nto peek or something, I'll mod all the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF exits to \"forbid egress\"鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225004"
msgid "You probably don't remember, but you have\na history of peeking around.\nA shock won't cut it this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225108"
msgid "If you'd like, how about we go in together?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225152"
msgid "Huh? You want to know what I was\ntalking to #C236196003Rani#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225252"
msgid "Like hell I'm going to say it in front\nof other people!!! Especially in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225340"
msgid "When three girls get together to talk,\nit can only be about one thing, right?\nRomance, always romance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225444"
msgid "But both #C236196003Rani#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF are clueless when\nit comes to that stuff… I'm not going to\nhassle them over it, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225592"
msgid "I was kind of hoping to see whose memory it\nwas about… Hmm, it feels like I got\nmy hopes up for nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225700"
msgid "We know what causes her invincibility, but the\nway to destroy it is more than just difficult.\nWe may as well call it a gamble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225828"
msgid "Why's it gotta be invincibility, anyway!?\nShe better be putting up her wallet if she\nwants a pass on cheats like that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2225948"
msgid "This will be the last time we work together.\nYou'll enter #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's mind and beat her.\nThen you'll bust into the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226116"
msgid "Just do what you always do and you'll win,\nno sweat. Don't get overeager, just stay cool."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226208"
msgid "Now I'm kind of relieved.\nFeels like I'm overflowing with motivation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226280"
msgid "Yep, yep鷙\nMoney really does make the world go round!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226336"
msgid "Wh-what!?\nIt's no big deal―― I do like money, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226396"
msgid "Hehehehehe. Time to show us how slick\nof a#RUBS      Magus#RUBE#C000246204 negotiator#CDEF#REND you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226504"
msgid "If you have anything left to take care of,\ngo get it done now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226568"
msgid "I guess all I have left to do is clean up\nthe Student Council Room and the room I've been\nusing. Then it's bedtime for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226692"
msgid "Alright, meeting adjourned.\nI'm in private mode now.\nWe'll pick this back up tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226780"
msgid "Oh?\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, you're back in our old uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226840"
msgid "Hm? I don't have much to say about it.\nI've seen plenty of that uniform.\nBut… you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2226932"
msgid "When I just sit and look you over, I think…\nNo, I thought this way before, too.\nYou're rather good looking…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227044"
msgid "Ah, what am I even saying!? \nI have nothing to say, nothing!\nGo get your ass in that Labyrinth already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227148"
msgid "So you obtained new dust data.\nI'll begin decompressing it, then. A volume of\nthis size should take a few seconds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227264"
msgid "………………………decompression failed.\nAnd verification, complete.\nSo that's what it was, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227368"
msgid "The contents of the first cube was\na compressed version of the first Arena."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227444"
msgid "The contents of the second cube was\na compressed, special hostile program."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227520"
msgid "It appears to be a skill which\ncompresses anything to its minimum, no matter\nhow large the volume is, and stores it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227640"
msgid "The issue is in, I think, that this compression\nis irreversible. Whatever data she compresses\ncan never return to its original form."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227776"
msgid "The moment it gets compressed into a cube shape,\nthe data becomes garbage which merely\n\"was once that kind of data.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2227896"
msgid "Though it's compressed, it can't be\ndecompressed. Though it's destroyed,\nit persists as it was before in form――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2228012"
msgid "…this data, thrown away in the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF, is a mass of information which we\ncan't comprehend from our point of view."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2228156"
msgid "Is a person a person because they're in the\nshape of a person? If you gather up human parts,\na human's necessary materials, is it human?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2228296"
msgid "Where does one put the soul, all the qualia?\n…if we put those questions aside… This\ncompression may be an instance of eternity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2228428"
msgid "Those who are compressed by #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF\nare anchored for eternity, and are stowed away\nin a storage named the \"recycle bin.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2228568"
msgid "What lies ahead for them is Hell, where they\nlive on, transformed into slices of flesh. That\nsuffering isn't perceivable to us, outside."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "2228708"
msgid "Mystic Code \"#C000246204Dustcloud of Osiris#CDEF\""
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "2228760"
msgid "added to the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2228788"
msgid "Apologies for the wait.\nThe data #C236196003Archer#CDEF gave us has\nfinished decompressing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2228880"
msgid "Since the folder is unnamed, we don't know whose\nmemory this belongs to… But this is an advanced\narchive file utilizing pseudo-Spiritrons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229020"
msgid "If we open the folder, a patch will\nautomatically be applied on its owner.\nShall we open it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229116"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF was cautious about storing it, after all.\nThere's a high chance that there's a clue\nin it that will help us defeat her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229256"
msgid "P-please wait!\nYou can't go opening someone's \"memory\" when\nyou don't know who it belongs to――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229356"
msgid "There's nothing risky about it, right?\nIt's not as if someone else's memory is\ngoing to get overwritten."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229464"
msgid "Overwriting memories that aren't yours to\nbrainwash someone is a huge endeavor.\nEven #C236196003BB#CDEF would need some time to pull it off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229608"
msgid "Simply opening the file and having the memories\nreturn to their owner won't matter. If they're\nfake, they'll bounce off of the soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229744"
msgid "Then I'll extract it.\nI believe it'll be relevant to either\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, or me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229880"
msgid "Close your eyes, relax your consciousness.\nAlright―― I'm opening it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2229952"
msgid "I haven't discovered anything new, either.\nIt must have belonged to #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF then,\nI suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2230072"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, please comment. If it's hard\nto speak aloud, or even if it's a memory of Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, feel free to write it down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2230260"
msgid "I take issue with these two keenly peeping at me exclusively.\nAnyway, I don't feel very much different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2230364"
msgid "…if I recall correctly, it was said during that\n#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF that the \"truth\" would be revealed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2230476"
msgid "I see. Well, it'll become clear at some point,\nlike it or not. Don't worry about it,\njust keep exploring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2230584"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF is right.\nLet's get to doing what we can do right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2230660"
msgid "…hm? I may just be imagining it,\nbut #C236196003Sakura#CDEF seems to be acting a little strange.\nShe looks pale and seems to be suppressing some chills."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2230816"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?\nYour thought-routines aren't stable.\nHas your accumulated #RUBS fatigue#RUBEdamage#REND not gone away?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2230948"
msgid "…what was that?\nAs #C236196003Sakura#CDEF went to leave the Student Council Room,\nshe glanced at me as if to tell me something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231080"
msgid "Maybe she wants to tell me something in private?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231132"
msgid "…what's the matter?\nI don't think there's any more\nneed to speak to me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231208"
msgid "…the old me wouldn't have suffered.\nIf I hadn't learned about the human mind,\nI would've maintained my own mental state――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231336"
msgid "…still need something?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2231360"
msgid "…no, it's nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231380"
msgid "…how about going to your room and\ngetting some sleep?\nYou look tired. We both do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231464"
msgid "Every #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF erases all NPCs\nand resets every AI's experiences."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231584"
msgid "…let's see.\nMy guess is that so it won't deviate from how\nit should be as an observation machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231684"
msgid "In reality, it may be so that it avoids\ncases like the one we're in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231756"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is the eye of god. Within the\nCore is its storage medium, made of photons,\nwhich exists on a higher dimension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2231900"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF knows how to end humanity.\nHowever, it provides no evaluation of such\na result."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232020"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF doesn't say which choices lead to\na better future―― That is to say, it has no\ncriteria for evaluating good and bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232168"
msgid "That's exactly why it leaves humanity to manage\nthe Earth. No, it exclusively acts as an\noutsider that never intervenes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232292"
msgid "But, if an AI with a clear criteria were to\nenter it, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF may use it as a part\nof its intelligence and pick a better future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232444"
msgid "――Which would be the obliteration of humanity.\nIf they're ultimately going to go extinct,\nthen it should be done now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232564"
msgid "Taking it as a decision that curbs the\nwaste of resources, I think it's\nextremely logical."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232656"
msgid "So long as it's an AI that can't break from being rational,\nany AI would choose to \"purge the Earth of humans.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232768"
msgid "In #C236196003BB#CDEF's case, her method―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232812"
msgid "\"Collapse by way of human free will\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2232852"
msgid "The result of all this is that what wasn't\nsupposed to be possible to happen did… Some\nfatal bug has occurred in the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233000"
msgid "It's not that Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, you, or I were\ninadequate. Nor is it #C236196003Sakura#CDEF or #C236196003BB#CDEF's fault.\nThat bug is the cause of this destruction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233180"
msgid "Saying this, #C236196003Rani#CDEF then stops talking.\n…it looks like #C236196003Rani#CDEF is more defeated than #C236196003Rin#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233320"
msgid "It truly pains me to say this:\nit's impossible to analyze any further\nwith just Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and me alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233444"
msgid "Figures… So it's not going to be that easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233492"
msgid "\"#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF\" is a part of #C236196003BB#CDEF's matrix.\nIt's not likely that she would reveal her weaknesses so easily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233628"
msgid "It's thanks to the #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF that we got part of that data.\nWe couldn't have done it on our own――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233748"
msgid "So please provide us with Sakurament.\nWith this many points,\nI'll get this analysis done in three minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233856"
msgid "So it WAS that easy…!\nIt's a massive amount of points,\nbut it's enough to scrape together somehow!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2233956"
msgid "Look me in the eye, Darling!\nAs the keeper of our finances, I can't approve\nof such wasteful spending!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234060"
msgid "So money speaks loudest in the end, as usual.\n\"King of Heroes Money-is-Power system\"… hmph.\nHas a nice ring to it, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234188"
msgid "Hey! You stole that from me!\nThe Money-is-Power system is a #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF business!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234284"
msgid "It is what it is.\nWe simply don't have enough mechanical power.\nWe have to make up for where we fall short."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234392"
msgid "Haven't I said this before?\nMoney. Money makes the world go round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234460"
msgid "Have you gathered the Sakurament?\nThen please transfer it to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234528"
msgid "Wait, I don't have enough on hand.\nLet's come back once we earn #C00024620450,000 Sm#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234620"
msgid "Once you gather enough, please #C000246204come talk to me#CDEF.\nI'll get this analysis done in three minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234732"
msgid "Please give me a few minutes.\nI swear on Isis, mother of magic,\nthat I will unveil #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "2234844"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's #C000246204Matrix#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234888"
msgid "I don't see a way to block #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF,\nbut I have an idea on how to counteract it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2234988"
msgid "After analyzing #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF,\nI acquired privileges from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nto access \"primordial powers.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235120"
msgid "#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF is the genesis of human history;\nthe dawn lighting over civilization."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235220"
msgid "To summarize, it's an #ROFS0001#RUBS    origin#RUBEarchetypal#REND power from\nwhich human genes began.\nIt is inherent within every human being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235364"
msgid "If they're equal in strength, then it\nmay prevent #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF ability to make things\n\"as if they never happened.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235496"
msgid "Hm? A Servant's primordial strength…\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, you don't mean…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235576"
msgid "Primordial… One's origin, huh? The original\nform of a Heroic Spirit that even we have no\nknowledge of… No way. Really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235700"
msgid "Gehh!\n\"Primordial\" is referring to my\nsource material!? Oh boy, so that means…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235780"
msgid "Oh?\nSo you mean to involve my prototype?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235824"
msgid "Yes. Diving into a Servant's Cyber Frame and\ndirectly accessing their Heroic Spirit core will\nreveal their root, sealed by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2235980"
msgid "We'll unlock a \"#C000246204Mythological Mystic Code#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236040"
msgid "Going directly into a Heroic Spirit's core…\nLike when we did a mental dive into #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236148"
msgid "#[He][She]#'s going inside me!?\nJ-j-just one thing―who will protect\nPraetor if #[he][she]#'s inside me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236256"
msgid "Not to brag or anything,\nbut my red blood cells… rather, my sanitation\nprogram is vicious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236348"
msgid "If you throw my adorable Praetor in there,\nI'm certain #[he][she]# won't last two seconds!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236440"
msgid "Diving into a Servant's digital frame…\nIt may be possible, but it comes with risk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236524"
msgid "So it really has come to this, huh?\nDarling is going to see this part and that part\nof my insides, goodness――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236636"
msgid "Hyaan, how embarrassing for #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236688"
msgid "Ha!? W-well, let's leave that aside for now!\nAs much as I LOVE my Darling, my sanitation\nprogram on the other hand…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236808"
msgid "I don't have control as far down as the cells\nguarding my body. They won't recognize you as\nDarling; they'll try to harm an intruder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2236944"
msgid "Now this is extraordinary. I won't deny you\nto experience my prototype… but with it\ncomes equal part risk, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2237064"
msgid "Any body will have a sanitation system serving\nas the immune function. There are neither\nenemies nor allies there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2237180"
msgid "…that's the one issue. While we can use #C000246204Multi-\nColored Tranquility#CDEF to send in #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF,\n#[his][her]# Servant won't be there for protection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2237352"
msgid "I planned to include an escort doll to serve\nas a pseudo-Servant, but the doll doesn't\nhave very high stats…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2237464"
msgid "…realistically, we can't. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is already\nutilizing memory beyond her limits to maintain\nthe old school building's systems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2237608"
msgid "Performing analyses is one thing, but we don't\nhave the spare memory to add a new,\nindependent function."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2237716"
msgid "O-okay, that would do――\nW-wait, that won't change the fact that\nPraetor will be seeing my insides!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2237820"
msgid "More importantly, under no circumstance\ncan I allow Praetor to contract with\nanyone but me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2237912"
msgid "…makes sense.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF is a Servant deserving of full confidence.\nI need to prioritize my Master's safety."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238036"
msgid "…though, personally, I find it hard to\nagree to this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238092"
msgid "T-this is a lot to take in… My instincts are\ntelling me to protect Darling, but I'm also\nthinking that I'm getting what I deserve."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238224"
msgid "I honestly don't like #[him][her]# contracting another\nServant, but #C236196003Karna#CDEF won't bother becoming a\nrival, I think, so I'll allow it this once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238384"
msgid "So, him… He certainly is competent.\nI have no objections to his\ndignity and strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238472"
msgid "But do not contract him, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nA trial contract should pose no issue, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238572"
msgid "What other choice do we have?\nYou'll have to work with it. We absolutely need\na buffed Servant to compete with #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238704"
msgid "Same goes for you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nThis will be your second dive, so please\nprepare for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238804"
msgid "I know diving into a digital frame is dangerous,\nbut this is our last hope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238880"
msgid "…yeah. Worst case, we can force her… but I\nwouldn't even bet on #C236196003#NICK#CDEF's\nlife that we could do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2238996"
msgid "So… There is one thing we can try…\nShe'll definitely get on board if\nwe sell it well…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239088"
msgid "She doesn't seem to be referring to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239152"
msgid "Don't mind me, just thinking out loud.\nPlease go #C000246204convince Jinako#CDEF. She won't talk\nto anyone but you at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239284"
msgid "I'm not very confident that I can succeed\nin persuading her, but without #C236196003Karna#CDEF's help,\nit's too dangerous to dive into my Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239432"
msgid "For now, let's go to the #C000246204Janitor's Closet#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239492"
msgid "Now that #C236196003Rani#CDEF mentions it, I forgot about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239556"
msgid "In that case, I recommend gathering some\ninformation at the library."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239628"
msgid "He's one of many famous heroes of India's\nmythology… There should be detailed\ndescriptions of him in the #C000246204sacred Mahabarata#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239772"
msgid "Makes sense.\nKnowing that makes this a lot easier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239824"
msgid "Before going into the Relief,\nlet's stop by the #C000246204library#CDEF and investigate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2239916"
msgid "It's good that you're safe, #[Mr.][Ms.]# #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nI heard about what happened from Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240044"
msgid "#C236196003President Leo#CDEF's final moments, #C236196003BB#CDEF's goal…\nThe problems are piling up.\nWe mustn't lose heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240172"
msgid "We'll gather the resources we have left,\nand with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's aid, the Student Council\nwill unite to take measures against #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240328"
msgid "#C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF… I was wavering over\nwhether to report this to you or not, but I'll\njust go ahead and tell you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240460"
msgid "About the #C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF we discussed\npreviously: it's not something we programmed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240564"
msgid "It's a gift #C236196003BB#CDEF gave us and put in the\nStudent Council Room. I suppose it's her\nway of provoking us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240680"
msgid "Before these \"seven days\" come to pass,\nlet's do whatever it takes to prevent #C236196003BB#CDEF from\nreaching the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240832"
msgid "Good day. This is the first time we've spoken\n#RUBS        this side#RUBEon the #REND#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240956"
msgid "…the first time, RIGHT?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2240984"
msgid "My analysis of the dust data continues.\nThis data requires a massive amount of storage,\nso it seems its use will be limited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241112"
msgid "However… I know this is immodest,\nbut the decompression of this strange\n#RUBS              codec  #RUBEcompression information#REND makes my heart throb."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241268"
msgid "Although her abilities are unknown to us,\nwe can expect that she has considerable\nfirepower. Please be extra careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241388"
msgid "Good morning.\nIn this old school, it's evening\nall day long, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241456"
msgid "The damage done to the data wasn't my fault.\nI'm careful never to make mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241540"
msgid "I don't want to think about it, but it must\nhave something to do with a skill she possesses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241636"
msgid "I'm estimating it will be a 225% increase\nin security. It won't break even if an elephant\ncame crashing on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241748"
msgid "The most effective way to protect an #C000246204SG#CDEF\nis for the Sentinel to conceal themselves\nand never appear before you, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241912"
msgid "Does she have unshakable confidence\nthat her #C000246204SG#CDEF can't be stolen…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2241996"
msgid "…it's inexplicable. All I can think of is\nthat there's#RUBS     a bug#RUBE an issue#REND with\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's #RUBS subroutines#RUBEprinciples#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2242160"
msgid "I completed a program that increases resistance\nto Instant Death. I already provided the\nCommissary with the necessary information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2242292"
msgid "I also supplied it to the Commissary\nin order to simplify their process of\ngathering and mass productionizing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2242404"
msgid "Please don't get me wrong. I don't think like\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF does. She would do something like \ncollude with Mr. #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF for profit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2242568"
msgid "Great reviews at the Commissary, and there's a\nspecial going on―― No service fee!\nPlease be sure to purchase one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2242684"
msgid "So, a pretend couple………………………\n…………………………………………\n………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2242788"
msgid "………no, I don't really think anything\nof it. I expect this to turn out well.\nPlease go to hel… erm, do your best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2242908"
msgid "Even if I recover my memories, no part of me\nwill fall out of order… but what about\neveryone else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2243008"
msgid "Now I know for sure. That my actions\nduring my time as a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF were\na temporary confusion, not my true self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2243136"
msgid "That's because the subconscious doesn't surface.\nAlso, when one is a Labyrinth,\nthey're synchronized with #C236196003BB#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2243264"
msgid "An unwanted personality change happens,\nbasically. Yep, I think that's it.\nOtherwise these #C000246204SGs#CDEF couldn't possibly exist!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2243400"
msgid "Ahhh. I must say, those were\nsome impressively dramatic changes\nthe two of you went through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2243496"
msgid "Hohoho. Is #C236196003President Leo#CDEF running his mouth?\nPerhaps I should start setting off\nsome Atlas-style mustard bombs around here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2243636"
msgid "I agree with #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's suggestion for\na tea party. For humans to have a burst in\nperformance, they must be mentally satiated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2243784"
msgid "A group whose leader demands 100% performance\nat all times has no future. Look no further\nthan history for proof of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2243908"
msgid "What I'm saying is, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF is a leader\naccustomed to that performance, although I don't\nknow if that's from intent or from instinct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2244064"
msgid "And so with that, I'll be polishing my tea-\nmaking skills in preparation for the coming day\nof our tea party. Please look forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2244204"
msgid "To be able to maintain one's ego without\nbeing influenced by instinctive desires and\nlaziness is a privilege of rational people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2244336"
msgid "I just can't comprehend this statement\nfrom #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2244412"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF… She's a person that I\ncan't understand, but I CAN understand\nher righteousness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2244528"
msgid "She helps people without reward, without\nimposing her ideas. The ethics and social\nwelfare behind her ideology are wonderful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2244656"
msgid "The truth is that many sick people and people\nat a low point in their lives are grateful\nto her. Truly a modern-day saint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2244780"
msgid "It's sad, but organizations out for profit\ntargeted her for that reason and labeled her\nas a cybercriminal――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2244892"
msgid "Ah!? So that's it. Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF dislikes her\nbecause it's a clash of the avaricious character\nversus the non-avaricious character…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2245044"
msgid "I don't think any direct harm will come to us,\nbut bear in mind that #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF\ndoesn't have a normal mindset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2245176"
msgid "Everyone puts themselves first.\nHowever, I believe that you're quite not\nso inclined to do so, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2245296"
msgid "A bystander might praise that as hard\nto come by, but depending on the situation,\nit could be fatal. Please be careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2245416"
msgid "To be more specific, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's style was\nin desk work. Your style is in field work,\n#C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2245560"
msgid "This may sound cruel, but you won't be allowed\nto rest, #C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF. Please be ready\nfor more back-breaking work than ever before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2245716"
msgid "You'll be fine. There's never been a single\nincident of a human being dying over food\ntasting bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2245816"
msgid "The unarmed Shinji-boy――\nConsidering it was free software, it did a #RUBS  good job#RUBEGJ#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2245916"
msgid "I gave it four stars on the store. I wasn't a\nfan of the avatar's design, so that was a minus.\nI'm looking forward to the next version."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2246052"
msgid "Between my intervention with Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's self-protect program, we're suppressing\nthe encroachment for the time being――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2246220"
msgid "We don't know when she'll be breached.\nHurry, get the #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2246320"
msgid "――――I don't understand what that means.\nHowever, we're racing against time.\nPlease #C000246204get a hold of Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2246456"
msgid "Have you gotten the #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF?\nThen #C000246204speak to Miss Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2246564"
msgid "Please leave the rest to us\nand get some rest, President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2246624"
msgid "Even if we flex our technical muscles and apply\npatches to strengthen her, what will ultimately\nsave her is someone's #ROFS0003#RUBSheart#RUBEmind#REND――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2246780"
msgid "It's not logical, but with how I am now,\nI feel elated that such is the case.\nPlease take care of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2246928"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF… One more #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nIt wouldn't be wrong to consider her as #C236196003BB#CDEF's\nlast bastion of defense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2247080"
msgid "However… She turned #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF into a virus,\ncast her out, and worse. #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's threat\nlevel is different than the other #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2247264"
msgid "Once I gain more emotions, I think I'll send\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF a thank-you letter. Naturally, I'll\nthank her for teaching me what not to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2247416"
msgid "And I deem that it's thanks to Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nthat I got this good at making jokes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2247516"
msgid "I'm confident in how I shaped the decoys to\nuse against #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. It's at a level where\nI could ship them out as official figurines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2247668"
msgid "…I wasn't expecting those memories to not\nbelong to anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2247732"
msgid "In that case, where did that memory data\nend up going, I wonder?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2247800"
msgid "She didn't modify herself, but rather,\nthe system. Quite a hacker's way of thinking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2247888"
msgid "Without Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF here, a hacker on\nthe international most wanted list,\nwe likely wouldn't have realized it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248016"
msgid "We'll continue our analysis on how\nto overcome #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's #C000246204Invincibility#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248124"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's Relief…\nShe also possesses a weakness in her heart,\nsome trauma…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248220"
msgid "…no, this is not a good choice of\nperson to sympathize with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248284"
msgid "We've made it this far at great cost.\n#C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF,\nplease prepare for the battle ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248396"
msgid "Our support is perfect now that we have more\nmechanical power, but convincing Miss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF\nis a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248528"
msgid "This is something that only you can pull off,\n#C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF. We're counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248632"
msgid "You want to know what familiar Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nprepared for you? Sorry, she didn't tell me\nanything about it, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248764"
msgid "However, you should know better than anyone\nthat whatever Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF prepares always goes\nabove our expectations, #C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2248932"
msgid "…well, more like diagonally above our\nexpectations, but that's what's\ncharming about her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2249024"
msgid "…ah, yes. It's been some time since I\nread the stars. Perhaps I'll do so.\nMay a good light shine over our battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2249140"
msgid "Well, well.\nYou're wearing our uniform\nfrom the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2249212"
msgid "I shall introduce myself once more.\nI am my king, #C236196003Leo#CDEF's, Servant:\nMy name is #C236196003Gawain#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2249332"
msgid "We clashed in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, but this\nis the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF. With the same aim,\nlet us be as passing good comrades."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2249492"
msgid "I am this room's bodyguard. This is the center\nwhich governs over the old school's system…\nLogically, the strongest should stand guard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2249632"
msgid "? I only stated the obvious… scouting the enemy\nis a low-rank soldier's role. The stronghold\nmust be protected by knights of glory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2249768"
msgid "…sorry, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nAs you can see, #C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF has a\npleasant, honest personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2249880"
msgid "You must have a few thoughts to share,\nbut please just leave it at that… It'll make\nmore sense as you get used to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250000"
msgid "Huh? You too, #C236196003Julius#CDEF!?\nWhy do you both apologize?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250068"
msgid "It would appear my words have given rise to\nsome misunderstanding. It seems that I came off\nas condescending… It is inexcusable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250200"
msgid "…ahh. I suppose this is another\ndifference between our time periods…\nHow I yearn for Camelot…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250300"
msgid "Not only your battle experience,\nbut even your Noble Phantasm is sealed…\nQuite a harsh state of affairs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250408"
msgid "Please try not to rouse yourself. Press on\nwith a tranquil mind. Knowing you, the right\noutcome will surely follow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250524"
msgid "A Servant in need of rehabilitation…\nAstonishing to hear that it is the King of\nHeroes. Passingly negligent of him, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250648"
msgid "Yet, there is no use in criticising him now.\n#[Mister][Lady]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI cannot even imagine your anxiety…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250772"
msgid "As long as my lord is here, the path of\nrighteousness is with us. Please, continue\nyour exploration without any fears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250892"
msgid "I already had an inkling that he was so,\nbut it turned out to be more than I expected…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2250980"
msgid "By the way, about our recent discussion.\n#[Mister][Lady]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, only you have yet to\nconfess your favorite type."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2251112"
msgid "It is uncordial to keep things from your fellow\nmen. Later, tell me of your thoughts\nsecretly in code or something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2251228"
msgid "Sincerest apologies, my Lady.\nIt violates good manners for us men to become\nso rowdy in spite of your presence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2251340"
msgid "Rest easy, as I will take responsibility\nby admonishing #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2251420"
msgid "The Heroic Spirit #C236196003Karna#CDEF… If I recall correctly,\nhe was in the Mahabharata of Indian legends.\nHe was a hero who was defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2251564"
msgid "He is not well known, but he has been described\nas being a warrior who was the great hero\n#C236196003Arjuna#CDEF's archrival."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2251692"
msgid "It is said that his true power surpassed that of\neven #C236196003Arjuna#CDEF's, and that the gods used\nseveral means to defeat him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2251824"
msgid "It is incredible that #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF contracted\nsuch a powerful Servant. \"Neet\" is certainly\na fearsome occupation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2251960"
msgid "Splendid work on the first floor. You fought\ndifferently from back in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF…\nI found myself fixed on the monitor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252104"
msgid "The characteristics of Lady #C236196003Rin#CDEF's Labyrinth will\ncontinually change. Please be steeled for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252216"
msgid "About backing you up inside the Labyrinth: even\nif Lady #C236196003Sakura#CDEF says she will aid us, it is\ndifficult for #C236196003Leo#CDEF to do alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252372"
msgid "I desire the addition of new members, posthaste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252424"
msgid "Money is something one wants to obtain, so for\nthat purpose, one collects. In other words, it\nis a means to an end, not an end in itself―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252564"
msgid "So I believed… I did not imagine she would\n\"like money itself.\" It seems difficult to\nunderstand and sympathize with Lady #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252708"
msgid "To press on ahead, it will be necessary\nto remove that Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252772"
msgid "If it was a normal wall, we could simply\ndestroy it. However, since Lady #C236196003Rin#CDEF is inside…\nThis is quite troublesome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252904"
msgid "It appears that you have secured a method\nof entering into the Relief.\nBe careful in there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2252996"
msgid "We may have uncertainties and missing persons,\nbut otherwise, things are passingly favourable.\nLet our smiles endure as we march today too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2253136"
msgid "So little remains of the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nWith #C236196003Rin#CDEF added to our backup, the Student\nCouncil has grown stronger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2253284"
msgid "We should be returning to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\nsoon. When I think about it, I feel a tad\nreluctant to part with this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2253428"
msgid "[#C000246204Management Desire#CDEF]…\nAmong the knights we have rules,\nbut it's different than management."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2253536"
msgid "Knights control themselves through their loyalty\nto their lord. A knight incapable of temperance\nis no knight at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2253656"
msgid "…stating my own opinions in disregard of\nmy lord's. I have done an impertinent thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2253744"
msgid "I yet still lack experience.\nHenceforth, I shall stay focused."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2253808"
msgid "This #C000246204SG#CDEF certainly is as well. Well, since #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nwas delighted with it, I personally welcome\nit with open arms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2253952"
msgid "Today looks perfect for engaging the Labyrinth.\nGo with high spirits."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2254024"
msgid "I enjoyed chess quite a bit back in Camelot,\nbut I was slain in this bout."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2254100"
msgid "You still played a pretty good game with #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nHow about having a game with me next?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2254204"
msgid "Yes, with pleasure. Not to sound vainglorious,\nbut I was among the superior of the Round Table.\n#C236196003Percival#CDEF and #C236196003Galahad#CDEF made worthy opponents."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2254376"
msgid "Although, Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's defense was impenetrable.\nShe repelled every assault I made.\nHer deft movements were worshipful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2254512"
msgid "That there is what can almost be seen yet not,\nthe white-walled fortress…\nThe #RUBSgap of bare leg skin#RUBEZettai Ryouiki#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2254644"
msgid "[#C000246204Powergamer#CDEF]…\nIt certainly is an extremely dishonorable title.\nI have to be wary around that one…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2254760"
msgid "Meals are about quantity over quality, no?\nMounds of potatoes & vinegar & bread―plus, as\nlong as there's a little ale, I'm satisfied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2254896"
msgid "Then there's vegetables. Eating just carrots\nis good enough for me. The king would consume\nanything without complaint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255016"
msgid "For me… she is out of my range of expertise.\nShe possesses a marvelous body,\nbut her age is a tad―you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255128"
msgid "…ahh. It causes me great dole.\nIf she had come into this world but ten\nyears earlier…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255216"
msgid "They're not Masters,\nthey're not Servants,\nthey're not #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255300"
msgid "Just what kind of a being are #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\nI wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255368"
msgid "It was a good opportunity,\nso I decided to prepare a meal for #C236196003Leo#CDEF today.\nHow was your breakfast, #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255504"
msgid "Yes, it was horrible. After you finish\nrunning 100 laps around the grounds,\nplease study under #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, #C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255652"
msgid "How can this be!? Even though I had\nthe best ingredients prepared!? My lord,\nis something wrong with your palate!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255768"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF, even with the best ingredients,\nyou can't call it cooking when you simply\nmash them and serve it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255892"
msgid "What… did you say…!?\nBut the King would wolf it all down,\nsilent and expressionless, cool as always!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2255996"
msgid "Hahaha. #C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF of then sure was\nblessed with a good lord.\nBut this is something I won't compromise on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256120"
msgid "From now on, I order that #C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF shall\nhold absolutely nothing save his holy sword.\nKnights aren't really suited for the kitchen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256272"
msgid "*kgh*… I, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF, am yet inexperienced\nin the field of cooking…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256356"
msgid "I have no choice now, I vow to be\neven more diligent! I SHALL heap together\nan even denser stack of potatoes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256468"
msgid "No need for concern.\nIn my case, I can make anything threefold\nso long as it's daytime!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256556"
msgid "…it's as if he hasn't reflected on anything.\n#C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF IS the strongest… no, never mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256664"
msgid "This is bad… We need to\ndo something about this knight, quick…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256732"
msgid "…my heart might just shatter from\neveryone's scathing criticism… Nevertheless!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256816"
msgid "Though I may be a knight from Britain,\nI shall prove that I CAN make the highest\nclass of mashed potato!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2256924"
msgid "We're telling you NOT to cook!\nAre all Heroic Spirits in the Saber class\njust muscle-brains!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2257020"
msgid "We already possess two of #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's #C000246204SGs#CDEF.\nLet's keep up this pace\nand secure the third one as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2257156"
msgid "I dishonor us.\nI pride myself in the facing of mighty foes\nand engaging in glorious battles, yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2257256"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is on the eighth floor.\nShe's not on the present furthest reach―\nthe ninth floor―so take heed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2257380"
msgid "Have no fear. If necessary, having #C236196003Gatou#CDEF enter\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF will suffice.\nBetter yet, let's simply do that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2257528"
msgid "This is all about being affectionate, isn't it?\n#[Mister][Lady]# #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF and #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nYou two are well-suited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2257672"
msgid "If a princess, yet awaiting her Prince Charming,\nhas her emotions turned into loathing, then――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2257772"
msgid "…though it be a doleful thing, I think she\nwould become more terrifying a monster\nthan any demon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2257872"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's attack power is not even close\nto ordinary. Meet her in battle\nwith a defensive strategy in hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258000"
msgid "It gladdens me to see that the outcome of\nrecovering our memories ended without\nstrife between the Masters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258108"
msgid "Though the Masters gathered here are mutual\nfoes, they have respect for the affairs that\none must prioritize as a human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258232"
msgid "Though it came after my time,\nblack tea is the spirit of Britain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258300"
msgid "One day, I, too, would like to make black tea\nworthy of #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258380"
msgid "To resolve on losing before one's fight\nthen running wholeheartedly from that truth…\nSad, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258484"
msgid "Her flight will assuredly lead her nowhere.\nI think that she, the one running,\nknows that better than anyone else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258600"
msgid "The darkness within #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's heart,\nthough shallow, is rooted deep.\nHer self-harm is slow and insidious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258732"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nOnce we escape, we'll be in the main event\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258864"
msgid "Then we'll become mutual foes. Nevertheless,\nthe companionship my lord incubated\nin this old school building is no falsehood."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2258992"
msgid "Let's meet on the other side.\nMay you be a worthy trial for my lord,\nas you always have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259084"
msgid "…you want to know what I've been up to?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259128"
msgid "Cleaning gutters, as usual. While you had\n#C236196003BB#CDEF and #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF distracted, I took\nthe opportunity to examine the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259284"
msgid "But this time, it was all in vain.\nRather than find our #C000246204Memories#CDEF,\nI found #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, who zeroed in on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259424"
msgid "Does that mean #C236196003Julius#CDEF was caught\nin the middle of his secret operation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259512"
msgid "Yeah, it was my biggest screw up ever… well,\nnot really. That woman has keen senses. She saw\nthrough my ordinary stealth, easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259644"
msgid "She also caught on that I was searching for our\n#C000246204Memories#CDEF. I got away before her claws crushed\nme, but she'll notice if I go in there again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259800"
msgid "This is why #C236196003Leo#CDEF postponed my search to\nrecover our #C000246204Memories#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259896"
msgid "……………sorry about this.\nI tacked another job onto your workload."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2259968"
msgid "I felt like I just saw something incredible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260016"
msgid "I don't know what exactly is incredible,\nbut I know it's something RARE."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260092"
msgid "I must not know because my #C000246204memory#CDEF is hazy.\nIf I get my #C000246204Memories#CDEF back, I should come\nto realize what this \"unthinkable thing\" is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260256"
msgid "So you need some money to pay #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF……?\nSorry. Try someone else.\nI don't think I can arrange for anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260388"
msgid "Money? Why are you asking me?\nI thought I already told you\nI can't arrange for anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260480"
msgid "If you want to borrow, then try someone else.\n……besides a #C236196003Harwey#CDEF, if possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260580"
msgid "…………persistent, aren't you?\nStop bugging me. Try someone else. Got it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260656"
msgid "………………………………I have, no money."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2260700"
msgid "If you won't respond, shall I mess with you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260748"
msgid "Fine, you win. Put your hand out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260784"
msgid "I figured since he's #C236196003Leo#CDEF's older brother,\nhe would give me something a bit more generous……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2260896"
msgid "I may be a #C236196003Harwey#CDEF, but outside of missions\nI didn't ever have money to throw around.\n……or ever needed to, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261028"
msgid "What I just handed over to you is absolutely\neverything I can call my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261104"
msgid "That―― makes this 800 Sm really heavy.\nI can't just take everything he owns,\nso I'll give this back to #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261236"
msgid "You don't need to worry about it.\nFind any way you can to make good use of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261316"
msgid "He decisively shot down the return,\nso I reluctantly pull my hand back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261388"
msgid "It's only right to give my thanks with a bow and \"Thank you.\"\nI'll return #C236196003Julius#CDEF' goodwill by getting #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF for sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261560"
msgid "…yeah. I'm counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261592"
msgid "……that was everything I owned.\nGet the most out of it that you can, for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261672"
msgid "About 20% of the participants freed\nthemselves from the #RUBS  roles#RUBEscript#REND the system prepared\nfor them. However…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261800"
msgid "Hm…? What's the matter?\nDon't take too many scenic routes.\nHurry up and go home."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261884"
msgid "Don't take too many scenic routes.\nHurry up and go home."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2261944"
msgid "You may think #C236196003Leo#CDEF is an imposter,\nbut that there, without a doubt, is\nthe real thing. Just trust me on this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2262072"
msgid "This is so we can return to the\nrightful #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. The other Masters\nmust also lend their strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2262196"
msgid "Our labor shortage hasn't been resolved.\nIt's obviously true that the burden lies on you.\nAccept it, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2262324"
msgid "…so, you're back. As you heard from\nthe Student Council, return to the\n#C000246204second floor's My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2262448"
msgid "The school is currently under maintenance.\nIt IS an old model after all. We can't let\nit end up like the Near Side school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2262572"
msgid "An amnesiac Master and a Servant who\ncan't unleash their full power. A shield in the\nLabyrinth. Things aren't looking so good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2262700"
msgid "Still, a technique that deduces secrets\nof the mind and reveals them, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2262776"
msgid "If it gets rid of the wall guarding a person's\nmind, then that means trespassing on another\nperson's Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2262884"
msgid "#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF called it a medicine.\nI think this sort of thing shouldn't be called\na vaccine; it should be called a virus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263020"
msgid "Your report can wait until after you rest.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF left a message: #C000246204head back\nto My Room and turn in for the day#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263164"
msgid "If you can spew that sort of nonsense, you're\nalready used to this strange state of affairs.\nThis much is more than enough for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263296"
msgid "I suggest you use that excess energy of yours\nto go back to your room and rest already.\n………………I'll put it under consideration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263432"
msgid "Did #C236196003Jinako#CDEF seem like she could be useful?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263492"
msgid "……well, it figures. She refuses to\neven show up to the Student Council Room.\nCan't expect miracles to happen now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263608"
msgid "#[Yo][Hey]#…………………………………………\n…………………………… good, to, see, you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263696"
msgid "…………I'm not cut out for this.\nIt's much too hard to do things you're\nnot used to, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263796"
msgid "The greeting is cancelled. I'll go back to\nsimply verifying your return, just as before.\nThat should put you at ease as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2263924"
msgid "We're skipping this morning's briefing.\nYou already know what you have to do.\n#C000246204Head to the Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2264048"
msgid "…so even #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF can get desperate.\nSelling the rights to walk her own Labyrinth?\nA performance to put vultures to shame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2264192"
msgid "That makes #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's third #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nWe'll break that Relief with our next attack."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2264308"
msgid "Everything's been going well so far, but\nthat woman's abilities as a Master are real.\nDon't let your guard down, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2264448"
msgid "…she's revealed herself. It must've been\nwithin #C236196003Leo#CDEF's expectations that a mastermind\nwould be standing behind #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2264604"
msgid "But who could've guessed that it would\nbe a runaway AI, removed from being under\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2264724"
msgid "This is completely different from dealing with\nMasters as we have been.\nFirst thing to do is collect intel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2264832"
msgid "You're back. …how was it?\nAfter getting corrected, are you more of an\nhonor student now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2264924"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's policies aside, a stance of upholding\nthe rules is a good thing.\nNothing to do with the military. You know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265056"
msgid "Now, quickly get back to your room and rest.\nNo unnecessary pit stops. Those are the words of\nmy old teachers. Heed them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265180"
msgid "I had left to investigate a previous floor\nof the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF that you conquered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265284"
msgid "It was a very risky job. I did it despite\nknowing that it would be especially unfruitful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265376"
msgid "Though it did on a number on me. Having no\nServant, I'm used to this sort of dirty work.\nNothing for you to be concerned about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265504"
msgid "Ah, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Looks like your mission\nwent without a hitch. Right now, I'm about\nto head back to the Labyrinth――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265636"
msgid "Wait. Why are you scowling at me? You don't\nwant me to resign from babysitting #C236196003Leo#CDEF?\n――――I see. I see……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265764"
msgid "…I won't bother asking what happened,\nbut I'll guess what's on your mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265840"
msgid "This may sound a bit out there, but…\nYour emotions and mine are unprecedentedly\nsynchronized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2265936"
msgid "So you made it back, too. You beat her pretty\ndamn fast… Ahh, your Servant isn't feeling so\nwell, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266040"
msgid "Good that you made it back.\nYou've taken some… no damage, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266104"
msgid "The Student Council is convened due to the\nspecial circumstances. You, too. Head to the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF right away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266244"
msgid "After you've freed #C236196003Rani#CDEF, don't pause.\nContinue to the end and capture #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266352"
msgid "Contrary to her looks, #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF specializes\nin operating covertly and in\nscouting out enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266468"
msgid "She can tail someone well at mid-range, but at\nclose range, you can hear her approaching\nby the sound of those claws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266588"
msgid "…that #C236196003BB#CDEF has some bad taste.\nWho would make such a paradox out of\ntheir own offshoot?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266692"
msgid "Made it back, huh? How did you feel about\nfacing an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF? Was it a miserable\nmonster, like #C236196003BB#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266824"
msgid "…hm. No, it's none of my concern.\nNow's the time for rest, not chitchat, right?\nGo on inside. I'm calling it a day, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2266948"
msgid "I… I had to drop what I was doing and race\nback from the Labyr… *cough*… much to\nmy chagrin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267044"
msgid "Regardless, I had to come back due to the\ncircumstances… don't mind me, rest up.\nWe'll be putting you to work again tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267172"
msgid "*cough cough*………\nI ran out of Return Crystals. I took off once\nI got word that you obtained an #C000246204SG#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267292"
msgid "Adding #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's power to our own\nwill open up new strategies, but we've already\nfailed once to persuade #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267448"
msgid "But the time is nigh. She can't look away\nforever. It's time to light a fire under\nthat woman's blubber of an ass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267564"
msgid "Use your stubbor― ahem.\nUse your perseverant persuasion\nto open that shut-in's locks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267652"
msgid "…so, let's see if you pull this off.\n#C236196003Carigiri#CDEF's Servant definitely is a powerful\nHeroic Spirit. However――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267780"
msgid "Well, no use worrying about that now. The plan\nitself is sound. The rest is up to circumstance\nand how mentally prepared you two are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267916"
msgid "It's a little late to be saying this now, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2267964"
msgid "Regardless of our Near Side relationship,\nuntil we escape the Far Side, we're still\ngoing to be in a partnership."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268080"
msgid "Let's both trust each other as much as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268132"
msgid "I don't really need to be repeating this, but be\nsure to get some rest. If your body starts to\nfail, it'll mean disaster in whatever you do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268276"
msgid "Don't worry. Until we escape the Far Side,\nI don't intend on bringing up anything\nabout the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268400"
msgid "Currently, it looks like this job will keep me\nbusy… Oh please, after I wrap things up, I'll\nbe back again to do this dull check up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268536"
msgid "I was the one who asked for the\njob of greeting you, after all, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nPhew. …see ya."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268640"
msgid "I see this world has come to loathe heroic\nmen such as my humble self! Ooh!\nSurely this is a mass-ex-tinc-tion!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268752"
msgid "Elohim, Essaim. Elohim, Essaim!\nI implore you! O gods and Buddha, please bestow\nme with trials and tribulations!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268868"
msgid "Specifically, bestow a bloodthirsty Shura!\nOr a VERY bloodthirsty Shura! If not,\nthen an EXTREMELY bloodthirsty Shura!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2268988"
msgid "At least one good foe worthy of fighting!\nAt this rate I, #C236196003Monji#CDEF, will be so soothed\nthat my backbone will fall out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269120"
msgid "…I desperately try to remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269156"
msgid "The person making a racket before me is clearly a Master.\nIf this guy were an NPC, I would be complaining to his maker."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269276"
msgid "Hm!?\nYou, you're a Master!\nThat's undoubtedly the presence of a Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269352"
msgid "If I keep ignoring him, it seems like\nhe'll just follow me around.\nSo, let's just answer honestly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269452"
msgid "Just as I thought! When I saw you, I\nnoticed the ferociousness in your eyes.\nTruly a Cupid in hell, indeed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269560"
msgid "I say, but in here, I'm the same as you:\na mere Master, together in the fight, the\nstrife. Well, I have no Servant, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269684"
msgid "And being defeated means―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269716"
msgid "Well, about that. My god left me a revelation:\n\"#C000246204I'm not actually a god#CDEF,\" and then departed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269824"
msgid "Even the posture of this primordial, golden\ngoddess was wilden…… just so you know,\nI combined \"wild\" and \"golden\" there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2269948"
msgid "After I came to, I found myself all alone\nin this pink school. Since then, I've been\ntoo bored and destructive for my own good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270076"
msgid "He's pretty much in the same boat as #C236196003Leo#CDEF and I."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270140"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF… He seems like a pain in the neck,\nbut right now we need all the help we can get."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270248"
msgid "I'll try inviting him to join the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270300"
msgid "Oh? The Masters are making an escape\nplan, you say? You all feel like\ngetting out of here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270392"
msgid "Obviously we're going to think about getting out\nof here as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270472"
msgid "Answer with \"seppa.\"\n\"Somosan\" means I'm going to ask a question.\n\"Seppa\" tells me that you're READY."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270576"
msgid "We'll leave that aside for now.\n#[Lad][Lass]#, what do you think of this place?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270656"
msgid "I think… it's an antiquated school building\ndyed in an evening glow and a complete contrast\nto the original school building…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270784"
msgid "That's probably all there is to say.\nI'm fond of this school building more so\nthan the other one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2270884"
msgid "The sun sets, cherry blossoms flutter in the\nsky, on the roof, in the school yard. Yes,\nlots of cherry blossoms and not much else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271016"
msgid "Yet, there isn't a single dangerous area here.\nOutside seems uninhabited, but this school\nbuilding is filled with good thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271148"
msgid "And there's no concept of time. If you can spend\nhours without any days passing, then this place\nis a Shangri-La or a Dragon King Palace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271288"
msgid "…I'm surprised.\nThat's one way to look at it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271336"
msgid "Like #C236196003Gatou#CDEF says,\nthis school building is safe for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271420"
msgid "Even if this IS the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\ndetached from the normal world,\nthere might be no danger in staying here――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271556"
msgid "I shall not choose a place of asceticism.\nA new world, rather, sends my heart athrob.\nThis is an agreeable place to train."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271680"
msgid "I see.\nSo I guess that's why he's been spewing nothing\nbut nonsense so far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271756"
msgid "…#C236196003Gatou#CDEF doesn't seem like he wants to escape.\nI don't expect him to join the Student Council, then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271872"
msgid "I'll go look for someone else who's capable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2271920"
msgid "No, I'll join this \"Student Council.\" This isn't\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. So it would be shameful for\na warrior to refuse to help when asked!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272076"
msgid "Hey, didn't he say before that he was a monk!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272124"
msgid "Ahaha! Your quips are like flashing lightning―\nGrazie! Where there's a will, there's a way!\nSurely this is Providence!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272244"
msgid "Don't be shy, don't be shy. Once I gather up\nmy belongings, I'll meet up with you.\nNow then, look forward to my great efforts!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272372"
msgid "I'm sure I've already looked all around the school building.\nI'll go back to the Student Council Room and\nreport this to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272516"
msgid "In the corner of the hallway,\nI found a noticeably conspicuous giant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272588"
msgid "…#C236196003Gatou#CDEF?\nI wonder if he's here for something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272652"
msgid "Oh, #[lad][lass]#! Working hard at those\ngeneral affairs today, too, eh?\nTruly good work out there!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272752"
msgid "Agh, yeah. I came to speak to #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF,\nbut she won't even open the door for me.\nI've been utterly defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2272884"
msgid "I think this is another trial, like opening the\nHeavenly Rock Cave. Talking and singing amounts\nto nothing, not even a hint of opening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2273020"
msgid "And now for my mortal arcanum: imitation! I\nthink it's time for the nude, large-spin dance!\nNow is the time to slip off these cloth―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2273160"
msgid "Absolutely NO thank you! Forget locking, an old\nman dancing naked in front of a girl's room\nwarrants a quick report to the authorities!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2273296"
msgid "Agh, come on! I have nothing to talk to\nyou about, old man! #C236196003Karna#CDEF, take it from here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2273400"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF speaks from behind the door,\nthen alongside a flash of light, #C236196003Karna#CDEF appeared,\nlooking a little troubled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2273544"
msgid "…sorry, but please leave.\nIt seems that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is busy cutting the\ntail off of a gigantic dragon right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2273672"
msgid "Gwaa! This solar radiance is overwhelming!\nJust like when the Heavenly Rock Cave opened,\nand Amaterasu suddenly appeeeareeed!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2273800"
msgid "Anyway. O' child of god, I am slightly\nconcerned about your Master. Is there anything\ntroubling her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2273904"
msgid "Now that you mention it, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF had a cat\nsculpture… her \"keychain,\" she called it.\nShe's morose over having lost it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2274040"
msgid "The other day when she reluctantly went over to\nthe Commissary to buy sweets, she said that she\ndropped it. It seemed very important to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2274184"
msgid "The hell, #C236196003Karna#CDEF!?\nWhat are you blabbering about!?\nI told you to shoo them away, quick!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2274288"
msgid "…you heard her.\nSorry for cutting our talk midway,\nbut I ask that you please leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2274376"
msgid "#C236196003Karna#CDEF's piercing gaze drives us away,\nand we change locations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2274456"
msgid "In the end, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF wasn't able to see #C236196003Jinako#CDEF in person,\nbut he clenches his fist with seemingly extreme elation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2274600"
msgid "Troubles exist in all shapes and sizes.\nI think I'll do my utmost to search\nfor #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's keychain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2274716"
msgid "Well, I suppose I could…\nI'm indebted to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF for helping out with #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nso it might be good to help search for this keychain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2274880"
msgid "There's a chance someone already picked it up, too.\nIn the meantime, I guess I'll try asking the students\nnear the Commissary about it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275020"
msgid "Holding the Cat Keychain I received from the AI,\nI call out to #C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275108"
msgid "\"So I found something that looks like #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's keychain…\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275184"
msgid "Wuhaat! Let me see!\nIs it a keychain of a pouncing cat!?"
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "2275244"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275292"
msgid "Wooah! Just how great a messiah ARE you!?\nI'm impressed with how quickly you found it\nwhile I was looking here, there, everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275424"
msgid "Alright. Let's head over to #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF\nat once. There's no time like the present!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275528"
msgid "Without wasting his breath, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF grabbed hold\nof my arm, and I gave in to him dragging me\nout of the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275668"
msgid "Not to brag, but before this I was a beggar monk\nwho didn't know where his next dinner would come\nfrom! Never had any money or much else!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275808"
msgid "Well of course.\nIn the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, all Masters are enemies.\nThey must be defeated, and that's that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2275928"
msgid "But this is not the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nEveryone here is an ally. We need to take\ngood care of the bonds we may form here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2276064"
msgid "As a member of the Student Council,\nI intend on putting forth my best effort!\nAll for one, and one for all Gandhara!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2276184"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF… hmm. I feel like I've heard\nthat name somewhere before, but also like\nI never have…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2276304"
msgid "Well, it's okay. My policy is to forget the\nsmall stuff!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2276364"
msgid "A money fixation is the same as a carnal desire.\nI see that your duty is to perform the 108 quick\nand prompt chimes to guide lost lambs back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2276508"
msgid "Me? I respectfully abstain! Since, up until now,\nI have never held a conversation with that kind\nof high schooler!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2276624"
msgid "1000-Arm Kannon can save 25 worlds with each\nhand. But, I'm incapable of intervening in\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's tiny world. My training is lacking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2276776"
msgid "Things are bad now with these #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF. It's\nlike the Six Worlds Rebirth―with the unseeable\nend―but if we quit, our lives are forfeit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2276932"
msgid "What? As long as you persistently survive,\nthe road will open by itself! When it doesn't\nopen, feel free to give up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2277052"
msgid "Don't worry about #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF. Now is the\ntime for her to comprehend what her own shell\nis. Soon enough, she'll come up to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2277200"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, pour your heart and\nsoul into your search of the Labyrinth.\nI shall also offer my meager assistance!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2277336"
msgid "What? This monk can't have sex on his mind?\nNo matter the heresy or sorcery that befalls me,\nmy mercy wavers not!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2277452"
msgid "Yes, the time hath come!\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, work with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nand give it your all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2277556"
msgid "I wonder if #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF is alright…\nConsidering how she broke down, isn't leaving\nher alone extremely dangerous?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2277692"
msgid "Don't worry about me.\nMy past is nothing to write home about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2277756"
msgid "More importantly, we need to focus on rescuing\n#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF. Despite everything, she's a\nwoman. She must be feeling helpless all alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2277912"
msgid "Hm? The darkness in #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind?\nEveryone has something like that\nwithin them, more or less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278024"
msgid "However, if I have ties to someone who has that\ndarkness and is trapped in it,\nI can't turn a blind eye."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278132"
msgid "That's because being kind in a pushy way\nis what a religious man does best!\nIt's my bread and butter!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278236"
msgid "Well, whether I end up helping or not is up to\nchance… hmm. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you may be able\nto open #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278380"
msgid "…hrrrrmmmmm.\nJust standing around and watching makes me\nuneasy. Is there truly nothing I can do…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278480"
msgid "I figured she would ask me this at some point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278528"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF say nothing about my judgement to me.\nBut #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278660"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks away, slightly embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278720"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said that she likes me.\nShe did all of those things because she likes me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278824"
msgid "Maybe this #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here understands where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278900"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks away, slightly embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2278960"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said that she likes #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nShe did all of those things because she likes him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279084"
msgid "Maybe this #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here understands where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2279160"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279180"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's eyes widen, and she's at a loss for words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279248"
msgid "The short, actually, very long silence eventually breaks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279308"
msgid "Erm, this is odd.\nI thought I wouldn't like the idea\nof being lumped together with them, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279404"
msgid "I feel relieved.\nIn any case, I'm happy to hear that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279460"
msgid "She is who she is, I am who I am.\nI'll support you until the very end.\nI'll do my best!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279548"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, I wish to speak with you in private."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279612"
msgid "Praetor. Please wait in the\ncorner of the room for us to finish.\nDon't move a muscle until I tell you to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279720"
msgid "…ahem.\nThere's only one thing to ask about:\nThe Psycho Dive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279784"
msgid "I'm not particularly afraid or anything,\njust a little uneasy.\nI'll be consulting you on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279880"
msgid "I could tell where the Presi…\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF was inside of me,\nbut it was mysterious, a new feeling…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2279992"
msgid "It felt like heat from a different source\nthan myself was racing through my nerves.\nIt was warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280092"
msgid "But, um… It felt like\nevery inch of my body was being looked at…\nEmbarrassment is one thing I felt plenty of…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280208"
msgid "T-that certainly is embarrassing!\nI learned much from this!\nYou have my thanks, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280312"
msgid "…ahem. Now then, my Praetor,\nlooking so glum up against that wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280380"
msgid "For no particular reason,\nI'm going to go take a little bath.\nWait for me here until I finish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280476"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF? Do you have a moment to spare?\nI have a brief thing I would like to speak\nto you about in private."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280600"
msgid "Ah, please go sit in that chair there, Darling.\nCount cherry petals in the schoolyard. Be like,\n\"aren't cherry trees in bloom so romantic?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280740"
msgid "…okay. There's only one topic to discuss:\nThe experience of your mental dive, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280828"
msgid "As you can imagine, I kind of don't have \nexperience with having my mind… or rather,\nmy body adventured in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2280940"
msgid "What does it feel like? Does it actually hurt?\nIf it does, in what way? Like a cavity\nor a headache, something of that nature?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281068"
msgid "This level of exposure\nis right up #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF's alley."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281136"
msgid "Now then, that's enough of our secret talk.\nDid I keep you waiting, Darling?\nOkay, let's go full speed ahead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281248"
msgid "Yeah. Although I'll be dormant during the dive,\nmy immune functions will still be working.\nDon't take detours, go straight for the goal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281388"
msgid "Fool. Don't speak as if your Spiritron makeup\nis anything equivalent to mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281468"
msgid "My flesh possesses the supreme Golden Rule.\nIt's the finest work of art on this entire\ncelestial body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281572"
msgid "To one who is ordinary, every part of me\nis a perilous poison. Go forth steeled,\nand try not to become charmed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281684"
msgid "I called out to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF as I went to hand over\nthe Classic Sailor Uniform I got a hold of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281792"
msgid "……but just as she turned around,\nI got a little nervous,\nwondering if I was just being presumptuous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2281896"
msgid "No, no, no, it would be a complete waste to stop now.\n#[It's not like I'm going to wear a girl's uniform, anyways.][I don't need a second set of the same uniform anyway.]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2282068"
msgid "I grasped the folded uniform tightly,\nresolved myself,\nand thrust the uniform in front of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2282184"
msgid "\"I know this is sudden,\n but #[please take this][take this]#, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!\""
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "2282272"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2282320"
msgid "Since #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's an ally helping us escape from\nthe Far Side of the Moon,\nI absolutely want her to wear this uniform too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2282456"
msgid "Please return it to #C236196003Father Kotomine#CDEF at once,\nand buy something else with it.\nLike a recovery item, or a Mystic Code!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2282592"
msgid "It hurts to have #C236196003Sakura#CDEF reject it so profusely.\nI did expect her to be confused by it,\nbut I didn't expect her to say \"No.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2282732"
msgid "Ah… T-that's not it…… I just meant\nthat we should keep an order of priorities\nbased on the situation…… so……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2282848"
msgid "I don't want to inconvenience you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nSo it's not as if I don't like it,\nor anything like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2282968"
msgid "I look up and say \"In that case……\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283008"
msgid "\"If you're really not opposed to the uniform, then――\n as an ally of the Student Council,\n and an ally who supports #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\n I definitely want you to wear it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283196"
msgid "\"It'll definitely look good on you, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283260"
msgid "………you're a curious person, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nNo one else seems to mind things like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283360"
msgid "……I understand. Since I need to change,\nwill you accompany me to the Infirmary?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283444"
msgid "I left the Student Council Room along with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283512"
msgid "What is it that you need?\n………wha――? You're giving me a uniform?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283584"
msgid "I am very grateful for your consideration,\nbut I cannot accept this\nunder the current circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283688"
msgid "This Sm belongs to #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF……\nSo please put it towards\nexploring the Labyrinth instead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283792"
msgid "……I know what #C236196003Sakura#CDEF just said isn't wrong.\nIf I didn't go out of my way to prepare this uniform,\nI wouldn't have run into as many issues as I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2283960"
msgid "I did want to see #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in the classic school uniform,\nbut I should give up on this for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2284072"
msgid "She usually turns her head and gives me a smile,\nbut she was gazing somewhere far off, looking depressed.\nIt seems as if she hasn't noticed me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2284216"
msgid "Growing concerned, I try calling out to her again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2284268"
msgid "It's rare for the hard working #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to be so sluggish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2284344"
msgid "Which reminds me, when I was diving into #C236196003Rin#CDEF's\nLabyrinth Core, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF helped me out as well.\nCould that have been really taxing on her…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2284516"
msgid "No structural defects exist\nin AI who are products of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nHowever, #C236196003BB#CDEF appeared――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2284644"
msgid "…I see. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF are identical models.\nIf #C236196003BB#CDEF did go rogue, that means it could happen with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2284816"
msgid "For humans, no one could use \"because they're human\" as\na reason to say that another person and I are the exact same.\nFor those two AI, it's different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2284968"
msgid "No matter how different they are on the inside,\nas long as they were made from the same design,\nthe same outcome would be possible for both…\nShe must've realized that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285140"
msgid "But this really isn't something she needs to worry about.\nThe cause for her going rogue is most likely a bug, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285260"
msgid "As a comrade in the Student Council, as our ally,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is protecting the health of everyone in this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285388"
msgid "In our last meeting,\neveryone must have confirmed as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285448"
msgid "Yes. I was truly happy\nafter hearing everyone's words back then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285516"
msgid "…but I can't ignore the chance of a defect\nlying within me as much as you all trust me.\nI can't say for sure that a bug won't appear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285652"
msgid "When I think about how, by some catalyst,\nI may end up like #C236196003BB#CDEF, I wonder if staying here\nis the right choice or―aahh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285788"
msgid "I aim for the defenseless #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's forehead,\nand let loose a light karate chop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285884"
msgid "A critical hit! Sakura has been stunned!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2285928"
msgid "Supposing that #C236196003Sakura#CDEF doesn't trust herself, everyone else DOES.\nBefore thinking about the \"worst case scenario,\"\nI want her to turn to the words of her comrades."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2286108"
msgid "Plus, if #C236196003Sakura#CDEF were to ever go rogue like #C236196003BB#CDEF,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF would do\neverything in #[his][her]# power to stop #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2286292"
msgid "I spoke pridefully to my kouhai,\n\"I'll karate chop you over the brow until you cry,\n so don't worry so much.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2286404"
msgid "…yes, you're right. I have everyone by\nmy side, and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF even comes to visit me\nto see how I'm doing, like now――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2286540"
msgid "I won't make mistakes.\nI don't expect them to happen.\nI won't become #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2286632"
msgid "I put my strength into a solid nod at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2286708"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and I won't let that happen.\nSo… someway, somehow, I want her to feel at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2286832"
msgid "…yes! To make sure the trust\neveryone's put in me won't be in vain,\nI'll keep trying my very, very best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2286940"
msgid "Yeah. Now that that's settled, I can't be\nstanding here daydreaming. I have to return to\nthe Student Council Room now. Yes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287064"
msgid "I had #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF wait in the classroom because\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# was a little hard on the eyes… erm,\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# looks different from what you're used to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287284"
msgid "Waking up from a long sleep is mentally\ndraining enough for you, so I had them wait\nsomewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287384"
msgid "…um.\nAnyway, please don't be surprised, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287432"
msgid "About #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF―― He was looking all around\nthe old school building and\nwouldn't listen to me at all――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287556"
msgid "Y-you're asking about money?\nI'm sorry. I wish to help you in\nas many ways as I can, but……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287652"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does not pay any wages.\nThus I am, one could say, penniless…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287744"
msgid "And the Labyrinth's value of currency……\nits excess memory is different than what's\non the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287860"
msgid "I wonder what it is about the name \"Sakurament.\"\nFor some reason, it feels incredibly malicious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2287960"
msgid "Um, how about collecting some locally?\nM-manual labor is a wonderful thing, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288048"
msgid "You want to know where #C236196003Shinji#CDEF is?\nUmm, please give me a second to look him up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288144"
msgid "…huh? He's not in the hallways.\nThere's two signals in the Janitor's Closet…\nBut isn't that where #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288272"
msgid "I'll be assisting everyone from here on out.\nSpecifically, as an OS that executes and\nsupports #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's operations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288412"
msgid "Currently, I'm using root to also serve as\nthe main CPU that makes up the old\nschool building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288508"
msgid "In case of an emergency, I'll open the\nInfirmary right back up if anyone needs it.\nSo please don't worry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288616"
msgid "As a health management AI, I'm against\nyou entering the cherry blossom tree, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288700"
msgid "Hee hee, I'm a pretty lousy nurse.\nI ended up concluding that you're all making\nthe right decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288800"
msgid "I won't cut any corners while supporting you.\nI'll do my best to try and be as\nhelpful to everyone as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288912"
msgid "How did you like My Room?\nIf anything inconveniences you,\nplease tell me, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2288992"
msgid "Me? No issues in the slightest.\nThis boost to my analytic functions actually\nhas me feeling in tip-top shape!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289104"
msgid "Asking about my destabilized emotional values?\nThank you for your concern."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289180"
msgid "But there's no need to worry.\nSince my optimization program is running,\nI'll adapt to the changes soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289292"
msgid "When we're installing new software,\nthis sort of thing happens more often\nthan you'd think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289384"
msgid "You want to know about #C236196003Jinako#CDEF? As far\nas I know, she hasn't taken a single step\noutside of the Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289516"
msgid "So I don't have any new information on her.\nMy apologies……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289580"
msgid "How did it go with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?\n*sigh*… She really won't leave the\nJanitor's Closet, will she…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289688"
msgid "The custodial room is similar to My Room for\nyou, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. But since it's in an\nalmost offline state, I worry a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289824"
msgid "To think such a large wall could exist…\nthis would never happen on the Near Side…\nso what's going on with this Labyrinth…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2289952"
msgid "And, umm……\nIt's a lot more, organic and――\nbizarre, than it needs to be……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290032"
msgid "Wha―― You're going inside the Relief?\nThat's unknown territory.\nIs this really going to be okay…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290136"
msgid "……no. Even if safety isn't guaranteed,\nthis is not a situation where we can afford\nto let that stop us. Isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290260"
msgid "…you need to quickly ask about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's plan…\nThis is an important task, so I will not\nallow you to fail!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290384"
msgid "However, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF has nothing with him. I can't\nscan the entirety of the Labyrinth, so I'm\nworried…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290500"
msgid "Anyway, rescuing #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is our highest priority\nright now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290576"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's previous outfit… There should be\nsome material on it around here… Hehe.\nI'm starting to feel a little excited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290712"
msgid "Good morning.\nIt looks like there's no meeting this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290776"
msgid "Sorry, I wasn't able to prepare anything else.\nPlease be careful during your search."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290864"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, if you ever feel tired,\nthen please take a break.\nHow about having some tea?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2290968"
msgid "It would be nice to know what #C236196003Rani#CDEF likes…\nBut I don't currently have any data\non her to infer from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291088"
msgid "Regardless, I can't believe I was the fastest\nto lose among us… I'm a disgrace as an AI…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291180"
msgid "Ahahaha. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is a little cruel, huh?\nEven though she's our enemy this time around,\nI sympathize with #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291324"
msgid "If I were #C236196003Rani#CDEF, I'd direct the school's\ntrash disposal towards the Janitor's Closet\nand do everything I could to open it up鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291468"
msgid "I can still confirm signs of Masters and\nNPCs within the Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291536"
msgid "I'm unable to measure the Relief's interior, but\nthere's no mistake that we must win against #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nin battle to free them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291676"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, we're counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291724"
msgid "Hurry, #C000246204go before the Relief#CDEF. We'll also be\nadvancing our setup for the #RUBS     spiral #RUBEdepth descent#REND…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291856"
msgid "I was a bit overloaded\nand my processing speed fell,\nso I had taken a break in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2291952"
msgid "Ah, I'm fine now. I'm able to exhibit\n100% performance, so please don't worry\nabout a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292048"
msgid "I'm fine now. I'm operating completely normally.\nPlease leave the backup to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292128"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are beings born from rogue AI.\nThe likelihood of their basic structures\nbeing malfunctioned are high."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292260"
msgid "Thus, even if they appear normal at a glance,\nplease don't ever let your guard down.\n…these girls are obstacles we must defeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292392"
msgid "There are others with the same model as me,\nbut I have no \"sister\" machines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292472"
msgid "But when I'm looking at #C236196003Rin#CDEF, I sometimes\nimagine… if this is what having\nan older sister is like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292588"
msgid "Although it's unclear as to why I feel that way.\nMaybe the cause is because #C236196003Rin#CDEF is so caring\nthat I started to depend on her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292732"
msgid "I can tell by looking at your face, I don't\neven need to scan it. I AM an apprentice\nin health management AI, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292856"
msgid "Of course, I didn't forget about\nbringing supplies! Okay, please take this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2292932"
msgid "The Student Council can back you up physically,\nbut we can't give care for mental fatigue.\nPlease take care of your body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293056"
msgid "#C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF…\nA constitution that inclines one towards\nacts of torment after seeing her, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293180"
msgid "…it doesn't make much sense to me.\nI wonder why #C236196003BB#CDEF would add that sort of\ndefect to her own offshoot…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293300"
msgid "…my assumptions were too optimistic.\nNow I'm going to tighten the entrance's\nsecurity up more than ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293408"
msgid "Even if #C236196003BB#CDEF herself tried, I won't let\nanyone invade this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293496"
msgid "But I raised the density due to this incident.\nEven if an enemy were kitten-sized, anything,\nincluding their body, would be repelled back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293636"
msgid "It involves signals rather than a body, and\nwhile we're within the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, the Spiritron\nNetwork can't be cut even if we wanted to…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293788"
msgid "………ah… I-I'm sorry.\nI was a little out of it.\nIs there something I can do for you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293876"
msgid "…sorry, I lost myself for a second there.\nWell, two people is safer than one… I wasn't\nsurprised or anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2293996"
msgid "Sorry for making you worry yesterday.\nI took my time debugging overnight,\nnow I'm up and ready to go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294100"
msgid "About your memories…\nUm, I know everyone is having a hard time\nright now, but keep being careful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294200"
msgid "It's going to be okay, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWe'll definitely get back the memories\nyou still don't have yet, soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294320"
msgid "Black tea, black tea…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294344"
msgid "With or without your memories,\nI think that it doesn't change\nwho you are, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294428"
msgid "I spoke to just about every Master during\nthe 1st Round of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nbut I never got to speak with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294580"
msgid "She was confined in the Janitor's Closet the\nentire time. That door transforms into the\nArena's entrance after the preliminaries end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294716"
msgid "…we're almost there, aren't we?\nThis will all be over soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294780"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, we're counting on you.\nLet's escape from the Labyrinth this time,\nfor sure. That will lead to #C236196003BB#CDEF's deletion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2294932"
msgid "Black tea mixed with coffee, plus sugar and\nmilk. That's an extra order I got from #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF.\nOh! And the lemon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295060"
msgid "He'll be in tip-top shape to provide\nbackup on his side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295120"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you seem tired.\nPlease go back to your My Room\nand have yourself a long rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295224"
msgid "I still have plenty of medicine, so please\nlet me know if you run out. It may only serve\nas a small solace, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295340"
msgid "You're always acting reckless, after all,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Please be sure to rest\nwhen it's time for a break."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295460"
msgid "Um, this might… not help wash away the taste,\nbut I tried making a bento for you.\nPlease eat it if you'd like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295572"
msgid "I hope it's to your liking…\nI'll be making lots more so I can hand out\nsome to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF next."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295704"
msgid "Doing things like exchanging bentos will\ndefinitely liven up the place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295776"
msgid "I thought all it would do is put your mind at\nease, but it worked better than I\nthought it would. I'm glad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2295884"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2296064"
msgid "I have to go see #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and figure out a way to solve this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2296140"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2296320"
msgid "Let's go after #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nIf she's going to be anywhere,\nmaybe she'll be around the deepest part of the\nSakura Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2296456"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2296636"
msgid "Let's enter #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's subconscious and\ncut out the bits eating away at her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2296728"
msgid "Well of course. She's an AI gone rogue.\nShe seems logical, but she's holding on to\nchronic #RUBS    lag #RUBEemotions#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2296852"
msgid "Things normal AIs would consider as fluctuating\nand cut out, she holds on to forever…. \nFrom the start, something was wrong with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2296988"
msgid "…s-sorry…\nI find it difficult to speak when I look\nyou in the eyes now, Senpai…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297072"
msgid "I'm not sure how to put this… I don't know\nthe reason why, but my chest feels warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297160"
msgid "Leave the rest to us.\nPlease go get some rest in My Room, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297228"
msgid "I'll take charge of getting #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nto rest before they grow exhausted.\nPlease let me take care of things!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297372"
msgid "Huh? Why are you laughing?\n\"I'm pretty dependable, oddly enough\"?\nY-you think so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297456"
msgid "Welcome back. Did you forget something?\nWe have our system to back you up all set to go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297548"
msgid "To also double as thanks for saving me from the\nMelt Virus earlier, I put in a little extra\neffort! Please use it on your companion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297684"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are trying their hardest,\nbut please be very careful in the Labyrinth,\nokay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297808"
msgid "…there's less than a 10% chance of success,\nbut we have to do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297876"
msgid "Even after the building's power shuts off,\nI'll be able to handle your Navi on my own,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2297988"
msgid "I can only do so much, but please let me\nhelp you until the end.\nIt's also my duty to do so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298084"
msgid "Exploring the eighteenth floor comes first, yes?\nLet's not get distracted by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's\nCore, lest we ignore what's before us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298232"
msgid "…I want to step up in turn.\nNo matter what happens on the final floor,\nI'll definitely protect you, Senpai…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298344"
msgid "I know I did something unforgivable, but…\nI want to do my best for you,\nof my own volition――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298440"
msgid "I have no more hesitation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298468"
msgid "If you choose the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, where you\nmight perish, over this tranquil yet\nempty old school building, then――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298604"
msgid "A way to disable the #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298656"
msgid "Until we find a way, I won't open my Relief\nfor you. Please think of it as the bare\nminimum before facing #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298784"
msgid "If we can do it, then I also want\neveryone to return to the normal world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298860"
msgid "…huh?\nYou'd like some supplies for tomorrow, you say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2298916"
msgid "…huh?\nYou say the last thing you want is to have some\nof my bento? And you'll pay handsomely?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299012"
msgid "…oh, you. In terms of healing,\nelixirs are more effective and\nefficient, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299096"
msgid "Hee hee… I was planning on giving you some\nregardless if you pleaded me or not. I've been\ngiving out supplies for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299224"
msgid "Senpai, please stay safe tomorrow.\nGet plenty of rest tonight and clear your mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299308"
msgid "Tomorrow is when we finally reach the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF. Please get plenty\nof rest tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299416"
msgid "Those clothes… That's the uniform from\nback in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299512"
msgid "It couldn't have been that long ago,\nbut I feel very nostalgic looking at those."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299596"
msgid "Changing clothes every now and then makes\nfor a nice change of pace, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299680"
msgid "I'm pretty sure this woman is… oh, yeah.\n#C236196003Taiga#CDEF… #C236196003Fujimura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299772"
msgid "This was the \"previous school building's\" new teacher.\nSince she was a teacher, I figured she was\npart of management―――an NPC prepared by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nbut she may be a Master too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2299976"
msgid "? #C236196003Taiga Fujimura#CDEF, you say?\nHow peculiar… I don't remember ever calling\nmyself by such a charming name…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300100"
msgid "The nun casts her eyes down, looking troubled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300148"
msgid "This lady… #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, smiles gracefully.\nHer gaze is warm, as if she's grateful from\nthe bottom of her heart to meet me again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300288"
msgid "Despite the entire situation we're in,\nher gaze makes me unconsciously blush."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300368"
msgid "Yes. Consumed along with the school in the\npreliminaries. Luckily, I'm fine as you\ncan see. I'm still in one piece."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300484"
msgid "If you doubt whether this is dream or\nreality, then would you like to touch me and\nfind out? Go on, no need to hesitate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300608"
msgid "…no, I need to calm down.\nThis isn't the time for this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300668"
msgid "What's important is that we both went\nthrough the same ordeal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300732"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF was also in that school building\nand was swallowed by the Black Noise?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300828"
msgid "From the first floor hall, I called out to you\nas you went towards the stairs.\nDo you remember that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2300932"
msgid "…I see. In that moment, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF was also asking for help.\nThe reality is that she was left in that building,\nand ultimately no one came to rescue her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301100"
msgid "No, it's alright. Please don't blame yourself\ntoo harshly. That was your best option\nat the time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301200"
msgid "Besides…\nYour regret more than makes up for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301252"
msgid "You cared enough to feel regret over my loss,\nsomeone you only ever spoke to once before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301344"
msgid "With a \"thank you,\" #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF expresses heartfelt\nappreciation towards #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\nwho had abandoned her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301492"
msgid "…a warmth rises in my chest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301524"
msgid "Even if her words were just concern over my sense of guilt,\nher wholehearted \"gratitude\" was genuine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301628"
msgid "She gently smiles as if embracing the\nbehavior and personality of another person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301712"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF's modest conduct is seldom seen in everyday life.\nSomeone like this will definitely join the Student Council.\nBelieving that, I explain about #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2301924"
msgid "…the Student Council, you say?\nCertainly, if leaving is the goal, the best\nthing would be for everyone to work together."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302048"
msgid "No way!\nThe other Masters are one thing,\nbut for her to refuse joining is…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302128"
msgid "I don't want to soil your determination with\nsuch a trivial thing, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI'm very sorry, but please leave me be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302260"
msgid "I understand how much she's concerned for me.\nSo much that it hurts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302332"
msgid "But… she doesn't want to leave?\nWhat could that be all about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302396"
msgid "Perhaps I could say… that in accepting that\nwhich is impossible, my heart has been broken."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302488"
msgid "Though I say that, I have tried escaping\nin my own way. However with my power, all I\ncan do is open a rift to the outside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302612"
msgid "The moment I step outside, my power will not\npreserve my form, and I will likely\nbe deleted. The same for my Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302732"
msgid "When that happens… when you escape,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, will you abandon me\nhere without a second thought?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302848"
msgid "I'm sure you'll hesitate, due to being\nunable to abandon those who are powerless.\n…that would be a twofold tragedy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2302968"
msgid "…don't look so sad.\nThere's no need to worry. After all, this school\nbuilding isn't such a bad place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303072"
msgid "This means they have a generous heart,\ndoes it not? The same happened in the\nother school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303172"
msgid "However, no one can say for sure how\nlong that \"someone's\" generous heart will last."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303260"
msgid "That is quite so.\nThus, I won't reject everyone of the Student\nCouncil. I think I will support you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303360"
msgid "…I have no choice but to back off if she says that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303416"
msgid "No one understands a Master and Servant's\nability better than the Master themself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303500"
msgid "It would be irresponsible for me, a stranger,\nto interject if #C236196003Kiara#CDEF herself says she's not strong enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303624"
msgid "Hee hee.\nYou really are a troublesome one.\nPlease don't make that face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303696"
msgid "I, #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF, am still so depraved that\nI prioritize only my own life, but I shall\nsupport you covertly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2303824"
msgid "That's the one thing which must be\nconcealed throughout the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF above all else:\na Servant's #C000246204True Name#CDEF. And she spoke it with no issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304004"
msgid "She's truly given up on going back alive.\nShe's showing her hand to me,\nsomeone who would've eventually become her enemy,\nbecause she doesn't want to return to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304200"
msgid "Famous for \"The Little Mermaid\" and \"The Little Match Girl\";\none of the world's three greatest fairy tale writers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304316"
msgid "Were the fairy tales I heard at bedtime\nso many times really written by this young boy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304404"
msgid "No need to bother mentioning my class.\nSince, befitting this awful Master,\nI'm a vulgar Heroic Spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304508"
msgid "But what a shockingly ordinary face you have.\nNo anguish, no sorrow; just someone cast out of\nthis world, playing the victim."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304636"
msgid "Very nice, not bad at all.\nExactly how a clown SHOULD look."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304696"
msgid "They say idiocy is a sin, but a toss out\nof society is fortuitous for the mediocre.\nNow you can enjoy good and evil!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304816"
msgid "Don't trust others.\nDon't trust women.\nAvoid THIS woman especially, at least."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2304896"
msgid "Flesh; words; thoughts; outcomes. These\nare all poison to the ordinary person.\nCuriosity killed the cat, as they say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305016"
msgid "The sermons of the holy are unbearable to\nthe masses. If they come out of this woman,\nthey're even harder to bear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305132"
msgid "…enough. Once your mouth opens, it's all\nhorrible things. All I did was confess to my\nlack of will and ability to resolve all this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305268"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF.\nPerhaps the inside of a box DOES suit you\nbetter than being outside?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305364"
msgid "Hmph. All I did was speak when you told\nme to speak. And once I take off,\nmy scribble-scrabbles don't stop, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305496"
msgid "You're the one who ordered me to guide\nthese commoners. I don't mince words.\nBeating around the bush doesn't help anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305620"
msgid "I will disparage that person's worth\nas best I can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305672"
msgid "…*sigh*. Again with that talk. We've been\ntogether for a while now. Haven't I been\ntelling you not to attribute worth to people?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305804"
msgid "―――The same applies to you, young Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305852"
msgid "He looks at me with a discerning gaze, as if appraising me.\nHe doesn't look like a young boy―he has a mature presence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2305972"
msgid "You intend on being the lead in your\nown story, right?\nYes, that's the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306052"
msgid "But that stage will one day appear,\nand your story will end as unbearable trash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306136"
msgid "Everyone is a lead actor, but only a few\nwinners can pull off a great performance and\nbring the curtain down on a masterpiece."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306264"
msgid "Therefore, do not stop.\nDo not squander.\nDo not waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306320"
msgid "If you want to realize your dreams, don't\nsit here listening to a critic's voice. Get out\nthere and work like a mule, you third-rate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306456"
msgid "Hee hee. You see what kind of Servant he is,\nbut please be nice to him. Deep down,\nhe's an honest and good person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306572"
msgid "I-is that so.\nIf #C236196003Kiara#CDEF hadn't smoothed things out,\nright about now #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF would've probably jumped\nout and start hurling insults―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306772"
msgid "Anyway, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF turned down joining the Student Council,\nbut will cooperate as much as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306884"
msgid "I apologize, but I cannot join the\nStudent Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2306936"
msgid "However, if there is anything else I can do,\nthen I'll support you as much as I can,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2307048"
msgid "Hmph. You look like quite the sucker,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF. She's a hypocrite\nand uses that to butter people up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2307172"
msgid "…and with that, I'm sure I've been all\naround the school building.\nI'll stop by the Student Council Room and report to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2307316"
msgid "Oh my. What a grave expression you have.\nI heard that you forayed into that strange\narena. Did something happen in there?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2307440"
msgid "I tell #C236196003Kiara#CDEF about what occurred in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2307532"
msgid "About how, with the backup of the Student Council,\nwe forayed into that unknown arena."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2307620"
msgid "Wow… oh my goodness. All that happened while\nI was here timidly counting stains on the\nwall due to my lack of power…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2307740"
msgid "Yet, I'm so relieved. Hmhm. The #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF, you say? You look so well-behaved,\nbut you're #[still a boy, after all.][quite lustful, aren't you?]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2307908"
msgid "I mean, for so many people to be\nforcibly entering #C236196003Sakura#CDEF…\nI wonder if it was her first time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308020"
msgid "To be told of such a raw scene so upfrontly…\nI'm a woman, so, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308096"
msgid "…I'm changing my opinion of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308132"
msgid "Huh? That's not what you're talking about?\nThe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the name of the Arena?\nOh my. My my my."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308256"
msgid "I'm sorry. You had to listen to one of my\nselfish delusions. Of course. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF\nwould never do such a thing. Hohohoho."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308392"
msgid "…I wonder if #C236196003Kiara#CDEF has any in-depth knowledge of sex at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308472"
msgid "I explain the situation to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and ask for her advice.\nAny little detail she might think of will help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308596"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF stares straight at me and\nrebukes me for trying to destroy the Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308700"
msgid "…however, this isn't the time to be\nsaying such things, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308764"
msgid "Something like: \"I won't forgive you if you\ntouch that door\"―\"treat female enemies with\ndelicacy\"―\"I hate to say it, but I feel it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308900"
msgid "…I recall my conversation with #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nNow that I think about it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2308984"
msgid "\"Don't look into someone's heart.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309020"
msgid "A mental wall, materialized from human emotion…\nfrom the \"true character and qualities\none cannot show to anyone.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309136"
msgid "In short, it's how the mind guards its secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309184"
msgid "There's a practice in psychotherapy of\n#ROFS0004#RUBS  diving#RUBEsneaking#REND into a patient's psyche to rid them\nof the source of their anguish…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309336"
msgid "In those cases, walls are very likely to appear.\nUltra-hazardous barriers which repel,\nor obliterate, pseudo-Spiritronized #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309508"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is likely unfamiliar with medicine…\nwith clinical psychology.\nNaturally, he wouldn't understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309628"
msgid "Admittedly, this is also the first time I've\nseen something of such size and strength.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF is vehemently rejecting us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309764"
msgid "A mental wall… That's what that Shield really is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309816"
msgid "Which means that wall is #C236196003Rin#CDEF's self-defensive mind.\nBeyond it lies #C236196003Rin#CDEF's secrets―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2309936"
msgid "Hey, what are you so excited about? Your heart\nis beating faster. Well, that said,\nI'm getting all giddy as well!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310052"
msgid "Not wanting to reveal yourself―wanting to see\nwhat's hidden―are parts of human psychology,\nbut you have to mind your manners first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310188"
msgid "Oh boy… By that logic, then that wall is\ncertainly going to be a sturdy one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310268"
msgid "Or rather, normal logic won't do zilch. A\nmaiden's mind is hardy when keeping secrets,\nlike a millennium Yakushima Cedar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310392"
msgid "A wall that keeps secrets, now?\nIf no lock exists, then I can't even demonstrate\nthe power of my Key of the King's Law."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310512"
msgid "If so, then I think drastic measures are\nneeded. I'll help you, with my limited ability."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310604"
msgid "Please go on ahead to the Student Council\nRoom. If I suffice, I can teach the\nbasics… of unraveling a person's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310724"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF, who had no intention to before,\nnow tells me that she'll help us deal with the Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310836"
msgid "I can this say this went better than expected.\n#C000246204I'll go report to Leo in the Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2310952"
msgid "A mental wall in the Labyrinth appears,\nthen one of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's offshoots took form―――\nI had a feeling it would come to this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2311092"
msgid "So #C236196003Rin#CDEF's true self is in there after all…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2311152"
msgid "Even #C236196003Sakura#CDEF says she can't make a gate.\nLike with the #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF, we may need a special skill\nthat's different from what #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF usually use―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2311376"
msgid "…indeed.\nHowever, this is a closely guarded ritual that\nI cannot instruct you on so readily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2311472"
msgid "Therefore―――\nI shall assist you in entering the Wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2311532"
msgid "You have obtained many of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's secrets,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. With three, I believe you can\n#ROFS-007#RUBSinfiltrate her mind#RUBEPsycho Dive#REND even further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2311716"
msgid "I must warn you, though. A person's heart\nunconditionally refuses visitors.\nIf you go, confrontation will be unavoidable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2311840"
msgid "With this many fragments of her mind,\nI can send you into the depths of her\nconsciousness right away, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2311968"
msgid "However, you should head to #C236196003Leo#CDEF first.\nWe won't be late even if you proceed to battle\nafter developing a strategy with everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2312116"
msgid "There's a sort of lack of time here.\nIf you rest for a moment, no, a mere day, or a\nweek, it won't change a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2312232"
msgid "What's most important is that you're okay.\nI heard a summary of what happened\nfrom #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2312348"
msgid "Did you hear this? All the people captured\nin the Torture Chamber had their consciousnesses\nreleased from the Net Ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2312472"
msgid "Certainly, we may still be sailing in the dark,\nbut people were saved by your actions.\nI graciously thank you on their behalf."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2312600"
msgid "Being thanked by her like this makes me feel\nproud about triumphing over #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2312700"
msgid "The extension of the Labyrinth.\nThe appearance of the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2312784"
msgid "This bombardment of bad things kept me\nin low spirits, but on the other hand,\nit sounds like I was able to be of help to someone―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2312920"
msgid "Although, we don't have the time to chat idly,\nright? I definitely saw the footage of the\n#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313040"
msgid "I thought she would be some sort of demon, but\nno, she's an adorable girl. Sweet #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF…\nHmhm. She's a nice girl, isn't she?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2313188"
msgid "I think she's a nice girl."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2313216"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313236"
msgid "That's wonderful. In my opinion,\nshe must wish to know you better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313304"
msgid "To know others is to hurt others.\nThe pain of knowing and being known is grievous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313388"
msgid "Oh dear. You don't think so?\nPersonally, I enjoy the awkwardness\nof such people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313472"
msgid "The reticent, awkward, cowardly, inarticulate―\nThey tend to be misunderstood, but they\nhave compassionate minds too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313592"
msgid "Skill in communication isn't the only thing\nthat determines whether a person is worthy\nof love, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313696"
msgid "Please look after what's inside that girl.\nSurely a childish, charming face of a young\ngirl is hidden within."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313808"
msgid "That may be because she only glanced over the footage.\n#C236196003Kiara#CDEF doesn't seem to be afraid of #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2313944"
msgid "Still… No matter how charming she appears,\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF has fiendish claws on both hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2314052"
msgid "Servants can take it, but for a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND,\njust touching them would mean instant death.\nI believe being cautious is human instinct, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2314236"
msgid "Praetor, you're agonizing over the wrong thing.\nPut your opinions of that #C000246204Ego#CDEF aside.\nAsk about the #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2314372"
msgid "#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF. I won't have you misleading my\npure Master. #[He's][She's]# a novice who has\nplenty of troubles as it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2314504"
msgid "No, we've had enough with that Oppai Monster's\nstrength as a heroine. We'd like to ask\nwhether or not her #C000246204SGs#CDEF could be extracted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2314652"
msgid "Woman. I have no interest in your preaching.\nThis one shall gauge that #C000246204Ego#CDEF girl.\nWhat we need to know is about #C000246204SGs#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2314800"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF? In that case, nothing changes.\nActually, I think it may be easier to extract\nthan with #C236196003Rin#CDEF and such."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2314960"
msgid "Though an offshoot of #C236196003BB#CDEF, she does have a heart.\nNo, perhaps I should say that it's because\nshe's #C236196003BB#CDEF's offshoot that she has a heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315128"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF split her functions into #C000246204Egos#CDEF.\nAfter that, she composited many Servants\nwith them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315248"
msgid "As a result, the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are independent――\nThey are separate from #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nand gained hearts that weren't born from AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315400"
msgid "But, it's ironic. They were only just born, so\nthey don't know how to conceal their minds. They\nhaven't developed along with their secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315540"
msgid "Thus, you should be able to extract the gaps,\nthe weaknesses of her mind by merely\nconfronting her. But there's one condition―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315668"
msgid "A condition?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315684"
msgid "A condition?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315700"
msgid "A condition-al clause?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315724"
msgid "You were able to discuss things with #C236196003Rin#CDEF and\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, but reaching a mutual understanding with\nthose girls will prove difficult."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2315884"
msgid "You'll most likely end up fighting. Prepare as\nif it will always turn into a fight, and please,\ndon't show them any mercy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316008"
msgid "…I see.\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF was the combat proxy for #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316112"
msgid "But it's different for an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\n#C236196003Lip#CDEF herself is a combat machine with the\nabilities of a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316248"
msgid "I take #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's warning to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316300"
msgid "I'll brace myself then #C000246204head for the Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316364"
msgid "I found #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and #C236196003Andersen#CDEF in the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316440"
msgid "…I recall what #C236196003Rin#CDEF told me about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's background.\nI was a little hesitant, but I tried asking\nher about whether it was true or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316608"
msgid "\nIf all the adherents connected to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF killed themselves――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316688"
msgid "I don't think that this willowy woman\nwould be in the middle of such a maelstrom of death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316780"
msgid "What I thought or what my goals were\nwas irrelevant to the people. The only thing\nleft in my hands was the outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316896"
msgid "The lives of many people were consumed\nby my own avarice. However――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2316968"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF looks puzzled,\nas if miserable from the bottom of her heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317052"
msgid "Her expression makes me think of a\nterrifically beautiful and fleeting heaven lotus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317140"
msgid "They loved me by their own will,\nbecame despaired by their actions, and at the\nend of their love, ended their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317260"
msgid "There was no bloodlust in them to be found.\nThey simply drowned in me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317332"
msgid "They went insane, as if despairing from that\ntruth, as if craving and lusting insatiably for\nme―― As a result, they ended their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317472"
msgid "I wanted to save them.\nThey wanted me to save them. In the end,\nthey died, and that's all there is to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317580"
msgid "Saying that, she smiles.\nSorrowfully. With such beauty that any who\nsaw it would be touched."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317676"
msgid "And that's why――I find it difficult to consider her human,\nin terms of her mentality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317764"
msgid "As a religious leader, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF treated many people impartially\nand lavished them with love.\nThat resulted in those adherents becoming swollen with desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2317936"
msgid "\"I beg you, I want you to love only me――\"\n\"More, more; I want endless love from you――\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2318028"
msgid "But that wasn't allowed.\nAs a consequence of treating everyone equally,\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF possessed no love towards individuals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2318172"
msgid "…and then, their practically immolating desire\nwas how they literally were destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2318260"
msgid "Because they went and recognized #C236196003Kiara#CDEF as a saint,\nthey became aware of their essentially\nsalvation-less reality and despaired."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2318404"
msgid "They probably could have returned to their lives\nif they distanced themselves from #C236196003Kiara#CDEF,\nbut perhaps because they had known this\nalmost Bodhisattva-love,\nthey couldn't leave the palm of her hand――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2318620"
msgid "For now, please don't be concerned with my\naffairs. Please focus on defeating #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand returning to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2318772"
msgid "…and after, if a time comes when we face\neach other as Masters in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF――\nTHEN, please charge me with my sin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2318916"
msgid "I hope you'll tell me the answer as to\nwhether my Eiten school's doctrines\nwere correct or incorrect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319020"
msgid "Without replying to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's smile,\nI leave her presence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319096"
msgid "This is Heaven's battlefield;\na garden of selfishness where wishes\nare put on the line."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319184"
msgid "I'm certain that #C236196003Kiara#CDEF isn't special.\nHere, everyone fights for themselves――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319280"
msgid "Give it up.\nIt's not something you young ones\ncan sink your teeth into."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319352"
msgid "It's a narcotic that provides the fleeting\npleasure she seeks yet is loathe to mention, as\nmuch as it befits this filthy feline."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319484"
msgid "\"Pleasure leads to the pearly gates\" is the\nsort of justification typical for this woman to\nuse for her evil deeds. Why do you need it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319620"
msgid "…it's true that the #RUBS  Ten-thousand Colored Stagnation#RUBE#C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF#REND\nis a dangerous Code Cast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319760"
msgid "Because networks have become the foundation for human society,\nan ability which can utilize networks to dominate others\nis equivalent to an ability that dominates the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319936"
msgid "But right now we have to depend on it, even if it's taboo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2319996"
msgid "The Student Council Room has been hacked by #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2320068"
msgid "and the #RUBS  Ten-thousand Colored Stagnation#RUBE#C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF#REND is necessary to save #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nI explain all this to #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2320256"
msgid "…………now this is precarious. I fully\nunderstand what you're saying, but…\n…I really do have a problematic nature…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2320376"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF looks downwards, uneasy.\n…she's probably right to feel reluctant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2320476"
msgid "And the reason is because I'm not only inquiring about\nthe existence of a Code Cast considered to be the greatest\noffense in cyber history―I'm also asking to borrow it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2320648"
msgid "…get in return?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2320668"
msgid "Did she say she won't get anything in return?\nWell, she IS lending me something that belongs to her.\nOf course she should get something in return.\n…I didn't expect her to bring up something like that though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2320880"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF has always exercised foresight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2320944"
msgid "She's resolute, possesses an enlightenment\nnormal people like me won't reach,\nand is beyond good and evil―――\nEven she's thinking in this way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321092"
msgid "I never expected her to do something as materialistic as,\nlike, refuse because she won't get anything in return―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321212"
msgid "There's nothing off here. Simply put, this vile\nwoman would, for the sake of her own ego, save\nor even kill hundreds of millions of people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321352"
msgid "But if someone won't satisfy HER pleasure,\nshe won't lift a single finger."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321428"
msgid "She'll welcome you with open arms if YOU\njump into her bed, but she would hate to\nget up, even to peel an apple!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321544"
msgid "*sigh*… Mister #C236196003Andersen#CDEF. All the ladies will\nend up disliking you if you keep speaking\nyour mind so freely, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321680"
msgid "Ha! As if I would ever date a woman who hates\nme for speaking my mind! Who in the hell would\nenjoy my vitriol, anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321800"
msgid "Hee hee, indeed.\nOnly someone like you can see my\ntrue intentions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321868"
msgid "Who would've thought that famous fairy tale\nwriter was like this? Fate truly is ironic.\n…now then. #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2321996"
msgid "I know. \"Give these young ones something\nto give me,\" right?\n…really now. How filthy can you get?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322096"
msgid "Young #[man][lady]#. Sorry, but this is an order from my\nMaster. We shall take our leave off to #C000246204somewhere\nin the Labyrinth#CDEF. If you want this, come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322260"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF pulls out a massive book,\nand after muttering something,\nthe two of them vanish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322368"
msgid "They didn't just… run away, did they!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322408"
msgid "They did―― and they made a grand escape,\nat that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322460"
msgid "Damn. He mentioned the Labyrinth, no?\nBest place to hide away is the #C000246204deepest area#CDEF…\nLet's go after them, Praetor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322592"
msgid "…and here we go.\nAlthough I didn't expect this to be easy,\nnow it's turned into a headache."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322688"
msgid "Let's head to the Labyrinth. They're probably\nin the #C000246204current deepest floor#CDEF. \nWe'll just have to settle this there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322820"
msgid "Huh? His Master is the one you don't get?\nHmm. Personally, I don't care much about her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2322908"
msgid "How do I put it? He's got that instigating,\n\"I'll be the one that takes you down\"\nsort of thing going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323016"
msgid "…well, whatever. Let's go search the\nLabyrinth, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND. They've got to be in\nthe #C000246204lowest area#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323152"
msgid "Was that a Noble Phantasm? I suppose this means\nthat lowly fairy tale author's specialty is\nin disappearing and rearing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323276"
msgid "Anyway, pursuing them is the only option. They\nmust be in the #C000246204deepest part of the navigable\nLabyrinth#CDEF now. Then, we just take by force."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323428"
msgid "Oh dear. It appears that something is troubling\nyou. What happened?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323496"
msgid "However, I'm afraid to say I cannot help you.\nI am one who is disconnected from the secular\nworld. I carry no money on my person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323628"
msgid "#C000246204Please wait in the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nI'll also be there soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323712"
msgid "…how very regrettable. A human heart has\nbecome a Labyrinth wall… it will only get hurt\nthat way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323812"
msgid "Though it may certainly be a sturdy bulwark, I\nam reluctant to approve of it, for the heart\nmust be handled much more carefully."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2323944"
msgid "However, people have many secrets.\nIt is likely that one will not suffice.\nPlease be prepared for more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324048"
msgid "Hidden within the depths of a stout woman's\nheart, an innocent desire inexpressible to\nothers… Putting it to words may excite me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324180"
msgid "Hehe. Though it may be immodest,\nI'm kind of looking forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324248"
msgid "Know that, for a Master of my ability, I had\nno choice but to do that in order to survive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324340"
msgid "I won't make any excuse, but know that I\nlament my own weakness too…\nPlease just understand that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324440"
msgid "Ha! Stupid woman, it serves you right!\nThis is because you contracted a third-rate\nServant like me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324540"
msgid "If you do that, then I can finally get some\nsatisfaction over being pushed around by a\ncow like you every day!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324652"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nJust when did I ever force you to do cruel,\nbackbreaking labor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324744"
msgid "If that's what you desire, then I wouldn't mind\nusing the power of my #C000246204Command Seals#CDEF to toss\nyou into the Labyrinth right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2324888"
msgid "I went too far with my impoliteness. So lay off.\nReally, don't do it. I hate manual labor\nmore than anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325000"
msgid "I get it. I made a mistake in calling you a cow.\nThat metaphor was too straightforward! I\nshould've said something like \"Melons' Pass\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325136"
msgid "E-excuse me.\nI bought some Ohagi cakes at the Commissary\non a whim…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325208"
msgid "Um. It's indecent for a woman like me to be\nthankful for sweets, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325292"
msgid "That's why… I hid myself alone somewhere and\nate them… but I ended up being seen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325376"
msgid "I really can't be doing bad things… I can't\nbelieve I let #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF see such an\nembarrassing side of me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325500"
msgid "This is a lonely place, isn't it?\nSure, there are people to talk to,\nbut they're mostly just NPCs…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325600"
msgid "In this #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF, there's no distinction between\nhumans and AI, but…\nRaw desires run thin here… *sigh*."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325724"
msgid "The sensation of being nude is truly one of\na kind. I would love to have a long talk\nwith #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325836"
msgid "A Habit of Exposure and worshipping nature are\ntwo different things. You mean to say being nude\nequals being wild? How uncivilized, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2325992"
msgid "I heard that a new Sentinel appeared.\nI wonder what kind of being #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are?\nI'm curious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326104"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF have minds like humans, but what\nbecomes a Core is not an achromatic mind, but\na mind which was discolored to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326256"
msgid "These girls have been unbalanced from\nthe very start. Please don't forget that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326340"
msgid "\"#C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF\" you say… Hmhm.\nSuch a constitution may be a burden to her,\nbut to some, it's irresistible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326476"
msgid "Indeed.\nPriests are good at attaining spiritual\ninsight from hurting themselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326560"
msgid "Isn't that right, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nYou've got PROFOUND insight into THAT, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326644"
msgid "Yes, well, you could say that I too have\nsomething of a #RUBS      family view#RUBEpersonal#REND opinion on pain――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326764"
msgid "W-wait, no!\nWhat are you making me say, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nI know nothing of this. No comment!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326868"
msgid "The skills I trained for back on Earth\nweren't learned in vain, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2326940"
msgid "I feel like I've been beaten to the punch…\nI secretly had my eyes on you, but… huh?\nThat's not it? It's part of your strategy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327072"
msgid "Ah… no, I shouldn't be glad about this.\nIt's a strategy for capturing an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nIt's going to be dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327204"
msgid "Please be careful.\nI'm praying that you'll return safely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327264"
msgid "In a sense, between all of them, she may become\nthe most troublesome opponent yet.\nPlease stay focused."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327368"
msgid "…occasionally,\nI think it's necessary to make a level-headed\ndecision. Please keep a stout heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327468"
msgid "All humans tell lies.\nOne could say it's like an\narmor that protects one's mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327552"
msgid "SHE'S pure? Hmph, how stupid. She's not pure.\nShe just knows nothing about the world. Just a\n#RUBS      newb #RUBEsulky child#REND without enough experience points."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327720"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mental wall is surely\na formidable one, but her Servant is\nthe one who piques my interest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327836"
msgid "The Heroic Spirit, #C236196003Karna#CDEF―――\nI've heard that his strength rivals that\nof the great hero of Indian myth, #C236196003Arjuna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2327984"
msgid "In the Near Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, I say he's\nof the highest tier, without a doubt. Please be\nsure to gather plenty of experience, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328140"
msgid "Thanks to my pact with #C236196003BB#CDEF, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF and I\nmade it out without being attacked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328252"
msgid "Have you met with the others?\nIt seems everyone is doing alright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328320"
msgid "Hm? You want to know why I stand in this corner?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328372"
msgid "Well, there's no particular reason,\nbut being in the corner is less stressful\nthan being in the center, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328488"
msgid "She's just staying all the way back, so the\nhealthy boys and girls don't notice her. Even\nTHIS woman knows about right place and time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328624"
msgid "Unleashing the people's desires… Perhaps #C236196003BB#CDEF's\nobjective is her duty as a health management AI\ntaken to the extreme."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328760"
msgid "However, it only applies to their minds.\nHuman happiness lies in the union of\nmind AND body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328856"
msgid "Her ideals are too underdeveloped. I'm no match\nfor her, but you're capable of putting her\nwicked intentions down, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2328996"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, why is it that you wish\nto see the depths of the Labyrinth so badly?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329092"
msgid "…sorry, that was a foolish question.\nPlease forget what I just said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329164"
msgid "Wha―― That you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?\nOh thank God, finally someone who gets\nwhat I'm talking about!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329272"
msgid "As soon as he sees me, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's face starts to glow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329344"
msgid "He's barely said anything yet,\nbut just from his gestures I could tell that he's the\nsame #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF I saw in the \"previous school building.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329504"
msgid "Even if that \"previous school building\" was a dream I had,\nthe actors in that dream were projections of those\nthat had I met in the \"real preliminaries.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329660"
msgid "It's safe to say that this #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has\nthe same personality as I remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329752"
msgid "So, same thing for you? When you came to,\nyou found yourself in this school building?\nHey, have you seen any sort of exit?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329876"
msgid "I answer #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's question with a shake of my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2329944"
msgid "I explained that I had just woken up in this\nold school building, so I had yet to see an exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330040"
msgid "Shinji talks the same way he usually does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330084"
msgid "I know he's saying rude things,\nbut I don't feel any animosity towards him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330160"
msgid "It looks like I've gotten TOO used to his\nelitism and self-consciousness from my dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330248"
msgid "…also, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF really IS brilliant, despite how he looks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330324"
msgid "Just like #C236196003Leo#CDEF asked of me,\nlet's try scouting him for the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330416"
msgid "Huh? Student Council?\nTeam up and work together so we can\nescape from here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330492"
msgid "Ha! No way! A Student Council isn't worth\na damn. If everyone wants to get all chummy\nto escape, then go right on ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330616"
msgid "I'm a genius, you know.\nI don't work with commoners.\nI won't ask for anyone's help, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330708"
msgid "More importantly, this is the first I've\nheard of #C236196003Leo#CDEF being here! I despise that guy.\nSo smug. All cool and calm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330840"
msgid "If #C236196003Leo#CDEF got the boot and I'd be made President,\nI'd consider it. Until then,\ndon't come to me for anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2330972"
msgid "…he ended up rejecting me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331000"
msgid "But just what does #C236196003Shinji#CDEF\nthink he's going to do all on his own?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331084"
msgid "I know he's not great at making friends,\nbut I don't think it's smart to act tough\nin a situation like this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331196"
msgid "Let's put that aside. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\ndo you remember the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331296"
msgid "I answer by saying that I can't recall anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331348"
msgid "I feel like I made it through several rounds with my Servant,\nbut so long as I don't know \"who\" or \"how\" I fought,\nI have nothing to tell #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331512"
msgid "The only real feeling I have left\nis the firm bond I have with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331600"
msgid "I answer by saying that I can't recall anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331652"
msgid "I feel like I made it through several rounds with my Servant,\nbut so long as I don't know \"who\" or \"how\" I fought,\nI have nothing to tell #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331816"
msgid "Obviously, being a Master and all, I reply.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's astonishment was closer to fear than confusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331936"
msgid "…yeah, sort of, I answer with little confidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2331988"
msgid "…gone. Apparently, we got separated\non the way here. Well, once I return to the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she'll come back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2332128"
msgid "…that's right, I need to hurry up and get back\nto the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.#RUBS         I'm#RUBE Her Master's#REND not there.\nThat woman must be lonely in some dumb way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2332312"
msgid "Besides, I'm sure the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's still on.\nIf you're not on the final battlefield in\nseven days, you lose by default, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2332460"
msgid "A #C000246204seven day period#CDEF…\nA #C000246204final battlefield#CDEF… \nA #C000246204loss by absence#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2332572"
msgid "When I heard that, I remembered it too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2332612"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is a tournament with seven rounds.\nFirst, an opponent is decided for you.\nAfter seven days of preparation,\nyou go to the final battlefield and fight the enemy Master.\nThose are the rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2332836"
msgid "Naturally, losing this fight means elimination.\nNot reaching the final battlefield is also \"defeat.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2332940"
msgid "Ridiculous. Worst comes to worst,\nall you have to do is log out.\nIt's an old scare tactic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333032"
msgid "Sure, that could be how the final selection\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is.\nWorst comes to worst, you can just drop your connection\nand return to your body on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333208"
msgid "…however, they say that not a single #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND who\nwent up to the Moon has ever returned from that cyberspace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333364"
msgid "And――The real problem is that we're\nin this school building, unable to get out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333448"
msgid "W-what's with that gloomy look on your face!?\nThere's probably just no connection\nbetween here and the surface."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333560"
msgid "What? The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a Brain of God, right?\nThen it'll help us soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333656"
msgid "You're so damn persistent.\nA friendly little Student Council isn't\nmy thing. Can't you bother someone else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333764"
msgid "…like I thought,\nit sounds like #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has no intention of joining either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333856"
msgid "I'm sure I've already looked around the\nschool building from top to bottom,\nbut I haven't gotten very good responses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2333976"
msgid "Let's stop by the Student Council Room to report to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334052"
msgid "First, we visit the Student Council.\nIf we all come up with another plan,\na way to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF may arise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334172"
msgid "Or rather, we'll find a way.\nThough it's only chess, losing over and over\ngoes against every fiber of my being!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334284"
msgid "About our issue with #C236196003Rani#CDEF: what if we challenge\nher to a game other than chess? I'm confident\nthat I'm second to none in Hanafuda…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334432"
msgid "Did we have games with pieces back in\nancient Uruk, you ask? The answer is obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334516"
msgid "All of humanity's intellectual property, from\nall origins, come from my stores. That #C236196003King of\nConquerors#CDEF' library only imitates mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334668"
msgid "Heeeeeeeey!\nIt SURE DOES look like my time to shine, huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334728"
msgid "Ah! #C236196003Shinji#CDEF…!?\nWhere did you come from…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334788"
msgid "I was here the whole time!\nDo you know how many minutes\nI've been waiting here!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334872"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, you… were waiting for me,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2334972"
msgid "Why on Earth―― Well, that's what I would say,\nbut it's not really that strange.\nMaybe he was spying on the Student Council again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2335104"
msgid "Hmph――! I heard about it from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Chess? How no one could beat her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2335216"
msgid "Hmph――! I heard about it from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Chess? How no one could beat her?\nAh, except for #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2335372"
msgid "I don't feel like joining in on your\npointless floundering, but I can't just\nignore a classmate in trouble, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2335492"
msgid "It won't hurt to show off what this\nNo. 1 Game Champ of Asia is made of.\nI'll lend you a hand, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2335612"
msgid "Oh my. I sense an indescribable vigor from this\nman… Listen, Praetor. Could this be the first\ntime he's been useful in his entire life?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2335752"
msgid "…I won't give him points for eavesdropping,\nbut it's good that he volunteered to cooperate.\nLet's see what he's got, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2335884"
msgid "――――Hm.\nThough minuscule, I felt #ROFS0001#RUBSkingliness#RUBEan aura#REND……\nCould this \"#C236196003Shinji#CDEF\" be the King of Buffoons?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336028"
msgid "Hmph. As usual, your Servant always\nhas something to say. Just you wait and see―\nthis time I'll show you how awesome I am…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336156"
msgid "…hey, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nHave your Servant and I\never spoken to each other before?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336244"
msgid "Hey now, that Servant of yours\nhas a real sharp set of eyes on him!\nHe's all golden and looks tough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336348"
msgid "…whatever. Anyway, go on over to #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI'll be on standby in\nthe Student Council Room, got it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336464"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is full of energy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336508"
msgid "Let's trust in the Game Champ's skills\nand try challenging #C236196003Rani#CDEF once again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336600"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is standing in front of the room.\nBy the looks of it,\nit seems he wants to talk to me about something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336728"
msgid "Ever since the whole affair with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF has become increasingly obstinate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336848"
msgid "I wonder what #C236196003Shinji#CDEF wants to talk to me about,\nin spite of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2336932"
msgid "#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's been keeping me in the loop.\nYou saw just how outclassed you are,\nyet you still went into HER Labyrinth, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2337068"
msgid "Not only did she treat me like a worm,\nshe even went and nano-sized me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2337144"
msgid "If you had left me there, I'd be\nliquid nutrients for that #ROFS0002#RUBSSakura#RUBE#C236196003AI#CDEF#REND right about now.\nThinking about it makes me shudder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2337308"
msgid "…so, how'd it go?\nYou entered her Labyrinth, so you fought her,\nright? Show me your battle logs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2337408"
msgid "He doesn't know about #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nfighting style or her #C000246204invincibility#CDEF skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2337520"
msgid "How about we show him our previous data?\nThis man is a rather persistent one.\nHe'll keep asking and asking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2337628"
msgid "Please show him our last battle records.\nWe might even get… probably nothing out of it,\nconsidering it's this guy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2337744"
msgid "*sigh* We haven't a single grain of obligation\nto tell you anything, but having you follow us\naround is SO annoying… Go ahead, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2337884"
msgid "It would clearly be in vain to do so, but\nthere's always a possibility. If all he desires\nis the battle data, then give it to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338016"
msgid "Urged on by #C236196003#SVT#CDEF,\nI share my impressions of the time we were assaulted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338104"
msgid "Huh…?\nI knew about Drain, but what's up with that\n\"#C000246204Invincibility#CDEF\"? Is she really invincible?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338216"
msgid "I can at least say that she nullified\neverything we threw at her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338284"
msgid "Maybe she just has high defense,\nand if we get our attack stat up, we can break through…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338376"
msgid "…all we can do is hope that's the case\nand head to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338444"
msgid "You've got some guts heading into\nthe Labyrinth with her after you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338516"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF both have awful personalities,\nbut SHE'S even worse than awful. You'll get\nslaughtered without mercy if she finds you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338688"
msgid "And you're going to beat THAT?\nDid #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and the others come up\nwith some sort of strategy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338800"
msgid "They're coming up with one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338828"
msgid "But the hole #C236196003Leo#CDEF left behind is a big one.\nAll the work keeps piling up solely on #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2338972"
msgid "I have no choice but to find a countermeasure\nfor #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF within the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339072"
msgid "…unbelievable.\nAre you seriously not scared? You do realize\nwe have no chance of winning, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339172"
msgid "Yet you're still going to defy #C236196003BB#CDEF?\n…the Near Side of the Moon\nain't that great a place, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339288"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF was an actual slaughterfest.\nEven if we make it back,\nwe'll either live or die. That's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339416"
msgid "I don't hear any of the usual bravado in #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339492"
msgid "In his own way, he's speaking his mind.\nHe's expressing his raw apprehensions without any pretense."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2339592"
msgid "I still have to get back to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2339636"
msgid "…to be honest, I'm scared too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339672"
msgid "…it's not that you want to go back,\nit's that you have to…\nWhat's the deal with you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339760"
msgid "You're just #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWhen did you start walking around,\nacting like a hero?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339852"
msgid "That stuff about the end of humanity?\nIt's a load of bull.\nShe's totally just talking it up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2339948"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is fundamentally the same as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, right?\nSo it's fine. No way she's capable of\ndoing something that heinous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340096"
msgid "That's right, you should be.\nYou're up against a monster out to dominate\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. No one can blame us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340224"
msgid "You wouldn't be you otherwise, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nThe fate of the world, protecting the Moon――\nIt's got nothing to do with us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340360"
msgid "…looks like my answer didn't get through to #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340432"
msgid "No matter what I say,\nthere are no words that will make #C236196003Shinji#CDEF feel better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340524"
msgid "That's something every person left in the\nold school building has in common, not just #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340636"
msgid "The ones remaining are those who stifle such thoughts\nand struggle on, and those who can no longer struggle on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340748"
msgid "A-anyway, that's all I wanted to talk about.\nI want nothing to do with all this pointless\nfloundering about you're all doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340876"
msgid "I just got―you know―a bone to pick with HER.\nI was curious about what's been going on.\nThat's all this was, really!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2340996"
msgid "…you heard me? DON'T.\nIf you value your life, then do nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341060"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF leaves, like he was holding back his frustration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341136"
msgid "…don't go into the Labyrinth.\nIf we just stick to the old school building, we'll be safe…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341228"
msgid "…it's absurd to imagine, but:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341260"
msgid "maybe if we did as she said, our situation\nwouldn't have changed, and no one would've disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341360"
msgid "It would've been like sleeping in an empty cradle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341412"
msgid "We wouldn't have known about the outside world's destruction.\nMaybe we would've slept as much as we wanted\nwithin this sunset school forever――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341560"
msgid "But I've seen #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF go through\nthe cherry tree with that dinky face of #[his][hers]#.\nI need some info, stat…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341688"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's in front of the Student Council Room.\nHe's trying to peek inside by looking for gaps in the curtains\none-by-one, unaware that I'm standing right behind him."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2341872"
msgid "Your face looks as sorry as ever, #[huh][doesn't it]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2341928"
msgid "\"Why?\" you ask……\nI AM involved in the Student Council,\nso of course I'd come through here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342024"
msgid "And why're you here, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF?\nCould it be that you relate with #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG1#CDEF?\nSo, despite speaking ill of the Student Council,\nyou're actually interest――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342224"
msgid "I mean, giving up on someone as uber talented\nas me after getting rejected one time?\nStudent Council messed up big time there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342352"
msgid "Like, do you really think I'M obligated\nto help them in any way? After all,\nthis problem'll go away if I just wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342468"
msgid "That's why I'm only keeping an eye on you guys\nso you don't do anything excessive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342552"
msgid "I see……\nWould've been great if #C236196003Shinji#CDEF joined the Student Council,\nbut if he doesn't want to, he doesn't want to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342684"
msgid "Guess I'll keep doing whatever I can,\njust like I always have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342748"
msgid "How could you accept that so easily?\nCan't you…… do better than that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342824"
msgid "You really are a dunce, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI really wanna see how you go about\ngetting your Student Council business done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2342952"
msgid "Dumbass―― That wasn't what I…!\nSarcasm! That was SARCASM!\nDon't you get it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343032"
msgid "Arrrgh, whatever! No matter how many times\nyou invite me, it's not like I'd ever join\nyour little Student Council! Never ever!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343160"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF left while shouting at me.\n……I feel that somewhere in his heart,\nhe's got something similar to that aspect of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343320"
msgid "If I ever get stuck when I'm looking around,\nI might be able to ask #C236196003Shinji#CDEF for advice…… I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343436"
msgid "Money? Come on #[man][girl]#,\nI already told you I wasn't gonna help out!\nWhy would I start handing out money?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343548"
msgid "Besides, I'm the one strapped for some cash!\nI can't use my #RUBS  PPT#RUBEmoney#REND from the Near Side,\nand I can't find any extra memory anywhere!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343700"
msgid "I don't have a Servant, so it'd be ridiculous\nfor me to start farming mats!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343776"
msgid "…huff, huff… I did it…\nI was right all along… It takes a genius\nto know a genius… That's how it is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343884"
msgid "Now I can survive…\nThis'll end without me dying…\nNo, if I pull this off, I can…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2343968"
msgid "S-sorry about that. Just thinking about\nsome things. Looks like you're doing alright.\nYou insisted on surviving, again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2344088"
msgid "So, what are you all going to do now?\nYou were calling it the \"Student Council,\"\nbut #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF got done in, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2344240"
msgid "There's no way out of this now, right?\nAll you, #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, and #C236196003Rani#CDEF can do now\nis whatever #C236196003BB#CDEF says."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2344388"
msgid "How about accepting it and preparing for\nher recommendation to surrender? Ya never know,\nshe might spare you, if you're lucky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2344516"
msgid "……#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF? She should still be in the #C000246204garden#CDEF.\nGo meet her if you want."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2344624"
msgid "In the first place, only second-rates\nhang out in stuff like Student Councils.\nI'll show you how I do things on my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2344744"
msgid "When the time comes to escape,\nI'll do you a favor and call out only to you,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Be thankful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2344860"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF is also here in this school#REND, right?\nMaybe I'll pay her a visit later.\nI'm a bit worried, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2344988"
msgid "Huh? You're going to the Arena?\nThe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? You're able to go in\nthrough the schoolyard's cherry tree?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2345120"
msgid "So #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF is the culprit\nbehind this weird situation, right?\nMan, what the hell is she doing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2345232"
msgid "Don't tell me, was she so scared of losing\nto me that she ran from the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?\nAww, that's actually kinda cute!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2345368"
msgid "Ohh, #C000246204SG#CDEF, huh? Making walls in the Labyrinth\nout of the walls in people's hearts?\nWhat kind of shady joke is that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2345500"
msgid "It's fine to ignore stuff like other people's\nfeelings. If there's an impassable wall,\nwhy not just smash it to pieces?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2345620"
msgid "I met with #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF.\nI'm glad that she's alright.\nYeah, Teach's as nice as ever……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2345724"
msgid "…hmph. Couldn't find an exit\nno matter how hard I searched.\nBut help should be coming soon, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2345824"
msgid "No way would the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF abandon me.\nOnly idiots run around risking their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2345924"
msgid "Then again, fussing over things like that\nis just like you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346016"
msgid "What's up with that damn #C236196003BB#CDEF…!?\nThe nerve to hack our five senses and tout\nher shitty AI self as someone important…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346152"
msgid "Shit, I can't stop shaking……\n'cause of that violent hack,\nI still can't feel my arms n' legs yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346256"
msgid "She honestly thinks she can make\na fool out of me! If I just had #C236196003Rider#CDEF,\nI'd blow that bitch away!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346372"
msgid "And what's with \"#C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF,\" huh?\nShe making fun of me!?\nI'd rather she just picked one!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346484"
msgid "Pfft. That's great.\nYou'll be needing my help soon, I'm guessing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346552"
msgid "She called herself #C236196003Matou#CDEF all on her own.\nShe's not my little sister or anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346652"
msgid "…I guess she is pretty quiet and\nunderstanding. It's not like I hate her type…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346736"
msgid "But, uh, isn't she a little scary?\nLike she's a landmine, or has a scary smile…?\nAnyways, I'm not related to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346852"
msgid "This uniform? Yeah, when I came to\nI was in this uniform. Probably got it\naround the time I arrived in this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2346968"
msgid "Since it's got the same performance,\nI don't really care if the design is different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347056"
msgid "But… I never wore anything like a uniform\nuntil I joined the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347152"
msgid "…h-hmmph. Having fun, aren't you\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF? #C000246204Habit of Exposure#CDEF, huh…\nIt's a very \"adult\" taste…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347280"
msgid "Huh!? N-nah, I just happened to overhear it!\nI don't even go near the Student Council Room,\nokay!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347380"
msgid "Hmph. Keeping your nose on the grindstone, huh?\nYou being a pleb and all,\nhonest, hard work is right up your alley."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347496"
msgid "Will the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF come to save us first,\nor will you guys clear the Labyrinth first?\nI'll be watching to see what happens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347636"
msgid "But just you wait. No doubt that, one day,\nI'll give her a run for her money in chess!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347724"
msgid "Hehe. My father taught me how to play chess\nwhen I was five years old."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347796"
msgid "At last, it's time for the main act.\nTHAT means it's #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF's turn.\nI'll show you what I can do!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347916"
msgid "…in the end,\nno one was able to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF at chess, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2347992"
msgid "…in the end,\nno one was able to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF at chess, right?\nAh, other than #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2348120"
msgid "…don't finish your sentence, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nYou need my help, right?\nI'll do it, I'll play some chess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2348236"
msgid "…the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF still isn't coming, huh…\nCould it be…\nIt's really not coming to save us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2348344"
msgid "Shit…! That \"#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF\"\ndoesn't give a damn even if you're outside\nthe Student Council Room!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2348456"
msgid "Ugh… Sorry, I feel awful right now…\nNever even got nauseous when I was playing\n3D FPS games…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2348552"
msgid "Things are looking real dodgy now…\nYou really gonna be alright? If it's too much,\nisn't this a good time to throw in the towel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2348684"
msgid "W-well, whatever. Do what you want.\nYou're all hogging the Student Council Room,\nso it's your job to find the exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2348800"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF's skill can open up Shields in\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, right? I knew #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF\nwas different from the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2348968"
msgid "…but that Servant is the worst.\nI went to talk to #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF, and he tore me\nopen a new one with his criticisms!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2349100"
msgid "Agh! It pisses me off so much!\nHe looks pretty similar to me on the outside,\nso who does he think he is!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2349208"
msgid "Stolen memories?\nI guess if you say you'll give them to me,\nI'll take 'em off your hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2349300"
msgid "But is it really alright? If you recall\nmemories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, you might\nend up bawling your eyes out, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2349452"
msgid "After all, I've been kicking asses without\ntaking names, so I must've had you checkmated!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2349544"
msgid "Nah, nah. It's all good. Even when we\nget our memories back, we're still pals.\nI'll treat you like I have been up until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2349672"
msgid "Yeah… I'm winning again and again…\nOf course I'll keep winning…\nI'm the top pick of this tournament…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2349780"
msgid "But… #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF are saying different\nthings… Imaginary number spaces, the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF…\n…why the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF won't intervene…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2349976"
msgid "…no, I better stop. If I think about it\ntoo seriously, I'll have nightmares…\nIt can't be… it can't…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2350084"
msgid "Listen here. I know plebs envy the talented.\nAnd I'm an adult, so I'll\nlet this be water under the bridge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2350192"
msgid "But come on! Is there no way everyone can\nSTOP FORGETTING about me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2350264"
msgid "Even in the Student Council Room,\nmy name NEVER gets brought up!\nYou can't exclude people, it's not nice!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2350372"
msgid "No need for me to even lift a finger.\nYou'll wipe the floor with that nasty AI\nfor us in no time, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2350480"
msgid "W-was someone outta this world in the schoolyard\njust now!? They had a Spiritron structure\nbeyond a Servant's―the hell are they…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2350616"
msgid "Since you have a Servant with you,\nyou're obligated to fight in my place.\nJust don't go dying in vain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2350720"
msgid "Huh? You're gonna take #C236196003Jinako#CDEF to the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? That's a strategy even\nI wouldn't be able to manage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2350860"
msgid "If you're gonna take #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, then you'd have\na hell of an easier time taking one of\nthose trees in the schoolyard, instead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351000"
msgid "Hmph. Wondering about what I'm doing here?\nI'm not exactly staring at the sunset\nand getting all down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351104"
msgid "This spot gets good reception. I can't take\nover the old school's system, it's being\nmanaged by the Student Council and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351248"
msgid "But, though slowly, I can gather Sakurament\nwhen I stand here! Geniuses don't need to even\nlift a finger, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351360"
msgid "Just you wait, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWith all the power source I'll stockpile,\nI'll whip up a special #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF#RUBS  technique#RUBE program#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351528"
msgid "You're not shrewd enough to know to run\nfrom a situation like that.\nYou must've had no choice… right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351632"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF, huh…\nShe's an oddball, but she's still a Game Champ.\nShe won't go down so easy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351748"
msgid "…oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWord is you're going to break open\nthat memory data you got."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351840"
msgid "…#C000246204let's go to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nYou're the only people I don't want getting\na one-up on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2351956"
msgid "Aww, damn… damn… damn…!\nI should've never gone through with it\nif THIS was going to happen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352052"
msgid "…didn't I tell you not to talk to me?\nCan you not remember squat, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352144"
msgid "Ha! You can't, can you!\nYou remembered everything BUT yourself!\nIt's plastered all over your face!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352244"
msgid "MAN. Same old, same old, huh!?\nYou're such a wimp that it pisses me off,\nso take a hike in the Labyrinth or something!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352364"
msgid "That explains why she had over 6,000 hours\nof playtime in FA. The Total Champ turned out\nto be a pretty lonely person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352484"
msgid "Damn! Now I went and remembered it again!\nI was finally starting to calm down, too!\nDamn it, damn it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352588"
msgid "I'm not like him. I'm special.\nI'm going to get out of this alive,\nno matter what…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352676"
msgid "………what is it? Can't you see me\nthinking here? If you want some friends,\nhow about you try the Student Council Room?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352796"
msgid "Yo, if it isn't #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nGood job crawling back out of rock bottom.\nSo, what's the plan now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2352904"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is gone and #C236196003Julius#CDEF is gone.\nWe have no chance of winning, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353008"
msgid "Well, if it comes to that,\nwe'll be living like chained slaves, though!\nHahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353088"
msgid "I knew the differences between\nplebs and geniuses, but THIS was REAL cruel.\nWoe to the unchosen guys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353192"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF is dead…?\nYou're joking… #C236196003BB#CDEF said as long as we don't\noppose her, she won't kill us…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353324"
msgid "Shit! So that's how it is!?\nIn the end, we're all going to… Damn it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353396"
msgid "I know. Not only was I useless,\nbut on top of betraying you,\nI proactively got in your way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353488"
msgid "I'm the very definition of a silly clown!\nEnough, please stop treating me like an ally!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353576"
msgid "C'mon, please stay away from me!\nI'm the one turning down your pity!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353648"
msgid "Like I said yesterday,\ndon't go to the Labyrinth anymore.\nThat way none of us have to die……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353744"
msgid "I've done what I needed to do.\nI'll haul ass after I take a breather."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353816"
msgid "………………well.\nPlaying friends with each other\nwasn't so boring after all, huh…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2353904"
msgid "Oh, what's up, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nThat outfit sure takes me back.\nFelt like the preliminaries for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354016"
msgid "Eh? You found that in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? \nYou can really find anything over there, \ncan't you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354132"
msgid "…but man…\nIt's a good thing I walked in normally…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354188"
msgid "If I had just a little more courage, I ALMOST\nwould've decided to drop in with a pose\nlike a mighty morphing hero…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354304"
msgid "I eavesdropped on your chat with #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nThis is all way beyond me, ya.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's gonna be at the Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354448"
msgid "…no matter how much you pep me up,\nin the end, a snail is a snail, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nI can't change my personality that easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354580"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF has graduated from NEET-hood.\nFrom now on, I'll be intangible like a ghost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354680"
msgid "…so, I don't want you to worry over me.\nPlease treat me like I'm not even here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354764"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is sound asleep.\nShe doesn't plan on waking up anytime soon,\nand any plans after that are TBD!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2354884"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF seems to be sleeping with her eyes open.\nPerhaps this is another part of her training.\nI'm sorry, but leave her for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355040"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's not the type you wanna get close to, huh?\nBut she's got this enticing smell of sweets\nabout her～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355160"
msgid "An emotionless glasses girl, AND flat to boot?\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF got some fearsome attributes there.\nMight even be a bit too much, honestly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355304"
msgid "If there's no thread on this in 2 minutes, \nI'll make her mai waifu!\nGah! That's what I'mma do～♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355404"
msgid "…hm?\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, aren't you supposed to specify\na value of temperature when you say \"tepid\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355512"
msgid "…*sigh*. I don't need tasteless quips for\nevery little remark. And like, your quip is\nalready tasteless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355620"
msgid "…I see. Sorry about that.\nWell then, I'd like you to tell me what it was\nthat hurt your feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355720"
msgid "Was it that I interrupted your meal?\nYou DO always look happy when you're stuffing\nyour mouth with snacks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355828"
msgid "Even if someone were to think you looked\nlike a sea lion or a seal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355896"
msgid "Agh, enough! That's what I'm talking about!\nJeez, why did I have to draw a Servant like\nthis?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2355992"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is currently guarding her home～\nI'm super busy finding myself,\nso dash outta here―― and make it double!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2356124"
msgid "Sorry. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF can't handle all this free time,\nas you can see. Don't pay any heed.\nCome back again sometime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2356252"
msgid "Don't go blabbing about what they don't need\nto know! If you underestimate guarding your\nown home, you'll regret it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2356372"
msgid "Enough, there's no way. I can't move an inch.\nNEETs ain't made for working.\nIf we work, we lose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2356472"
msgid "Oh, wow～ We've got a top tier enemy here!\nBy \"top,\" I mostly mean her chesties, ofc. Them\ntig bitties got plenty mass for sandwichin'."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2356608"
msgid "So you're pretty popular right now.\nWhat's so great about being a normie?\nMakes no sense to this shut-in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2356716"
msgid "Are you saying I'm as thin as a bean sprout?\nI see, it's pertinent. This is the first I've\nheard of thin builds being unpopular, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2356856"
msgid "If so, then you have the makings of\none who's plenty popular, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nSince you're the opposite of thin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2356980"
msgid "You're implying I'm FAT, yo! If you're supposed\nto be a Servant, then be a little more sensitive\nto how your Master feels!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357104"
msgid "That's not my point!\nAgh, someone please rewire the speech center\nin this guy's brain…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357192"
msgid "You sure like to walk around aimlessly. How\nabout you don't come here, and instead go to the\nLabyrinth to meet with her, fair prince?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357328"
msgid "Hm? Whassup?\nYou don't need me for anything anymore, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357388"
msgid "………or something like that.\nBluffing is real tough on me, so the nice\nthing to do is leave me alone, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357496"
msgid "Still goin' around, exposing girls'#RUBS   traumas#RUBE secrets#REND\nin the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, huh?\nWell aren't you energetic～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357640"
msgid "But #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's already closed shop.\nAll I'm gonna do now is mumble curses at you,\nso you may want to leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357764"
msgid "This normie is gonna do her normie thing――\nJust look over news sites while letting the\ndiscontent leak outta me～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357880"
msgid "So, how about buzzing off to the Labyrinth?\nYou may be normal, but unlike me,\nyou're a proper, pro Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2357988"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's new job is \"ghost.\" Talking to me\nis pointless; lecturing, pointless; attacking,\npointless; diet, pointless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2358124"
msgid "A true background character with no collision\ndetection. Seriously, how many times do I gotta'\nsay it before you get it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2358248"
msgid "No, I really can't do it…\nNo matter how hard a snail tries,\nit's still a snail…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2358332"
msgid "Yep. And with that, we part.\nNo more event flags are gonna get set!\nI know you love glasses, just give up鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2358440"
msgid "You still intend on trying something? I think\nyou're incredible #C236196003#NICK#CDEF #[my boy][babe]#,\nbut sometimes it's pointless to push on…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2358588"
msgid "I told you before.\nI have no intention of helping you.\nComing here is a waste of time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2358676"
msgid "Sorry, I don't know why #C236196003Karna#CDEF is being so\nstubborn, either. I think it's\nprobably… pointless to talk to him about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2358812"
msgid "I'll be streaming your heroism #C236196003#NICK#CDEF-#[boy～][pal～]#\nHellfire shall rain down on the comment section!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2358932"
msgid "So… yeah, go get 'em. I know it's a bit\nlate to say this, but for you I guess,\nI can give my full support."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359040"
msgid "The Student Council Room differs from the other classrooms.\nWith its lush carpeting,\nit gives off the feeling of a real conference room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359180"
msgid "In this greatly anachronistic, wooden space\nwas a boy in a black uniform;\na young man dressed in a coat;\nand a young man donned in white armor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359324"
msgid "The boy in the black uniform… is #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359380"
msgid "His uniform color may be different,\nbut there's no way I could forget that he's my classmate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359476"
msgid "However, the other two I haven't met… I think―\nYet also… I think I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359552"
msgid "My foggy memory must mean that I was\ntheir acquaintance during the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359652"
msgid "Ah! Here #[he is, here he is][she is, here she is]#!\nAlright you two, together now…\nGood morniiiiiiinnnngggg!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359764"
msgid "I thought I told you to give a cheerful, lively\nmorning greeting―so much like a student that\nyou feel dumb enough to doubt your own brain."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2359904"
msgid "Did you eat something bad?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2359932"
msgid "Good. That was very nice.\nA fitting tension for a student\nwith a bright future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360012"
msgid "Brother. This #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF may be an imposter.\nNo, #[he][she]#'s an imposter, so let's change #[him][her]# out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360136"
msgid "…#C236196003Leo#CDEF.\n#[This guy][This girl]# is definitely #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360232"
msgid "Is that right?\nOkay. Although, the tension is getting\nstifled like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360308"
msgid "Yes, I certainly did eat something.\nGobbled it right up.\nSomething that looked like black coal tar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360408"
msgid "This school has no cafeteria. I'll admit to\nyou now that the one and only thing I enjoyed\nduring the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF was the cafeteria."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360560"
msgid "But since there's no cafeteria space,\nI had asked for a big favor from my brother\nto cook for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360660"
msgid "With no cafeteria, he cooked in a corner\nof the grounds. He cooked up a black coal tar\nlooking―curry? Sort of thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360780"
msgid "Just because it's spicy, cooking with\nblack pepper doesn't make it an orignal,\ncultural dish, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360884"
msgid "Since you asked for something like soup,\nI filled a barrel with water and mixed in\npepper and olive oil, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2360996"
msgid "I had high expectations since junk food is your\nthing, but I'm disappointed. You really\nare helpless without #C236196003Assassin#CDEF, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361136"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF, do not lose heart. You are our last\ndefense. I want you to hold strong, such that\nI don't get stuck with these absurd tasks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361288"
msgid "―――What did this just turn into?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361324"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF and these two young men are playing out an entire skit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361400"
msgid "…hm.\nFrom the looks of it, it appears that\nyou remember who I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361468"
msgid "Let's end our little banter here.\nWorry not, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. I can assure you\nI'm the calm, collected #C236196003Leo#CDEF you remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361616"
msgid "Let me start over.\nI've been waiting for you,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361696"
msgid "You may think it odd to have introductions\nat this point, but it's the first time we've\nmet in this school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361816"
msgid "Brother, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF.\nIntroduce yourselves as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361880"
msgid "…I'm #C236196003Julius#CDEF.\nRight now, I'm committed to supporting #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2361972"
msgid "The person who called himself #C236196003Julius#CDEF,\njudging by #C236196003Leo#CDEF's manner of speech,\nseems to be #C236196003Leo#CDEF's older brother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362128"
msgid "They don't look alike at all,\nbut maybe they're half-brothers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362192"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF seems to be a Master,\nbut I don't see his Servant anywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362276"
msgid "I don't feel the presence of a Servant nearby,\nnor the typical pressure of a Master from #C236196003Julius#CDEF himself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362400"
msgid "…even if #C236196003Julius#CDEF' Servant were to have the\n\"Total Disappearance\" skill,\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF himself wouldn't be able to hide his status."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362556"
msgid "On the other hand, it's apparent that #C236196003Gawain#CDEF is #C236196003Leo#CDEF's Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362652"
msgid "His class is #C000246204Saber#CDEF.\nOf the Servants summoned in this #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nhe's at the top of the ranks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362784"
msgid "…for some reason, that's one thing I can recall exactly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362844"
msgid "Excuse me. I've completed the full scan\nof the school building. There appears to\nbe no more undiscovered Masters."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2362960"
msgid "The girl from the Infirmary―――#C236196003Sakura#CDEF enters the room.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF nods, saying \"alright,\" then turns back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363100"
msgid "There's no erasing that fact, whether I remember\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363192"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nI had you come here for a reason.\nFrom this old school building…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363292"
msgid "No, would you join us in our plan to\nescape from the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363384"
msgid "A plan to escape from the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363452"
msgid "Wait.\nWait a second.\nI can't keep up with all these rapid, new developments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363532"
msgid "What happened to the school building\nswallowed by the Black Noise?\nWhy have I lost my memory?\nWhere are we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363640"
msgid "If I can't at least get these three points\ncleared up, then I can't make a decision…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363728"
msgid "Oh. You didn't receive any explanation\nfrom #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, I see.\nWould it be fine if I explained?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363836"
msgid "Yes, please do.\nI can only speculate on all this, so an AI such\nas myself can't provide any explanations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2363944"
msgid "Of course. An AI can only provide Masters\nwith information they've deemed to be true.\nA restriction from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364088"
msgid "Alright then, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease ask your questions."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2364156"
msgid "About the school swallowed by darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364196"
msgid "I ask about the school swallowed by darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364244"
msgid "Here's the scene I just saw #C236196003Leo#CDEF in―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364304"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF, and I were classmates.\nI explain how that after a sudden announcement,\nthe people inside the school building were swallowed by\ndarkness and disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364504"
msgid "…we were classmates at school…\nThat must be the extended preliminaries.\nStrange… It was different for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364616"
msgid "Probably, before the school was attacked,\nI made it through the preliminaries and broke\nout of the school you were in, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364760"
msgid "There's no issue, I think. We're outside\nof the system here, and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nhas made it through the preliminaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364888"
msgid "Then I will.\nThe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF had a preliminary\nand a final selection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2364980"
msgid "The #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF who accessed the Moon from Earth,\nfirst had their memories taken from them,\nand were then given false \"personals.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2365148"
msgid "I see… That feeling of being suddenly abandoned\nby the \"world\" was due to me believing the role that\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF imposed on me was my \"current occupation.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2365324"
msgid "Only #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF who regained their true self\nafter sensing discomfort in that role\nbecame Masters and acquired Servants."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2365480"
msgid "That's why I would've expected you to have been\nattacked during the #C001246204final selection#CDEF just like\nme. Do you not remember?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2365616"
msgid "It means that while you were comatose, what\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF calls the \"black unknown\" had been\nholding your soul captive for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2365760"
msgid "Thus, while you were afflicted by that long\nnightmare, your memories of the final selection\nwere erased… swallowed, perhaps?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2365888"
msgid "The preliminaries you spoke of were a mix of\ndreams and a reality that once was. Likely,\nthose preliminaries were fabricated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366016"
msgid "…fabricated preliminaries…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366048"
msgid "No, since each character's default#ROFS0004#RUBS     personality  #RUBE configuration#REND\nwas reproduced from my past memories,\nthen was just the final sight of the\n\"school building being swallowed\" a dream?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366260"
msgid "Even so, there was that fall at the end.\nThe chill of that empty darkness was definitely no dream―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366364"
msgid "…that has to be it. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\nyou were captured by a monster during the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF and were imprisoned until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366516"
msgid "The black space you saw in your dream…\nwas the inside of the monster that\nswallowed you… Something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366628"
msgid "Inside of a monster…?\nThat endlessly stretching space devoid of amusements?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366708"
msgid "This is the electronic ocean.\nMaybe that's what it's like to be taken\nin as data by another being…\nBut it's sounding increasingly repulsive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366852"
msgid "We were caught by a monster possessing\nthat kind of darkness…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2366916"
msgid "It's not just you.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF and the rest of the Masters in this\nbuilding suffer the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367020"
msgid "Yes. All of us have lost the memories of\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367100"
msgid "Also, I have an admittedly concerning interest\nin you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, but I've forgotten\nthe reason for that interest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367232"
msgid "I recall all that I've done with my Master, #C236196003Leo#CDEF,\nbut I cannot clearly recall anything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367340"
msgid "…yes. Right after passing the preliminaries,\nthe Masters' mental states and memories\nreverted to that of the 1st Round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367464"
msgid "I had a worse case of memory loss,\nmore so than #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367548"
msgid "So basically… I can't recall any sequence of events from\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF or my background as a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367720"
msgid "…it was obvious, but the truth of it\nstill sent a chill down my spine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367792"
msgid "The fear that only I had lost my memories has died down,\nbut nevertheless, not being able to recall\n\"who I used to be\" leaves me terribly uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2367948"
msgid "Brother?\nDo you have some comment for #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368012"
msgid "Now that you ask, this #[man][girl]# always acted like\nthis in any pinch.\n…seems like something happened, long ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368132"
msgid "In any case, there must be a connection\nbetween our lost memories and being in\nthis old school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368240"
msgid "Logically, our abnormally lost memories should\nreturn to us if we analyze this abnormal\nsituation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368340"
msgid "However, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF can't see us here.\nWe're in a blind spot of the law, so to speak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368448"
msgid "…#C236196003Leo#CDEF.\n\"WKTK\" is slang that expresses one's mental\nstate; it's not diagram terminology…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368556"
msgid "It's a WKTK-diagram, brother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368588"
msgid "You were the one who got riled up, saying that\na gothic font for this diagram would look\ncooler than a proportional font here, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368720"
msgid "I see. I hate to say this, but weren't the\n\"teams you commanded over\" just\nfourteen-year-old students in that school?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368840"
msgid "Well, let's get back on topic.\nAs shown in the diagram, we're currently\nin the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2368960"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF happens over in the\nNear Side of the Moon.\nBasically―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369056"
msgid "We fell from the Near Side to the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369100"
msgid "Actually, that unknown Black Noise\ndropped us over to the Far Side―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369176"
msgid "That's naturally how to think of it.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, please explain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369256"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a recorder that uses light to\nstore and \"doesn't rely on matter,\" but this is\na high dimension where that light is jumbled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369416"
msgid "Malignant information and even Imaginary\nNumbers materialize as sources here; this is\na place outside #RUBS    space#RUBEthe world#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369556"
msgid "If the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF is a light-trapping cage\nof the faithful, then this is a garden of\nthe fallen made of Imaginary Numbers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369704"
msgid "An absolutely forbidden area, where intelligent\nlife must never enter. Even us advanced AI\nare unable to enter the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369832"
msgid "Well, since we're in here now, it's not\nvery \"absolute\" or \"forbidden,\" is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2369912"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF lets out a cheerful \"hahaha.\"\nNext to him, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF wear grim expressions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370048"
msgid "However, seeing that they're deliberately not complaining\nmeans they've embraced #C236196003Leo#CDEF's sudden change in attitude."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370180"
msgid "This is just my guess, but maybe… #C236196003Leo#CDEF,\nnow freed from \"his status,\" wants to live\nthis kind of life as a student. Or has always wanted to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370336"
msgid "The same happened to us NPCs. We were\nconsumed along with the Masters in the final\nselection―those who survived are left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370460"
msgid "…the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370508"
msgid "This is the first I've heard of such a space,\nbut certainly, the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF IS a journey\nfrom the surface of the Moon to its center."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370664"
msgid "Since the Moon is circular, it wouldn't\nbe strange for \"another stage\" to be behind\nthe Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370760"
msgid "The question is probably whether we can leave\nhere or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370820"
msgid "True. This old school building appears\nsafe, but there's no proof as to how long\nthat'll last."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2370916"
msgid "And more, the outside of the school\nbuilding is a black ocean. We'll probably\ndisintegrate the moment we touch it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371032"
msgid "So now you understand the situation.\nNow then.\nTime for my questions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371104"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF. Lost memories.\nThe mystery of the old school building.\nAn exitless world. Those of us that are left."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2371248"
msgid "Escape, and return to the Holy Grail War……?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2371296"
msgid "If there's no exit, then we stay here……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371340"
msgid "Oh, sorry to jump in.\n#C236196003Gawain#CDEF, what are our plans for today?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371416"
msgid "\"Today\" is incorrect, #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nThis school building has no concept of date\nand time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371516"
msgid "It seems that no matter how many hours or\neven thousands of hours pass, we are stuck on\n\"this day.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371616"
msgid "Thus, rather than by day, let us\naccurately schedule by denoting units of hours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371700"
msgid "…it's obvious.\nNo matter what circumstance we're in,\nwe have to get back to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371816"
msgid "I have yet to recover anything:\nthe memories of who I am,\nhow I joined in this battle,\nthe ideals I have for obtaining the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2371968"
msgid "…I bet. Regardless of if we were enemies\nduring the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, we have to help\neach other now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372088"
msgid "That's the kind of #[man][woman]# you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372132"
msgid "An answer above my expectations.\nThis begins our united front."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372196"
msgid "Until we return to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF―――\nNo, until we escape from the #C000246204Far Side of\nthe Moon#CDEF, we're allies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372340"
msgid "Now then――In the name of #C236196003Leo B. Harwey#CDEF,\nI declare here, the founding of the\nTsukumihara Academy Student Council!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372472"
msgid "His declaration was filled with strong determination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372528"
msgid "I'm not so sure about the name,\nbut under this commander, we can overcome any hardship―――\nHe's enough to inspire our hope of such."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372664"
msgid "However, we have our first issue.\nIf we don't clear it, we won't even be\nable to work out an escape plan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372772"
msgid "It's very difficult to say this, but…\nwe could use a few more people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372844"
msgid "We only have me the president, my brother\nthe secretary, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF the old manservant…\nand #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF of general affairs!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2372996"
msgid "I can't call this the Student Council I've\nalways dreamed of.\nNo, how COULD I call it so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2373088"
msgid "Student Councils are far more brilliant,\nfilled with the aroma of youth,\nconstantly causing trouble!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2373192"
msgid "Quite so, my lord.\nI was thinking that adding more flowers would\nlook nice, whatever the kind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2373288"
msgid "With this being the case, please scout some\nmore members. At the very least I would say a\nVice President and a secretary are required."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2373424"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF's first order is to recruit.\nHe says I need to help launch the Student Council\nby finding other Masters in the school building,\nthen persuading them to join."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2373604"
msgid "Welcome back, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nHave you finished recruiting?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2373676"
msgid "\"Yeah,\" I nod in reply.\nRegardless of the outcomes, I spoke with all\nof the Masters in the school building… I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2373796"
msgid "Pardon me! I am the spider's thread,\nhung by Amitabha down to hell! As soon as\n#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF is called, he begs! For! Charity!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2373940"
msgid "…there he is.\nBefore I can report the results,\n#C236196003Gatou#CDEF clamors into the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374052"
msgid "Ahahaha――! That is so! Actually,\nwhat's amazing is being called by the next\nhead of a western financial conglomerate!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374172"
msgid "Yet, \"Mr. head of his family\" is overly formal.\nBeing allies in the Student Council,\nmay \"#C236196003President Leo#CDEF\" suffice?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374304"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, looking genuinely annoyed, glances at me.\nI nod, \"That's right.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374392"
msgid "…yes, well then. I had no\nintention of choosing members based on\nwhether they had a Servant or not, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374500"
msgid "Then all is well! I'm free labor,\nso killing me off would be a waste!\nI'll organize the cheerleading!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374604"
msgid "―――Hee hee hee. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nWho told you they wanted you to\nbring a #C000246204comedian#CDEF here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374720"
msgid "I bowed my head and apologized\nfrom the bottom of my heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374780"
msgid "It's not that important,\nbut the correct quote is \"Art is long, life is short.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2374860"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF, please handle cleaning the room, serving\ntea, patrolling the school, and cleaning the\ntoilets. Brother, please show him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375004"
msgid "Now, now. He says and does problematic things,\nbut I've heard that #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF is someone\nimportant. Surely, he'll help somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375152"
msgid "I report on three people: #C236196003Shinji#CDEF, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, and #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375256"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF has no Servant and couldn't stomach\njoining the Student Council, so he refused."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375360"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF shut herself in the Janitor's Closet\nand stated that she would only monitor us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375464"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF will support the operations of the\nStudent Council but won't join the council itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375584"
msgid "…hmph.\nOne doesn't want to leave, one isn't interested\nin leaving, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375660"
msgid "You're right. Perhaps I'm overthinking it.\nIt's just that, I felt a subtle\ndiscrepancy in her wording…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375764"
msgid "Anyway, including us, there are only\nseven Masters in the school building, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375852"
msgid "Presently, we have more than half of all of\nthem as Student Council members.\nWe'll take it for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2375952"
msgid "The Student Council members are #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Julius#CDEF, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, and myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376064"
msgid "This could certainly be enough…\nbut I feel like there were more Masters who\nwould fit in to the Student Council.\nAbout two of them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376200"
msgid "…it's no use, I can't remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376236"
msgid "We'll resolve our lack of personnel in time.\nNow is the time to act, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376332"
msgid "…yes, as this is an emergency, I acquired\npermission to take special measures.\nHowever… I'm against this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376440"
msgid "I can't guarantee #[his][her]# safety.\nSending #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF into such a place is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376536"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF speaks vaguely while peeking at me with side glances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376616"
msgid "…I don't understand what they're talking about,\nbut it seems #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is concerned for my well being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376736"
msgid "Still, there's no other way right now.\nThis is our decision. I won't have you,\nan AI, be responsible for whatever happens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376860"
msgid "………I understand. Please allow me to\nlend a hand, at least. Managing everyone's\nhealth is the reason I was created."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2376980"
msgid "I'll also request you to do so.\nWe're short handed right now, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2377056"
msgid "Hold on, hold on.\nWhat are you all planning?\nCould you explain to #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF and me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2377156"
msgid "My apologies. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. I know this\nexplanation comes last minute, but from now on,\nwe'll have you going to the #C000246204Arena#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2377308"
msgid "If I remember correctly… it's a structure prepared\nfor the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nOne could call it a \"dungeon.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2377432"
msgid "For Masters who've had their opponents decided,\nwithin the seven day period: they train,\ncollect information on their enemies,\nand proceed to the final battlefield,\nall within an #C000246204Arena#CDEF constructed in layers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2377656"
msgid "Is he saying that this school building also has an #C000246204Arena#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2377732"
msgid "No, it's… similar to an #C000246204Arena#CDEF. Please think\nof this school building as a sort of bubble\nfloating in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2377892"
msgid "If the bubble pops, Imaginary Numbers will\neither consume everyone or everyone will wander\nforever as \"volatile random numbers.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378024"
msgid "It's… #C000246204the schoolyard's #RUBS       sakura#RUBEcherry#REND blossom tree#CDEF.\nUnderneath that tree is an unknown arena\nwhich seems to lead outside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378184"
msgid "So, if we go through that #C000246204Arena#CDEF, we'll return\noutside… to the Near Side of the Moon,\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378332"
msgid "The chances of that are high.\nSince \"unknown arena\" doesn't sound nice,\nI named it the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378456"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378500"
msgid "The only road to the outside world.\nSounds like investigating it is the duty\ngiven to me and #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378616"
msgid "But―――wouldn't #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Gawain#CDEF be a little\nmore reliable for this job?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378724"
msgid "I would very much like to do so,\nbut it's night at best in there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378792"
msgid "Someone please toss this person out somewhere,\nlike to the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2378864"
msgid "Well, the day or night thing was just a little\njoke. The reality is that backup from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF\nand me alone is insufficient."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379004"
msgid "As you know, this is uncharted territory.\nWe'll monitor you constantly, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF,\nand if necessary, we'll log you out…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379140"
msgid "Like #C236196003Leo#CDEF says, I'm just not that skilled.\nI mean, it took everything just to make\na contract with my Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379268"
msgid "So long as I lack digital battle and logistical support skills,\ndoing a field survey on foot is the \"most I can do.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379388"
msgid "Thank you for understanding so quickly.\nWe've prepared ourselves already.\nWe'll back you up from this room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379496"
msgid "Please head to the #C000246204cherry tree#CDEF, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF will open the gate for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379620"
msgid "……yes. I used my administrative privileges\nto create a gate that goes into the tree.\nThe rest is up to you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379756"
msgid "Forget it.\nA Master without a Servant will just get the\ntables turned on them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379836"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF, disappointed, shushes himself with a \"hm.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2379904"
msgid "…I see.\nSo, the general rule is that only a Master who brings\na Servant along can enter the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380032"
msgid "That's all. Please head to the grounds.\nThe first mission into the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nbegins. Our so-called \"maiden voyage.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380172"
msgid "But, what's the issue? There's no special\nrelation between your chastity and our\ntravel into the Labyrinth. Is it the name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380296"
msgid "I report about what turned out to be more than just a clue:\nwhat that Shield really is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380384"
msgid "Even if I could gauge the darkness in a\nperson's mind, I probably couldn't do anything\nto alleviate it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380488"
msgid "What are you saying, #C236196003Leo#CDEF?\nYour brilliance is the light of the sun. \nFacing you would dispel anyone's darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380616"
msgid "…suddenly, a faint memory crosses my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380660"
msgid "He certainly was the sun, illuminating all.\nHe held a kingly sanctity which dispelled\nany and all wickedness, even emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380788"
msgid "However―――that won't solve the root of the problem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380844"
msgid "A salvation that merely illuminates―once that\nsun has set, those left behind have only\ndarkness left to sink into."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2380960"
msgid "Even I feel awkward about intruding on a\nsecret boys' meeting. If now isn't a good time,\nI could return later?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2381072"
msgid "It's okay. We've been waiting for you,\n#C236196003Kiara#CDEF. Without further delay,\nplease teach us how to destroy that Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2381204"
msgid "Transfer…?\nDoes this mean you already have something that\nwill effectively counter it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2381292"
msgid "Destroying a wall of the heart is difficult.\nA Wall is not something to be #C000246204destroyed#CDEF,\nbut to be #C000246204understood#CDEF. Think of it like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2381456"
msgid "Understanding… you say?\nThis doesn't mean sweeping away the troubles\nin one's mind, does it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2381552"
msgid "No. It means seeing through the hidden nature,\nthe workings of #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's mind and\ngrasping it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2381668"
msgid "Speak with her, battle with her, observe her.\nObtain her \"secrets.\" They will serve as the\nkey to opening the door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2381784"
msgid "To know one's enemy, one crosses blades with\nthem, laying one and the other bare―――\nIs this what you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2381896"
msgid "Hardly. You won't learn a damn thing like that.\n#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF. That lip service may work on Earth,\nbut this is a battlefield. We need solutions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2382052"
msgid "Of course, I know. The mind's workings and\nspiritual reactions are usually measured\nthrough oscillations in #ROFS0002#RUBS    graphs #RUBEbrain waves#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2382208"
msgid "To measure the metaphysical, the observer\nthemselves must also become a being\ncomposed of mainly mind and spirit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2382324"
msgid "This is something that normally requires a\ngreat deal of practice, but we're in an\nemergency, aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2382432"
msgid "I shall bequeath you a pale imitation of the\n#RUBS   Five Approaches to Meditation#RUBE#CDEF#C000246204Five Meditations program#REND#CDEF… Eiten School version."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2382596"
msgid "There are five basic meditations for severing\nworldly desires: #RUBS     vileness of body      compassion#RUBEPatikulamanasikara, Maitrī, #REND\n#RUBS  dependent origination  phenomenal world   mindful breathing#RUBEPratītyasamutpāda, Mahābhūta, & Anapanasati.#REND"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2382864"
msgid "Well now. I'm impressed, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nYou're well-versed in Buddhism too.\nThanks for explaining."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2382972"
msgid "Of course, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF. I agree,\nI'm as great as laundry drifting on the Ganges.\nHowever, the thing about minds…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383104"
msgid "You're going to say it will be quite\ndifficult to find, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383168"
msgid "Yep. Correct, my good lady."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383196"
msgid "But… the thing is, that road is for facing\none's own carnal desires. Looking into\nanother's desires makes no sense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383316"
msgid "I wouldn't have suggested if it were not\nfor these circumstances,\nMister #RUBS     arahan #RUBEenlightened#REND monk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383436"
msgid "Y-yes. Call me not #RUBS   worthy one#RUBEan arhat#REND, but #RUBS  wandering monk#RUBEa shramana#REND.\nI, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am still in training, you see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383604"
msgid "Agh! It's time for my bathroom break!\nI just remembered some business I have,\nso, excuse me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383700"
msgid "Looks like #C236196003Gatou#CDEF really struggles in dealing with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383792"
msgid "With a dissatisfied and troubled look on his face,\nhe leaves the room while muttering sutras like\nthe \"shujoumuhenseigando,\" and the \"prajnaparamita.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2383944"
msgid "Let's return to the topic at hand. With\nthis Five Meditations, can we see through\n#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's mind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2384064"
msgid "The #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF is a medical program.\nIt detects a patient's scars and\npurges them of the dregs within them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2384196"
msgid "That Shield is a#C000246204#RUBS wall of the heart#RUBE mental wall#REND#CDEF that keeps secrets\nsafe. So, if the secrets are known,\nthe \"keeping\" part loses its meaning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2384368"
msgid "If a wall of the heart is a disease,\nthen the #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF is a vaccine―――\nThinking of it as such will suffice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2384504"
msgid "Yes. Naturally, we must have #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\ndo #[his][her]# best in gathering the patient's#ROFS-002#RUBS reaction#RUBE data#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2384644"
msgid "I'll correct you on one thing.\nWe won't install it in this room,\nbut in #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #[him][her]#self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2384760"
msgid "Installing a #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND into me…\nI've never experienced that before,\nbut it's not that crazy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2384880"
msgid "In cyberspace, bodies are composed of quasi-Spiritrons.\nIt must be possible to install a program,\nattaching on new functionality.\nA Master's #C000246204Code Casts#CDEF go by that same theory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385072"
msgid "If there's anything to worry about, it's the procedure's volume.\nPowerful software will harm one's personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385184"
msgid "Will my body be able to handle the increased\nload of this \"emotion observing\" technique\nthat I've never seen or heard of before―――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385320"
msgid "An AI like myself is capable of handling\nexternal software."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385380"
msgid "Expanding our functions is typically\nforbidden, but this is urgent.\nI can ignore the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's rules!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385500"
msgid "Of course I'M surprised, but even #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Julius#CDEF,\nand #C236196003Gawain#CDEF are blinking their eyes in wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385644"
msgid "Why do you say so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385664"
msgid "B-because my duty is to manage everyone's\nhealth. Outside the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, I can't\nallow #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF to do anything dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385824"
msgid "So that's why. If that's your reasoning,\nthen I can be at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2385888"
msgid "Please close your eyes for a moment.\nI will now bequeath you with a portion\nof the #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386008"
msgid "Don't worry, it won't be a burden on your soul.\nIt's only about as heavy as a #C000246204Command Seal#CDEF,\nso just relax."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386132"
msgid "I have no right to refuse, because right now,\nthis technique is the only way to break through that Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386240"
msgid "Doing as she says, I shut my eyes and loosen myself up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386296"
msgid "W-what the hell are you two doing!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386332"
msgid "So bold, in public… Ahh, is that hand around\n#[his][her]# waist the flutter of a swan? Or a snake\ncoiled around a Palo Santo tree?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386464"
msgid "Mm… phew. Thank you for your patience.\nI believe I have safely #RUBS   installed#RUBEtransferred#REND\nthe #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF into you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386640"
msgid "Wh-wha, wh-wh-wh-wha, wh-wh-wh-wh-wh-wh-wha…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386688"
msgid "I turn to everyone in the Student Council Room,\nlooking to them for some explanation as to what just happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386800"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF is blatantly avoiding eye contact."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386860"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF gives #C236196003Kiara#CDEF a bow,\nbabbling about how she made \"passing good cheer.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2386968"
msgid "Thank you very much #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, and in more ways\nthan one. Now then, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF has been\nappended with a new skill, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2387116"
msgid "\"More ways than one\"!? What's that mean…!?\nAnd feisty? Of course I'll put up a fight!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2387204"
msgid "…what a total #[shock][blunder]#.\nI was frantically trying to push away with my hands,\nbut far from getting away, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF held me tighter the\nmore I pushed. Feeling like she was coiling around me,\nI ended up at her mercy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2387444"
msgid "…hmph.\nWhat \"efforts\" need to be made, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2387496"
msgid "The details are not important, as long as\n#[he][she]# gets #C236196003Rin#CDEF feeling enthused."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2387596"
msgid "And once that heart is laid bare,\nthat's the opening for the #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF\nin #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF to mercilessly deflower them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2387748"
msgid "T-that's how it is, huh? So, in a nutshell:\nfind #C236196003Rin#CDEF; talk to her; fight if it comes down to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2387864"
msgid "It won't be any different from what we've\nbeen basically doing until now.\nShouldn't be different. I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2387972"
msgid "After that, it's #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's job: take the\n\"secrets\" #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF obtains, transfer it to\nthe Shield, and remove the wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2388120"
msgid "Also, a new technique will be necessary.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Earlier you said you could\nexpand your functionality, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2388244"
msgid "Now then. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, I shall have to ask you to\ntake the remaining pieces of #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2388368"
msgid "What I gave to #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF was ultimately only\none part. I will insert the foundation of\nthe technique into you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2388496"
msgid "Your base personality will be overwritten,\nbut there's nothing to worry about, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2388600"
msgid "Overwriting someone's base personality\nsounds really violent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2388664"
msgid "This is different from installing external functionality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2388724"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF may be an AI, but I can't tell the\ndifference between her and a human.\nI felt repulsed by #C236196003Kiara#CDEF treating her like a thing,\nbut out of everyone in the Student Council Room,\nonly I'm concerned about #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2388984"
msgid "In this day and age, even if an AI is identical\nto a human, they still lack \"that\"――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389072"
msgid "…this common sense I learned somewhere\nsome time ago flitted across my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389152"
msgid "Now, then―――ah, this place is no good.\nSince I'll need you to strip,\nlet's head to the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389256"
msgid "Both of them left for the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389296"
msgid "…I'm a little worried.\nIs it really okay to leave them be?\nShould I go check?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2389376"
msgid "I can't miss this! To the Infirmary!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389416"
msgid "You must not, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. I\nunderstand you are curious, being a man and all,\nbut this calls for prudence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389536"
msgid "You must not, my lady. I understand you\nare curious, you being a woman as well,\nbut this calls for prudence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389648"
msgid "―――Hey! I was stopped before I could lift a finger!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389704"
msgid "And by #C236196003Gawain#CDEF, no less.\nThe very moment I looked away to casually go after them!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389804"
msgid "That's right, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nYour wicked thoughts are spelled out on your\nface. Let's wait here patiently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2389924"
msgid "Ahh, I need to stop by the restroom for\na second, though. Looks like I had a little\ntoo much tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390024"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF. With all due respect, you have yet to\ndrink any liquids in the past few hours,\nlet alone tea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390140"
msgid "Hahaha. Very sharp of you, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF.\nDid I say restroom? Actually, I meant I needed\nto return a book to the library."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390272"
msgid "Before #C236196003Leo#CDEF could finish speaking,\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF stealthily moved up to the door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390380"
msgid "No need to bother the President with this.\nI'll go take a look at what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390464"
msgid "How could you, brother?\nWhy is it that only in these moments are\nyou so considerate?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390552"
msgid "I do the dirty jobs. I'll wait by the\nCommissary. If anything feels off, I'll give the\nInfirmary a knock and peek in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390672"
msgid "Splendid. Precisely how a gentleman handles\nthings. #C236196003Julius#CDEF, we gratefully leave it you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390776"
msgid "…#C236196003Leo#CDEF is still young, I fear it may be too\nstimulating. Let me know the details\nlater, just me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390888"
msgid "Hey! That's not fair! He's not that much older!\nAs long as whatever happens is \"rated R-15,\"\nit's okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2390992"
msgid "I'm just going to keep an eye on things.\nSeriously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391044"
msgid "This is a good time to let you know:\nas Council secretary, I will punish insolence\nimmediately on sight. Keep that in mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391168"
msgid "I'm the one who failed here.\nI apologize, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391236"
msgid "…though I'm worried about #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nI'll wait here patiently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391316"
msgid "If I step out into the hallway now,\neveryone might get the wrong idea about me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391396"
msgid "I don't care much about the girls being naked,\nbut peeking in on a depraved act…\nSounds like a delectable situation, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391524"
msgid "#C236196003President Leo#CDEF. The immorality of peeking aside,\nI think one should abstain from stating\ndisinterest in nudity before a lady."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391668"
msgid "Why is that? If I'm not taking a peek to\nsatisfy my sexual urges, I'll be proving\nhow I can't possibly be any more pure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391792"
msgid "…#C236196003Leo#CDEF. Though your remark just now proves your\n\"mental purity,\" it also proves how you\ndiscriminate against all women."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2391928"
msgid "It's dismissive of women… actually,\nmaybe it's ignoring women.\nThe public won't be quiet about this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392032"
msgid "You misunderstand me. I also love women,\nyou know? It's just that none of the women\nhere are my type. Simple as that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392152"
msgid "But this is a good chance to talk about\nour favorite types. What type of person\ndo you like, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392272"
msgid "…as long as they're thoughtful and\nopen-minded, they can look… no, looks are\nimportant. I won't budge on long hair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392392"
msgid "As long as I am younger than them,\nI do not mind. Verily, I do not mean mentally,\nbut in physique."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392492"
msgid "The next thing I knew, #[the four of us guys][these three guys and I]# were chatting\nabout our favorite types in the opposite sex."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392624"
msgid "Sorry to keep you all waiting.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's installation went smoothl… oh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392712"
msgid "Hee hee. Now it feels cheerful in here.\nWhen men have their secret meets,\nthey turn into boys again. You're all smiles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392832"
msgid "Since #C236196003Leo#CDEF randomly brought up such a peaceful subject,\nbefore we knew it, we seemed to start feeling like\nstudents again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2392972"
msgid "Except I'm the one girl here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393004"
msgid "Since #C236196003Leo#CDEF randomly brought up such a peaceful subject,\nbefore we knew it, we started feeling like students again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393136"
msgid "More importantly, how is #C236196003Sakura#CDEF doing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393192"
msgid "No, nothing really. I can't comprehend\nminds, but my ability to analyze\nShields has dramatically improved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393300"
msgid "Well then, I shall take my leave.\nIf anything else happens, please feel free\nto reach out to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393400"
msgid "It was just a slight motion, but the deep\nbow of her head left a strong impression on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393492"
msgid "She's the total opposite of the over-exaggerated #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nI think I get why #C236196003Gatou#CDEF struggles with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393644"
msgid "Let's give it a test run, at once.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, #C000246204please head to the\nSakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393760"
msgid "First, let's discuss Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nShe referred to herself as \"#RUBS   Ego#RUBEdesire#REND.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2393872"
msgid "According to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, the Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF we saw\nwas a copy, an offshoot of her True Self…\nMaybe like some sort of cyber demon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2394032"
msgid "A cyber demon… A #ROFS0003#RUBS  Magi's#RUBE#C000246204Wizard's#CDEF#REND servile familiar.\nA type of#ROFS0002#RUBSsmall demon#RUBE goblin#REND, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2394184"
msgid "Normally, it's just a hostile enemy based on\nthe user's preference… but no one is capable\nof producing a body with a copied personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2394324"
msgid "Perhaps so, on the surface. I believe that #C236196003Rin#CDEF\nis using the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's processing power to\noperate her offshoots."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2394472"
msgid "So that's it. Calling herself \"#C000246204Queen of the\nMoon#CDEF\" wasn't just for show."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2394560"
msgid "That copy had the abilities of an A-Rank Master.\nIf that's just a quarter of her capabilities,\nthen it only proves how strong she truly is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2394700"
msgid "…the situation is worse than I expected.\nAt the moment, taking down those clones\none by one may be our best option."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2394820"
msgid "Next, about the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF.\nWe verified that there's a new floor\nbeyond the shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2394928"
msgid "We can think of going through these lower\nfloors as getting closer to the Near Side.\nThat's because――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395032"
msgid "It must be because #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF is guarding it.\nShe did claim \"I won't let you leave\nthe #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395176"
msgid "And if so, there's only one reason she was\nblocking our path: the Labyrinth leads outside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395268"
msgid "Yes. That would be a logical explanation.\n…still, why would Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF commit all this\nmayhem?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395384"
msgid "Trapping us in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nusing that strange Servant #C236196003Lancer#CDEF,\nand having that much power?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395520"
msgid "We still don't know all of the details… but\nwhat we can say for sure is that she's different\nfrom the #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF we know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395660"
msgid "…I think back to the carnage of that torture\nchamber I saw in the castle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395736"
msgid "I don't think #C236196003Rin#CDEF would do such a thing.\nAnd even if she did, there must be some reason for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395848"
msgid "Are you sure?\nLady #C236196003Rin#CDEF was our greatest enemy back in the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2395956"
msgid "This mayhem may have been some tactic for\ndefeating #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396032"
msgid "She was a pragmatist. Wouldn't she be willing\nto steal other Masters' magic power to empower\nherself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396136"
msgid "…I hate to say it, but I can't refute that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396184"
msgid "#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF could sometimes be a nice person,\nwhile at other times be a level-headed #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2396340"
msgid "No, I don't think Rin's like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396376"
msgid "No. #C236196003Gawain#CDEF's opinion only amounts to a possibility."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396444"
msgid "The #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF that I know wouldn't do such a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396516"
msgid "If we are speaking of that red demon…\n#C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF, then perhaps she WOULD do so\nwith force…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396628"
msgid "No, it couldn't be. That woman wouldn't resist\ndoing the dirty work herself, but she sucks\nat using others as a stepping stone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396756"
msgid "It would be different if she was just the boss\nof the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, but it's crazy that she\nwould start off with that torture chamber."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2396912"
msgid "I feel the same way. I say for certain that this\nis absolutely beyond what Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF would do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397028"
msgid "Why is that?\nI think that in this situation, it could be\neither or…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397100"
msgid "She's lost her senses.\nI want to bring her back to normal, somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397168"
msgid "That will be the Student Council's objective\nfrom here on out. Does anyone object?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397252"
msgid "For some reason, a warm feeling is welling up inside me.\nI never knew #C236196003Leo#CDEF trusted #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nhis rival in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, so much…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397432"
msgid "So, our next operation will involve contacting\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and figuring out what happened to\nher from how she reacts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397568"
msgid "Since I am the President, I can't move away\nfrom the Student Council Room so readily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397656"
msgid "So let's prioritize retreat for now and have\nyou gather some experience in the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397772"
msgid "…I agree. If we had at least one more decent\nServant, things would be much easier though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2397864"
msgid "Since he's the President, he can't leave\nthe Student Council Room, he says.\nThat reasoning aside, I need #C236196003Leo#CDEF to back me up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398004"
msgid "It would definitely be great if we had one more\nMaster with a sustained Servant contract, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398104"
msgid "Huh? Doesn't #C236196003Jinako#CDEF from the Janitor's Closet\nhave a contracted Servant?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398196"
msgid "What did you say!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398216"
msgid "Awawa! I was so surprised I dropped my cola onto\nmy futon…! And hey, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF! What the hell are\nyou thinking!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398344"
msgid "Squealing about someone's equips is an invasion\nof their privacy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398412"
msgid "Well, no harm done, so we'll leave that aside.\nBut this changes things.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, head to the Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398540"
msgid "Benching valuable assets in our fight is\nunacceptable. Please bring #C236196003Jinako#CDEF here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398640"
msgid "…I didn't see this coming at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398676"
msgid "I don't think I can convince #C236196003Jinako#CDEF that easily,\nbut I'll try heading to the #C000246204Janitor's Closet#CDEF anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398812"
msgid "The surviving Masters gathered in the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398872"
msgid "The only ones not present are #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\nwho's shut up in the Janitor's Closet, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2398972"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF, who joined the Student Council on his own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399040"
msgid "Huh? That #C236196003Gatou#CDEF guy isn't here?\nRight about now he'd be the first to start\nhowling, wouldn't he?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399156"
msgid "That old-timer took off just a bit ago.\nI tried looking for him too,\nbut he wasn't even in the restroom."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399264"
msgid "It's not like I ever got his personality,\nanyway. Maybe he's behind the school and away\nfrom the cameras, training or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399396"
msgid "Waah! The hell is this transmission!?\nAnd anyway, who is this otaku? Where'd this\nthird rate character pop out of?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399512"
msgid "Hey #C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF――Same as ever, I see～\nYou really should ditch that habit of yours,\ncondescending all over people you just met."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399664"
msgid "That's why everyone over at PJ calls you\n\"Super Champ (LOL),\" \"Attention Whore (LMAO),\"\nand \"Kelp Head (ROFL).\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399776"
msgid "It always ends up like that for you～\nTake this as a condescending warning\nfrom #C236196003jinaKO#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399880"
msgid "Nyahaha! You're too kind, too kind.\nDon't expect me to give you any goodies for\nyour praise～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2399976"
msgid "Play time equals proof of being a winner.\nEvery gamer knows that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2400044"
msgid "You're just a no-lifer! It hasn't been a year\nsince FA released―that's about 18 hours a day!\nWhat school grade are you even in!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2400176"
msgid "Not tellin'～ #C236196003jinaKO#CDEF's a no-life who\neven forgot how to sleep since\nI'm leveling up even in my sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2400296"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is thoughtlessly snapping at the\ntransmission from #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2400396"
msgid "If I recall correctly, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF was the Game Champ of Asia.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF also seems to be a game enthusiast,\nand both of them have some sort of connection\nfrom before they came to the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2400612"
msgid "Excuse me. I found this a bit strange, but―\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, are you acquainted with #C236196003Gatou#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2400728"
msgid "I am. The old-timer visits the Janitor's Closet\nrelatively often. I can't stand how loud he is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2400824"
msgid "…though, I never let him in―even once.\nHe brought me some sweets, so I at least lent\nhim an ear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2400924"
msgid "Is that so? It worries me that he won't respond\nto our calls, but let's focus on listening\nto Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401056"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. Although we witnessed what\nhappened, please explain it to us in detail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401160"
msgid "About what you did once you woke up\nand about that #C000246204dark girl#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401240"
msgid "Ahem.\nBefore I do, I'll apologize―more or less."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401292"
msgid "Her actions were more or less to be expected,\nbut at the end of the day, #C236196003Rin#CDEF didn't harm us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401404"
msgid "\"The money stuff aside, don't worry about\nhaving been an enemy,\" I replied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401480"
msgid "There's no need to worry about it, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nI've always believed in you.\nI expected this outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401600"
msgid "I thought you were a spoiled, rich kid;\nan elitism fanatic; a horrible prick at\nheart, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401696"
msgid "Yes. I always believed you would be all bark\nand no bite, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. I saw this heartless\nspew of yours from a mile away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401840"
msgid "Hey! Just what part of me were you\nbelieving in!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401892"
msgid "What's this feeling?\nSomething warm is welling up within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2401956"
msgid "A real passion was hidden behind that remark of\n\"I believe in you, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2402056"
msgid "Agh, enough! You are my enemy after all!\nI was stupid to be moved by your words for\neven a second!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2402156"
msgid "Oh? Now that's a crying shame. If Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nwere to be moved by me, it would be that much\nharder to win the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2402316"
msgid "Hmph. Keep talking, you cold-blooded man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2402360"
msgid "Now then, I'll introduce myself again.\nI'm #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF, one of the masters in the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF who was captured by #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2402532"
msgid "However, I don't remember very well how far I\nmade it in the final selections or what\nhappened at that time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2402644"
msgid "What I do remember is about getting attacked by\nthe Black Noise and having my consciousness\nfiddled with by #C236196003BB#CDEF after that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2402784"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF said this: \"If you maintain the Labyrinth\nthe way it is now, I'll grant any wish\nyou have.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2402896"
msgid "Once I realized what happened, my mind became\nvery obedient to her, and I started acting like\nthe boss of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403020"
msgid "The rest is as you all know. I teamed up with\nred #C236196003Lancer#CDEF and became the proprietor of\nthe Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403140"
msgid "I feel like I got hints of all the things that\nhappened when I became the proprietor, but…\nsorry. I can't remember them either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403272"
msgid "It's like, rather than having forgotten it,\nI feel like I never \"put it to memory\" to\nbegin with…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403372"
msgid "Like an external hard drive. While that AI was\nconnected, it dominated her and simultaneously\npulled information she had."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403496"
msgid "But now that the connection has been severed,\nthough she may be free, the AI's knowledge\ncan't be shared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403604"
msgid "That would mean the Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF from before\nwas both #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF AND the #C000246204dark AI's offshoot#CDEF\n…if I'm not mistaken?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403768"
msgid "…yeah, great example.\nHowever, I think that's exactly right. I was\na perfect little puppet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403864"
msgid "That culprit who imprisoned us all here;\nThat AI who destroyed the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF―――\nIs #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2403992"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's explanation was mostly what I expected it to be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2404064"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF was also attacked in the final selections\nand pulled into the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nThe biggest part of what #C236196003Rin#CDEF forgot was about\nhow that dark female AI―#C236196003BB#CDEF―captured and deployed her\nas the boss of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2404348"
msgid "Now, #C236196003Rin#CDEF has also returned to us, back to her \nnormal self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2404424"
msgid "She may have lost her power as the Labyrinth boss\nand doesn't have a Servant,\nbut having her excellent prowess as a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND\non our side is reassuring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2404624"
msgid "So now, the next topic of discussion is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2404672"
msgid "Eyes gather on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2404712"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF had the same face as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nObviously, there's some relationship\nbetween them as AIs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2404836"
msgid "We need to investigate the truth as\nto whether #C236196003BB#CDEF is the cause behind all this or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2404940"
msgid "I'll ask you plain and simply, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nJust who is that AI girl? As far as we saw on\nthe screen, she had the same face as you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2405084"
msgid "That's… that's an identical model, as me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2405128"
msgid "An identical model… An identical model of\nmanagement type AI, which transmits information\non Masters to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF… is that it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2405280"
msgid "Since plenty of NPCs are also identical models\nto one another, you having an identical model\ndoesn't sound that strange, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2405408"
msgid "…I get it. If she's the same model as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nwho reports data to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, then she\nhas a free passcode to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2405588"
msgid "Anyway, that's what we're up against.\nThat management AI went berserk and messed\nup our #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2405708"
msgid "Is that reasonable to conclude, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2405764"
msgid "…yes. I have no grounds to refute it.\nI don't know what caused this to happen,\nbut it's definitely as you say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2405876"
msgid "That management AI… #C236196003BB#CDEF's objective is unknown,\nbut I agree that she's the culprit behind\npulling you all and us NPCs to the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2406028"
msgid "That said, um… I truly apologize for this,\nbut I just don't have the power\nor the authority to stop her…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2406136"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is the embodiment of #RUBS   cheating#RUBEillegality#REND.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, who conforms to the rules,\ncan't stop #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2406296"
msgid "She could've potentially always been that sort\nof AI. Like, if something sneaky happens in the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she'd pop out like the police."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2406456"
msgid "A super law enforcer sorta person. If there's\na malicious player cheating, every participant\ngets deleted―that sorta thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2406584"
msgid "Yeah, that's right.\nGood stuff, you no-life player.\nYou catch on quick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2406656"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does rebuke Masters about rule\nviolations, but the rules themselves have\nnever been broken before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2406788"
msgid "To encroach on the entire school,\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's stage… no AI exists\nthat could authorize that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2406908"
msgid "And firstly, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does not create AI\nwith such cyclopean calculative capacity.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF is an AI which mustn't exist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2407064"
msgid "…seems so. The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a monster of\ncontrol. It probably wouldn't create something\ncapable of turning against it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2407200"
msgid "That AI… #C236196003BB#CDEF―maybe we need to look at her\nas having fell out of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's control\ndue to a coincidental bug."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2407348"
msgid "And then, she chose to augment her functions by\n#RUBS an algorithm#RUBEa thinking#REND based on her own judgement… likely\none for optimizing her survival and duties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2407516"
msgid "That's the method for a storage capacity's\nstrengthening and intake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2407588"
msgid "I've concluded that #C236196003BB#CDEF disassembles Servants and\nNPCs, and by using them as her memory, she grows\nin to an \"even more advanced AI.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2407736"
msgid "An AI that's not being managed has no #RUBSrestraint#RUBElimits#REND.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF has been capturing Masters over and over,\nsinking them into the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2407928"
msgid "We've been stored as further additions to that\nwoman's memory, but thanks to this old school,\nwe survived, narrowly… Something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408068"
msgid "…#C236196003Julius#CDEF' hypothesis sends shivers down my spine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408136"
msgid "She assimilates servants as\n\"additional storage capacity\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408196"
msgid "No animal on the surface could do this.\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, though, composed of\nelectrons and Spiritrons, could actually do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408336"
msgid "Hold on a second! That means she's going to\nkill us and make parts out of us!?\nTh-that's just plain murder, isn't it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408456"
msgid "Some damn AI thinks it can defy humans?\nThis has to be a joke, yeah!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408528"
msgid "…on the surface it would be. However, this is\nthe Moon. The Three Laws in which AI obey humans\nhaven't been established here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408656"
msgid "Correct. The only laws that apply to us are\n[to properly manage the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF] and\n[to fulfill our given duties]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408788"
msgid "Since I'm the health management AI for all the\nMasters, under those laws I will protect you\nall. However… it's different for other AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2408924"
msgid "If the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF considered you all \"pointless\"\none day, they would likely try to delete you all\nwith efficiency―for management's sake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409080"
msgid "Wh… what are you saying?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409108"
msgid "Are you saying that, if we were out of the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's sights, then AI and NPCs would be\nour enemies…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409228"
msgid "…………I don't know. Not just among AI,\nbut also among NPCs there are individuals who\nare discontent with humans―I hear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409352"
msgid "That's because―\nThey have no \"reason\" to go so far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409408"
msgid "Even if they had discontent, such a thing only\ncauses their emotion values to waver. It\nwouldn't… lead to such devilish conduct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409540"
msgid "If we let #C236196003BB#CDEF run loose, she'll assimilate\nNPCs and Servants #C001246204without rhyme or reason#CDEF――\nand in the end, she'll go for the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409724"
msgid "That will lead to the collapse of the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. Before that happens―――\nsomeone has to stop #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409860"
msgid "…I see. Rather than going on a rampage,\nit would be appropriate to say that she's\nmalfunctioning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2409960"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF seeks to expand her functions… Though it\ncould also be a form of self-preservation,\nshe no longer chooses methods for that end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2410108"
msgid "No, it's more like, \"she can no longer choose.\"\nShe looks a lot like a human, but she's an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2410204"
msgid "This means that she's become a machine who only\nchooses the most efficient methods to damage her\nethical functions, designed by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2410364"
msgid "This situation is completely beyond the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's expectations; an incident outside\nof its calculations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2410488"
msgid "…beyond expectations, outside calculations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2410536"
msgid "This is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF said that here, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's eyes can't see us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2410676"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF didn't assume such abnormal events would occur,\nand it still can't observe said abnormalities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2410804"
msgid "It didn't expect this to be possible, it can't even detect it.\nBasically――We're not going to be rescued by the system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2410928"
msgid "You're telling us to pull some magic out of\nour asses!? I don't even have a Servant!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2411016"
msgid "Ohh? Are you lonely there, #C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF?\nHey? Does this mean that I, having a Servant,\nam one of the winners? I'm a winner, yeah!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2411168"
msgid "That Servant's being wasted though.\nThe only Masters here that can handle a fight\nright now are #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2411312"
msgid "Nah, I don't feel like going out to fight.\nPlease don't consider me as usable\nfighting power."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2411408"
msgid "Huh? What the hell are you saying? You plan on\nhiding that Servant we'll be needing? Aren't\nyou all about cooperating right now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2411540"
msgid "…ah, that's what you mean. Certainly, it would\nbe better if #C236196003Leo#CDEF doesn't go first. It's\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF's job to be the vanguard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2411692"
msgid "True. Splendid, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. You catch on\nquick, and you're wily. If you were in my shoes,\nyou would do the same, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2411832"
msgid "―――Hmph. You flatter me. I'm not the\nslightest bit happy about it, but I'll just say\ngood work, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2411964"
msgid "Why are you praising him? This shark #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nis hiding his Servant so he can crush\nthe final selections!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2412084"
msgid "This guy never had any intention of hiding to\nbegin with. Not fighting now is one type of\ntactic. It's a sort of, \"Golden Move.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2412216"
msgid "An opponent would think of a way to block a\ntrump card as bold as #C236196003Leo#CDEF. But if that trump\ncard isn't shown, there's no need for a plan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2412368"
msgid "He'll conserve #C236196003Gawain#CDEF's Noble Phantasm until\nthe most crucial moment―――Does that sound\nabout right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2412488"
msgid "Excellent. Splendid as always, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nI really will have to leave the Vice President\nseat to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2412612"
msgid "…you really are set on making me a part of\nyour group. I'm only here to make up for the\ntrouble I caused when I was your enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2412744"
msgid "Oh?\nNot satisfied as Vice President?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2412784"
msgid "It's fine. I have no problem with being\nVice President. I wanted to try acting like a\nstudent anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2412888"
msgid "And #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF is on General Affairs, right?\nAs part of your job in the Student Council,\nyou'll listen to our requests, yeah?鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413028"
msgid "Of course. Since, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's skill in \nhandling errands exceeds even that of myself,\nthe President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413144"
msgid "I wouldn't be so happy having THAT skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413188"
msgid "So―now that we understand the situation,\nlet's go over our plan from henceforth\none more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413284"
msgid "In order for us, the surviving Masters, to\nreturn to the Near Side of the Moon, we need\nto break through the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413428"
msgid "We'll have #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF head out first as the\nvanguard. We, in the Student Council,\nwill back #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413564"
msgid "Naturally, #C236196003BB#CDEF―who dragged us into the Far\nSide―will try to obstruct us, but we'll combine\nour strength and repel her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413700"
msgid "Broadly speaking, that's all.\nDoes anyone have any questions or objections?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413776"
msgid "I have no objections, of course.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF's plan is easy to grasp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413856"
msgid "But… when this all goes down, what will\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2413924"
msgid "She's an AI of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nSince she's serving to manage the health\nof the Masters, she's our ally for now―\nBut wouldn't opposing #C236196003BB#CDEF, an identical model,\nconflict with her duties…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2414144"
msgid "I… want to be helpful to you all. Since #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand I are identical models, you might not\ntrust me, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2414268"
msgid "There's no need to worry about that, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nYour moral circuits are holding steady."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2414372"
msgid "I guarantee that as an AI, you have a\nhigh standard of perfection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2414440"
msgid "That's right. Now that I think about it,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is the reason we're able to\nuse this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2414556"
msgid "Without #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, we might have been expelled into\nthe imaginary number space and vanished into\nfoam by now. I believe #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and trust her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2414728"
msgid "I guess so. Our #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here has a dopey face\nand doesn't seem capable of doing something\nstrategic like backstabbing us, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2414872"
msgid "Got a Rare～♪ …uh, what's with this tension?\nDo I trust #C236196003Sakura#CDEF or not? Hrrmm.\nEven if you ask, I don't got much to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415012"
msgid "Hmm. As long as there's no trouble in the\nJanitor's Closet, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's got no hate for 'em.\nAlso, I like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's misfortunes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415172"
msgid "There ya have it. I'll also be reassured having\nher by our side. It kind of seems like she\nhelped us a lot in the Near Side too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415304"
msgid "Everyone… thank you very much. I'm happy.\nI'll show you all by doing the best I can, okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415396"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF eyes well up, and she gives us all a bow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415464"
msgid "…she's an AI just like #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nIn light of these events, she must have been\nprepared to be treated as an enemy.……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415596"
msgid "Similarly, I was anxious about whether\neveryone would expel #C236196003Sakura#CDEF or not as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415696"
msgid "But all that worry was just in my head,\nand it's over now. I feel relieved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415772"
msgid "This voice―――!\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF, how's our connection to the outside?\nIs it warded properly!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2415872"
msgid "As long as you function through a network, no\nperfect security will ever exist. That's why…\nI can come along and do something like this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416012"
msgid "Okay! Are you all ready to applaud? I'm going\nto take all you good and bad kids, wrap you up\ninto little candies, and re-ship you off!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416148"
msgid "To everyone in front of the monitor―\nGood evening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416200"
msgid "It's time for the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's most highly viewed\nand popular content: #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416316"
msgid "The host is everyone's antagonist imp: #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416376"
msgid "The viewers are all of the sad little sheep\nshut inside the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416448"
msgid "You there, with the kelp-looking hair.\nNothing will come of kicking and screaming,\nyou know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416544"
msgid "You can't close your eyes.\nYou can't plug up your ears."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416600"
msgid "This is a brain-shaking nightmare liable to\nsnatch you away from reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416676"
msgid "That's right! Once it starts, you have to\nwatch until the end: a roller coaster movie!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416764"
msgid "Hehe. I'm so eager to please that it makes\nme blush, if I say so myself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416840"
msgid "Wha… what's going on!?\nOne second I'm in the Student Council Room,\nand now I'm in a studio."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2416936"
msgid "Actually, rather than being in a studio,\nI'm seeing a studio."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417000"
msgid "There's nothing else around but that.\nI can't see my own hands and feet,\nlet alone #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and the others.\nIt's like I've been turned into a camera…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417188"
msgid "Ah. I'm not permitting questions either.\nSince only #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF-senpai has\nspeaking rights―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417296"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and the rest of you, please\nstay quiet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417380"
msgid "Now then. In today's #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF, I'll be\nexplaining the basic rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417468"
msgid "Today's topic: \"How can we make our escape!?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417516"
msgid "Hey everyone, you want to know, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417556"
msgid "Silly me was so amused by Senpai's amazement,\nI ended up playing around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417632"
msgid "In the middle of the studio,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF giggles with a smile on her face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417716"
msgid "…however, she just said something terrible.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF said, \"I was planning to finish off #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417840"
msgid "Though from the tone of her voice,\nit could also be taken as a joke…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417912"
msgid "That was no joke. That girl is serious.\nThere's no laughter in those eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2417988"
msgid "…her eyes hold no laughter, I see.\nThat dark-colored #C236196003Sakura#CDEF… hmm… #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF?\nShe was seriously intent on killing #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2418160"
msgid "It doesn't seem to be a jest. That woman's\nexistence itself is strange, but the whirlpool\nof madness within her is genuine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2418284"
msgid "That woman―――Her body retains the appearance\nof a person, but it's already become a deadly\npoison, worse than #RUBS slime#RUBEfilth#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2418428"
msgid "Ahh. Because you're contracted with Senpai,\nyou're also sharing speaking rights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2418512"
msgid "Ahh. Because you're contracted with Senpai,\nyou're also sharing speaking rights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2418596"
msgid "Ahh. Because you're contracted with Senpai,\nyou're also sharing speaking rights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2418680"
msgid "Ahh. Because you're contracted with Senpai,\nyou're also sharing speaking rights."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2418764"
msgid "Ermm. As #C236196003Leo#CDEF guessed, after you go through the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, there IS an exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2418880"
msgid "If you want to escape from the #C000246204Far Side\nof the Moon#CDEF, just breaking through the\nLabyrinth will be okay!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419000"
msgid "But that alone won't be any fun, don't\nyou think?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419052"
msgid "That's why I've appended a special #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND\nto the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419140"
msgid "Now―time for a question鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419168"
msgid "What is this special technique?\nSenpai, do you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419224"
msgid "Ding ding! That's right!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419252"
msgid "Well, obviously you'd know. If you chose wrong\nthere, I would've given you the 8-bit\nspecial, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419356"
msgid "A-and here i-it is!\nYou're something else, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419408"
msgid "But unfortunately, that's incorrect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419448"
msgid "If I had my way, I would want to say that\nthat's correct, but alas, I'm a host right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419540"
msgid "The correct answer is Shield. Or Wall too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419584"
msgid "Please pick up on the social cues, okay,\nimbecile little 8-bitty #[boy][girl]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419664"
msgid "THAT'S the new #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND, #C236196003BB#CDEF's pride and joy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419752"
msgid "\"In the Labyrinth's Core…\nA girl-integrated…?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419804"
msgid "That's right. When it comes to resources,\nusing humans or AI makes no difference."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419888"
msgid "Please think of it as an honor that they're\nbeing treated equally, rather."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2419964"
msgid "Truly, it was an excellent wall, was it not?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420012"
msgid "A girl's mind is complicated and mysterious.\nThere's no firmer wall than that鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420092"
msgid "The downside is the limited size and amounts,\nI suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420152"
msgid "A single girl's worth of mind can plaster three\nfloors to the very brim."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420228"
msgid "An outstanding Master that can be used as a\nCore…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420280"
msgid "Female Masters of dense quasi-Spiritrons are\nrare resources, so they're hard to find."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420368"
msgid "Out of all the Masters I captured,\nI only used #C236196003Rin#CDEF and that girl as Cores."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420460"
msgid "Hehehe… now for some introductions!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420500"
msgid "With an intellectual white gown, glasses, and a\nshiny forehead―the precipitous / smooth,\nslender beauty!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420608"
msgid "Yes! She's the pride of Atlas Institute:\nEarth's last homunculus!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420676"
msgid "\"What lies under her cardigan?\"\n\"Does the Atlas Institute have no concept of\nshame?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420764"
msgid "Thinking about it makes my heart pound too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420808"
msgid "Go ahead. You can make a statement, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420856"
msgid "Let's hear your scathing comments on these\npuppies who will be challenging you from\nhere on out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2420956"
msgid "―――#C236196003BB#CDEF. I don't like playing up for\nthe cameras."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421024"
msgid "If they intrude into the fourth floor,\nI'll simply treat them as foreign\ninvaders―and dispose of them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421128"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF was just the beginning, a demo."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421192"
msgid "I will prove―――just how dangerous a\nstructure reflecting a young girl's heart\ncan be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421284"
msgid "…what's this I feel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421308"
msgid "I can't see or hear her, but right now,\nI feel like #C236196003Rin#CDEF is loudly booing next to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421412"
msgid "Okay鷙 Thank you very much for the promising\ncommentary鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421472"
msgid "A plain and simple game is no fun.\nThis design doesn't exist in the Near Side's\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421588"
msgid "If you want to reach the outside,\nthen please defeat the unconquerable #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421684"
msgid "This is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF. In exchange\nfor dropping out of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, you've\nall been freed from its rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421840"
msgid "\"The defeated are terminated\"――\nWell, such a rule doesn't apply here anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421920"
msgid "As long as you're here, there's no need to\nvanish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2421972"
msgid "…though, having that health management AI\nthere keeping you company really pisses\nme off…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422064"
msgid "I AM the one with a compassion deeper than\nan ocean: #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422140"
msgid "As long as you all stay in the school,\nI'll leave you all alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422208"
msgid "I can't guarantee your civil rights,\nbut I'll recognize your freedom as it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422288"
msgid "You're each free to have any dreams or\ndelusions you please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422352"
msgid "Your intracerebral simulators run on rather\nembarrassing forces, ones characteristic to\nhumans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422448"
msgid "Please keep discharging your young libidos,\neveryone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422504"
msgid "I'm always in that Labyrinth,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422536"
msgid "wanting and wanting to kill you all,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422576"
msgid "Everyone is alright.\nThis seems to have been only a sight-jack."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422640"
msgid "The external access has been severed. #C236196003BB#CDEF\nshouldn't be able to interfere with us at\nwill… at least, I want to believe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422776"
msgid "All she can do is eavesdrop and sight-jack,\nlike just now. That explains why she's been\nsetting traps in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2422896"
msgid "So, let's state the Student Council's moves\nagain. Our objective: escape the #C000246204Far Side of the\nMoon#CDEF. We'll repel #C236196003BB#CDEF's likely interferences."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2423068"
msgid "Welcoming Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF as Vice President, our\nbackup has grown even stronger. I expect\neveryone to synchronize more than ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2423212"
msgid "After #C236196003Leo#CDEF's speech I nod, \"Of course.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2423268"
msgid "…however. That didn't mean that everyone else\nin the Student Council Room agreed.\nThose who nodded were #C236196003Rin#CDEF and I… and with\na reserved nod, #C236196003Julius#CDEF. The three of us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2423468"
msgid "No thanks for me. I was only here to take a\nlook at things. Didn't I say I wasn't joining\nthe Student Council?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2423580"
msgid "We can just leave the risky business to those\nwho HAVE Servants. I won't be lifting a finger!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2423676"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF agrees with ol' #C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF DID say that while we're chillin' here,\nshe won't do a thing to us, y'know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2423848"
msgid "Is that so? Shame.\nIf you ever change your mind, you're always\nfree to knock on our door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2423940"
msgid "…let's switch. Now, how about you, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF?\nYou declared before that you wouldn't join―but\nthe situation has taken a drastic turn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424088"
msgid "Now that this threat, #C236196003BB#CDEF, has been made clear,\nare you still unable to cooperate with us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424196"
msgid "My plans do not change. If my skills will be of\nuse to everyone, then I won't hesitate to\ncollaborate, but to join together is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424328"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF… When we wanted to acquire #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF,\nyou went above and beyond for us, so why…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424464"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF asked a strange question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424512"
msgid "A while back, #C236196003BB#CDEF revealed herself\nas the mastermind after we beat #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424616"
msgid "To us inside the school, she was an enemy\nwe never knew about. Surely, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF wouldn't\nhave known, but―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424740"
msgid "―――Yes. I met with #C236196003BB#CDEF earlier than everyone\nelse. When we were assaulted by the Black Noise\nin the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424872"
msgid "The reason I don't share the same goal as\neveryone else is because of the pact I made\nwith #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2424984"
msgid "In exchange for not opposing her, she would\nspare my life… on that condition, I confined\nmyself to this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2425100"
msgid "In that moment, the moment when I abandoned her\nin the preliminaries school, she fell into #C236196003BB#CDEF's\nhands―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2425224"
msgid "…now that I think about it, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF said something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2425292"
msgid "Because, she said that she \"had no intention of\nleaving.\" #C236196003Kiara#CDEF knew something and had given up,\nthinking that leaving was impossible now――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2425452"
msgid "All because of that nuance.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF was monitoring #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nShe couldn't give any hint of #C236196003BB#CDEF's existence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2425600"
msgid "Despite that, since you wanted us to know,\nyou went out of your way to cleverly phrase\nthings, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2425704"
msgid "…what a foul imagination you have.\nDon't go farther than something like\n\"her heart will stop.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2425800"
msgid "No, there's no physical restriction. If I oppose\n#C236196003BB#CDEF even once, then at that moment, our peaceful\npact will become null and void. That's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2425956"
msgid "…that is why, if the need arises, breaking the\npact will be my final option."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426036"
msgid "Yes. However, remember that my pact is\nto \"not oppose #C236196003BB#CDEF\" all the way to the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426140"
msgid "As far as helping you all escape, I'll be\nlimited by that one condition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426216"
msgid "If that's what she says, but… is this alright\nfor an AI to do, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426304"
msgid "Yes. As long as she only cooperates with us,\nshe is not violating the rule about \"not\nbeing allowed to oppose #C236196003BB#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426436"
msgid "Things would be different if #C236196003BB#CDEF made the rule as\n\"not being allowed to escape,\" but since she's\nprovoking those who can escape to try…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426588"
msgid "Thus, please pardon me. At this time, I―\n#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF―will assist in your requests to the\nbest of my meager ability."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426720"
msgid "Her reasons for refusing were much different than\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's and #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's \"I can't stomach this\" and\n\"I got nothing to do with this.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426884"
msgid "Let's be happy that she's our ally for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2426928"
msgid "…sorry, but can we call it for today? I'm at\nmy limit, physically and mentally. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Give\nme the key to any empty classroom, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427084"
msgid "An empty classroom? If you want to rest,\nthen an infirmary bed would…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427156"
msgid "That's not it. I want to be alone! I'm talking\nabout venting out my stress in a classroom and\nforcibly burying my mental scars!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427284"
msgid "I don't want anyone near me for a while, okay!?\nEspecially #C236196003#NICK#CDEF! If you come over, I will\nseriously shoot beams at you! Beams!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427428"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF storms out of the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427488"
msgid "…I see… The impact from the #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF made\nme forget all about how so many of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's\nsecrets were exposed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427632"
msgid "Any normal person would be too embarrassed to\nshow their face in front of other people…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427724"
msgid "In spite of that, she participated in the meeting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427776"
msgid "Leaving that aside, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. I have a\nquestion… no, please let me hear your comments\non something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2427892"
msgid "…yes. No matter how much memory she builds up\nor is able to hack the system to her will, she's\na management AI with no fighting functions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428032"
msgid "This is helpful information. That's the comment\nI wanted to hear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428100"
msgid "Now then, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Let's break for a while.\nYou must be tired, so please rest yourself.\nAfter, we'll have you on General Affairs―oh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428252"
msgid "An external transmission. This is… #C236196003Gatou#CDEF?\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF, I'm turning the transmission on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428368"
msgid "Brother, turn the transmission off.\nThere's been a lot to take in, so let's all\nhave some dinner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428468"
msgid "…I know how you feel, but wait. This\ntransmission is coming from the Labyrinth.\nIt's not something to ignore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428580"
msgid "It's hard to understand? Is that so?\nThen I'll say this plainly: I'm chasing after\na dangerous homicidal maniac!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428696"
msgid "Since she felt as if she was a god, I urgently\nwent to rescue this lost believer!\nGod save me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428792"
msgid "The other side of this transmission is from the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF… Could it be that\n#C236196003Gatou#CDEF is…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428924"
msgid "Are you stupid, old man!?\nWhy would you go into the Labyrinth alone!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2428996"
msgid "What!? She's saying reckless men need to be\nsterilized! What an end of the century we're in!\nThe filth is certainly Quo Vadis!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2429124"
msgid "While I said that, it looks like I lost them,\nbut where am I? Wherefore are the stairs of\nreturn? Huh? Am I confined in here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2429252"
msgid "…I'm so very sorry, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Before you\ntake a break, please head to the Labyrinth one\nmore time. We need to make sure #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is safe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2429420"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF doesn't seem like the type who would die\nvery easily, but the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF isn't\na place for jokes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2429564"
msgid "I don't even have the time to catch my breath,\nbut I have to rescue him―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2429644"
msgid "Welcome back, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. I'm in the middle of\nanalyzing the footage and information from the\ncamera that was following you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2429780"
msgid "This is really more of #C236196003Rani#CDEF's forte though.\nThat girl is our enemy this time around, so\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF and I will analyze this somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2429940"
msgid "As you can see, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF has fully\nrecovered. From now on, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and I will\nbe serving as your backup."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2430088"
msgid "She may have lost her Servant,\nbut she's still an outstanding #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2430208"
msgid "She's more reliable than me, whose only merit\nis having a Master's contract."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2430288"
msgid "While #C236196003Rani#CDEF's attention is fixed on you,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, I have him searching the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2430436"
msgid "He's looking in floors you've already been to,\nbut there could be clues somewhere… High risk,\nlow return work is what bad guys do, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2430576"
msgid "Don't be concerned about him.\nSecret operations are #C236196003Julius#CDEF' specialty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2430664"
msgid "He's a shadow knight who fulfills his duties.\nNo matter the peril he suffers, or wounds he\ntakes, he returns to #C236196003Leo#CDEF's side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2430804"
msgid "Hey, shining knight. It's a bit severe to not\nsay he'll return without a scratch. To think\nthere would come a day when I pity #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2430956"
msgid "I have confidence in my brother. Anyway,\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. Please tell #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF about the\nresults of our analysis just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2431108"
msgid "Okay, okay. With #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's help, we tried\nmeasuring the depth of the Labyrinth through\npassive sonar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2431228"
msgid "The results show that the Labyrinth has\nsix floors in total. Since my Labyrinth was\nthree floors, the other three are #C236196003Rani#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2431372"
msgid "It means that if you can defeat #C236196003Rani#CDEF like\nyou did me, we'll be able to reach the\nLabyrinth's exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2431488"
msgid "The only females that can serve as Protect Cores\nare Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and #C236196003Rani #RUBSEighth#RUBEVIII#REND#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2431624"
msgid "Shields are tougher… or rather,\nthey're walls that can't usually be broken."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2431704"
msgid "Since #C236196003Kiara#CDEF was here, we had a method to unlock\nit; but if she wasn't here, then we would\nprobably be trapped here forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2431844"
msgid "Adding a young girl's mind into the Labyrinth\nCore is far from any deed we can do. One needs\nexceptional quasi-Spiritrions to create it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2431984"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rin#CDEF and Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF… Do you mean to say\nthat #C236196003BB#CDEF was lucky that at least those two\nwere compatible and available?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2432152"
msgid "Of course. Or, she may be searching the Near\nSide right now for more who are compatible.\nWe have a race against time there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2432276"
msgid "By the way, when we get back to the Near Side,\nI'm going to give you all a reaaalll thorough\nbeating… but escape is the priority now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2432412"
msgid "That's right. Continue making contact with #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Please find the gaps in her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2432536"
msgid "You want to remove your Servant's restraints?\nAh… I remember that now that you mention it.\nThat outfit was a restraint, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2432664"
msgid "I had that sort of knowledge back when I was a\nboss. Since your Servant was re-initialized,\nI had nothing to fear―that sort of thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2432800"
msgid "The re-initialization effect only happens once,\nbut it must feel weird to keep wearing the\nclothes that had that restraining effect…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2432936"
msgid "Okay. As repayment for the trouble I caused you,\nI'll try everything I can to help from my side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433036"
msgid "Basically, you'll be fine with removing the\nrestraining effect from your current clothes,\nright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433136"
msgid "Yes. A tactful woman―as I knew you were, #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nThe outfit isn't bad. I wish to use it regularly\nover my life, as part of my repertoire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433288"
msgid "…if you're going to do that, then I want you\nto delete the clothes along with it, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433380"
msgid "That would be nice. While you're at it, I would\nkill for a color change and adding just a\nfew more pink touches to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433500"
msgid "Say… If that's the case, I could try\nreproducing your previous outfit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433572"
msgid "Since I have data on all the Servants saved in\nmy memory, if I could have some time and around\n10% of the Student Council Room's source…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433712"
msgid "Wow. So you can can create Mystic Codes from\nscratch, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF? What, are you the type of\nperson who's good at sewing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433848"
msgid "I-I'm not really \"good at it,\" but… Since it\nseems that I could do it, I was thinking I\ncould give it a shot…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2433960"
msgid "Then it's settled. Since the restraint is #C236196003BB#CDEF's\ndoing, I'll hack the Labyrinth and look for\ninfo on the structure of the restraint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2434108"
msgid "And I'll create the formal outfit.\n…soo, first thing is to manage my memory…\nI wonder if I have any extra memory…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2434228"
msgid "Our work here is going to take a while, so in\nthe meantime, keep searching the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2434344"
msgid "There's no concept of time or date here, so no\nneed to rush, but you know about leisure. Once\na person starts slacking, they're done for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2434484"
msgid "I'm not talking about winning or losing at life,\nit's about life or death as basic animals.\n\"How greedy should you be?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2434604"
msgid "Don't you know that everything feels better\nwhen done fast?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2434664"
msgid "You can't stand the \"blessing of stability.\"\nYou're someone who strives for a brighter\n#RUBS   today#RUBEtomorrow#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2434784"
msgid "*sigh*. It's occult-ish either way… #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\ndon't got that kind of attitude. As long as the\npresent continues, I'm good. I mean it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2434932"
msgid "In the Student Council Room are #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Leo#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nIn the Janitor's Closet is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435088"
msgid "Though it's through the monitor, the four of\nthem continue their chat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435160"
msgid "I want to observe them a little longer,\nbut I'm the soldier that does the actual work.\nAs per #C236196003Rin#CDEF's advice, I won't slack off.\nI'll continue my search of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435348"
msgid "I stop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435384"
msgid "Before I head to the Labyrinth, I tried\nmaking some small talk as I greeted them, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435472"
msgid "Good work, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. About that message?\nThere's no new information really worth giving."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435576"
msgid "Even the commotion about how #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is going\nto go on strike if the Commissary won't stock\nnew items?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435696"
msgid "I don't know much about it, but don't American\nteenagers usually eat those Chinese noodles\nin those square boxes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435812"
msgid "She was saying she wanted to eat those. Well,\nsince she hasn't done any work, we can just\ncompletely ignore her requests."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2435936"
msgid "Ahaha… I went to give her my bento, if she\nwould take it, but homemade food is a no-go.\nSomething about it \"reeking of normie.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2436068"
msgid "Oh? Then be sure to hand me that bento.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's bento is a panacea after all.\nI'll stock up while I have the chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2436204"
msgid "Hey! If it's going to be like that, then give it\nto me! Have #C236196003Julius#CDEF make you something, #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nHe'll make curry any chance he gets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2436368"
msgid "I'd just sacrifice #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and make him eat it\ninstead of me. First, I need my brother to\nkick his habit of cooking in drums."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2436508"
msgid "The President and Vice President are\ngetting along fairly okay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2436572"
msgid "While #C236196003Sakura#CDEF watches over their exchange,\nshe hands out tea and whatnot with superb timing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2436680"
msgid "However.\nDisrupting the gentle ambiance of the\nStudent Council Room, an air of\nintimidation―like a drawn sword―lets\nloose right behind me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2436824"
msgid "The room's ambiance freezes in an instant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2436868"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF reveals himself, silently giving a\nwicked smile towards not #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the others,\nbut towards the still, silver knight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437028"
msgid "For some reason, the gentle #C236196003Gawain#CDEF exposes\nan antipathy to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF and stares fixedly at him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437156"
msgid "Something about #[his][her]# Servant?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437196"
msgid "He doesn't consider #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF to be an ally.\n#C236196003Gawain#CDEF's eyes speak, that \"he must expelled immediately.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437332"
msgid "But, in front of #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Gawain#CDEF can't verbalize his hostility.\nAs a result, he only shows defiant intent to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437496"
msgid "―――I see. The moment you devote your sword\nto your lord, you suppress you own convictions.\nYou devote your everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437620"
msgid "So you've been disciplined well, truly.\nGood. Out of respect for your antiquated\nchivalry, I'll permit you the first move."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437744"
msgid "Oh Knight of the Round Table.\nDeclare your honest opinion to the king.\nYou're well prepared, are you not?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437852"
msgid "―――I have no words for you. I'm simply\nincompatible with a Heroic Spirit who accepts\nother Servants who betray their lords."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2437980"
msgid "Well, now. I see, I see! So that's how it was.\nSplendid! You're the most loyal dog\naround, aren't you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2438084"
msgid "…what's so funny? I haven't uttered a single\nword that would bring cheer to a plunderer\nlike yourself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2438188"
msgid "Fool. You thought it would be enough not to\nlet your tongue slip? Reticence. That itself\nis sometimes a slip of the tongue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2438312"
msgid "You seal away your own will and become reticent\neven to one who contrasts your convictions.\nPray tell, how does that defend your lord?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2438448"
msgid "Honor is not something to protect. It's to show.\nYou hold a sword and become your lord's blade.\nWhat of your lord's justice can you measure?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2438592"
msgid "Those who have abandoned their own scales\ncannot measure the convictions of others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2438676"
msgid "That's why you cannot wash away #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's act of\nbetrayal. Their principles simply differed.\nThat's hardly \"betrayal.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2438812"
msgid "Betrayal means holding the same principles while\nstriking from behind. If principles differ from\nthe onset, mutual destruction is inevitable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2438956"
msgid "Isn't it the pure and righteous king you served\nwho didn't understand that? The ideal king\nwho carried everyone's thoughts, without err!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2439096"
msgid "Even I would like to see a star of such\ngreat beauty―――But alas, it's only an\nillusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2439188"
msgid "The \"ideal king\" people wish for is one the\npeople can't bear. Thus, your very king fell to\nmiserable self-ruin by way of betrayal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2439320"
msgid "―――Absolutely not.\nMy king did not err.\nI was the only one who made a mistake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2439404"
msgid "I will have you correct yourself,\n#C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF.\nI suffer not when you insult me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2439504"
msgid "However―――Know that slander towards my ruler\nis an impropriety that I shall conflagrate you\nthree times over for―I care not if more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2439644"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF and #C236196003Gawain#CDEF.\nNeither twitch even a finger.\nThey only confront each other through their gazes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2439780"
msgid "Within #C236196003Gawain#CDEF's eyes lies a quiet, yet blaze-like indignation.\nWithin #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's, he relishes in that indignation,\nputting on a vulgar smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2439956"
msgid "How frightful. I have the Veil of Darkness\nwithin my storage, but I can't produce a shield\nto protect that mongrel there from that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440088"
msgid "I'm amending my words, #C236196003Sir Gawain#CDEF.\nIt's not as if I actually saw it myself. Your\nking was likely destroyed, and that's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440228"
msgid "That was a miserable thing, but whether\nthere was betrayal from the citizens or not\nis of no concern to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440336"
msgid "A noble, just king; a noble, just knight.\nTruly it rings of that flower, Camelot.\nI probably wouldn't last a day there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440456"
msgid "…I can't make you understand. You, a tyrant,\nkept threatening his country; my ruler was the\nking of the holy sword, guarding the country."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440596"
msgid "Out of selfish desire you snatched riches;\nwithout reason snatched lives: a repulsive\nmurderer. Your thinking is far too distinct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440728"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF parts his gaze along with his words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440788"
msgid "Everyone in the Student Council who happened\nto be here seemed to be in approval of #C236196003Gawain#CDEF's views."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2440904"
msgid "No, that's not right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440928"
msgid "I deliberately left it at that without saying a word."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2440984"
msgid "It's not that I completely agree, but I felt\nthat I sympathized with what #C236196003Gawain#CDEF said."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441088"
msgid "Oh, yes. I am what you all call a tyrant.\nThere's no reason why our principles could\never overlap."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441188"
msgid "Now these two have nothing left to do with one another.\nFrom now on, there will probably only be hostility\nand no cooperation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441316"
msgid "Ah… err, I don't really know why myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441360"
msgid "It's just that as soon as I realized that,\nmy voice slipped out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441428"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is a cold-blooded Heroic Spirit;\na self-serving usurper;\na tyrant who, under the title of \"king\" reaped many lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441572"
msgid "Nevertheless―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441592"
msgid "I don't know why, but I thought that was wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441640"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF certainly is pretty moody,\nbut I don't feel like he would do someone in\njust because he's \"not feeling great\"――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441780"
msgid "―――This mongrel's jest has hampered my fun.\nAs that loyal dog howled out: I'm a tyrant\nwho doesn't consider others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441900"
msgid "You ordinary ones are walking down the\nwrong path. Never forget that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2441972"
msgid "…#C236196003Gawain#CDEF has his eyes cast down, seemingly with guilt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442044"
msgid "I may have objected on impulse, but I wonder\nif I went too far with what I said…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442128"
msgid "Sorry for the wait. I was able to remove the\nrestrictive effect. Yeah, thanks to those events\nin the Labyrinth, this went by super quick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442268"
msgid "Look, you don't know if there might be more\nclothes in the future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442336"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF sent us the Mystic Code.\nI was able to decompress it, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442420"
msgid "What's going on? This is unlike #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nbeing so inarticulate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442496"
msgid "I can pretty much guess, but is there\nreally an issue with the clothes #C236196003Rani#CDEF prepared…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442600"
msgid "Yes, erm… ethically. Even if it's only in the\nLabyrinth, I think there may be an issue\nrunning around in these…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442716"
msgid "I, on the other hand, can't accept you\n\"wearing this.\" 100% fig leaf!?\nWhere are we, in Eden!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442812"
msgid "And the back is all free, exposed! What are\nsupposed to be seeing from the rear camera!?\nOur monitoring will be a broadcast disaster!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2442948"
msgid "…*sigh*. Listen, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. The Student\nCouncil is firmly locking up this hazard. If\nyou want to change outfits, go find another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2443092"
msgid "If #C236196003Rin#CDEF is insisting so, then it makes me\ncurious about what kind of outfit it is,\nbut obstructing their support would be a\nmistake in my priorities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2443260"
msgid "I'll leave this matter alone and forget about it.\nI'll keep quiet about it to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2443372"
msgid "Just in case, I added a closet function to My\nRoom. If you find another Mystic Code, you'll\nbe able to change into it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2443492"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2443608"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2443760"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2443888"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2444024"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2444168"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2444324"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2444436"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2444552"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2444688"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2444804"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2444904"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2445024"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2445152"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2445288"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2445432"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2445568"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2445708"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2445824"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2445960"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2446076"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2446160"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2446284"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2446396"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2446524"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2446660"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2446772"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2446904"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2447024"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2447160"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2447272"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2447400"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2447532"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2447672"
msgid "We were able to extract all the #C000246204SGs#CDEF.\nNow, just like with Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF,\nwe'll need to get help from #C236196003Kiara#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2447828"
msgid "What's with that suggestive glance?\nIf you got something to say, then say it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2447908"
msgid "No, I was just thinking about what it feels\nlike to descend into another person's mind. As a\nmerely academic, medical spirit of inquiry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2448048"
msgid "You just have the mind of a voyeur!\nTh-that―――isn't really―――umm―――\nIt's not something one can answer…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2448164"
msgid "Flare up your desire to fight…\nSo the one who enters really is perceived\nas a foreign invader."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2448260"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF isn't belligerent like Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, but\nonce you enter the depths of her mind, you won't\nbe able to settle things through discourse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2448432"
msgid "When it was Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, her appearance came\nas a surprise attack. But we know that #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nis inside that Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2448580"
msgid "There's a great chance that she's laid out\na trap. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you need to tread very\ncareful―――What's this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2448708"
msgid "Okaaay♪ All you humans who escaped to the old\nschool, all you sacrifices wandering the\nLabyrinth! Are you hearing me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2448828"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's one and only top idol,\n#C236196003E#CDEF―err, no. #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's special broadcast is\nstarting. Perk up those ears and listen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2449000"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF finally completed the personal stage I\nhad her build for me. I'm giving you a special\ninvitation to celebrate its grand opening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2449152"
msgid "To all of you nameless piggies who supplied me\nwith blood so diligently up until now:\njob well done & many thanks. Now, farewell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2449284"
msgid "I've been rearing you all without killing you.\nBut that ends now. I'm slaughtering every last\nMaster and NPC in the Torture Chamber!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2449420"
msgid "Wh… what's up with that awful looking\nsculpture…!? Th-there's a ton of spiky things\ninside… no way! You put people in there!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2449552"
msgid "…the Iron Maiden: a torture device from\nthe Middle Ages. One of that size could pack\nin 20 people all at once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2449664"
msgid "It's a container for the Magical Energy she's\nstocked from slaughtering Masters. Obviously,\nto use against #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2449796"
msgid "You're joking―――Does this mean that\nthe Masters trapped in the Torture Chamber\nare going to be executed within that\nhuge, repulsive display―――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2449948"
msgid "Ah. If you want to blame anyone, blame the\n#[piggy][squirrely]# who #C236196003Rani#CDEF took seriously☆ My stage\nWAS on hold, but now it's completed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2450100"
msgid "So, are you ready? The#ROFS0002#RUBSlive concert#RUBE banquet#REND is about to\nbegin! #C236196003Rani#CDEF, roll in the#RUBS  sacrifices#RUBE audience#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2450260"
msgid "Tonight, I won't be counting calories!\nWe're going in hard in this #ROFS0001#RUBS    final#RUBEWalpurgis#REND,\nthis gluttonous#RUBS    carnival#RUBE bacchanal!#REND"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2450428"
msgid "Quasi-Spiritrons detected within the Labyrinth!\nMass signs of Masters and NPCs are heading\ntowards #C236196003Rani#CDEF's Relief―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2450564"
msgid "They're vanishing into the Labyrinth's\nsixth floor exit…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2450624"
msgid "No need to tell me twice.\nI nod to #C236196003Leo#CDEF's instructions,\nthen put the Student Council Room behind me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2450740"
msgid "Wait. It is important that we settle things\nwith #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF, but don't forget\nwhat comes after."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2450852"
msgid "Once #C236196003Rani#CDEF returns to normal, you'll hit the\nend of the Labyrinth. There's no doubt that #C236196003BB#CDEF\nshould be hiding there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451000"
msgid "You know that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451016"
msgid "While you all were searching #C236196003Rani#CDEF's Labyrinth,\nI was re-investigating #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's Labyrinth.\nI couldn't find #C236196003BB#CDEF's hideout, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451200"
msgid "If that AI is anywhere, it has to be in the\nfarthest depth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451260"
msgid "You'll be fighting without pause,\nbut you can do it, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451320"
msgid "I return a glance of confidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451356"
msgid "To be honest, I didn't have the slightest bit of confidence.\nBut after listening to #C236196003Julius#CDEF, my self-confidence swelled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451492"
msgid "…I can't really explain it.\nHis words carried a deep faith in me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451560"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF is putting his absolute trust in me―――\nThe moment I felt that, it was like warm blood\nrushed through my chest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451700"
msgid "I raise a hand to #C236196003Julius#CDEF, then leave the Student\nCouncil Room―for certain this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451804"
msgid "Let's hurry now. We'll free #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\ncapture #C236196003BB#CDEF, and escape the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2451940"
msgid "She's supposed to be in the Student Council\nroom backing me up. I wonder why she's here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452032"
msgid "…could it be that she's been waiting\nfor me… or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452096"
msgid "…sorry. I had a question I really needed\nanswered, so I slipped out of the Student\nCouncil Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452196"
msgid "No, I won't give up even under these\ncircumstances. You all don't understand."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2452276"
msgid "I don't really know why."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2452304"
msgid "For everyone's sake."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2452328"
msgid "Because you looked like you were in pain."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2452372"
msgid "For everyone's sake.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2452412"
msgid "Because you looked like you were in pain.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452472"
msgid "Is… that so.\nThough you don't know why, you believe.\nIt really is hard for an AI to grasp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452564"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF gives a seemingly lonely laugh.\nCaught up in the moment, I also give a strained\nlaugh, and nod."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452684"
msgid "I don't know the reason why,\nbut… I can't go running away.\nSince that belief is lit up within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452784"
msgid "It wasn't that you fight even though you won't\nwin… You have to fight even if you don't\nwin, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452888"
msgid "Great! Now it seems like I can understand\nSenpai better!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2452948"
msgid "I still haven't been able to analyze the cause,\nbut I want to try speaking with #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nmore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453060"
msgid "The reason why I fight, which #C236196003Sakura#CDEF came to ask me for…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453136"
msgid "While it is for the purpose of getting #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nthe others, and myself out of here,\nit's also to assuage #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Equally as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453316"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF lowers her shoulders, and, while\nshrinking away, looks up at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453404"
msgid "I repeated the same answer.\nAs a result of restating myself, I became a bit shy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453488"
msgid "I will assist you!\nPlease, absolutely come back as the Senpai\nyou are now…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453568"
msgid "All the Student Council members are gathered\nin the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453644"
msgid "…welcome back.\nThe operation went well… is what I want to say,\nbut it doesn't really feel like it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453748"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF is being treated in the Infirmary. Since\nshe's been with #C236196003BB#CDEF longer than me, it seems it\nwill take longer to bring her back to normal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2453920"
msgid "…in your case, it's more like you forgot\neverything rather than bouncing back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454000"
msgid "You had spiritually died from emaciation,\nso how is that taking meals was all it took\nfor you to recover?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454108"
msgid "Ahaha! It's the results of my discipline,\npale man. My #RUBS      elixir #RUBEalmighty scent#REND is this:\nsteaming hot Silver Ash with Pacific saury!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454260"
msgid "…I see.\nSo on a spiritual level, you're #RUBS  a zombie#RUBEimmortal#REND.\nGo scrub some toilets for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454368"
msgid "It's a classy bowl of rice, it sounds like…\nMaybe in certain situations, the freshly cooked\nrice is as valuable as platinum…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454496"
msgid "Ahh. Then I've heard of it as well.\nA quality meal affects even morale in battle.\nEspecially the king's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454604"
msgid "The old man isn't that profound. Simply, if he's\ngot good things going on, then he'll just forget\nall the bitter things up until then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454740"
msgid "Th-that function is impressive.\nTo \"forget one's damage\"―that's impossible even\nfor the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454856"
msgid "Yeah… A human's ability to alter their\nself-awareness when it suits them is one\nhell of a function too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2454964"
msgid "To tell you the truth, if the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's OS\nbecame a Gatou-type, it would mean the end\nof the universe. Most likely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455100"
msgid "The universe would begin, rather. There would be\nan Alpine meadow's worth of new, dumb rules\nflying around randomly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455220"
msgid "The mood sure changes when #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is here. Making\neveryone go from dead silent to loquacious\nis quite a hidden skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455356"
msgid "Ahaha, no need to be jealous. It's only natural,\nas the head of cheering. The harder times are,\nthe more you need to laugh, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455512"
msgid "Yes, I've taken that to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455544"
msgid "I was planning for us to discuss #C236196003BB#CDEF and those\ntwo #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF for a while now, but let's make\nsome time for other things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455700"
msgid "Everyone is tired, after all.\nI'll put off the briefing for eight hours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455776"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, and I will organize\nthe situation. So everyone, please\nget some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455900"
msgid "They'll keep going, without rest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2455936"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF have been backing\nme up without a break since I entered the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456076"
msgid "If anyone is tired, it should be those three."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456124"
msgid "Don't worry about it.\nAll I can do right now is support you, \n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF. So of course I will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456232"
msgid "You go to your room and rest ahead of us.\nResting is important work too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456308"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's cheerful expression reveals none of her fatigue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456380"
msgid "I can't object if she puts it like that.\nJust like how she devotes herself to her duty,\nI have to carry out the duty that I've been given."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456520"
msgid "That's how it is.\nBrother, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF. Please get some rest as\nwell, you two."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456612"
msgid "Especially you, brother. You probably haven't\nhad a wink of sleep since you got here. Since\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is here, you can't hide it for long."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456764"
msgid "I'll take a break myself then, no more than\ntwo hours. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. You get yourself plenty\nof rest too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2456880"
msgid "Thank you for reporting on the condition of my\nbrother's health, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. I didn't notice it\nuntil now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457000"
msgid "Th-there's no need to thank me. I really only\nhappened to notice, or maybe it's because\nhe's similar to me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457112"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF' hours of sleep entry always read\n[No health concerns], so I thought\nsomething was strange."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457228"
msgid "So, when I went back to search, wondering if\nthere was any problem, I found out that he\nnever got sleep to begin with…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457348"
msgid "He was deceiving #C236196003Sakura#CDEF with the fact that he\nhad an issue getting sleep, but still no issues\nwith his health."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457476"
msgid "Yes. Looking only at the outward results,\neven I didn't notice #C236196003Julius#CDEF' accumulated―――\nfatig―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457596"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…!?\nWoah, what a fever!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457644"
msgid "You can't talk about #C236196003Julius#CDEF!\nYou're on the brink of freezing and locking up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457740"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF rushes over to the collapsed #C236196003Sakura#CDEF\nand sits her up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457832"
msgid "Consciously or maybe unconsciously,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF apologizes with a ragged \"sorry.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2457928"
msgid "…#C236196003Sakura#CDEF shouldn't have consumed all her memory\nduring giving backup… No, let's put that\nquestion off for later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2458060"
msgid "Never mind that, come with us!\nIf you think about it, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's been doing most\nof the #C000246204SG#CDEF extraction work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2458200"
msgid "Running that unknown #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND would\nobviously put a load on her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2458292"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF and I will analyze the situation, so go\ninto sleep mode, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. #C236196003#NICK#CDEF, you get\neight hours of rest too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2458452"
msgid "Advanced AI are pretty similar to humans.\nIf they don't get rest, the accuracy of their\nwork gets worse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2458560"
msgid "…I'm no good as the President, huh.\nI wasn't watchful of my brother's rashness\nor #C236196003Sakura#CDEF working so hard…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2458684"
msgid "…I see. So this is what they call \"whining,\"\nright? It really is unproductive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2458764"
msgid "You get some rest as well, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. I'm\ngoing to take a short nap myself. When you're\nin a pinch, take deep breaths, as they say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2458912"
msgid "I'm worried about #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's condition,\nbut #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is in the Infirmary too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2459020"
msgid "We need to take a solid rest in My Room\nand dispel the fatigue from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2459128"
msgid "There are sounds of light tapping on a keyboard.\nNaturally, they're nothing more than localizations――\ntransformations upon my sight and hearing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2459276"
msgid "Ordinarily, a #ROFS0003#RUBS  Magi's#RUBE#C000246204Wizard's#CDEF#REND hacking wouldn't need visible computers,\nbut here in the Student Council Room,\nthis is how everyone shares information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2459468"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF purposefully used the expression \"last night.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2459536"
msgid "This old school has no night,\nbut getting a morning's greeting puts us at ease.\nIt's immensely beneficial to our mental health."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2459664"
msgid "Hehe. Looking at your face first thing in\nthe morning is pretty nice. I suppose this is\nwhat it's like in school dormitories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2459792"
msgid "Oh? If you'd like, we could make a cafeteria or \nsomething. IF we have the memory for it,\nof course. We can take turns being the cook."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2459928"
msgid "That's a great idea. Striving to revitalize our\nwork through stimulating our minds\nis reasonable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460028"
msgid "If we have spare memory, then let's definitely\nconsider it. Ahh―the problem is, who has or\nhasn't a chef's skills? #C236196003Gawain#CDEF, do you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460176"
msgid "Unfortunately, the duties of a knight don't\ninclude the preparation of food."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460256"
msgid "Besides, I'm vegetarian…\nI hold no prowess in preparations involving\nmeat and oil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460340"
msgid "What about #C236196003Julius#CDEF?\nHe may not look it, but he seems pretty good\nat home cooking, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460444"
msgid "My brother's curry was… unique, in a sense.\nI think there's still some uneate―left over,\nso let's treat you later, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460592"
msgid "Curry? That crunchy stuff you usually have,\nhuh…? If I had to choose, it would be Chinese,\nbut okay. I'll try it if you say it's good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460728"
msgid "If I had to choose, it would be Chinese,\nbut okay. I'll try it if you say it's good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460816"
msgid "…gnhh. Even I'm hopeless when it comes to\nfood too. Since I can only make 5-grain\nporridge, don't expect much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2460928"
msgid "There's no one with low-spirits to be found\nin the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461004"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Rin#CDEF must have been continuing\ntheir analysis of #C236196003BB#CDEF and the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF,\nbut clearly they haven't lost\nthe sense of their \"usual selves.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461212"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF isn't around…\nor rather, she probably hasn't woken up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461292"
msgid "If she was monitoring the Student Council Room,\nshe would be interjecting in #C236196003Gatou#CDEF's statements."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461408"
msgid "I smile back, \"That's 'cause you're making me listen\nto this silliness so early in the morning.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461508"
msgid "I got plenty of rest, and I have reliable allies.\nNow it's our turn, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and I, to head off to the search."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461632"
msgid "Excuse me.\nThis is #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF, requesting permission\nto enter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461712"
msgid "Good day, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF. Your pupils are more\ndilated than in usual times. Is there something\nto be wary of?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461844"
msgid "I'm genuinely elated, but before we get\nto anything, her outfit is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2461916"
msgid "This uniform?\nPer #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's instructions, I changed\ninto this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2462004"
msgid "The design makes me uneasy, but as a member of\nthe Student Council, there's no other choice.\nDo you have any thoughts you want to share?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2462144"
msgid "Student Council staff…?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2462172"
msgid "Isn't this opposite of your SG2?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2462208"
msgid "She looks great… actually, she looks\nvery attractive.\nI plainly shared that thought with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2462304"
msgid "The combination of #C236196003Rani#CDEF's tanned skin with the\narchaic school uniform looked extremely exotic\nand also had an irreproducible freshness to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2462464"
msgid "…fresh is a good thing. I'll be incorporating\na portion of this design into the next era of\nAtlas Institute uniforms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2462584"
msgid "And about THAT, I forbid you to reveal anything.\nIf you do so anyway, I might not be able to\nrepress the same emotions I had alongside #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2462740"
msgid "Ah, call me if it comes to that, #C236196003Rani#CDEF. If that\ndummy goes babbling about our secrets, it'll\ntake the both of us to let loose on #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2462900"
msgid "Good. A splendid plan, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. I'm hopeful\nof your heartless barbarism. How about \"#C000246204After\nSchool Execution Alliance#CDEF\" for our team name?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2463076"
msgid "…it's a bit too on the nose. It has a very\nback-alley vibe to it. How about something like,\n\"#C000246204Sailor Suit Rebellion Club#CDEF\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2463216"
msgid "I repent from the bottom of my heart, \"I apologize.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2463272"
msgid "I want them to stop concocting a plan to\nexecute someone with such serious looks\non their faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2463372"
msgid "She's starting today as a Student Council\nmember, and I'll be having her pair up with Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. #C236196003Rani#CDEF, your acceptance speech please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2463544"
msgid "I am #C236196003Rani VIII#CDEF.\nAs a result of all your efforts,\nI was freed from #C236196003BB#CDEF's control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2463656"
msgid "I'll use my abilities to serve as treasurer. So\nlong as I'm here, all revenue and expenditures\nwill be transparent. I won't accept waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2463796"
msgid "By my motto of swift and accurate Labyrinth\nsearches, I'll support the human-error prone\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and the playful #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2463964"
msgid "…well, excuse me for being\nthe biggest screw-up around here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464028"
msgid "But with #C236196003Rani#CDEF as treasurer,\nthere goes our plan for a cafeteria.\nIt would be a pretty big waste of memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464152"
msgid "Not so. Establishing a cafeteria IS going\ntoo far, but I approve of a breakfast system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464240"
msgid "Give energy to one's soul…?\nYou're talking about motivation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464304"
msgid "Yes. Vitality, the energy to exist. In Chinese\nstyle, it's what lies in the abdomen.\nIn ethnic style, I suppose it's Kundalini."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464432"
msgid "Yeah, energy and the abdomen. Kundalini.\nVitality is the desire to leave descendants…\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF! What are you talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464572"
msgid "#RUBS  Prana#RUBEEnergy#REND is the foundation for activity in life.\nTo activate one's Chakra…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464668"
msgid "Aggh, enough!\nAnyway, I'll explain our current situation!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464728"
msgid "And we beat that pest, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. Now, if we can\ncapture #C236196003BB#CDEF and exit the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF,\nwe can return to the Near Side of the Moon…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464912"
msgid "We didn't finish the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2464968"
msgid "That's correct.\nBeyond that wall where I was seized was\ndefinitely the \"end of the Labyrinth.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2465064"
msgid "She may have divined that my wall would be\nbroken and began appending to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2465152"
msgid "If the exit was behind you, then couldn't we\nget to the Near Side from the sixth floor,\nno matter how much is added to the Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2465288"
msgid "That's not right.\nIn the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, there's no concept\nof distance or time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2465392"
msgid "No matter how far the distance, as long as it's\nnot \"the end of the Labyrinth,\" the\n\"exit to the outside\" won't appear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2465512"
msgid "For us to escape to the outside, all we can do\nis reach the end of the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nbefore #C236196003BB#CDEF extends it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2465656"
msgid "…I see. In imaginary number spaces, concepts,\nrather than real numbers, become real. Anything\nother than conclusions here are vague."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2465792"
msgid "If that's the case, our plan is disadvantaged.\nNo matter how far we reach out, there will be\nno point if the Labyrinth keeps extending."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2465928"
msgid "Unfortunately, that's not the case.\nI can't append any more people to the Labyrinth\nthan what those two cuties are worth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466052"
msgid "They're parts of me, you know?\nIf I popped them out willy-nilly,\nI'd start turning itty-bitty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466148"
msgid "If I, the Queen, were to be weakened,\nsurely I wouldn't be able to keep you all\ntrapped here, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466252"
msgid "This ever-condescending voice is #C236196003BB#CDEF's…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466312"
msgid "She hasn't had enough of jacking the Student\nCouncil Room's circuits, huh?\nThat means what will follow is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466424"
msgid "Yep. Senpai is so wonderful, always rolling\nwith my punches鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466488"
msgid "Out of respect for your good guess, I'll give\nyou all a big bloodletting service\nthis time, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466588"
msgid "Now then: to all you thoughtless, powerless,\nworthless people in front of the monitor!\nAre you ready to scream?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466700"
msgid "Dun-dun-dun-dun-dun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466724"
msgid "Dun-dun-dun-dun-dun, dun-dun-dun.\nDun-dun-dun-dun-dun-dun-dun…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466792"
msgid "Resounding through the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a playful,\nstylish sound effect…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466880"
msgid "Is it a drum roll of fate?\nOr the resentful voices of unrevenged NPCs?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2466952"
msgid "Or the sound of a drill, whittling away stone?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467000"
msgid "Tonight you'll be drawn into a black, bloody world;\nthe new, rumored program―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467084"
msgid "Welcome to [Heartful☆Cursed Night\n―just some easy ghost stories from school]!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467164"
msgid "I will be your host, the heroine of this ghost\nstory, if you'll let me tell it:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467244"
msgid "Could it be that this girl is merely a nitwit?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467292"
msgid "…here's the sight-jack without letting us\nconsent, as per tradition.\nEvery time, without fail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467388"
msgid "…*sigh*. I want to change the channel, but\nshe's got the remote. The Student Council Room's\nsecurity sure has a lot of holes…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467516"
msgid "Here it is. The circuitous and backfiring\ncustomary approach. You deal with her, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467608"
msgid "…so it started, huh?\nSince I was kinda prepared and expecting it,\nI'm not that surprised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467700"
msgid "I wonder if #C236196003BB#CDEF shoehorns this plot of hers in\nif she ever thinks she has a weakness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467804"
msgid "Huh? You're spoiling the fun, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467844"
msgid "Jeez, and here I was pausing my construction\nto play with you. #C236196003BB#CDEF is so sad now. Sniffle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2467952"
msgid "Praetor, I feel torn. I like unique theater,\nso I don't want to go about criticizing\nthe actress…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468052"
msgid "But this isn't good. Truly, not at all.\nShe thinks she can hold the stage by simply\nbeing cute? This era's theater is depraved!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468180"
msgid "…good grief. If you want to deceive us\nthat badly, at least hide that giggly face\nof yours. Please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468284"
msgid "Ah, hey there, is this Tongue-Cut Sparrow?\nYeah, it's me! The wise mother. Do you have a\nminute?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468384"
msgid "Sorry, would you mind bringing the\n[Oddity/Tongue-Cutter Battousai] here\nfrom your tale? Oh, he's not home? *tsk*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468500"
msgid "…*sigh*. She's salivating, not just from her\nlips, but from her entire body. She's no Bull of\nHeaven; perhaps the Snake of Heaven?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468632"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF doesn't need to point it out.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's fake tears were pretty cheerful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468740"
msgid "Psyychee. Whether they're real tears or not,\nsince your silliness cracks me up so much,\nSenpai―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468840"
msgid "By the looks of it,\nyou haven't been discouraged enough to stop\nsearching the Labyrinth, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468936"
msgid "Your persistence is the one thing I'll\ngive you kudos for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2468996"
msgid "However, I'll flick away any stubborn\ndirt until there's nothing left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469068"
msgid "If you become too big a pain in my side,\nI'll abandon you to my #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF.\nSo please watch yourself, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469192"
msgid "I'm not sure what that means.\nIt feels like it has a different nuance\nthan being defeated or deleted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469296"
msgid "A maiden's secrets… \"#C000246204SG#CDEF,\" you called it?\nThat vile #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469400"
msgid "I can't believe you had such an unfair ace\nup your sleeve. I'm so sad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469472"
msgid "I had hoped that you'd be more like a\nrandom mob, without a single redeeming feature."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469560"
msgid "…and what's with taking out the gaps in\npeople's minds? What sort of occultism is that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469652"
msgid "That's the first spiritual phenomenon that's\nbecome a rumor in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469756"
msgid "Well, before we get to that, I have to say\nthat forcibly exposing a girl's secrets is\nthe scummiest thing ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469868"
msgid "Here's something for a Senpai\nlike that―――Take this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2469924"
msgid "A present from me to you, a special #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND\nmimicking what Senpai does!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470024"
msgid "Here's the second spiritual phenomenon鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470068"
msgid "Now, I'll say this one more time.\nWhen Senpai exposes a girl's secrets,\n#[he][she]#'s a bad #[boy][girl]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470176"
msgid "So it won't be a surprise if you get\nlocked up, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470232"
msgid "Yes, that's exactly right. #C236196003BB#CDEF is staunch, huh?\nWonderful. I wish you would take me\nas an enthusiastic associate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470364"
msgid "―――!? No! I didn't mean it, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!\nWh-wh-what's going on!? Everything she does is\nstylish, I can't help it…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470504"
msgid "That's right, #C236196003BB#CDEF. How can he so go far as\nto pry into a woman's affairs and spy on the\nrhythm of her daily doings…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470636"
msgid "Such a man is no gentleman. There's a time and\na place for things… I'll give him that, but\nas a guardian, this is is shameful!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470764"
msgid "I'm not sure what he means or what\nhis point is, but I need to think calmly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470844"
msgid "There's no doubt, it's as if #C236196003Archer#CDEF is one\nof #C236196003BB#CDEF's lackeys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2470936"
msgid "S-so this is what her rules do…!?\nFor example, yeah―――I can't help but see #C236196003BB#CDEF\nas the same type of girl as #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2471092"
msgid "…that's right. Excellent, #C236196003BB#CDEF. Even if it was\nfor the sake of survival, measuring the rhythm\nof a Master's daily doings was just evil…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2471244"
msgid "What… did he say…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2471268"
msgid "!? That's crazy, but you're definitely right!\nEverything about #C236196003BB#CDEF looks charming to me,\nI can't help it…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2471392"
msgid "Oh ho? That's one heck of a manifesto. Despite\nbeing #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF and all that, you make good\npoints. Actually, I rather like it. I guess?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2471548"
msgid "Okay, #C236196003BB#CDEF! I'll be one of your companions!\nWe can even create a good-wife harem of darkness\ntogether! But Darling belongs to m―――Ow!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2471700"
msgid "Sorry there, #C236196003Caster#CDEF.\nMy blow came in at a sharp angle to the back\nof her head, but hopefully she's alright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2471824"
msgid "You vile woman! I am a clean, proper, good wife.\nI haven't even an ounce to indulge you in those\nselfish thoughts of yours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2471948"
msgid "Damn you. This one is serious trouble… How\ndare you use that sketchy mind manipulation\non me, #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2472076"
msgid "If I don't do something quick, I might cause\nan unfixable rift in our relationship!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2472160"
msgid "What's there to say? Even if the Heavens were\nto turn a blind eye to a fiend like yourself,\nI would not. And you're almost out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2472288"
msgid "And, #C236196003BB#CDEF, I didn't notice until now, but you're\nconsiderably beautiful. Especially your bosom.\nThey're NOT my type, but somehow still nice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2472444"
msgid "How about it? We can jointly invest in creating\na club of bliss, where we revel in \npeople's secrets with grins and drink?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2472568"
msgid "How about I give you no interest, no collateral,\nperpetual loans of my stored gold? What?\nWhy would I go so far for you, you ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2472700"
msgid "Hmph―――You're ever the more sinful for\nmaking me say it, woman. #C236196003BB#CDEF. You are absolutely\nNOT my type, but you may become my Queen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2472848"
msgid "Loaning at no interest and with no collateral?\nAren't you getting swindled, big time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2472936"
msgid "Wh-what did I―what's going on!? This needlessly\nconspicuous breast pedestal appears as a blond,\nblue eyes, petite, and gallant maiden to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473080"
msgid "―――External virus infusion identified.\nConfirmed to be a nerve control agent #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND.\nRemoving special effects."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473224"
msgid "Well, that's okay.\nThe ghost story doesn't end here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473280"
msgid "Something else is what's promising."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473316"
msgid "There's a super scary monster in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473364"
msgid "Someone is always watching you from\nthe shadows, in fear鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473424"
msgid "But listen, Senpai.\nYou'll be better off not exposing any secrets,\nyou know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473504"
msgid "Curiosity killed the cat.\nThe joke will be on you―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473556"
msgid "Dumb-dumb #[boys][girls]# go straight into the trash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473612"
msgid "If Senpai ignores #[his][her]# cute kouhai's warning――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473672"
msgid "#[He][She]# may find #[himself][herself]# on a one-way trip to hell,\nfast鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473748"
msgid "My proper vision returns."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473776"
msgid "Unfortunately, there's no way to defend against\nthe #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF broadcast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473868"
msgid "You can claim that the old school is a safety\nzone, but there's no defense against a massive\nSpiritron output of that degree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2473996"
msgid "If that virus was a rabid beast, then #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF\nwould be like an earthquake. Beasts can be\nisolated, but you can only endure earthquakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2474152"
msgid "Simply traversing the Labyrinth won't suffice\nin accomplishing that, it seems. Let's take a\nstep forward ourselves, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2474276"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF seems to have difficultly choosing his\nwords. What does he mean by \"take a step forward\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2474388"
msgid "…yeah, you mean that.\nWell, it's about that time.\nWe can't just pretend we don't notice it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2474484"
msgid "That's because to #C236196003BB#CDEF,\n[knowing that our #C000246204Memories#CDEF were stolen\nwould be inconvenient for her]."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2474612"
msgid "If we clear things up, then there's\na big chance those memories can turn into\na countermeasure against #C236196003BB#CDEF's disturbances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2474752"
msgid "Hrmm…\nYou can talk about getting our memories back,\nbut how? Should we beat our heads together?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2474852"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a record monster.\nIt observes the Earth's, no, humanity's\nactivities. It's the recording eye of a god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2474988"
msgid "And it stores those records. That's why―――\nThere's a rule that #C255045045all AI produced by the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF #C255045045cannot erase memory#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2475152"
msgid "Take THAT back, is what you mean. But how are we\nsupposed to search for something when we don't\nknow where it is or what it looks like?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2475288"
msgid "There are two possibilities.\nThe first is that #C236196003BB#CDEF is holding on to them.\nHowever, this is impractical."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2475408"
msgid "Storing a Master's #C000246204Memories#CDEF is an\nimproper extension of an AI's functionality.\nRather, it's completely useless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2475536"
msgid "I don't think #C236196003BB#CDEF is holding on to data which\nwould put a load on her own storage capacity.\nShe must've transferred it somewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2475688"
msgid "That leaves one possibility left: she prepared\nan external storage repository\nand is hiding it there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2475792"
msgid "If #C236196003BB#CDEF wants to keep her secrets safe,\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF would be the most\nsuitable hiding place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2475924"
msgid "Extracting a Master's #C000246204Memories#CDEF and turning it\ninto a file is an illegal action."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2476020"
msgid "Thus the chances are high that our #C000246204Memories#CDEF are\ninside the stabilized #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, which is\nin the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF where the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF can't see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2476228"
msgid "She's a health management AI for Masters.\nShe can act on Servants and NPCs, but she can't\ntake a human's… a Master's life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2476352"
msgid "Even she, who boasts of her computational power\nwhich can construct the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF―the\nArena―#C255045045can't directly harm humans#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2476516"
msgid "So, wouldn't that explain why she got\npawns like Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF, and I?\n#C236196003BB#CDEF doesn't have the authority to do battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2476688"
msgid "…I see. For some reason,\nI felt a kinship with #C236196003BB#CDEF well up inside me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2476776"
msgid "Basically, no matter how much space #C236196003BB#CDEF controls,\n\"Masters\" are where it all ends for her.\nLike #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, she can't fight on her own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2476948"
msgid "That's why she used people like #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Lancer#CDEF.\nAll she could do was obstruct us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2477064"
msgid "I think #C236196003Rani#CDEF's right. It would explain\nwhy #C236196003BB#CDEF created those#RUBS   Alter Egos#RUBE offshoots#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2477196"
msgid "An #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF may be a part of #C236196003BB#CDEF, but they\naren't tied down to her fundamental\nduty of health management."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2477336"
msgid "That makes our enemies from here on out those\n#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF. Alright, then how about we get\nback to the main issue here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2477472"
msgid "However, it's not about just traversing this\ntime around. This will be a dungeon attack,\nwhere we're also searching for our #C000246204Memories#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2477624"
msgid "Traversing the Labyrinth is a given,\nbut I also agree with getting our lost #C000246204Memories#CDEF back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2477732"
msgid "I don't want to be conversing with everyone\nwith a hazy #C000246204memory#CDEF forever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2477820"
msgid "Then let's do one last check.\nOur objective is to recover our stolen #C000246204Memories#CDEF\nand overcome the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2477968"
msgid "The squad doing the heavy lifting will include\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, with backup from Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF. Please allow me to serve as commander."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2478152"
msgid "The Tsukumihara Student Council will henceforth\nbegin our third session of activities.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, be careful…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2478280"
msgid "Job well done.\nThough I expected it would happen, encountering\nan #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF so suddenly was disastrous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2478400"
msgid "That girl, \"#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF,\" was it? She seemed\nto make it clear that she's on #C236196003BB#CDEF's side, but…\nWhat do you think, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2478568"
msgid "Holding back the urge to #RUBS  complain#RUBEpoint out#REND about his\nexpectation that we would be attacked by\nan #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2478720"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF listened to every word we said.\nShe has neither the meanness of someone like #C236196003BB#CDEF\nnor the wickedness of #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2478892"
msgid "We might be able to get along with her―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2478940"
msgid "Their thought subroutines are riddled with\ncontradictions. I'm opposed to you\ngetting anywhere near such AIs, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2479076"
msgid "…please be careful. She may have been\namiable then, but the next moment, she may\nbecome a monster. …such is a rogue AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2479200"
msgid "…hmph. Pretty severe, coming from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nbut well, I guess that's how it is.\nForget about having any discussions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2479332"
msgid "I would say… no, never mind.\nOn the decompression of that data,\nit looks like it'll take a few hours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2479436"
msgid "Though it was discarded in a compressed state,\nits #RUBS            codec   #RUBEcompression algorithm#REND is unprecedented\nand unique, so…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2479580"
msgid "Unique?\nIf we decompress it, will a virus start\nspreading or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2479652"
msgid "I don't remember asking you.\nSo, what's the answer?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2479704"
msgid "To put it simply, its compression is\nirreversible. Lossy compression damaged the\ndata, putting it into an unrecoverable state."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2479832"
msgid "? Are you talking about data designated to be\nsealed and sent to the #ROFS0001#RUBSarchive#RUBEvault#REND?\nOr about deleted… #ROFS0002#RUBS    dust #RUBEabandoned#REND data?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2480008"
msgid "No. I was thinking, in order to fit into the\nrecycle bin, the original data was compressed in\nsuch a way which makes recovery difficult."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2480148"
msgid "Huh? Isn't that pointless? Recycle bins are\nsafety mechanisms, where you can \"throw away\"\nbut \"recover\" whenever you want."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2480272"
msgid "There's no need to put \"things that can't\nbe used anymore\" in the recycle bin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2480352"
msgid "It's premature to conclude it's of no use.\nI'll hasten the decompression and restoration\nof this dust data. I'll report back soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2480484"
msgid "…I don't really get it, but it seems like the\nanalysis will take a few hours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2480564"
msgid "Now isn't the time to be sitting here waiting\nfor the analysis to finish. Let's head back to\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF again and continue the search."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2480728"
msgid "Since #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is a different sort of\n#C000246204Sentinel#CDEF than what we've faced up until now,\nthe way you extract #C000246204SGs#CDEF may be different too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2480908"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nThat bed hair, as far as I can see, must mean\nyou slept well. That's wonderful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481028"
msgid "We want you to search the eighth floor of the\nLabyrinth today. After that, let's see if we\ncan find anything on #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481168"
msgid "I nod, \"Understood.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481192"
msgid "…but are we not going to look for our #C000246204Memories#CDEF?\nWe weren't able to find anything like it on the seventh floor…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481324"
msgid "\"#RUBS              Breast Valley  #RUBE#C000246204That which can store any trash#CDEF#REND.\"\n…even if it's for hiding secret data,\nI wonder if there's any other data elsewhere?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481504"
msgid "We can't conclude that our #C000246204Memories#CDEF are in\nher #C000246204Breast Valley#CDEF, based on what we know now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481628"
msgid "But it's highly likely that our #C000246204Memories#CDEF were\nleft under #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's control so that they\ncan be disposed when need be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481784"
msgid "Them being stored there means you can't just\nreach in so easily.\n…you can't reach in, got it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481880"
msgid "If you're going to be bold and attempt anyway,\nI won't stop you.\nHowever, let's search the Labyrinth first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2481988"
msgid "Since you're extracting #C000246204SGs#CDEF, direct contact\nwith #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is inevitable. When possible,\nplease take a look around for our #C000246204Memories#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482172"
msgid "Alright. Prepare and go to the Labyrinth.\nNaturally, we won't make any mistakes\non our side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482268"
msgid "Welcome back.\nDo you have all the partitioned data?"
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "2482320"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482368"
msgid "Perfect.\n…okay, #C236196003Rani#CDEF. Please begin the reconstruction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482440"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF hands the partitioned data to #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482512"
msgid "Well then. I'll leave #C236196003Rani#CDEF to her work\nand relax for a bit―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482596"
msgid "Reconstruction, complete.\nFor this to take any more than five seconds\nis total nonsense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482688"
msgid "This is why I hate superstar staff…\nI get no time to even slack off!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482760"
msgid "It has… an immense array of item folders with\nunknown purposes… It's as if they're packed\nunder the lid of a pot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2482876"
msgid "This is #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF's handiwork, huh? I didn't\nthink he would make it easy, but… the results\nare more disappointing than I imagined."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483028"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF apologizes with meek, downcast eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483088"
msgid "Sure, searching for transparent treasure was an\nannoying job… but all things considered,\nwe couldn't NOT check what this partitioned data was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483232"
msgid "Hearing you say that really helps.\nLet's make up for lost time and redouble\nour efforts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483324"
msgid "Okay. As soon as you're ready, please head\nto the Labyrinth again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483392"
msgid "I enter the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483428"
msgid "The usual members are here, but this time…\nno, this morning, #C236196003Julius#CDEF is here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483524"
msgid "If he's partaking in the briefing,\ndoes that mean he finished the\nsecret mission #C236196003Leo#CDEF gave him?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483636"
msgid "Our objective doesn't change.\nRecover our #C000246204Memories#CDEF,\nand reach the end of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483740"
msgid "Brother, please explain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483768"
msgid "There's no need to fight #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nOnce we get to the Near Side,\nshe won't be able to touch us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2483876"
msgid "No matter how powerful #C236196003BB#CDEF's authority is, it's\nlimited to the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF. Once in the Near Side,\nshe'll only be as strong as an enemy program."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2484052"
msgid "The vaccine for it is already complete.\nIf we get it to the Near Side, the Black Noise\nwill have nothing it can encroach on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2484180"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF …and #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF, huh? You four were only\npulled here because you were ambushed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2484352"
msgid "Someone like #C236196003BB#CDEF is trash in the Near Side.\nNo need to go out of our way to fight\nher in the Far Side where she rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2484488"
msgid "…he's right.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF can only take action in the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2484588"
msgid "If she goes to the Near Side,\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will detect her as a\nrogue AI and delete her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2484696"
msgid "Hrm. It's like how even the Queen of the\nUnderworld is a regular person above ground.\nEven #C236196003BB#CDEF can't defy the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2484848"
msgid "Hmm? That means, the moment we return to our\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, #C236196003BB#CDEF will be deleted, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2484968"
msgid "We've spent so many hours here, after all. We're\ntreated as missing over there. If the missing\nreturn, the events here will be exposed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2485104"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will at last focus on the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, detect #C236196003BB#CDEF, and terminate\nher; my automatic and total victory!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2485276"
msgid "But hey, if we can get to the Near Side,\nwe win. Nothing changes that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2485348"
msgid "That's why #C236196003President Leo#CDEF is ignoring #C236196003BB#CDEF\nas much as possible and prioritizing our\nclearing of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2485488"
msgid "Exactly. She may be rogue, but she's taking\nexceedingly rational action."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2485564"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is one example.\nShe won't extend it more than necessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2485660"
msgid "As necessary―that's the key here. She won't\nadd to the Labyrinth without a reason. That's\nwhat holds back AI who value optimization."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2485796"
msgid "They have no subroutines to \"senselessly add,\"\nreminiscent of humans. Conversely, the Labyrinth\nwon't be extended unless we reach the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2485936"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's opinion is that after #C236196003Rani#CDEF was freed,\nthe Labyrinth was extended by six floors."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2486060"
msgid "Since we're at the eighth floor now,\nthat makes clearing the remaining four floors\nour final objective."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2486164"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF comes first. As long as there's an\n#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF as the Labyrinth's Core, an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF \nwill surely be lurking in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2486348"
msgid "You'll investigate #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF and extract\nher #C000246204SG#CDEF. After that, enter this AI's facade\nand destroy this #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF from the inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2486528"
msgid "And if possible in the process,\nrecover our #C000246204Memories#CDEF. Only four floors left,\nbut more info and options won't hurt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2486660"
msgid "But, please don't push yourself too hard…\nReturning to the Near Side without your #C000246204memories#CDEF\ndoesn't mean you'll still have amnesia."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2486808"
msgid "Haha! A life update patch, pretty much～\nIt's nuts to think it has data on us from before\nwe got to the Moon. Totes occult, #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2486960"
msgid "So #C236196003Jinako#CDEF was also listening in…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487012"
msgid "\"Life update patch\" IS a clever way of\nputting it, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487072"
msgid "If something once happened,\nit's something someone experienced."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487136"
msgid "Since the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF records \"reality,\"\nalthough it might not record down\nto the emotions one bears,\nthere's no such thing as an \"unrecoverable past\" here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487308"
msgid "As long as that person isn't in an irregular state."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487360"
msgid "This concludes the Student Council's plan.\nI think we're all on the same page now as far\nas goals go. So―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487472"
msgid "#C236196003President Leo#CDEF. Before that, I have something\nto report. It's about the compressed data\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF found that we copied."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487624"
msgid "I made a mistake during my analysis.\nI was unable to decompress the data,\nso an accurate examination was impossible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487744"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF, you made a mistake…?\nDoes that mean you destroyed the data?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487828"
msgid "You heard her.\nIf you come across a cube within the Labyrinth,\nplease give it to #C236196003Treasurer Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2487944"
msgid "So, your run through the ninth floor begins now.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, be careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2488032"
msgid "Everyone gives a nod after #C236196003Leo#CDEF's announcement,\nthen returns to their own work.\nI'm off to the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2488180"
msgid "Wait, before that, I'll ask #C236196003Julius#CDEF about the\noutcome of his secret mission. If he's back,\nthen there must've been some sort of a development."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2488340"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, the details, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2488388"
msgid "Yes. Currently, we've been unable to detect the\ndata believed to be everyone's \"#C000246204Memories#CDEF\" within\nthe surveyable portions of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2488544"
msgid "However, the evidence we have indicates that\nthose \"#C000246204Memories#CDEF\" are present on this floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2488652"
msgid "The only applicable storage locations are either\nbeyond the Shield or #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's\nspecial skill… \"#C000246204Breast Valley#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2488800"
msgid "Therefore, I recommend that you first\nmake contact with #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF.\nIf possible, seize her, then eliminate her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2488928"
msgid "Eliminate, huh… That's no mild way to put it,\nbut she is our enemy.\nWe can't really sugarcoat it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489028"
msgid "But where is this girl at?\nIt looks like she's not on the\nninth floor anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489108"
msgid "That's… *cough*, I'll take care of that.\nI've already locked on to her position."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489192"
msgid "In the northeast area of the eighth floor,\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF is wandering about\nthe corridor-shaped pathways."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489312"
msgid "We'll have #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF head to the eighth floor,\nmake contact with the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF there,\nthen nab her #C000246204SG#CDEF and our #C000246204memory data#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489500"
msgid "…it's a simple strategy, but keep in mind\nyour opponent is an unknown powerhouse.\nMake sure your preparations are complete."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489628"
msgid "…capture #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, who's wandering\naround the eighth floor…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489708"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF are assuming\nthere's going to be a battle,\nbut it doesn't always have to end in a fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489844"
msgid "Going by the events that have transpired,\nit's evident that #C236196003Lip#CDEF is not aggressive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2489944"
msgid "If we play our cards right,\nwe might be able to talk her down…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490008"
msgid "At any rate, let's go to the\n#C000246204northeast area of the eighth floor#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490092"
msgid "…you've done well.\nI apologize for having made you waste\nsome of your time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490172"
msgid "True. I, too, am confident in my getaways, but\nthat AI's readiness to flee is amazing. A half-\nhearted means of capturing her won't work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490312"
msgid "That's why we'll try a two-man cell next.\nWe'll encircle her using two people paired up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490404"
msgid "Two people, paired…?\nIt's dangerous for anyone other than #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nto enter the Labyrinth, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490520"
msgid "No, there's someone. Someone with a \ncontracted Servant and too much time\non their hands. One person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490624"
msgid "Bring #C236196003Jinako#CDEF to the Student Council Room…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490684"
msgid "It's easy for #C236196003President Leo#CDEF to say,\nbut I have a hunch that this might end up\nbeing tougher than catching #C236196003Lip#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490832"
msgid "Oh, there's nothing to fret about!\nWorst case, you and I can pair up!\nTogether we'll knock out those knockers!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2490944"
msgid "If I'd have to go in with #C236196003Gatou#CDEF otherwise,\nthen I'll use every trick in the book to persuade #C236196003Jinako#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2491080"
msgid "Simply incredible, #C236196003Chief Gatou#CDEF.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's motivation has leaped threefold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2491188"
msgid "No turning back now.\nAnyway, I've got nothing to lose,\nso I'll head over to where #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2491300"
msgid "It seems you succeeded in persuading #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nI can tell by the look on your face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2491400"
msgid "Gahaha! So #C236196003Jinako#CDEF couldn't hold out against\nyour insistence either, huh, #[lad][lass]#?\nYes, very good. Very good, indeed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2491540"
msgid "Now we'll finally see her, in the flesh.\nNow that I think about it, only #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nhas spoken directly to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2491692"
msgid "So, she's a mysterious lady.\nI'm eager to see what she's like in-person.\nAren't you as well, #C236196003Julius#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2491812"
msgid "While exchanging trivial comments,\neveryone keeps their eyes on the\nStudent Council Room's door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2491912"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, who they spoke with only\nover the monitor so far, is coming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492000"
msgid "They've seen her face, but what sort\nof presence does she have in person―――\nThey can't help but feel giddy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492112"
msgid "…then.\nAs this was going on, sounds could be heard\ncoming from the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492192"
msgid "It's #C236196003Jinako#CDEF……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492228"
msgid "Suuup, soz for the wait～\nIRL #C236196003Jinako#CDEF has arrived\nin the Student Council Room～♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492328"
msgid "Ahh, good morning!\nAhaha! You're fatter than I imagined!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492388"
msgid "No, my apologies.\nIt's just that… how should I put it―\nYou're pretty ordinary, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492476"
msgid "Yeah, ordinary, isn't she? I was imagining\na more amazing personality… like you'd come in\nstriking a pose like a mighty morphing hero."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492612"
msgid "Yes.\nI assumed your character would be more\neccentric than Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492704"
msgid "The data on file says you're the same age as\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF… but not being in uniform gives\noff a strong outsider vibe."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492836"
msgid "……it's because you're untidy…\nErr, as in your appearance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2492900"
msgid "…my bad for being ordinary.\nMy specs are different from heaven-dwellers\nlike #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the rest of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493020"
msgid "Since we got here, it's been distinct\npersonalities EVERYWHERE, right? So, you coming\nin, looking plain, sort of makes an impact…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493152"
msgid "Exactly. Your unenthusiastic entrance actually\nsurprised us. That's all it is, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493256"
msgid "However, we did do you wrong.\nForgive us, Miss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF.\nI apologize for our impoliteness just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493372"
msgid "I-it's no biggie.\nI'm not really that angry!\nI feel awkward with you bowing your head!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493460"
msgid "A-anyhow, what is that you need?\nYou must be at the end of your rope if\nyou're asking #C236196003Jinako#CDEF here for help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493584"
msgid "True.\nYou'll see once I explain―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493624"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF briefly explains the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493676"
msgid "But when it's time to fight, she flees.\nDue to some odd assumption she's making,\nwe can't even have a conversation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493792"
msgid "The Shield in the Labyrinth is \nholding firm, and at this rate,\nwe won't be able to get her #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2493904"
msgid "In any case, unless we can come up with a\nway to \"not let #C236196003Lip#CDEF escape,\"\nwe can't continue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494012"
msgid "[Chasing] a stalker will backfire on you.\nIf you want to catch her, all you can do is\nmake HER chase YOU, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494128"
msgid "…it certainly is genius.\nAlthough, there ARE all sorts of issues with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494204"
msgid "Based on her actions up until now,\nonce she realizes that #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF has a lover,\nshe'll most likely pursue #[him][her]# even more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494352"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF will be the decoy. Yes, you.\nWhile the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF attacks you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF\nwill stealthily approach from behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494524"
msgid "After reaching into the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF's chest,\nthe data on our [#C000246204Memories#CDEF] will be retrieved."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494648"
msgid "If my guess is correct, that should be\nenough to stir up some drama."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494720"
msgid "As Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF says. Besides, #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF.\nWhen we played chess, this is what you said:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494848"
msgid "\"Don't underestimate ordinary people.\"\nPlease prove those words true by doing this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2494932"
msgid "…yes, I would very much like to do so, but…\nmy brother won't stop harping me not to do it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495028"
msgid "…ahem. I AM also an instructor.\nIt's simply too early for #C236196003Leo#CDEF to be involved\nin gender relations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495144"
msgid "Besides, #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF.\nWhen we played chess, this is what you said:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495232"
msgid "\"Don't underestimate ordinary people.\"\nPlease prove those words true by doing this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495316"
msgid "Also, #C236196003Rani#CDEF. You're still bitter about\nwhat happened, #C000246204Powergamer#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495416"
msgid "Pressured by #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF looks like she's about to run for it.\nI'd say this is about 80% settled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495596"
msgid "…if I was pressured head-on by those three,\nI wouldn't have the self-confidence to turn down\ntheir request either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495712"
msgid "Pretending to be two female lovers won't\nwork, anyway. Right, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2495800"
msgid "Yeah, I don't want to."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2495824"
msgid "I'm okay with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495844"
msgid "S-see? Doesn't wanna do it.\n…#[he][she]# said #[he][she]# doesn't wanna do it.\nThis strategy won't hold up. Mentally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2495964"
msgid "It'll be fine, it's just pretend, after all.\nDon't worry. The #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF will attack just\nby you being together with #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496124"
msgid "I can't NOT worry! Who knows how sick\nin the head that Oppai Monster is!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496200"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF sure has a sharp tongue,\nbut deep down, she's kind.\nShe's helped me out several times."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496312"
msgid "More importantly, being together is no big deal.\nIt sounds fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496376"
msgid "Then it's settled.\nPlease don't worry, Miss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496448"
msgid "Ah, y-yeah―――\nYep, just being together, is OK,\nthat's right―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496520"
msgid "…well, I guess that's that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496552"
msgid "If #C236196003Jinako#CDEF accepted the conditions,\nthen there's no reason for me to refuse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496644"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF and I will enter the Labyrinth together\nand capture #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496752"
msgid "I enter the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496788"
msgid "Aside from #C236196003Julius#CDEF, who's off searching for #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\nwhere's #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003Gatou#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2496932"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is in the Infirmary.\nShe suddenly fainted a while ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497012"
msgid "I was concerned about her unnatural\ncoughing fit over that previous transmission,\nbut now she's feeling sick again…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497132"
msgid "…we weren't watching her closely enough.\nI don't know why that girl won't report\non the load she's under."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497240"
msgid "Though she's probably worrying about us,\nexploring the Labyrinth utilizes an immense\namount of memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497344"
msgid "When someone enters the Labyrinth―――\nthat action itself causes damage to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497444"
msgid "Also, the deeper the layers get,\nthe heavier load it is on her.\nThat alone, we can't do anything about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497548"
msgid "That's why we've been telling her to rest\nwhen she gets tired, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497620"
msgid "She prioritizes caring for us more than\nfor her key principle as an AI… her own\nself-preservation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497720"
msgid "As soon as she recovers, I'll personally\ncaution her. I'll tell her that her\nself-preservation takes precedence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497836"
msgid "That's right.\nIf #C236196003Sakura#CDEF starts to malfunction, the efficiency\nof our Labyrinth traversal will decrease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2497956"
msgid "…I haven't exactly forgotten my animosity\ntowards #C236196003Leo#CDEF for treating #C236196003Sakura#CDEF like a tool."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498076"
msgid "Though, he's not dismissing #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nBy treating #C236196003Sakura#CDEF as an AI,\nhe's showing her the most respect he can give."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498220"
msgid "For AI, to be recognized for their functionality\nand superiority is joy itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498300"
msgid "In that respect, #C236196003Leo#CDEF―out of everyone in the Student Council―\nvalues #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's \"functionality\" the most."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498440"
msgid "So that's why the weird one here is me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498480"
msgid "Being upset about how #C236196003Leo#CDEF treats her\nmakes me the weirdo in this day and age―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498580"
msgid "We can't have this. You seem to be fatigued.\nPlease get some rest yourself after this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498668"
msgid "We definitely got our \"#C000246204Memory#CDEF\" data.\n#C001246204To do it justice, we'll decompress it\nonce everyone has gathered here#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498808"
msgid "? Why would you do that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498836"
msgid "We've got our \"#C000246204Memories#CDEF,\" so shouldn't\nwe put them back where they belong right now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2498940"
msgid "We can't do that. First, the preparations will\ntake some time. We also need #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's help,\nso there's no doing it right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2499084"
msgid "The other point to consider is that\n\"originally, we were mutual enemies.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2499160"
msgid "Once we return to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, we'll\nbecome rivals, denying each other.\nIn reality, we were already rivals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2499292"
msgid "Thus―――the moment our \"#C000246204Memories#CDEF\" return,\nwe won't know what kind of a fight may break\nout. Of course, we may also kill each other."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2499444"
msgid "In order to avoid that,\nwe'll return our #C000246204Memories#CDEF with everyone here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2499532"
msgid "Even if some of us are especially hostile\nto someone else, the surrounding\noutsiders will make fighting difficult."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2499648"
msgid "With our #C000246204Memories#CDEF restored,\neveryone will be on the same playing field,\nso it's less likely arguments will arise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2499780"
msgid "So long as the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is a fair fight,\nwe, too, should play fair here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2499876"
msgid "It wouldn't be very fair if one\nperson didn't get their #C000246204Memories#CDEF back,\nand if only one person gets their #C000246204Memories#CDEF back,\nour group cohesion will end up falling apart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500076"
msgid "For example, like what happened with #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500148"
msgid "She probably acted hastily\nand recovered her \"#C000246204Memories#CDEF\" already."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500232"
msgid "That's all for now. After a night's rest, we'll\nstart things off by eliminating #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF.\nWe'll decompress our \"#C000246204Memories#CDEF\" after."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500396"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. We'll go ahead and let #C236196003Kiara#CDEF know,\nso after you get some sleep, please\nhead to the Labyrinth's Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500540"
msgid "…that reminds me, you still haven't finished\nrecovering the cube, have you? It was laying\non the Labyrinth's ninth floor, was it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500672"
msgid "The cube's analysis will be related to\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF. To increase your chances of success,\nI'd like to look at it before you battle…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500820"
msgid "Pretty much every Master is gathered\nin the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500888"
msgid "I'm sure you're tired, but I went and called\nyou because we'll be unsealing\nour memories shortly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2500988"
msgid "I greet the concerned #C236196003Leo#CDEF, saying \"I'm fine.\"\nThen I observe everyone again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501084"
msgid "Hmm, the mood here is quite taut. And I am\nexpectedly silent. By the way, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF.\nIs breakfast ready yet?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501216"
msgid "We had forgotten these memories.\nObviously these guys are nervous, wondering what truths\nwere taken away from us by #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501352"
msgid "Among them, I suddenly sensed #C236196003Julius#CDEF\nlooking at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501420"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF seems to feel responsible for\nwhat happened to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501516"
msgid "I'll take any reprimandings and investigate\ninto what went wrong.\nYou did a fine job, brother."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501612"
msgid "Perhaps relieved by #C236196003Leo#CDEF's words,\n#C236196003Julius#CDEF slightly smiles."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501704"
msgid "…but, it's a little strange.\nJust now, the smile formed from\nthe lifted creases of his mouth\nwasn't one of joy, but more like―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501840"
msgid "…hey, are you alright, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF?\nYour face and hair are as pale as weeds.\nYou're not going to hurl, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2501964"
msgid "I'm not scared or anything! I just don't like\ngetting outdone by you guys!\nC'mon, let's get this over with already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502080"
msgid "Your knees are shaking, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF.\nYour bluff breeds fear all the more.\nBe like me, standing calmly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502196"
msgid "Nay, my mind is just a tad scrambled, is all.\nBy the way, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF,\nhow do you feel about scrambled eggs?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502324"
msgid "Thanks to #C236196003Rin#CDEF's loquacity, the mood in\nthe Student Council Room eased up a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502424"
msgid "The same thought hangs over all of us;\nwe're each afraid of what our \"forgotten\" memories\nwill be like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502528"
msgid "However, we can't stay afraid forever.\nAll the more if there are clues in them\nto help us figure out the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502640"
msgid "I fully understand. I think decrypting\nthese memories will be simple.\nI'll take care of any problems afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502756"
msgid "If we find a bug preventing a solid unity\nbetween the fleeting memories you cultivated\nhere with your recovered memories…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502880"
msgid "It's no big deal.\nEveryone more or less has two sides\nto their personality, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2502960"
msgid "I'm me.\nWhichever personality comes out,\nI'll swallow it right up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503028"
msgid "A very typical decisiveness out of #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503084"
msgid "…though I can see a bit of the same\ndesperation as when her #C000246204SG#CDEF was exposed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503180"
msgid "―――Very well, the #RUBS   Operation#RUBEdecryption#REND will begin.\nEveryone, please remain as calm as possible.\nPlease don't resist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503320"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's voice sounds firmer than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503380"
msgid "In that instant―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503404"
msgid "#C080080080The seal's release finished quickly, far too abruptly.\nI instinctively threw my guard up, despite feeling\nno pain or shock.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503544"
msgid "#C080080080The only thing was that my thoughts were sluggish,\nas if my brain had went numb.\nAs if I was underwater.\nThe alacrity of my thoughts was far slower compared to what\nit normally is. #CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503744"
msgid "#C080080080The act of simply remembering my own name exerts me.\nI get the impression of diving to the bottom of a pool\nand picking up a small coin.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2503900"
msgid "#C080080080At the bottom of that pool, I can see\na mound of #RUBS    coins#RUBEfragments#REND that weren't there before.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2504028"
msgid "#C080080080Once I focus my awareness and pick from the\nbottom of my thoughts, I see one, and then another;\nTHEIR visages, the ones I had overcome, return to me.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2504196"
msgid "#C080080080They're the people I defeated.\nI recall the figures of the competitors\nI finished by my own hand,\nas if it had all happened long ago.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2504348"
msgid "#C080080080They include #RUBS    Shinji#RUBEmy friend#REND, beside me right now―#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2504436"
msgid "#C080080080The #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF#C080080080's Master―#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2504508"
msgid "#C080080080And the assassin, #C236196003Julius#CDEF#C080080080,\nwho bore animosity towards me since the preliminaries.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2504632"
msgid "#C080080080Memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF#C080080080.\nI can still only recall bits and pieces,\nbut I know for sure that I advanced to the 5th Round.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2504804"
msgid "#C080080080But that's everything.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2504844"
msgid "#C080080080I can recall my memories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF#C080080080.\nBut anything \"before that\"――\nOf the me prior to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF#C080080080;\nof the history of the #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF#C080080080,\nwho decided to join this fight;\nand of the reason why I did so――\nIt's all still removed from my memory…!#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505208"
msgid "Somehow I endure the dizziness and reassure #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505276"
msgid "Though our memories have now returned,\nnot a single person exhibits a\nsatisfied expression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505368"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, even the expressionless #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nis standing motionless, brows knitted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505496"
msgid "Well, except for one person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505528"
msgid "Enough with that howling!\nShut it, you hodgepodge of a priest!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505592"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF crumpled to his knees.\nHolding his nausea down, his breathing grows harsh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505692"
msgid "My legs rush towards him without me telling them so.\nIt surprised even me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505768"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF looked at me, startled.\nFrom his gaze I feel a twinge―――of fear and despair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505872"
msgid "…the last update in my memories\nstops after the 5th Round's battle.\nDid everyone else have the same experience?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2505988"
msgid "…it feels the same for me.\nThough it's hard to tell if it stops\nbefore the battle or after."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506084"
msgid "I'm in a similar state…\nalthough my memories of the 3rd Round are hazy,\nI can clearly verify each and every part."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506200"
msgid "…it appears so. The only thing I can\nremember is who I fought against\nand who I defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506292"
msgid "…I also have memories only up until\nthe 5th Round. I faced off against―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506372"
msgid "\"Who was #C236196003Julius#CDEF' opponent in the 5th Round?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506436"
msgid "…his stare alone served as plenty an answer to that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506492"
msgid "―――I see.\nAnd the result was?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506528"
msgid "Sorry, but it's not coming back to me.\nWhat about you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nYou remember our battle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506632"
msgid "I shake my head negative.\nAll I can remember is that I did end up fighting #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506732"
msgid "…according to my memories,\nsomething went on between us since the 1st Round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2506812"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF was hostile to #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nAll I remember is that he detested me\nfrom the very beginning to the very end,\nconsidering me to be a threat to #C236196003Leo#CDEF that\nmust be eliminated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507040"
msgid "…well, I'm stumped. I speculated that these\nsealed memories concealed #C236196003BB#CDEF's secrets\nor weaknesses, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507164"
msgid "It was all just simply out of\nconcern, to ensure the welfare of our\nrelationships, it seems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507260"
msgid "Who fought who in the Near Side's\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF? Who was our enemy,\nwho did we wish to kill?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507372"
msgid "Indeed, if we had such memories,\nthere's no way we would've helped one another.\nNo, we may've even started killing each other."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507500"
msgid "I don't know what the intention was,\nbut I think that's how we have to interpret it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507588"
msgid "Unless, is there someone who remembers\nsomething else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507644"
msgid "If anyone here recalls a secret of #C236196003BB#CDEF's,\nor some inconvenient truth,\nthen please raise your hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507760"
msgid "Everyone is equally silent.\nThat's because all they know is\n\"what happened to me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507844"
msgid "There's nothing I can do even after\ngetting these damn memories back!\nI would've been happier if I forgot this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2507956"
msgid "Ah―――ah, ahhh DAMN!\nWho the hell wanted you to do this!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508016"
msgid "What do we do!?\nWhat are we supposed to do now!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508068"
msgid "His eyes are sunk, cheeks drooping, hair disheveled.\nHis shock is so great, he's falling apart…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508168"
msgid "I should at least say something―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2508208"
msgid "What did you remember, Shinji?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2508240"
msgid "You're gonna torment your hair off, Shinji."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508284"
msgid "T-there's only one thing it could be:\nthe 6th… no, I remembered the heroic sight\nof me advancing to the 5th Round!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508400"
msgid "Nothing's gonna fall off!\nI'm the hairiest guy here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508456"
msgid "Going bald is what old people do!\nIt doesn't apply to a kid like me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508528"
msgid "You're just telling me to suck it up!? You\ndon't how bitter this is for me! Ignoring that\nand getting all annoyed is terrifying, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508664"
msgid "Dammit……\ndammit, dammit, dammit……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508704"
msgid "Talking to him now would hurt more than help.\nAll I can do is leave him be for a while…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508796"
msgid "…something kind of bothers me, though…\nIt feels like my opponent in the 3rd Round\nand the following 6th Round went two ways…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508924"
msgid "Two ways?\nDid you fight two people at once at some point?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2508984"
msgid "No, that's not what I mean.\nIt feels like there were two patterns.\nFor example, my next opponent―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2509088"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF spoke up to that point,\nthen suddenly fell silent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2509160"
msgid "…for a single instant,\nit was almost like I felt her\nglance towards me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2509236"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nIf you can't get your thoughts #RUBS defragged#RUBEin order#REND,\nthen let's have #C236196003Sakura#CDEF take a look at you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2509392"
msgid "No need to worry yourself. Thanks. It doesn't\nseem like we have the time to poke holes\ncomparing every little detail, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2509520"
msgid "Something inconvenient for you?\nAh, I apologize. Please don't scowl.\nYou're thinking about #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2509644"
msgid "Even if we can't recall other people's\n#RUBS     records #RUBEcombat feats#REND, I would definitely be able to\nremember everyone I passed by in the halls."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2509800"
msgid "Yet, I didn't meet #C236196003Jinako#CDEF a single time.\nHow about the other members here? Anyone ever\nsee #C236196003Jinako#CDEF in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2509972"
msgid "Everyone identically shakes their head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510012"
msgid "…now that she mentions it, it is strange.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is one of the Masters who joined\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, too.\nHow, among this many Masters,\ndid no one see her \"even once\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510216"
msgid "…well, that girl IS sketchy as can be.\nI guess we'll just have to ask her in person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510304"
msgid "If only we could just get the slightest\nbit of information on #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510392"
msgid "At that same moment―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510420"
msgid "Is your fruitless discussion #RUBS  sweet#RUBEfun#REND?\nNaturally it's #ROFS0002#RUBS   sweet#RUBEpleasant#REND!\nOf course it's #ROFS0004#RUBS    sweet#RUBEdelightful#REND鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510596"
msgid "Our voices immediately cut out.\nLike a goldfish in a bowl,\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's mouth repeatedly flaps open and shut."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510720"
msgid "It was something we half-expected―――\na large-scale hack by #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510804"
msgid "The Student Council collectively sighs,\ndispleased by the nonsensical meddling,\nand keeps quiet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2510904"
msgid "Please have yourselves an eternal blast during\nthis sweet yet bitter #RUBS        moratorium #RUBEafter-school time#REND!\n#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF, start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511064"
msgid "As always, sitting through #RUBS     Violence Program Hour#RUBEthis BB time slot#REND\nis rougher than holding your breath for a while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511200"
msgid "Ah, but #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF doesn't\nseem to feel so bad about that, does #[he][she]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511292"
msgid "I pretty much get #[his][her]# sense of humor now.\nIf one is going to be suppressed, then they\nmay as well be comfortable doing it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511424"
msgid "…you optimistically approve of everything,\nbut will reject anything if it's useless…\nIncredible, #C236196003Leo#CDEF. Nothing gets to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511568"
msgid "Thank you very much. Despite who I am, if\n#[he][she]# were to pursue an exclusivity agreement\nwith #C000246204BB Channel#CDEF, I might just flip out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511720"
msgid "Did everyone make it out alright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511756"
msgid "Everyone else was like a spectator,\nbut I was a guest invited on to the stage\nand made to partake in the absurdity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511872"
msgid "I'm completely worn out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2511900"
msgid "…no surprise. Honestly, I can sympathize.\nIf it were me up there, I definitely\nwould've high-kicked her in the face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2512020"
msgid "But I'm sure at that moment, she would make an\nexample of me by pausing me, then spinning the\ncamera all crazy… #C236196003BB#CDEF… She scares me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2512172"
msgid "No, that wouldn't be the end of it.\nAfter, she'd play secret footage from when I\nwas made into a Labyrinth…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2512284"
msgid "I would die if that happened. Would I quietly\nretire? Maybe the only choice would be to become\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's lackey and destroy everything…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2512432"
msgid "If the Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF from back when she was a\n#RUBS knee-sockciety#RUBEdomineering#REND-psyched boss stood before this\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, I'm sure she would lose it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2512624"
msgid "Even when viewed objectively, it's cruel.\nOne could certainly call it a \"Maiden's Hell.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2512716"
msgid "Alright now, let's calm down, you two.\nAs members of the Student Council,\nwe should be intellectuals about this, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2512836"
msgid "Anyway, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is our focus right now.\nUnlike with the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF, our goal this time\nis not to defeat her, but rescue her――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2512996"
msgid "…one moment.\nWhere is #C236196003Chief Gatou#CDEF?\nDo you happen to know, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2513096"
msgid "Huh?\n…as soon as that guy was freed from #C236196003BB#CDEF's hack,\nhe flew out of the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2513208"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF―he couldn't have gone alone to the Labyrinth again!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2513284"
msgid "Explore the Labyrinth as well, but please\nbe somewhat prompt in protecting #C236196003Chief Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2513388"
msgid "I believe that creature could likely fend for\nhimself fine… but we have no choice. He's a\nmember of the Student Council, like us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2513520"
msgid "Well, knowing #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, he should be okay.\nIf it were #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, that would be one thing,\nbut our opponent this time is #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2513696"
msgid "Don't bother rushing things,\nplease make exploring the Labyrinth\nyour main priority."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2513784"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF… Everyone is clearly worried about him,\nso why are they AGAIN disrespecting him…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2513892"
msgid "At any rate, #C000246204let's head to the Labyrinth#CDEF.\nUnlike the rest of the staff here,\nI have to take this seriously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2514016"
msgid "Good morning. You're looking a little on the\npale side today. Shall we put on some\nblack tea to settle you out?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2514128"
msgid "If I may, #C236196003Leo#CDEF. #C236196003Julius#CDEF is currently elsewhere.\nUtilizing Lady #C236196003Rin#CDEF's capacities may induce\nthe opposite effect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2514288"
msgid "On the other hand, Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's chai tea is not\nfor everyone. I believe it would be wise\nto refrain from black tea this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2514432"
msgid "I like #C236196003Rani#CDEF's sugar-packed milk tea though.\nHowever, it does seem likely that it'll\ncause heartburn with how strong it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2514572"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. We'll leave the black tea for\nanother time. Come now, let's be hopeful that\nwe'll get another chance for a tea party."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2514716"
msgid "Our president's got nerves of steel, doesn't he?\nHe can't give up feeling playful,\nbecause \"this isn't the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2514856"
msgid "Compared to the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's\ndisposition is mild. I think #C236196003President Leo#CDEF\nis judging this correctly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2515020"
msgid "However, regarding the properties of an #C000246204SG#CDEF,\nthere's no difference between\nthose of an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF and a NEET."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2515160"
msgid "You have a point. A [#C000246204Compulsive Liar#CDEF] #C000246204SG#CDEF…\nWe have yet to encounter a type like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2515280"
msgid "Although, I honestly can't comprehend what #C000246204SGs#CDEF\nactually ARE. There's such a variety of them.\nDo all you women have them?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2515420"
msgid "…excuse me. I don't know or WANT to know what\nyou mean by \"you women,\" but asking that\nis poor etiquette, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2515560"
msgid "My apologies, you're right. By not only\nrevealing women's secrets but also evaluating\nthem, I'll get complaints from women's groups."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2515696"
msgid "I really REALLY doubt that.\nPeople like you go around practically\nwearing fairness and justice on your backs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2515808"
msgid "Even I've done things such as fake\nattendance of my lessons from time to time.\nWhen I DO cheat, I'm efficient at it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2515928"
msgid "At any rate, it's good that we cleared a floor.\nThough now we'll need to really\nlook around to get to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's #C000246204SGs#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516080"
msgid "She IS a #C000246204Compulsive Liar#CDEF.\nThe best thing to do may be to forget about\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF as we knew her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516208"
msgid "Doesn't this bring into question the\ncredibility of the information #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF\nprovided to us before?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516332"
msgid "That's true. Its a good idea to reexamine it.\nConsidering her #C000246204SG#CDEF, her personal information\nshould be a top priority."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516468"
msgid "Well then―――#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF. \nPlease keep up the good work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516564"
msgid "I reply to #C236196003Leo#CDEF with a nod and say, \"Leave it to us.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516636"
msgid "…wait. Putting that aside for a second,\nI haven't seen #C236196003Sakura#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516720"
msgid "Huh? You're right, where did she go?\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, do you know what happened to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516832"
msgid "…I apologize.\nI also became aware of it just now.\nI was too focused on my work…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2516916"
msgid "No matter where she moves to, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF would\nbe sure to say something to us. She might not\nbe in sight, but maybe she's in this room…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517068"
msgid "I feel the same way. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF wouldn't leave\nthe room without saying anything.\nWhat do you think, #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517204"
msgid "Oh, yes. She fainted not too long ago,\nso I ordered her to rest in the Infirmary.\nI told her to come back in an hour."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517324"
msgid "Wha―why are you so nonchalant,\nkeeping quiet about something so important!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517400"
msgid "I agree with Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. As much as you\nhave no prejudice against AI, you occasionally\nact more mechanical than one, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517568"
msgid "What's with you today?\nDid a couple of screws come loose, #C236196003Leo#CDEF?\nMaybe you're the one who needs black tea?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517692"
msgid "It appears that way.\nI'm all blunders this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517744"
msgid "Due to witnessing everyone's #C000246204SGs#CDEF,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF may have been overwhelmed by\nthe complexity of the mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517876"
msgid "And now she's finally awake,\nso please don't worry.\nShe'll be focusing harder from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2517968"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, I'll leave #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in your care.\nIf you have the time, please go check\nup on how she's doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2518104"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF's investigative work\nhas identified important information\nrelated to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2518252"
msgid "Specifically, details about her in the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. Not of her background on Earth,\nbut in the Near Side of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2518412"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF brings up the matter in a low tone,\ncontrasted to his usual cheerful ring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2518508"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF takes over, hand on his chin, nodding, \"hmm, yes.\"\nHe's acting completely normally, and it's a real letdown."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2518640"
msgid "Hear this! Steadily advancing through the #C000246204Holy\nGrail War#CDEF with my God, we came upon one chance\nwhere we won effortlessly―a win by default."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2518796"
msgid "This opponent that fell like, *WHAM*, right off\nthe shelf, was no other than #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nShe chose defeat, without putting up a fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2518944"
msgid "Urk! Your fury is warranted, but if you asked\na judge if they wanted to know the loser's name,\nthey'd reply that there's no need."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2519076"
msgid "There's no need to overwrite shame with shame.\nIn any case, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF and I were, by nature,\nincompatible comrades. Mhm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2519212"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Rin#CDEF supplied me with further information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2519296"
msgid "In the opening of the Near Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF discovered the #RUBSprotected#RUBElocked#REND Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2519452"
msgid "#RUBS The old school#RUBEThis school's#REND Janitor's Closet may have a different vibe,\nbut it's the very same shelter #C236196003Jinako#CDEF took before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2519608"
msgid "She hid inside the Janitor's Closet without\never taking the battlefield.\nHowever, if she were to have taken even one step\noutside that custodial room, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nwould deem her as being \"defeated\" and delete her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2519840"
msgid "Hence why #C236196003Jinako#CDEF was unable to leave\nand shut herself in the Janitor's Closet the entire time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2519952"
msgid "Still, when the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF closes…\nOnce the victor is proclaimed,\nthe school building will end up being\ncollected as a garbage object."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520108"
msgid "Naturally, the Janitor's Closet\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is hiding in will also be deleted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520200"
msgid "In other words―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520224"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF didn't die \"fighting in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\"\nbut her fate is to be deleted once the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF ends."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520384"
msgid "Panic struck #C236196003Jinako#CDEF once the\nmemory of that returned,\nand she ran away from us…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520484"
msgid "It resulted in #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF driving herself\nfurther into a corner.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF seized that opportunity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520616"
msgid "\"Returning to the Near Side only means death.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520664"
msgid "At the time when she recovered that memory,\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF must have certainly known that I,\n#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, was her original opponent…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520824"
msgid "Why does she distance herself from\nher unsolvable problem, even if it is postponed?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2520908"
msgid "Oh? Is that so? I'm sure it appears that way\nto you, Treasurer #C236196003Rani#CDEF, but that's not being\nvery human, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2521036"
msgid "―――If we declare that being swept along by\ninstinctive urges and idleness is what human\nnature is, then stray cats are quite human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2521172"
msgid "Nothing wrong with stray cats.\nThey're the ultimate lifeforms, in a sense.\nSuch gods exist too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2521268"
msgid "Suddenly, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's pained expression\nfrom when her #C000246204SG#CDEF \"#C000246204Loneliness#CDEF\" was released pops into my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2521416"
msgid "…if only I had gotten to know her\nback in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2521496"
msgid "There's no point in thinking about \"what ifs\" now,\nbut I wonder if having friends by her side\nwould've changed something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2521620"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is reporting that the twelfth floor has\nbeen activated. Once you're ready, continue your\nexploration and #C000246204SG#CDEF retrieval."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2521780"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF is the Labyrinth's #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF.\nNevertheless, she's one of our allies\nwho also desires to escape."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2521924"
msgid "We're all here.\nToday, before confronting #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF,\nthere's something we need to confirm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2522040"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, do you remember how we\nwere told in a previous briefing that no floors\nexist in the Labyrinth beyond the twelfth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2522180"
msgid "Now that he mentions it…\nIt feels like I heard about this;\nhow according to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's observations,\nsix floors were added to the Labyrinth after #C236196003Rani#CDEF was freed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2522376"
msgid "It's been six floors since #C236196003Rani#CDEF was freed,\nand now we're on the twelfth―――\nI didn't even realize it,\nbut we've cleared the entire Labyrinth…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2522540"
msgid "Yes. We've done it. You've done splendidly\nwith the exploration up to this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2522624"
msgid "I was worried that the Labyrinth was going\nto be extended before we\nreached the twelfth floor…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2522720"
msgid "The other #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF capable of becoming\na #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF is showing absolutely\nno signs of itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2522848"
msgid "Maybe it's intentional, maybe it didn't make it\nin time… I don't know what #C236196003BB#CDEF intends, but\nthe truth is that there's only twelve floors."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523004"
msgid "Following the theory #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF formulated,\nI verified it countless times."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523116"
msgid "Everything below the 12th floor\nwe've explored is completely empty.\nNone of my#ROFS0003#RUBSresponse signals#RUBE echo pings#REND have returned."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523264"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF boastfully swells with pride."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523316"
msgid "We're an even match for #C236196003BB#CDEF. It feels like\nAchilles finally caught up to the turtle.\nHehe, it's a turtle after all…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523448"
msgid "I suppose we could say this AI is limited\nby its reliance on humanity's history―――\nassets from the past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523556"
msgid "However… That's because #C236196003BB#CDEF is sticking to her\nstance as an AI. A perfect opportunity like this\nmay not come a second time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523696"
msgid "That's why there's something we need\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, of the Student Council's General\nAffairs, to do for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523816"
msgid "After confirming that #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's Relief\nhas disappeared, we'll have you continue\nstraight to the Labyrinth's end without break."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2523968"
msgid "The Labyrinth's end goes to the Near Side. Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF can teleport you to\nthe Near Side as soon as you arrive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2524148"
msgid "I said this before, but if just one person\ngets back, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will detect an\nanomaly, and #C236196003BB#CDEF will be deleted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2524296"
msgid "Once we destroy #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Wall, #C236196003BB#CDEF will likely\npressure us with obstacles. Pawns exhausted,\nshe'll come at us with full force."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2524456"
msgid "That's why―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2524476"
msgid "After we beat #C236196003Jinako#CDEF and #C236196003Karna#CDEF,\nwe'll have to evade a panicked #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand reach the end of the Labyrinth\nby whatever means necessary―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2524660"
msgid "That's right.\nIt's the very best plan we have at present."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2524720"
msgid "If all #C236196003BB#CDEF amounted to was some mere\n\"rogue health management AI,\" then my hand\nwouldn't have been forced like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2524852"
msgid "But her thought-routine prioritizes\n\"self-preservation\" …if I consider that,\nthis is very dangerous indeed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2524964"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is an AI who will be\ndeleted if the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF finds her.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF knows this. That's why――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2525104"
msgid "Sooner or later, her priority\nwill switch to eliminating the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nSo that she survives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2525216"
msgid "―――No, it could happen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2525244"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF may be more human-like than even a human,\nbut deep down, she's an AI.\nShe performs mechanically,\ndoing whatever she can, as much as she can.\nWhich means…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2525420"
msgid "\"If I'm eventually going to be deleted by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nthen I must hijack the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF first.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2525552"
msgid "It's possible that this is an extremely\nnatural conclusion that will come to pass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2525636"
msgid "That's right. Once I heard\n\"#C236196003BB#CDEF prioritizes her self-preservation,\"\nI thought, \"this is bad.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2525748"
msgid "It doesn't seem like she realizes, but if she\njust hides out in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will catch her at some point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2525916"
msgid "So, before that happens, she'll encroach on\nthe entire #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, like the Far Side―――\nShe'll eventually hit on that as an answer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526068"
msgid "…yes.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF no longer has any obedience instructions\ntowards the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526176"
msgid "She's capturing Masters and taking in Servants\nuntil her functionality expands.\nShe'll stand up to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526320"
msgid "That's what we intend.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF will likely be formidable,\nbut he's simply #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's guard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526440"
msgid "Our eyes are on our true hurdle: #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nKeep that in mind when you break down #C236196003Jinako\nCarigiri#CDEF's Wall. Then, please defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526612"
msgid "So #C236196003Leo#CDEF says, not skipping a beat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526664"
msgid "I intended to advance on him with the best look\nof defiance I could muster,\nbut the Student Council President cheerfully ignored it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526800"
msgid "Hey… #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nI'm sure you know this already,\nbut I'll remind you just in case."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526896"
msgid "Don't miss anything with your equipment.\nDon't feel like you need to skimp out on items."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2526988"
msgid "Okay? Tha-that guy #C236196003Gatou#CDEF went out like that\ncuz he was asking for it, you know? I told him\nso many times, but he just wouldn't listen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2527140"
msgid "But you still have room for improvement,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF. If you're careless and something \nhappens, I won't be able to sleep at night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2527284"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF stares at #C236196003Rin#CDEF, who's planning\nsome things ahead, and #C236196003Rani#CDEF from the side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2527412"
msgid "I thought hard about this, but even in that\nfinal place, what's still intact are the\nworkings of her soul… her conscience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2527536"
msgid "I'll be be happy if mourning turns into the\npower to move forward.\nWell, still―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2527624"
msgid "#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF himself was the same way.\nThis is just the way it goes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2527708"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF alone is an irregular who\nmanaged to avoid that leash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2527796"
msgid "I think the reason #C236196003Gatou#CDEF wanted to help her\nwas because he felt she was naive and lost,\nbut good-natured on the inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2527932"
msgid "This is where we find out if #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF,\nthe person closest to and most unbecoming of\na saint, had his will reach #C236196003Jinako#CDEF or not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2528096"
msgid "Of course, I'll never forget my gratitude.\nOr rather, he's the kind of person I'd have to\nwish on the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF to forget about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2528244"
msgid "…humans really are complex.\nYou can't measure what's within\nwith just theories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2528328"
msgid "If things didn't come to this, never in my\nlife would I have been aware of #C236196003Gatou#CDEF's\nhuman nature."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2528444"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF smiles vaguely bitterly, then looks around the\nStudent Council and says,\n\"Did we get contact from the others?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2528576"
msgid "If you ever get forced to make a choice,\nplease don't hesitate to choose yourself\nabove all else. That is my wish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2528692"
msgid "You deserve to live more than anyone.\n#ROFS-007#RUBS      Phosphorus#RUBEMay Venus#REND, the Morning Star guide your way――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2528820"
msgid "Now then. Please head to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Relief,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. The Student Council officers will\nprepare to back you up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2528964"
msgid "Henceforth, the Tsukumihara Student Council\nlaunches its fourth action―#C000246204its last mission#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529072"
msgid "At last, it's time to return to the Near Side.\nIt's all riding on #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's\nfinal struggle…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529192"
msgid "Let's prepare immaculately this time,\nthen face off against #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529276"
msgid "As I move to leave the Student Council Room――\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF approaches the window to address the knight.\nHis words seemed concerning and stayed in my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529440"
msgid "Unconcerned, the solar knight,\nstaring at the orange-glazed grounds, answered thus:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529524"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF.\n―――Does it seem like tomorrow morning\nwill be clear skies?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529612"
msgid "…yes, #C236196003Leo#CDEF.\nI think the dark night cloud\nshall be swept away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529692"
msgid "As if breaking through, the dark and crimson\nof sunrise eventually turns into blue sky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529780"
msgid "I'm sure the wind will sweep over the hills, and\nwe'll graze the manes of our blanketed, racing\nsteeds under the foliage-filtered light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2529920"
msgid "And then we'll be ushered into castle gates\nof yore, and our long-parched throats will\nbe quenched."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530020"
msgid "I'm sure we'll celebrate the king's return,\nsee the maidens whirling as flowers do,\nand love one another as sworn friends…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530144"
msgid "Morning. Good, good. Looks like you slept well.\nYou're even looking chipper now, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530248"
msgid "Good morning. It's been 6 hours and 15 minutes.\nSlightly more than you need, but otherwise\nthe ideal time spent sleeping."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530372"
msgid "Three people have already started stirring\nwithin the Student Council Room.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, who I didn't get to see yesterday, looks well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530520"
msgid "I reply with my own greeting, \"good morning,\"\nand take my usual seat, furnished with coffee."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530616"
msgid "…the president's seat in front of me is empty.\nThe graceful smile that belongs in it has sunk\nto the bottom of the Imaginary Number Ocean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530756"
msgid "Because while his body disintegrated,\nhe said he was \"passing the torch\" to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530836"
msgid "Suddenly, I see something I'm not used to.\nThe screen is displaying something.\nIt's the Moon―――no, it seems to be Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2530960"
msgid "That's \"#C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF.\"\nIt's a simulation of a future \nwhere #C236196003BB#CDEF has unleashed humanity's desires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2531096"
msgid "It's calculating the global environment seven\ndays after this: \"what if #C236196003BB#CDEF encroaches on\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF and makes her move?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2531260"
msgid "With #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, we inferred the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF specs and\nare reproducing the influence it has. Think of\nthis as the approximate future that'll occur."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2531436"
msgid "It's easy to imagine that the conclusion\nit'll crunch up won't be anything good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2531520"
msgid "…that said, I can't make any sense of this simulator.\nI mustered up the courage to ask,\n\"What's happening, specifically?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2531644"
msgid "Or a hundred countries getting wiped off the map.\nIt's hard to get a real sense of it,\nbut the total number of deaths would be despairing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2531784"
msgid "―――I'm thoroughly reassessing the gravity of our situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2531848"
msgid "…we tried recalculating countless times. But\nthis is what it is. It's confirming that the\nfuture will accelerate to extinction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2531980"
msgid "If that happens, the wish we must obtain\nthrough fighting in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\nwill naturally lose its meaning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2532112"
msgid "It's a big responsibility… or rather,\nwe're all in the same boat here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2532184"
msgid "Yeah, I know.\nWe'll win. We'll stop #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nAnd then, we'll return to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2532304"
msgid "Yes. Let's win.\nIn the name of the Atlas Institute, by the\npride I was bestowed with by my mentor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2532404"
msgid "……that's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2532424"
msgid "Humanity, ruined by its own desires―――\nWe mustn't bring about a collapse resulting\nfrom lives being abandoned."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2532540"
msgid "Alright! With that settled, that leaves only\naction. Now I'll talk about a specific method of\nattack… #C236196003Rani#CDEF, please explain the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2532696"
msgid "Currently, #C236196003BB#CDEF has seized 90 percent\nof the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. It appears that she\nneed only assault the Core now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2532836"
msgid "Along with that, the Labyrinth has been extended\nup to an eighteenth floor. The #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF are\nunknown, but one is likely an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2533004"
msgid "The Labyrinth was extended by six floors.\nThat should require two #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF,\nbut I can't think of any candidates either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2533144"
msgid "Still, this is how it always is.\nWhoever our opponent is, we have to crush them\nand progress through the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2533260"
msgid "You sure are the pro of winging it.\nLooks like you're on board.\n…we're counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2533352"
msgid "…may I add something? Although the outcome\nof #C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF is a problem, I'm also\ncurious about #C236196003BB#CDEF's state from this point on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2533516"
msgid "She reached the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's Core\nand will likely soon merge with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nIt's unlike what she's encroached on before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2533676"
msgid "Once her measurement / processing circuitry and\nevaluation systems are equal to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's,\nwill #C236196003BB#CDEF's thought-routine remain normal?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2533848"
msgid "Supposing it even does,\nit's evident that the reference for\nher personality will be overwritten."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2533948"
msgid "She can exist as she is if she only rules\nover the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nBut once she becomes the entire #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534100"
msgid "The hell?\nAre you saying there's a high probability of #C236196003BB#CDEF\ndestroying herself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534196"
msgid "For the time being. However, she can't stop\nthe program she's begun. Whether she's aware\nor not, her situation remains the same."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534328"
msgid "…either way, if we don't stop her before she\ngets to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF,\nwe're in big trouble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534444"
msgid "Correct. So, we'll have #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF\ncontinue exploring the Labyrin――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534540"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF turn their faces away,\navoiding eye contact with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534640"
msgid "So hey, I have something to ask you two…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534684"
msgid "I don't remember anything, got it!?\nI don't know anything about her secrets, okay!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534768"
msgid "Well, anything that could at least give a hint―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534824"
msgid "It feels like quite some time has passed since then,\nbut to these two, their time as #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF is a dark past\nthat must never be mentioned."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2534980"
msgid "Let sleeping dogs lie or whatever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2535016"
msgid "I must never talk about stuff\nlike #C000246204Money Worship#CDEF or #C000246204Habit of Exposure#CDEF. Ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2535128"
msgid "Well, we honestly don't know. Sorry we can't be\nof any more help. You'll just have to collect\nthe #C000246204SGs#CDEF the same way you've been doing it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2535284"
msgid "We'll manage somehow, with us three as backup.\nTruth be told, it hurts not having #C236196003Leo#CDEF here…\nbut we can do it, right? #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2535464"
msgid "Of course. I promise I'll continue\noffering you perfect support, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2535568"
msgid "Yes. Backing you up may be the only thing I\ncan do, but I'll do my very best at it as well!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2535660"
msgid "I don't expect that it'll be easy to\ncover for #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2535756"
msgid "Alright then. We'll start preparing too.\nWe've got a ton of tasks to get done…\nI'd even ask #C236196003Jinako#CDEF and #C236196003Shinji#CDEF for help."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2535912"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF, at this point…\nAlso now that you mention it, I have yet to\nsee #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF around today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536052"
msgid "Whatever. Not like he'll be useful, anyway.\nWE'VE got the most reliable chance of finishing\nthis! …#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, another cup of coffee."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536200"
msgid "As soon as you've finished preparing,\nplease continue to the thirteenth floor\nof the Labyrinth, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536332"
msgid "I reply, \"understood,\" then rise from my seat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536380"
msgid "We may be acquainted with our opponent, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\nbut the inside of the Labyrinth demands caution.\nWe need to shift gears and take our exploration head-on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536556"
msgid "―――I suddenly feel eyes on me, so I lift my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536612"
msgid "The three of them are staring at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536652"
msgid "The new president――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536676"
msgid "It's a bit of an embarrassing position for ME to take,\nand one of great responsibility."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536764"
msgid "…but that's precisely why I have to move forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536816"
msgid "No matter if I'm a coward or if I'm reckless―――\nMoving forward is the principle #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\nsticks to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2536944"
msgid "I turn to face each person and give each a solid nod."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537000"
msgid "I guess #C236196003Rin#CDEF and the others found something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537060"
msgid "\"Me too…\"\nI place the invitation I just picked up on the desk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537124"
msgid "I see. I knew you might get something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537164"
msgid "This confirms it. All that remains is to wish\n#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF luck in #[his][her]# endeavor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537276"
msgid "It'll all make sense quicker if you see it for\nyourself rather than have us explain.\n…#C236196003Rani#CDEF, can you take it from here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537412"
msgid "Sure. This is surveillance camera footage we\nrecorded moments ago off the fourteenth floor\nof the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537524"
msgid "…that's a surprise. When did they set up\na surveillance camera in the Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537608"
msgid "Don't sweat the little details.\nC'mon, it's going to start playing, so take\na seat somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537704"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF stops the footage there.\nThree faintly pitying smiles simultaneously\nturn towards me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537812"
msgid "No way. I don't want something messed up to happen to me,\nlike my stomach exploding…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2537900"
msgid "Well, all the better if you can get by without\neating. If you actually do get charmed, we'll be\nin big trouble. Probably won't happen though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538044"
msgid "That's a given.\nAnd I'd really prefer if you don't talk like\nI'm always dumpster diving.\nI do it sometimes… but only sometimes…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538176"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF timidly hands out to me some\ncherry blossom-brand stomach medicine.\n―――Her kindness brings a tear to my eye."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538312"
msgid "Now then, make your preparations.\nYour goal today is to clear the 14th floor of\nthe Labyrinth. We're counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538432"
msgid "I see #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF here in the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538520"
msgid "…although it concerns me that I don't see #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nthere's something I need to report."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538624"
msgid "When #C236196003Rin#CDEF does a check, she always catches something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538696"
msgid "I place the invitation I just picked up on the desk\nand explain the deal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538772"
msgid "…a \"dinner party,\" hm.\n#C236196003Elizabeth Báthory#CDEF was apparently educated\nin alchemy, according to her legend…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538892"
msgid "…I think there probably are too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2538928"
msgid "Even if the food she puts out for me looks amazing,\nI'll have to muster up an iron will and push it away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2539036"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF? She's presently deallocating in the\nInfirmary. She's amassed unneeded data, so we\nrequested that she clear her internal memory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2539188"
msgid "We want her to take a break, even if just\na short one. That girl won't rest unless\nwe ask her explicitly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2539296"
msgid "…let me switch to some serious talk. While #C236196003BB#CDEF\nencroaches on the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, she's\nalso heading for the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2539476"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's personal values are now becoming the norm\nof the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nThat's why―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2539604"
msgid "You've noticed how many times #C236196003Sakura#CDEF has\nfainted so far, right? It's not because she's\noverexerting herself…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2539732"
msgid "…it's tough for me to say this. As long as\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is on our side helping us, she'll\nslowly keep breaking down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2539860"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF begged us many times to stay quiet\nabout it. \"Knowing will hold #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF\nback from fighting.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2539992"
msgid "…therefore, please continue acting in the\nsame manner as you have been, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2540092"
msgid "To #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, that would be the most effective\n\"healing\" she could ever receive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2540188"
msgid "We'd like to at least ease her mental burden.\nThat's why we have her\nresting in the Infirmary right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2540296"
msgid "We're not telling her to purely out of kindness,\nthough. While we do worry about her health,\nmaintaining her performance is more important."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2540436"
msgid "Our scans show that there's only a little more\nLabyrinth left. And that little bit will be\ndangerous, guaranteed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2540552"
msgid "A moment of carelessness or the slightest\nmisstep will be fatal… Of course, I'm \ntalking about for you, not us, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2540688"
msgid "That's why this operation will be taken on\nunder optimal conditions. Instability in\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF will create problems for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2540824"
msgid "…that letter from #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF had me wound up,\nbut this snapped me back into focus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2540924"
msgid "With every moment that passes, destruction draws nearer to us.\nThis isn't the time to be getting distracted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541036"
msgid "Exactly. Please continue directly with clearing\nthe Labyrinth. Every second we save means a\nsmaller burden on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541172"
msgid "\"You can count on me.\"\nI then leave the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541236"
msgid "…still, I'm worried about how #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541300"
msgid "Before I head to the Labyrinth,\nI'll stop by the #C000246204Infirmary#CDEF for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541388"
msgid "Welcome back. Things have gotten a little\nout of hand with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, haven't they…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541492"
msgid "In the meantime, we're re-scanning the\nLabyrinth to look for some clue we can latch\nonto. While that happens―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541608"
msgid "We've been working on two tasks for\nquite some time now:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541668"
msgid "A counter-measure against #C236196003BB#CDEF and an analysis\nof #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541760"
msgid "We have no leads on counter-measures against #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nbut we propose a way to overcome #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\n\"invincibility.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2541904"
msgid "Thus, the hypothesis is that if we discover\nwhich Servant the skill originated from,\nwe'll find a way to overcome it in due time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542036"
msgid "Yes. So first, I'll start by accessing\nthe sixteenth floor of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542116"
msgid "Since the Labyrinth itself is #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nit should be more than possible to scour\nfor her personal data."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542240"
msgid "After that, I'll take #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's structural\ndata and look within the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's libraries\nfor a goddess with the same structure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542404"
msgid "We'll find the corresponding Servant,\nthen look for a weakness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542468"
msgid "I didn't know she could pull all that off…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542512"
msgid "It's a sure-fire method, but is there any risk, I wonder?\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is nearing the point of exhaustion.\nIf something were to happen…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542660"
msgid "Thank you very much.\nHowever, I'm fine. Something like this won't\nburden me that much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542748"
msgid "…okay.\nI guess that's why they told me to come back\nto the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542832"
msgid "With that, I'll access #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nLabyrinth immediately.\n―――#C236196003Rin#CDEF. I'll send you the data."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2542960"
msgid "That's the stuff. Same model means instant\naccess. Wow… This is #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's wavelength…\nYep. Honestly, makes no sense to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2543104"
msgid "Wha-!? It makes no sense to you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2543140"
msgid "Even if we obtain the data, analyzing it using\nthe Old School's entire resources would take,\nperhaps, ten years?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2543256"
msgid "Needless to say, we don't have that much time.\nSo we're simply going to look through the\nlibrary to find a \"matching wavelength.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2543388"
msgid "Woah… quite a few.\nThere are legions of Heroic Spirits,\nbut tons of goddesses, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2543476"
msgid "Hmm. This one kind of fits, no?\nA Hawaiian goddess, #C236196003Pele#CDEF. Pretty much\ninvincible. Ah, but she's got drawbacks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2543604"
msgid "If we're talking fierce \"war goddesses\" I would\nsay goddesses of Indian legend… #C236196003Hariti#CDEF? Not\nreally. No anecdotes about invincibility."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2543756"
msgid "…actually, I don't even see anyone with an\n\"invincible\" property anywhere. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, does\nthis really belong to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2543912"
msgid "Huh…? That… that can't… I'll check one\nmore time… Nothing strange… no signs of\nanything illicit within #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544052"
msgid "No… way―――#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's \"invincibility\"\nisn't a skill? It's her legitimate privilege…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544160"
msgid "I-I'll do one more.\nThis time I'll try a deeper search!\nThat should―― Huh――? Kyaa!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544248"
msgid "That can't…! Three layers of Black ICE are\nbeing melted through almost simultaneously――\nHow is this kind of hacking possible…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544380"
msgid "Hee hee. It's not THAT big of a surprise,\nis it? I mean, you girls are the ones who came\nto ME to access my secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544500"
msgid "This voice, it's #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544552"
msgid "She can even break into the school―a safe-zone!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544604"
msgid "That's not it, please calm down…!\nThis is only the sound of her voice.\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF hasn't entered the building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544732"
msgid "Yes, you're right.\nAs vexing as it is, that area is a\nsafe-zone beyond my reach."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544816"
msgid "…well, I'm sure #C236196003Lip#CDEF would've been able to\nsmash her way in, but she's no longer with us.\nI took the offensive in my own way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2544960"
msgid "We were careless…!\nShe went through#RUBSthe Student Council's#RUBE this place's#REND channel\nand accessed #C236196003Sakura#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545096"
msgid "Yes. I was attacked first, anyway.\nYou're trying to divulge my privileges.\nObviously I would strike back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545204"
msgid "Understood. We'll execute #RUBS  cryptobiosis#RUBEdry storage#REND\nand perform both a physical and logical freeze."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545320"
msgid "It's no use.\nI've already injected her with my nectar.\nThere's no saving that woman. Or rather―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545424"
msgid "That woman belongs to me now.\nShe'll become a part of me,\njust as the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will in due time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545540"
msgid "She'll become a part of #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545596"
msgid "What does she mean by that?\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF would try to smash someone, compress them,\nthen stuff them into a \"trash bin\" cage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545736"
msgid "That means #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's ability is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545796"
msgid "My skill is #C000246204All Drain#CDEF.\nI'm the #RUBS poison#RUBEnectar#REND queen―stealing not only stats,\nbut also levels and even personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2545944"
msgid "I gave that woman some of that top of the line\nnectar. And also… hmhmhm.\nI mixed into it a very special little bee."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546064"
msgid "You need that woman's help to break through\nthe Labyrinth walls, right?\nNow you have no way forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546168"
msgid "Understand? There's no saving any of you now.\nYou've all become nothing more than data\nfor me to simply melt down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546284"
msgid "That doesn't change my objective. #C236196003#NICK#CDEF,\nI'm going to bestow unto you a perfect world.\nI'll adjust your surroundings to do so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546428"
msgid "That just leaves the peanut gallery.\nTrembling in wait will suffice―until the advent\nof my perfect gospel!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546536"
msgid "It's no use…!\nHer internals should be completely frozen,\nyet there's still some activity going on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546636"
msgid "At this rate, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF will end up absorbing\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's consciousness…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546744"
msgid "Her consciousness will be absorbed…!\nThat means she'll be brainwashed―no.\nHer personality itself will be stolen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546860"
msgid "And if she falls into #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's hands,\nour defeat will automatically be assured."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2546960"
msgid "Because without #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's support,\nwe can't proceed through the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2547052"
msgid "…although, this time the stakes are way\nhigher. But I'll protect #C236196003Sakura#CDEF for as long\nas I possibly can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2547172"
msgid "There is hope. For all things related to\nhacking Spirtronized Cyber Frames,\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF should have some information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2547312"
msgid "It's fortunate that we investigated her\nbackground earlier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2547372"
msgid "It seems that when she was in the order of the\nShingon Tachikawa Eiten school, she had\ndeveloped a certain Code Cast:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2547492"
msgid "As she was sickly by nature, to treat herself\nshe researched an esoteric Buddhist practice\nand awakened it―\"#RUBS  Ten-thousand Colored Stagnation#RUBE#C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF#REND.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2547696"
msgid "…that's the reason why INTERPOL went after\n#C236196003Kiara#CDEF. It's now considered the greatest taboo\nin all of cybercrime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2547824"
msgid "Yes. It's a forbidden Code Cast which invades a\nperson's cyberbrain to communicate and control\nthem at will. We have a chance if we use it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2547964"
msgid "The #RUBS  Ten-thousand Colored Stagnation#RUBE#C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF#REND………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548064"
msgid "I can't wrap my head around how it works yet,\nbut it sounds like we need #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's help to save #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548200"
msgid "I need to meet with #C000246204Kiara#CDEF as soon as\npossible to discuss the situation…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548292"
msgid "…after the sensation of being brought back\nby an intense force subsides,\nI find myself back in the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548416"
msgid "I try moving my fingers.\nThey're stiff, but they move."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548472"
msgid "Thank goodness… you appear to have\nsuffered no harm. Welcome back, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548576"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF carried #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to the Infirmary\nand is overseeing the internal cleaning's\nprogress. Moreover―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548720"
msgid "Ooooh… is this…\nThe Student Council Room…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548768"
msgid "I supplied him with our reserve resources.\nIt was a rushed job, but I restored him\nto his original form."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548876"
msgid "I have a message to you from Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF:\n\"I'll postpone your scolding,\nso get some good rest.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2548992"
msgid "………hmph.\nGetting all serious about other people's\nbusiness. She really is dumb too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549080"
msgid "…if you're going to complain,\nthen you should've left me behind.\nI'm fine, just leave me alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549180"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, appearing to be brooding,\nleaves the Student Council Room without looking back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549284"
msgid "…I wonder if my delivery was bad.\nI don't think the contents of the message\nwere bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549372"
msgid "No, #C236196003Rani#CDEF did nothing wrong,\nso there's no need for her to worry.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF probably has a lot on his mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549508"
msgid "In any case, I saved both #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003Shinji#CDEF.\nI'm glad I was able to protect my friends' lives.\nI'm glad I was able to bring them back safe and sound."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549692"
msgid "―――These sincere thoughts cross my mind\nwhile #C236196003Rani#CDEF stares at me, puzzled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549788"
msgid "The moment I sigh in relief,\na heavy dizziness assails me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549848"
msgid "With my tension broken,\nthe fatigue that had built up seems\nto have caught up with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2549936"
msgid "It seems that a foray into a digital frame\nburdens one's Self more than forays\ninto the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550036"
msgid "It's pathetic to say, but that seems to be for the best.\nI leave the Student Council's business to\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF and head towards My Room to get some sleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550200"
msgid "The air has never been so tense\nthroughout the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550272"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF is expressionless―as usual―but her\nlips are shut tighter than normal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550368"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550400"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF may be operating like well-oiled assistants,\nbut I clearly see fatigue in her face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550532"
msgid "Oh, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. You're up early.\nWould you like to have a briefing, or maybe\nhave yourself a relaxing time farming exp?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550664"
msgid "…the cat is out of the bag, huh?\nWell, no point in hiding it. The #C000246204Seven Days\nLater#CDEF numbers have gone up again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550792"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF says, then sends the simulator's results to the terminal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2550872"
msgid "#C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF:\nA simulator for what will happen when #C236196003BB#CDEF\nreaches the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF and liberates\nhumanity from reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551044"
msgid "The number of people who will commit suicide has reached 60%."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551108"
msgid "Don't worry, there's still enough people.\nWild animals may head slowly towards extinction\nwhen their population drops to half,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551236"
msgid "but humans are higher lifeforms. It would\nbe difficult to maintain the same standard of\ncivilization, but it won't end in extinction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551372"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF explains it in such a way as to not cause worry,\nbut it's hard to find any peace of mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551484"
msgid "60%.\nThe prediction says that for every two people, one will die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551552"
msgid "Take a step with your left foot or right foot―\nOne of them means a neighbor loses their life―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551652"
msgid "Pay it no mind, Praetor.\nIt's a simulation and nothing more. In any case,\neverything will be sorted out if we stop #C236196003BB#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551788"
msgid "This is merely a thought experiment.\nAren't #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF being a little too anxious?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551908"
msgid "It's no reality to be optimistic about,\nthat's for sure. But it's just a simulation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2551996"
msgid "I don't think people can become\nTHAT reckless, though.\nHmm. #C236196003Dark Sakura#CDEF is nothing to scoff at."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552108"
msgid "But you know, this is purely conjecture.\nIf we defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF, no harm will come to\neven a single person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552228"
msgid "I approve of a \"world challenging for humans,\"\nbut a \"world where humans destroy themselves\" is\nof no interest to me. Not worth my judgement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552372"
msgid "Well, the matter will be settled if you defeat\nthat AI. A future that will never come is\nbut a castle in the air."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552488"
msgid "…………\nI have some information related to the\nsimulation, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552576"
msgid "Wait, #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nIt hasn't been confirmed yet.\nKeep it quiet for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552660"
msgid "………you're right.\nIt only amounts to a possibility.\nPlease forget I said anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552748"
msgid "This is weird.\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF were looking composed,\nbut now I see in them the gloom of anguish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552876"
msgid "…?\nI was aware of that from the beginning…\nBut the moment I said so, \nan indescribable chill ran down my spine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2552992"
msgid "What's the meaning behind the subtle\ndifference in their nuances…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553060"
msgid "By the way, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nHow is the analysis coming along?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553136"
msgid "Only you are capable of taking\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's place.\nPlease focus on that for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553240"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. I know.\nI'm studying up on it right now, but I'll make \nit in time no matter what it takes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553344"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF is taking #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's place…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553408"
msgid "But now that they mention it, it's an important role.\nSo long as #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is around,\nwe'll have to \"go into someone's heart\" at least one more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553576"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF are better than me at converting\nnumbers, but they struggle with the\ninconsistencies emotions have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553724"
msgid "When we graph out thoughts and the\namplitude spikes, they stumble―literally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553804"
msgid "When we talk about romantic relationships,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF flushes bright red and freezes.\nShe's like a schoolgirl reading a dictionary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2553948"
msgid "I-I'm ashamed to admit it…\nI'm sorry for not being useful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554012"
msgid "Looks like I can clear it when things gets\nfuzzy like that. That makes me the best\ncandidate for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554128"
msgid "Converting the quasi-Spiritrons already half\ninside a metaphysical form to be more Spiritron-\nlike, and sending that form into the mind…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554268"
msgid "Heh heh heh… If I can master this,\nmy payback for having my mind peeked into\nthat one time can be realized…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554380"
msgid "I just felt a chill, but I'll say I just imagined it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554436"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's wicked plot aside, it's promising to hear\nthat our preparations to take on #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF are coming along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554580"
msgid "Three floors remain.\nThis enemy is the most ruthless and powerful thus far:\nthe #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554716"
msgid "If #C236196003BB#CDEF is the threat of an unreal cataclysm,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is like the very real bloodlust of a drawn blade."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554856"
msgid "We have to face her with the best lineup we can muster;\nkeep racing forwards in the face of death; and―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2554968"
msgid "…it's more like a headache then freezing…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555012"
msgid "Really, at this stage of the game…?\nOh come on, even #C236196003BB#CDEF must've gotten the memo by now…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555120"
msgid "The signal jack ends, and my regular sight returns."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555172"
msgid "There was a weird interval near the end there,\nbut #C236196003BB#CDEF was her usual self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555264"
msgid "…it didn't feel like that to me.\nThat footage was actually recorded this time.\nShe may be pressed for time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555376"
msgid "You think so? She wasn't tormenting\nyou very much this time, Darling.\n…hmm. Maybe she wasn't feeling well?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555484"
msgid "She was candid. I see she used up her reserve\npower to approach the Core. She may end up being\nthe one self-destructing, not humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555620"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF mumbles something ominous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555668"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF was acting differently than she has been…?\nThe moment I thought \"that's nonsense,\" I became astonished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555792"
msgid "…what's wrong with me? THAT'S the nonsense here.\nI can't believe I just had even the tiniest concern for #C236196003BB#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2555920"
msgid "We're at the final phase. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Can you\npredict how long it'll take for #C236196003BB#CDEF to break down\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF's barrier?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2556092"
msgid "…I don't know. The barrier which\nleads to the Core is in the theoretically\n\"unreachable\" category."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2556192"
msgid "Only the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF can open that barrier, but #C236196003BB#CDEF\noccupied the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF and gained the\nsame amount of resources to calculate with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2556384"
msgid "…it'll be decided in an instant. If the\nbalance of power leans towards #C236196003BB#CDEF in the\nslightest, the defenses will be broken."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2556524"
msgid "…yes. Presently, the Core's barrier hasn't\ntaken even 1% damage.\nEven #C236196003BB#CDEF must be getting discouraged."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2556644"
msgid "…which means we have a chance.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF was talking herself up, but leaving things\nto #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is proof that she's desperate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2556800"
msgid "Yes. Even if she created a route connecting\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF to the Central Region,\nshe can't enter if the barrier's still there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2556952"
msgid "Breaking down barriers is harder than expanding\nthe Labyrinth… I want to believe we still\nhave an extended window of time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2557076"
msgid "OK. Both sides are desperate.\nOr at least, that means we don't have\ntime to sit here and chat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2557172"
msgid "We'll let you know when we have countermeasures\nto deal with #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF's #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF.\nWe're looking into it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2557336"
msgid "Just focus on clearing the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF. Start with the 15th floor,\nat #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's Shield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2557488"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF will be#ROFS-003#RUBSquantumly observing#RUBE monitoring#REND to prevent\nessence dissolution. I'll be analyzing the\ninner structure, navigating, and jamming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2557672"
msgid "The three of us can only guarantee 40% safety,\nbut we're using everything we have.\nPlease be careful out there, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2557812"
msgid "Good job. We'll get right to\nanalyzing the data you just obtained."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2557880"
msgid "You did well too, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Since #C236196003#NICK#CDEF\nis back, you can turn down the map output.\nYou must be tired, as wel―――#C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558052"
msgid "Transfer complete. I sent #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to the\nInfirmary. The question is whether she'll stay\nin there and focus on restoring herself now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558200"
msgid "Geez. She held on until right before\nwe shut the system down… That girl is getting\nmore and more reckless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558308"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF was transported to the Infirmary.\nA transfer route to the Infirmary was set up thanks to #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558444"
msgid "It seems like #C236196003Rani#CDEF expected this to happen sooner or later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558520"
msgid "…but this is a problem.\nI've run out of ideas.\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, what about you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558616"
msgid "Sorry, even I'm racking my brain.\nI can't think of any more suggestions\nfor version updates."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558712"
msgid "I feel the same way.\nWe still have to rely on #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558792"
msgid "…#C236196003Rani#CDEF looks down in frustration.\nThese two have been able to mitigate #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's\ndamage so far, but that option no longer works."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2558952"
msgid "From this point on,\nif I infiltrate anything, I'll simply disintegrate―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2559032"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF care for #C236196003Sakura#CDEF from the\nbottom of their hearts.\nIt's been a while now since they became allies\nfighting alongside one another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2559224"
msgid "And I'm obviously a part of that team."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2559264"
msgid "I don't expect my visits to heal #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's damage,\nbut if it'll make #C236196003Sakura#CDEF happy, I'll drop by whenever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2559404"
msgid "Ah…\nDo you have a second before you go?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2559448"
msgid "I didn't think it was right of me to butt in―\nand since I don't have experience with this to\nbegin with, I figured I would keep quiet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2559588"
msgid "But I can't keep it in, so I'll say it. Clearing\nthe Labyrinth so many times, I came to have\na vague suspicion as to what's going on…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2559724"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, which isn't used in\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, is being taken over to\nserve as one of #C236196003BB#CDEF's faculties."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2559896"
msgid "Everything outside the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's Core\nis becoming synonymous with #C236196003BB#CDEF's body.\nI explained this before, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560040"
msgid "So that's where the problem lies.\nYou've infiltrated the Labyrinth countless\ntimes. Why have you been able to?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560152"
msgid "Even if we were to construct a gate, #C236196003BB#CDEF\nshould've made it so that intruders\nare rejected."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560260"
msgid "Since she's an AI, I'm sure it works differently\nthan it does for humans, but fundamentally, a\nbody is made to eliminate foreign matter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560400"
msgid "For #C236196003BB#CDEF to allow you in means that―\nHow should I put it…?\nUmm…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560484"
msgid "I'll give it to you straight.\nDoesn't that mean that #C236196003BB#CDEF likes you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560568"
msgid "I'll give it to you straight.\nDoesn't that mean that #C236196003BB#CDEF considers you to\nbe a close friend?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560676"
msgid "I'm not sure what to make of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560712"
msgid "And she's readjusted her glasses all formally―\nShe's got a tiger mom look on her face!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560800"
msgid "Please forget about #C236196003BB#CDEF, she's not\nimportant here. This is about #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2560904"
msgid "Your priority level with her is unusual.\nShe places more precedence on your safety\nthan she does on preserving herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561024"
msgid "Likes me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561036"
msgid "But she's an AI. An AI? Liking me in THAT way?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561084"
msgid "This is nothing more than speculation,\nbut perhaps #C236196003Sakura#CDEF feels a strong friendship…\nor has feelings of affection for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561224"
msgid "Feelings of affection…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561252"
msgid "I have plenty for her as well,\nbut that's because I'm human.\nIt's normal to be fond of allies who fight alongside you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561372"
msgid "But she's an AI.\nWhy would an AI have emotions that\nneither benefit nor hurt them…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561460"
msgid "Yes. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF has allotted more thought-space\nto you than necessary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561544"
msgid "Regardless of the fact that the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nis being encroached upon and of the amount of\nwear it imposes on her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561672"
msgid "Since I'm still learning of the subtle workings\nof the heart, I don't know what meaning\nthis has, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561776"
msgid "Hmm, are you sure? I don't think that's how\nit is with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. #C236196003BB#CDEF is definitely the\none who likes #C236196003#NICK#CDEF here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2561936"
msgid "There's no logic behind that.\nIt's contradictory to hurt the one you love.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is the one fond of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562080"
msgid "There's no contradiction. I know what\nit's like when you're interested in someone\nand just want to prod 'em a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562196"
msgid "That's unique to you, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. I say that\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is a wholesome-maiden model and has the\nsame thought-routines I do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562352"
msgid "They started to quarrel,\nputting their respective claims forward."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562420"
msgid "With no interest in stopping them,\nI silently leave the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562500"
msgid "…anyway, let's head to the #C000246204Infirmary#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562556"
msgid "Unrelated to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF's opinions,\nI need to thank #C236196003Sakura#CDEF for helping us despite her pain."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "2562700"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562748"
msgid "Welcome back.\nWe're currently hyperspeed-analyzing\nthe data you got from the #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562856"
msgid "This turned out to be an unexpected win, huh?\nWe had pretty much given up on thinking\nwe could get a hold of #C236196003BB#CDEF's data."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2562992"
msgid "That's right. Thinking in terms of efficiency,\nwe don't expect #C236196003BB#CDEF to make any\nmore personal appearances in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2563132"
msgid "Can you take a look for us, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF? You're both\nthe same model, so you should be able to tell\nin what way #C236196003BB#CDEF is illegally modded, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2563304"
msgid "Let's leave these three to their analysis.\nIf we can identify #C236196003BB#CDEF's Matrix,\nwe should be able to counter that skill of hers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2563444"
msgid "Oh yeah. If you're thinking about the simple\nMatrix, then it should already be registered\nwith you by now. Give it a good look over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2563580"
msgid "…and that's that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2563600"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF also seems to be exhausted after\nfacing off against #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF,\nso let's call it a day and head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "2563768"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2563816"
msgid "I hand #C236196003Rani#CDEF the \"memory data\" she's referring to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2563884"
msgid "It's not as if I know how to use it.\nWe need #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to look at it for us,\nlike before when we all recovered our memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564024"
msgid "It's memory data, just like before.\nHuh…?\nBut this is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564084"
msgid "…it has a different form. Rather than a stored\nitem, it's more of a prohibited item―――\nit uses #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's compression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564228"
msgid "Judging by the size,\nI think it contains one person's memories\nover the course of several months."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564328"
msgid "The contents are damaged,\nbut if we carefully decompress it,\nit should be possible to reconstruct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564428"
msgid "We'll have Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF focus on\ncountering #C236196003BB#CDEF's skill, and I'll\ntake charge of this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564548"
msgid "U-umm, #C236196003Rani#CDEF. Do we really have the time\nto spare? Maybe we should focus on\ncountermeasures against #C236196003BB#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564684"
msgid "It's not a difficult process.\nAll it'll take is some time; it won't cost\nus any labor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564772"
msgid "I wonder whose memories those are, though. If #C236196003BB#CDEF\nwas hiding them, then do they belong to someone\nshe regards as the biggest threat to her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2564928"
msgid "We won't know until it's decompressed.\nOkay, everyone. Let's return to our tasks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565012"
msgid "Once the decompression finishes,\nwe'll report to #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565088"
msgid "I enter the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565124"
msgid "Maybe the three of them are taking a little break.\nThey're away from their consoles\nand seem to be having a lighthearted chat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565252"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nYour fatigue points are in a safe region now.\nIt seems you slept well. I'm glad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565372"
msgid "Next up is Floor 17. We have decoys ready to\nuse against #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, so please just relax\nand focus on clearing the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565516"
msgid "Decoys to use against #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565568"
msgid "We have body doubles of you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWhile you're on the 17th floor, we'll have\nthese running around the other layers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565704"
msgid "I'm saying we have body doubles of #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nWhile you're on the 17th floor, we'll have\nthese running around the other layers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2565848"
msgid "I can infer from the amount of experience\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF has accumulated that she can detect\nintruders across the entire #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2566016"
msgid "Since we'll be concealing the real #SVT[you][#C236196003Archer#CDEF][you][you]#,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF will chase after the decoys first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2566160"
msgid "However…… in the case that\nshe's waiting for you on the 17th floor,\nthe decoys will prove pointless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2566264"
msgid "Let's prepare for the worst\nand confront her if that's the case.\nWe need to acquire her #C000246204SG#CDEF anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2566380"
msgid "Run if you can, and fight her 'til\nthe last moment if it comes down to it.\nGive it your best, new President of ours."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2566500"
msgid "Avoid making contact with #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF as much as possible\nand search for hints on how to defeat her\nduring our exploration of the Labyrinth…\nIt's a plan resembling a gamble, but we have yet to identify\nwhat #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's #C000246204Invincibility#CDEF is. We have no other choice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2566812"
msgid "Okay. I'll put my faith in the\nStudent Council's backup and go to the Labyr―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2566896"
msgid "…Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\nDo you not wish to report\non the incident that just occurred?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2566992"
msgid "Ahh… I guess it's fine, it's nothing major.\nIt won't add any more unnecessary stress than\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF already has… right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567128"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF is evading details here."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "2567176"
msgid "…you see a roachy or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567212"
msgid "W-why would there be any HERE!?\nDon't do that―don't make up stories\nlike THAT, even as a joke!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567308"
msgid "………pardon me.\nIt appears I froze up after hearing\nthat statement, so lacking in ANY delicacy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567408"
msgid "Seriously. The wooden textures around here\nalready give off this vibe like a ghost is\ngoing to pop out, let alone one of THOSE."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567536"
msgid "Yep. When girls get together,\nthey seem to always overreact to those summertime crawlies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567628"
msgid "However… I faintly remember something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567668"
msgid "About a tenth of the girls who come from\nwomen's colleges show no mercy when dealing with them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567764"
msgid "Um… it's about #C236196003Shinji#CDEF. While everyone was\nnapping, it appears that he sneaked in and\nrummaged around, looking for something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2567908"
msgid "What!? He not only watched a maiden's adorable\nface as she slept, but he also laid hands on\nher!? To the Colosseum with him!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568036"
msgid "Oh? If one messes with these girls, they're\nliable to strike with a head-gut-groin\nthree-hit-combo. He dared to rob THEM…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568160"
msgid "I see that Seaweed in a new light now.\nA dim one, that is. So, what did #RUBS    Gekisha Boy#RUBEPolaroid Pete#REND\ntake pictures of? He cover wars or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568324"
msgid "That man never learns.\nLike grass on the seafloor, hiding away\nin shame. So, what did he borrow?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568424"
msgid "It was… a sample of the virus.\nThe one that drains levels, skills, and whatnot.\nMan, what is he thinking…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568536"
msgid "The chances of him misusing it are not zero.\nFor example… if he sought a quick death.\nThat sort of thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568644"
msgid "Drinking the poison would end one's life…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568688"
msgid "That kind of thought never occurred to me,\nbut under these circumstances, I can't say\nfor sure that they would never occur eventually."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568824"
msgid "He figures that if #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF are\ngoing to kill him, then it would be better\nto go out comfortably while he has the chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2568988"
msgid "No, he's not thinking that.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF doesn't have the guts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569064"
msgid "O-of course. Considering #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's\npersonality, I would think he'd be using it for\nsome no-good prank."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569184"
msgid "That's why you needn't worry about it.\nFocus on clearing the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569256"
msgid "Then we can drop the discussion here if #C236196003Rin#CDEF insists on that.\nBut…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569340"
msgid "Morning, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nI like that motivated look you got there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569416"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF has her invincibility and #C236196003BB#CDEF her privilege skill.\nWe're at a total disadvantage, but we're also\nin no position to get cold feet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569588"
msgid "We're always at a disadvantage, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569628"
msgid "Well, that's reassuring to hear. Personally,\nI feel a bit iffy. I have good news and bad\nnews. Which would you like to hear first?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569760"
msgid "Offering such a choice is inefficient, Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF. Regardless of which one is chosen,\nthe same reports will be given out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2569900"
msgid "Come on, how boring. You'll never get the man\nof your dreams to fall for you if you only ever\ngo straight to the ending."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570024"
msgid "………ahem.\nWe'll leave that topic for another time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570080"
msgid "As the Student Council clerk, I will give the\nreport to #C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF. It took time,\nbut we learned how #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF is cheating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570244"
msgid "I believed that #C236196003Rin#CDEF and the bunch would make a breakthrough,\nbut truly hearing about it catches me by surprise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570372"
msgid "What else would one expect from the top candidates\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?\nNo one is as reliable as they are…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570500"
msgid "We figured out why she's invincible,\nbut now the problem is how to get through it…\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, if you please could."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570628"
msgid "Yes. I'll give you a high-level explanation:\nit appears that #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF has been tampering\nwith the system, not herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570768"
msgid "It states that \"#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF cannot be harmed.\"\nShe is completely guilty of performing an\nillegal modification."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570896"
msgid "She didn't modify herself, she modified the world―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2570956"
msgid "How much audacity can she have?\n#ROFS0001#RUBS      participants#RUBEMere players#REND like us never would've come up with that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2571088"
msgid "Yep. She's not enhancing her defense through\na skill: a rule is making her invincible.\nShe may be a cheater, but she's one smart #C000246204Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2571240"
msgid "So that's what it was… no wonder I couldn't\nfind any traces of illegal modification in\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, no matter how much I looked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2571388"
msgid "…I need to travel to and reach the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Central Region#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2571472"
msgid "Basically, they want me to dash over to the final layer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2571532"
msgid "But Shields are blocking up the Labyrinth.\nI think that I can't get through the Labyrinth\nunless we defeat #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2571668"
msgid "…there's only one solution. If we aggregate\nall the computation used to operate this\nbuilding, it's possible to destroy Shields."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2571800"
msgid "However, we only get to destroy one. After the\nShield is destroyed, the old school building\nwill halt. It'll take time to recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2571932"
msgid "During that time, all of your backup will be\ncut off, #C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF. It'll be\nextremely dangerous, and you'll be alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572072"
msgid "…so yeah, that's how it is.\nNow I'll give you the bad news."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572136"
msgid "In order to beat #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF,\nyou'll have to keep evading her\nand get to the end of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572252"
msgid "Then, even if you do reach the barrier,\ncommunications between us will be completely\ncut off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572348"
msgid "Before #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF catches up to you,\nyou'll get rid of that unfair rule."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572440"
msgid "See? There may only be one floor left,\nbut this is a TALL order, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572516"
msgid "Still… there's no other choice left.\nThis strategy has a sub-10% chance of success,\nbut it's the best chance we have at present…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572648"
msgid "Correct. The Vice Preside… no, our proposed\nstrategy is a suicide mission that, while\npossible, has low chances of success. But――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572784"
msgid "There's no need for #C236196003Rin#CDEF and the others to look so gloomy.\nI mean, until now we didn't even have a \"chance.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2572908"
msgid "If we can just wipe out that rule,\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's invincibility will go with it.\nAfter that, we'll just beat her in a match of pure strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2573064"
msgid "Conversely, that means #C236196003#SVT#CDEF can finally get some\npayback after getting sliced up so much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2573172"
msgid "―――Yeah. Gosh, is it fine for me to\nfeel this impressed? That sort of positive\nthinking makes me want to start worrying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2573296"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. If #C236196003#NICK#CDEF―the one facing\nthe most danger here―is raring to go, \nthen we need to be determined too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2573460"
msgid "―――Okay. Once the Shield is destroyed,\nthe school's power supply will shut down. I have\nmy own separate reserve power though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2573592"
msgid "We'll be adjusting the old school building's\nresources. We'll increase computation so that\nwe can destroy the Shield quickly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2573720"
msgid "Our strategy is as we outlined before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2573760"
msgid "You'll storm the eighteenth floor and head\nfor the end of the Labyrinth without getting\ncaught by #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2573888"
msgid "Then it's all up to you and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nWe don't know if something is waiting for you\nin the #C000246204Moon Cell's Central Region#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574040"
msgid "Regardless―――You can do it, right,\nour new #C236196003President #NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574120"
msgid "I'll do everything I can to see our plan through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574172"
msgid "Alright, then please hurry over to the\nLabyrinth. Before #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF catches on to\nour plan―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574288"
msgid "What's wrong, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF? Something bothering you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574352"
msgid "\"Loss of time perception.\" The Imaginary Number\nSpace has different physical laws than real\nspace, so technically, one cannot sense time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574492"
msgid "…there's certainly a silver lining there.\nThanks to not having that rule, we were able\nto accept the gravity of our situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574620"
msgid "It's typical for humans to overlook\ntheir own dishonesty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574680"
msgid "Humans… ah, #C236196003BB#CDEF is quite human-like, isn't she?\nAs are the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574784"
msgid "Yes. Although it's peculiar that, while an\nAI, her actions are driven by emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2574868"
msgid "…#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, the #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nAn #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF that said she doesn't need #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand even goes as far as to mess with the rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575052"
msgid "She's earnestly trying to end the world,\nfor different reasons than #C236196003BB#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575144"
msgid "An #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF that said she doesn't need #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nand she even goes as far as to mess with the rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575272"
msgid "She's earnestly trying to end the world,\nfor different reasons than #C236196003BB#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575364"
msgid "…yes. Even if she developed emotions, we\ncannot let that stand. No, any AI cannot\nbe allowed to develop emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575480"
msgid "Please, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nDon't let #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF put any more\ncontradictions into your head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575596"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's death.\nOur final battle against #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF;\nthe second showdown with #C236196003BB#CDEF that awaits us afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575752"
msgid "With all of these items on our plate,\n#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF silently absorb themselves in their work."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575880"
msgid "Welcome back, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nWell done clearing the eighteenth floor.\nAre you feeling in good shape?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2575992"
msgid "I AM feeling more tired,\nbut this is no time to be resting in My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2576064"
msgid "For #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's sake, who made this possible,\nwe need to infiltrate #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's mind as soon as we can."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2576200"
msgid "…okay, we should be good! #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, the course\nof infiltration we aligned with #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nbiological pattern should be safe to use now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2576372"
msgid "The rest is up to #C236196003#NICK#CDEF―――\nAh, no need to even bother checking, I see.\nThat look says you're about to jet off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2576504"
msgid "Then do your usual final checks.\nOur schedule may have changed, but the\noutcome we want hasn't."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2576600"
msgid "After that is the end of the Labyrinth――\nYou'll storm onto the floor that\nconnects to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2576728"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF will be there still trying to\nhack her way past the defensive barriers\nto the Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2576832"
msgid "Victory is ours if we stop #C236196003BB#CDEF from breaking\nthrough the Core's barriers―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2576928"
msgid "…or if we ignore #C236196003BB#CDEF and return to the Near\nSide. I can manage making a gate to the Near\nSide there with my privileges somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2577072"
msgid "There's no need. We won't push you any further\nthan we already have, plus we have another\noption that's currently more effective."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2577204"
msgid "My hypothesis is that #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF and #C236196003#SVT#CDEF\nwill be treated as errors and returned\nto the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2577332"
msgid "Once #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF returns to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's illegal activities will be revealed.\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will automatically delete #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2577544"
msgid "…that's true.\nThat's the best solution we have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2577596"
msgid "Thankfully, #C236196003BB#CDEF is tunnel-visioned on those\nbarriers. Once our plan starts, she'll be stuck\nin a fight of strength against the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2577768"
msgid "The smallest misstep could cause #C236196003BB#CDEF to be\nincinerated instead. That's why she arranged\n#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF to be her final defense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2577924"
msgid "Right now, even if #C236196003BB#CDEF knew that #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nwas near and on the way, she can do nothing\nabout it. All she can do is project images."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578084"
msgid "More favorable for us. Ultimately, the question\nis whether #C236196003BB#CDEF will break the barriers down\nfirst, or if we'll defeat #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578252"
msgid "That's basically all that matters.\nWe're counting on you, #C236196003President #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578344"
msgid "\"Of course,\" I nod in agreement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578380"
msgid "Once I'm ready, I'll head to the final barrier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578428"
msgid "We're also rushing to analyze the #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF\nskill, but let's focus on #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578556"
msgid "Once #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF reaches the sculpture\nof #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF, we'll begin our final operation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578672"
msgid "…I'm sorry, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nI know you're at your limit, but please\nrun #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF one more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578804"
msgid "So long as it's just one more time…\nI'll be fine. Safely and surely\nI'll send #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF in―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578916"
msgid "…I return to the Student Council Room with a heavy heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2578976"
msgid "…only one thing is different here.\n…it's the simulator #C236196003Rani#CDEF was running.\n…it's stopped doing anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2579100"
msgid "…seeing this, I became worried that the vague anxiety\n  hanging over me was now an evident truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2579200"
msgid "…okay. Without any basis for doing so, I accept it.\n…which means, I―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2579272"
msgid "This is how the \"seven days\" ends if #C236196003BB#CDEF seizes\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―――no, if #C236196003BB#CDEF is assigned to be\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's management software."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2579468"
msgid "The final death toll amounts to 90% of the\ncurrent population. Think of it as civilization\non Earth coming nearly to a halt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2579596"
msgid "……but, we still have time.\n……a collapse in the future is imminent,\n    but we still have seven days to work with.\n……if we can somehow separate #C236196003BB#CDEF from the\n    #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF as soon as possible―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2579832"
msgid "President… that's no longer…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2579864"
msgid "…is she trying to say it's impossible?\n…that beating #C236196003BB#CDEF is impossible?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2579956"
msgid "…I know that. I already know that.\n…I'm trying desperately to stay strong,\n  but my heart is already broken."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2580068"
msgid "…you're misunderstanding. We don't have seven\ndays to spare. The Earth has already fallen\ninto ruin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2580172"
msgid "The \"seven days\" have passed…\nThe Earth has been a planet of death ever since\nwe were trapped in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2580312"
msgid "Through #C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF, all we've been doing\nis observing a #RUBS present#RUBEfuture#REND that's already been set."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2580448"
msgid "…nevertheless, I find myself accepting the outcome.\n…the Earth is already in ruins? Is that so.\n…we've been looking into the future? Apparently."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2580596"
msgid "We had no time to work with from the very\nbeginning. Actually―――No time has passed\nwhile we've been in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2580744"
msgid "…does that mean we've been in a loop?\n…just like how I was endlessly repeating the preliminaries,\n  have we been repeating the same span of time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2580892"
msgid "…that question is of no importance right now, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2580948"
msgid "If we were looping, there'd still be hope. But\nthat's not it. Once #C236196003BB#CDEF broke the barrier and\nsurrounded the Core, she became the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2581120"
msgid "And the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF has no concept of time like\nour #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF does. She now\nexists in both the future and the past."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2581276"
msgid "…I don't get what #C236196003Rin#CDEF is saying at all.\n…but I don't have the willpower to question it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2581384"
msgid "…I'm sorry. I'm not in the best mental state to \nexplain this either. Let me just skip to\nthe conclusion, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2581500"
msgid "No matter what we do, #C236196003BB#CDEF… or rather,\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is untouchable to us.\nShe's turned into the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2581664"
msgid "…the #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF… A #C000246204wishing device#CDEF that makes any\n  wish come true, which is given to the\n  victor of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2581836"
msgid "…ahh, okay.\n…is this sorrow coming from realizing this truth\n  with all five of my senses?\n…back when I was in front of that colossal wall?\n…from the bottom of my heart, I no longer―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2582028"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail#CDEF is an observation device that\nsimulates a fixed period of Earth's future,\nstoring records since human history began."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2582176"
msgid "They may just be possibilities, but this Moon\nhas records of an infinite number of futures."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2582268"
msgid "Obtaining the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF means getting to\npick out a desired future from amongst them\nand make it come true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2582392"
msgid "…get it? The world won't instantly become the\nway you want it to, but it can reliably manage\nthe Earth to become the way you wish it to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2582532"
msgid "It's the most realistic wishing device…\nNo, schedule management device there is.\nThat's what the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2582668"
msgid "…the #C000246204wishing device#CDEF itself intentionally\ndecided this \"future\": \nthe death of humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2582776"
msgid "This future is becoming established history.\nEven if we return to the Near Side, there may\nnot be a #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF or even a #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2582944"
msgid "…yes. We're still alive because the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is a\n#C000246204universe of records#CDEF, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583068"
msgid "Those in the Near Side would probably see\nall of us over on this side as ghosts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583152"
msgid "…?\n…what they said just now struck me a little.\n…#C236196003Rin#CDEF said, \"even if we return to the Near Side.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583268"
msgid "…judging by that phrasing, does that mean\n  they've confirmed that there's a way to\n  return to the Near Side…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583384"
msgid "…yeah. Right after #C236196003BB#CDEF made her announcement,\na gate to the Near Side appeared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583480"
msgid "I think it has to be because in the Near Side…\nin the established future, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's\nfunctions have changed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583612"
msgid "We can go back to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF\nwhenever we feel like it. But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583700"
msgid "It must be hell outside by now.\nWhether it's in the Moon or on Earth, there's no\nplace where we can survive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583812"
msgid "In other words―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583836"
msgid "…ahh, I figured we might reach that conclusion.\n…please don't tell me.\n  Please don't say it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2583932"
msgid "…because the \"conclusion\" I came to when I\n  stood in front of that wall will end up coming true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584032"
msgid "If we stay here in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,\nwhere the \"present\" is paused for all eternity,\nthen everyone will be safe…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584172"
msgid "But to live such a life,\nsuch an existence―what would be the point?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584244"
msgid "Our final goal, to the return to the Near Side\nof the Moon―――to the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, has\nlost all meaning now. It's all over for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584396"
msgid "…#C236196003Rani#CDEF's words fall on the Student Council Room\n  like a curtain call."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584484"
msgid "It's all over?\n   The Earth, the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\n   our battle―it's all really over?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584588"
msgid "―――Without a doubt, it really is over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584632"
msgid "The proof is in the fact that no one said anything further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584692"
msgid "Our battle ends here.\n\"Death\" simply hasn't visited us yet,\nand we have nowhere left to go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584784"
msgid "The sweet poison slowly making its way\nthrough our bodies had reached lethal\nlevels from the very start."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2584892"
msgid "Brain waves shifted to wakefulness. Pulse, heart\nrate, blood pressure, breathing, cognition, and\nvitals stable――Conversion safely completed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585036"
msgid "Do you know where you are, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585088"
msgid "I hear #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and immediately look up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585144"
msgid "I find myself back in the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585192"
msgid "Now releasing Servant from dormant state.\nWell done, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe mission was a resounding success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585308"
msgid "Now releasing Servant from dormant state.\nWell done, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe mission was a resounding success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585424"
msgid "Now releasing Servant from dormant state.\nWell done, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe mission was a resounding success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585540"
msgid "Now releasing Servant from dormant state.\nWell done, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe mission was a resounding success."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585656"
msgid "Mhm. I was worried for a moment there,\nbut it appears that you safely accomplished\na mighty task. Splendid, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585776"
msgid "…well, to tell the truth, I would've liked \nif you stayed there a tad longer… but we have\nurgent business. I'll have to make do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2585908"
msgid "Nice job. I was worried how far you'd get,\npaired up with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF,\nbut you knocked it out of the park."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586028"
msgid "…although, thinking about it, you faced off\nagainst me this time. You know my tricks better\nthan anyone, so of course you won."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586156"
msgid "―――Phew. Everything went smooth, indeed.\nSplendid work, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586248"
msgid "But alas… ahh, how loathe I am to part\nfrom that paradise of an experience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586328"
msgid "This is what it means to be entranced,\nand I may get hooked on it…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586396"
msgid "I wasn't aware of any seals, but… that #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\ndoes fine work, surprisingly. It appears my\nprimordial linchpin has been fully released."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586548"
msgid "Now the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF has been unsealed.\nNot that we know what it is,\nonly #C236196003#SVT#CDEF was able to see inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586692"
msgid "Now the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF has been unsealed.\nNot that we know what it is,\nonly #C236196003#SVT#CDEF was able to see inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586836"
msgid "Now the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF has been unsealed.\nNot that we know what it is,\nonly #C236196003#SVT#CDEF was able to see inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2586980"
msgid "Now the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF has been unsealed.\nNot that we know what it is,\nonly #C236196003#SVT#CDEF was able to see inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2587124"
msgid "I've confirmed the presence of a black box\nin the center of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Cyber Frame\nthat wasn't present before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2587248"
msgid "I've confirmed the presence of a black box\nin the center of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Cyber Frame\nthat wasn't present before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2587372"
msgid "I've confirmed the presence of a black box\nin the center of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Cyber Frame\nthat wasn't present before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2587496"
msgid "I've confirmed the presence of a black box\nin the center of #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's Cyber Frame\nthat wasn't present before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2587620"
msgid "I believe it's the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF should be able to raise #SVT[her][his][her][his]#\nSpiritron levels on command."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2587780"
msgid "I believe it's the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF should be able to raise #SVT[her][his][her][his]#\nSpiritron levels on command."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2587940"
msgid "I believe it's the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF should be able to raise #SVT[her][his][her][his]#\nSpiritron levels on command."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2588100"
msgid "I believe it's the #C000246204Mythical Mystic Code#CDEF.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF should be able to raise #SVT[her][his][her][his]#\nSpiritron levels on command."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2588260"
msgid "Ah, no! You mustn't use it here! Its power\nis extraordinary, it may bring down\nthe old school building's systems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2588376"
msgid "Also… know that it's a very powerful engine,\nso please be cautious when using it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2588460"
msgid "…I'm fully aware. I got a sense of what\n#C000246204Mythical Mystic Codes#CDEF are. I'll only wear\nit when it's time to finish things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2588596"
msgid "Gosh. It's not like it'll turn me into massive\nsize. #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF really wants to try it on!\nI mean, it fairly―――O-ohh…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2588732"
msgid "Was this what I would wear in my origins!?\nAh, okay, let's make a show out of this one!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2588820"
msgid "May as well… right!?\nI've decided―when I do the unveiling,\nit will be during our final battle!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2588920"
msgid "Obviously. Living up to my myth isn't so\ndemanding that I would break, but a king's true\nface is not something to show so readily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2589052"
msgid "I shall cast aside my pride during the final\nbattle only. Until then, I'll devote\nmyself to this amusing excursion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2589168"
msgid "―――Then the conditions have been laid out.\nWe got our hands on a way to counter #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nNo more objections, right, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2589324"
msgid "…yes. Though the raw chance is low,\nthere's now a possibility of eliminating #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2589424"
msgid "Once #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF arrives at my wall…\nAt the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF's Core, I'll remove it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2589540"
msgid "Now there are no more walls in our way,\nno more impassable obstacles to impede us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2589624"
msgid "All that's left to do is head to the Central Region\nwith #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, and this will all be over―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2589736"
msgid "Hold on. How about we get a full night's rest\nbefore that? Don't we have enough time to spare\nfor that, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2589888"
msgid "Yes, of course. Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's suggestion\nhas taught me something about how to time\nbreaks effectively."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590008"
msgid "As a special treat, I'll try seeing if I can\nchange our outside location. I hope\nI can make it look like nighttime…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590128"
msgid "Okay. With that, we'll adjourn for the time\nbeing. Everyone, if there's anything left for\nyou to do, wrap it up quick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590248"
msgid "Also… #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. Know that what we're\ntrying to do will end up destroying the\nold school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590360"
msgid "I bet the NPCs are against it.\nI'm moving forward regardless.\nI'm well aware of how tyrannical it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590464"
msgid "However, that's not the kind of person you are.\nYou have virtue… or rather, humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590552"
msgid "If there's anyone you want to make that clear\nto, go get that done too. Even if you end\nup not coming to an understanding."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590676"
msgid "There's not much to say about the mood\nthroughout the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590752"
msgid "Although everyone is absorbed in their work,\nthe mood is dignified and clear―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590836"
msgid "Basically, it's the same morning scene it's always been."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590896"
msgid "Oh? Morning, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nRefreshed after a night's sleep?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2590968"
msgid "Good morning, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nI can have a morning meal prepared at once,\nif you'd like?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591068"
msgid "We can have tea afterwards.\nDo you all like having tea after breakfast?\nOr maybe you're all more the coffee type?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591184"
msgid "…I find myself grinning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591212"
msgid "Even though―or rather, because it's our last morning,\nthe girls are making good use of the day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591312"
msgid "Looky here! My processing speed is as fast as \nlightning! You look like you're in good shape,\ntoo, but I'll give you a run for your money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591452"
msgid "I removed various guards, making me more solid.\nI feel refreshed, like when a diet starts\nshowing progress."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591560"
msgid "Yeah, it's just like when you start trimming\nsome belly squish―― Er, forget it.\nNevermind. I've never been fat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591676"
msgid "A-anyway, I'm all set on my side.\nDon't worry about a thing,\njust jump straight into that final battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591780"
msgid "All my self-diagnosis system levels are nominal.\nI'm able to maintain my avatar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591864"
msgid "However… Every time I think about how I'll\nnever see this setting again, my emotion\nregulator produces not unpleasant feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2591996"
msgid "My self-diagnoses aren't being affected,\nso it may be a product of my cerebral nerves…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592084"
msgid "It surprises even me that I have such thoughts\nof \"attachment\" to this place,\nhaving kept so distant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592188"
msgid "My #C000246204SGs#CDEF were forcibly extracted,\nI had disgraceful qualities made up for me――\nMy time here was quite the headache…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592324"
msgid "But now, I feel like even those errors\nare precious to me. All in all,\nI think I had a worthwhile experience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592436"
msgid "Now please head off to battle.\nIt's time for you to put an end to this,\nby your own hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592528"
msgid "Ah… e-erm… I-I don't really have any\nwords to send you off with!\nI couldn't think of anything \"cool\" to say…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592640"
msgid "I'm hopeless, aren't I…\nAll I can ever talk about is work…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592704"
msgid "End of the line.\nThe monitor is out, our comms are out.\nNow we've got nothing to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592792"
msgid "Okay. Alright, let's split up areas to wrap up.\nYou take the Student Council Room, #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI'll take the school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2592928"
msgid "Understood. We'll use all the memory\nand power source here to bolster\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's defenses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593036"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF left already, did she?\nGuess it's just us then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593108"
msgid "Maintaining the Student Council Room takes up\nmemory, anyway. And I don't like the idea of\nwaiting around to see if #[he][she]# wins or loses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593252"
msgid "…hmph. Sorry for acting tough.\nWe've got nowhere else to go but back to\nthe Near Side when this place is gone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593364"
msgid "And that's a scary thought.\nRight now, there's no future for us\nunless #[he][she]# wins."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593456"
msgid "If we get back in the Near Side just to pop back\ninto bodies dying from euphoria to then drop\nstraight dead―――That would not be fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593592"
msgid "…hehe. As if you pay that any mind.\nIt's truly difficult for me to understand\nthe way you show concern."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593700"
msgid "We firmly believe that #[he][she]#'ll come out\nvictorious. That's why we're afraid―about what\nawaits us when we return to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593840"
msgid "And no wonder.\nAs I recall, my next opponent is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2593896"
msgid "…ahh, same for you, #C236196003Rani#CDEF?\nThen one thing's for sure:\nthings won't be getting any easier for us…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594012"
msgid "Who knows? If the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF returns to normal,\nthen all the events that occurred in the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF will be erased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594172"
msgid "All of our encounters, all the time we\nspent together, all our shared\nlaughs―everything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594264"
msgid "My guess is that we'll completely forget\nabout this as \"one possibility that\nmay have happened.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594364"
msgid "Ah. This was a nighttime dream the entire time.\nThe moment the Near Side's future is protected,\nthe events of the Far Side get wiped clean."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594504"
msgid "Yes, unfortunately.\nIs that something we should be celebrating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594568"
msgid "Looks like we're just about at the limit.\nYou can go on ahead if you want, #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594668"
msgid "Don't be a stranger. When we exit,\nwe exit at the same time.\nWe'll let #[him][her]# take care of the rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594776"
msgid "Yes.\nAnd you made for the finest #ROFS0004#RUBSstaff#RUBEally#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "2594844"
msgid "Thank you――and thanks for all your\nhard work this whole time. Well then,\nlet's meet up again in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

